{"id": "9631", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9631", "title": "Claire Andrade-Watkins", "text": "Claire Andrade-Watkins, ni umunyamateka akaba n'umukinnyi wa filimi ukomoka muri Cape Verdean na Amerika. Ni intiti itandukanye y\u2019amateka nyafurika n yibanda ku mateka ya Amerika na Cape Verdean, ndetse n\u2019Abafaransa nyuma y\u2019abakoloni. Hagati aho, yitwaye neza muri sinema nyafurika ivuga Igiporutugali, sinema za diaspora ya Africana, hamwe na firime y'Abanyamerika b'Abirabura ndetse n'abayikora. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYize muri Lincoln School Providence, abona impamyabumenyi ya BA muri Simmons College nyuma abona MA na Ph.D. wo muri kaminuza ya Boston. \nUmwuga.\nAndrade-Watkins ni Umuyobozi washinze umushinga wa ' Fox Point Cape Verdean ', umushinga w\u2019ubushakashatsi bwakozwe mu baturage mu 2007. Afite isosiyete ikora kandi igakwirakwiza, 'SPIA Media Productions, Inc.'. Yashinzwe mu 1998 kandi izobereye mu bitangazamakuru byo muri Afurika Diaspora. \nNiwe mwarimu wa mbere wigisha amasomo yamabara muri kaminuza, akaba na Porofeseri wambere wuzuye wamabara muri Visual and Media Arts mbere yo kwimukira mu kigo cyubuhanzi bwa Liberal Arts &amp; Interdisciplinary Studies. Ni n'umwanditsi w'ibitabo byinshi birimo,\"Society for Visual Anthropology\", \"Research in African Literature\", \"The Independent Film and Video Monthly\", \"American Historical Review\", and \"Cin\u00e9mActionn\"."}
{"id": "9633", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9633", "title": "Francisco Manso", "text": "Francisco Manso (yavutse 28 Ugushyingo 1949), ni producer akaba n'umukinnyi wa filimi wo muri portigali. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime zizwi cyane,\"Napomuceno's Will\", \"\" and \"O Nosso C\u00f4nsul em Havana\".\nUmwuga.\nYarangije amategeko muri kaminuza ya Lisbonne. Mu 1976, yarangije muri firime muri Centro de Arte e Comunica\u00e7\u00e3o Visual (Ar.Co) maze, mu 1979 kugeza 1980, arangiza amasomo y\u2019ubuhanga bw\u2019amajwi maze aba umuyobozi wungirije muri televiziyo rusange R\u00e1dio e Televis\u00e3o de Portugal (RTP). \nMu 1978, yimukiye muri sinema nk'umuyobozi wungirije wa mbere wa filime \"O Meu Nome \u00c9\", iyobowe na Fernando Matos Silva. Ibyo byakurikiwe na \"O Pr\u00edncipe com Orelhas de Burro\", iyobowe na Ant\u00f3nio de Macedo, mu 1979. Mu 1980, yimukiye muri Gineya Bissau akora kuri filime \"Acto dos Feitos da Guin\u00e9\" iyobowe na Matos Silva. Mu mwaka wakurikiyeho, yasubiye muri Porutugali maze akora kuri filime \"Guerra no Mirandum ya\" Matos Silva yo mu 1981.\nNyuma yo gukora nk'umufasha imyaka myinshi, umurimo wa mbere wa Manso wo kuyobora ni 1983 hamwe na filimi ya televiziyo \"A Epopeia dos Bacalhaus\". Yahinduye kandi filime ye ya mbere yerekanwe kuri tereviziyo, \"Terra Nova, Mar Velho\", muri uwo mwaka. Iyo filime imaze gutsinda, yakomeje kuyobora filime na documentaire nka, \"A Aposta\" (1987), \"Na M\u00e3o de Deus\" (1989), \"Nostalgia\" (1994) na \"O Esp\u00edrito da Cor\" (1994). \nMu 1997, Manso yakoze filime ye ya mbere yerekana sinema, \"O Testamento do Senhor Napomuceno\", ashingiye ku gitabo cyitwa \"The Will Will and Testament of Senhor da Silva Ara\u00fajo\" cyanditswe na Germano Almeida kirwa cya Cape Verde. Filime yatanzwe ku rwego mpuzamahanga kandi yerekanwe mu minsi mikuru ya firime, ihabwa ibihembo byinshi harimo bitatu mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Gramado. Mu 2000, yakoze TV mini-serie \"Almeida Garrett\". Inyandiko ye, \"Mem\u00f3rias de um rio - Avieiros, os n\u00f3madas do Tejo\" mu 2004, yahawe igihembo cyihariye cya Lusophony mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya 10 ry\u2019ibidukikije - Cine Eco 2004. \nMuri filime yakurikiyeho yakoresheje cyane cyane amateka, nka firime \"O \u00daltimo Condenado \u00e0 Morte\" ya 2008, yabayeho mugihe cya Revolution Liberal muri Portugal muri 1821/22. Mu mwaka wa 2011, yakoze filime \"O C\u00f4nsul de Bord\u00e9us\" yari ishingiye ku buzima bwa Aristides de Sousa Mendes ndetse n\u2019ibikorwa yakoreye ikiremwamuntu mu gihe cyo gutoteza Abayahudi. "}
{"id": "9634", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9634", "title": "Marc Serena", "text": "Marc Serena (wavutse 1983), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Espagne, umunyamakuru n'umwanditsi. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa documentaire nyafurika \"izwi cyane\" nka Tchindas, \"Peixos d'aigua dol\u00e7a\" na \"Umwanditsi ukomoka mu Gihugu kitagira ibitabo\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1983 i Manresa, muri Espagne, ubu akaba atuye muri Barcelona. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2011 afite imyaka 25, yanditse igitabo \"Urugendo kuri 25\" cyagize amahirwe menshi muri Aziya. Nyuma yaje gusohoka mu ndimi eshanu zirimo Igishinwa n'Igikoreya. Muri 2014, Serena yasohoye \"Un-African love?\" ikusanya amajwi yibibazo aturuka mubihugu 15 bya Afrika. Hanyuma yayoboye urubuga rwa documentaire \"Double Epidemic\" muri 2015. Muri uwo mwaka, Serena yanditse kandi ayobora filime yamamaye cyane \"Tchindas\", afatanije na Pablo Garc\u00eda P\u00e9rez de Lara. Film nyuma yatsinze Outfest 's Grand Jury Award for Excellence mu sinema. \nHamwe no gutsinda muri film, yakoze film ye itaha \"Double Epidemic\" mumwaka umwe. Muri 2018, yayoboye filime \"Peixos d'aigua dol\u00e7a\" hanyuma \"Umwanditsi wo mu Gihugu kitagira amaduka y'ibitabo\" muri 2019. Hagati aho, muri 2009, blog ye yahawe na Lonely Planet nka blog nziza yingendo zitari Icyongereza. "}
{"id": "9635", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9635", "title": "Alexis Tsafas", "text": "Alexis Tsafas (yavutse 1956), ni producer numukinnyi wa filimi wo mubugereki. Yagize uruhare runini muri sinema ya Cape Verde akora firime zizwi cyane, \"A menina dos olhos grandes\", \"Tunnel\" na \"Zenaida\". "}
{"id": "9636", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9636", "title": "J\u00falio Silv\u00e3o Tavares", "text": "J\u00falio Silv\u00e3o Tavares (yavutse 1959), niUmukinnyi wa firime muri Cape Verdean. \nUmwuga.\nKuva mu 1979, yize umuco gakondo wa Cape-verdean, aho yashinze Itsinda rya Theatre Experimental igihe yari producer numuyobozi wa gahunda yumuco 'Dragoeiro' yatambutse kuri Televis\u00e3o de Cabo Verde (TCV) kuva 1993 kugeza 1997. Kuva 1994 kugeza 1996, Tavares yari umuyobozi wa gahunda yumuco 'Articultura' kuri R\u00e1dio de Cabo Verde (RCV). Ni n'umuyobozi wa sosiyete ikora firime yitwa 'Silv\u00e3o-Produ\u00e7\u00e3o Filmes' yashinze mu 2004. \nHagati aho, yakoze firime \"O Desafio\" mu 1999. Mu 2005, yerekanwe bwa mbere muri firime na \"Batuque, Alma de um Povo\".Ku itsinda rya muzika rya batuque Raiz di Tambarina, n'imizi y'iyi njyana ya muzika i Santiago, Cape Verde. Iyi filime yerekanwe i Lisbonne mu Gushyingo 2010, nyuma yerekanwa mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. "}
{"id": "9637", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9637", "title": "Diana C. Zollicoffer", "text": "Diana C. Zollicoffer (wavutse 1977), ni umukinnyi wa filime muri Seychellois akaba n'umukinnyi wa filime ukora cyane mu nganda za firime z'ubuhinde. Azwi cyane nka producer wibikorwa byamamaye cyane nka \"Schmoolie the Deathwatcher\", \"Bridget na Iain\" na \"Bayou yibagiwe\". \nUmwuga.\nYarangije muri Duke Ellington School of Arts, Washington DC."}
{"id": "9638", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9638", "title": "Mosonngoa", "text": "Mosonngoa ni filimi yo muri Mosotho yasohotse 2014 ikaba filime ngufi iyobowe na Lemohang Yeremiya Mosese kandi yakozwe na Hannah Stockmann. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo Siphiwe Nzima-Ntskhe mu mwanya wa mbere mu gihe Masele Tokane, Chaka Phehlamarole Khalechene na Retselisitsoe Sekake bagize uruhare runini. \nFilime yakiriwe neza nabayinenga kandi yerekanwa mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. "}
{"id": "9639", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9639", "title": "Tseko Monaheng", "text": "Tseko Monaheng, numukinnyi wa filimi muri Mosotho. Azwi cyane ku ruhare muri filime \"This Is Not a Burial, It's a Resurrection\", \"Five Fingers for Marseilles\" and short film \"Behemoth: Or the Game of God\". \nUmwuga.\nMu 2005, Monaheng yavumbuwe n'umukinnyi w'inararibonye akaba na producer, Silas Monyatsi mu gihe cyo kwerekana ikinamico ya SIDA \"Ke Khetho Eaka\". Nyuma yaho mu mwaka, yakoze mu filimi ngufi \"Untitled\" iyoborwa na Kaizer Matsumunyane. Hagati aho, yakinnye mu makinamico menshi ya radiyo kuri SIDA. Mu mwaka wa 2006, yakinnye bwa mbere mu ikinamico yo muri Afurika y'Epfo hamwe na Soul City's \"Untitled Stories\" harimo \"Mapule's Choice\" na \"Monna Motsamai\". \nYakinnye kandi muri firime nyinshi za Mosotho harimo na Lemohang Yeremiya Mosese ya firime ngufi yamamaye cyane Behemoth: Cyangwa Umukino w'Imana nk'uruhare runini 'Umubwiriza'. Hamwe no gutsinda muri make, yahise atoranyirizwa mumushinga utaha wa Mosese\"\" muri 2019. Filime yerekanwe no mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Yakinnye kandi muri firime \"zaho: Kau la poho\" (2008) na \"Lilaphalapha\". \nMuri 2017, Monaheng yakinnye muri firime yo muri Afrika yepf. Yabigizemo uruhare nk'umupolisi urya ruswa. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi ihitamo kwerekanwa mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto (TIFF) kuva ku ya 7 kugeza ku ya 17 Nzeri 2017. Muri 2018, yatangiriye kuri tereviziyo yo muri Afrika yepfo hamwe nikinamico \"Rhythm City\". Icyakora, yageragejweho uruhare mu Kwakira 2017. Monaheng kandi yifatanyije na productions ku: \"Mantsopa\" na \"Qomatsi\" ndetse bitandukanye 'Lesedi' FM darame radiyo. "}
{"id": "9640", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9640", "title": "Behemoth: Or the Game of God", "text": "Behemoth: Or the Game of God poster\nBehemoth: Or the Game of God ni filimi yo muri Mosotho yasohotse 2020 ikaba filime ngufi y'amayobera iyobowe na Lemohang Yeremiya Mosese kandi yayikoranye na Hannah Stockmann. Muri filime hagaragaramo Tseko Monaheng nka 'Umubwiriza' mu mwanya wa mbere. \nFilime yakiriwe neza nabayireba kandi yerekanwa mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. "}
{"id": "9641", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9641", "title": "Aletta Bezuidenhout", "text": "Aletta Bezuidenhout (yavutse ku ya 17 Gicurasi 1949, 13 Gashyantare 2024), ni umukinnyi wa filime ukomoka muri Kenya wavukiye muri Kenya, umwanditsi akaba n'umukinnyi wa filime. Akora azwi muri productions ya:\"Weerskant die Nag\", \"Committed\" and \"Spoon\", \"Lament for Koos\" and \"Mother Courage\".\".\" \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 17 Gicurasi 1949 i Nairobi muri Kenya. Se yari injeniyeri. Yakoraga mu Nama Njyanama ya Transvaal yubuhanzi (Truk). Yatoje kandi arangiza BA Drama muri kaminuza ya Cape Town. \nYashakanye n'umucuranzi Colin Shamley, icyo gihe umukinnyi Tertius Meintjes nyuma na Anthony Perris. \nUmwuga.\nYize ikinamico muri kaminuza ya Cape Town nyuma atangira umwuga we wo gukina i Kruik. Nyuma, yimukiye muri old Transvaal akora muri Sosiyete na Theatre y'Isoko. Hagati aho, yakoraga mu nama nyinshi zo mu karere zishinzwe ubuhanzi, nka 'Truk en Kruik'. Nyuma yaje gutangira gutoza abandi bakinnyi. \nMu 1970, yagaragaye muri \"The Space\" nyuma aza gukorana na \"Dusa Stas Fish\" na \"Vi\", \"The Resistible Rise of Arturo UI\" and \"Treats\". Mu 1974, yashinze isosiyete ikora, 'The Company'. Hagati aho, yagize uruhare mu ikinamico akina amakinamico nka \"Desire\", \"Mother Courage\" in 1977, \"Women of Troy\", \"Lament for Koos\" and \"The Minotaur's Sister\" mu 1985. \nUsibye gukina, yakoraga nk'umwanditsi w'amakinamico kandi akora \"Time of Footsteps\", \"Silent Envelope\", \"Angel in a Dark Room\" and \"Little Big Worl\". Muri ecran ya tereviziyo, yakoraga kuri serial \"The Lady of the Camellias\", \"Thicker than Water\" and \"Die Sonkring and Orion\". Some of her popular films include: \"Djadje\", \"Committed\", \"On the Wire\", \"Country of My Skull\" and \"Paljas.\" "}
{"id": "9642", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9642", "title": "Amr El-Bayoumi", "text": "Amr El-Bayoumi (wavutse 1965), ni Umunyamisiri n'Umunyamerika akaba n'umuhanzi wijwi. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"Kapiteni Phillips\",\"The Fifth Estate\" and \"Psychosis\".. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1965 i Alegizandiriya, mu Misiri. Yarangije amashuri abanza mu ishuri ribanza rya Bailey i East Lansing, muri Leta ya Michigan. Kuri ubu abarizwa i Washington DC n'Umujyi wa New York. Amaze kubona impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko, yimukiye i Los Angeles maze ahabwa akazi ko kuba injeniyeri. \nUmwuga.\nYakinnye ibitaramo byinshi muri Amerika, Ubwongereza, na Misiri. Muri 2008, yakinnye muri firime ngufi \"11 Missed Calls\" yamufunguye kugirango yerekane impano ye. Hanyuma muri 2009, yatoranijwe kubindi bigufi \"NASA and the Space Pen\" nka 'abavuga'. Nyuma yandi mafirime abiri: \"Drift\" na \"Loose End\", El-Bayoumi yakinnye bwa mbere muri firime hamwe na firime ya \"gatanu ya\" 2013. Muri filime, yakinnye nka 'General'. Mu mpera z'umwaka wa 2013, yashoboye kwigaragaza muri Amerika \"Kapiteni Phillips\" nk'umunyamuryango wa Maersk Alabama.\nYagaragaye muri serivise nyinshi zizwi cyane kuri tereviziyo zo muri Amerika mu bihe byashize zirimo: \"House of Cards\", \"Mr. Robot\", \"The Blacklist\", \"Madam Secretary\", \"Quantico\" and \"Person of Interest\". "}
{"id": "9643", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9643", "title": "Garth Breytenbach", "text": "Garth Breytenbach (yavutse 14 kamena 1979), ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Afrika yepfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"\", \"Beyond the River\" and \"Mandela: Long Walk to Freedom\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye i Cape Town, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yakoraga i Londres, akora umwuga wo kwakira abashyitsi. Ariko, nyuma yaje kwimurirwa mu gukina amashusho. Yize rero arangiza muri CityVarsity School of Media Studies, Cape Town. Hanyuma yize muri Creative Arts College, kugirango arangize Impamyabumenyi yo gukina Kamera.\nUmwuga.\nIshyaka rye ryo gukina ryaje ubwo yitabiraga amakinamico i Cape Town ndetse na Festival ya Grahamstown. Garth yaremye Mugaragaza ye gukinira mu 1993 na benshi muri Afurika y'Epfo \"mayaruka\" serial. Muri iyi filimi, yagize uruhare ruto rwa 'Jacques Venter'. Muri 2005, yakinnye muri mini-seri, \"Triangle\" iyobowe na Craid R Baxley. Hanyuma yakoze uruhare rukunzwe 'Pvt. Slug Skinner 'muri 2008 yerekanwe kuri videwo ya \"Starship Troopers 3: Marauder\". Kuva mu 2014, yagaragaye kuri filimi rusange akina na \"Black Sails\" nyuma muri \"Deutschland 86\" (2018). \nMuri 2017, yakinnye muri mini-serie ya \"Madiba\" na firime \"Beyond The River\". Icyakora uruhare rwe rwamamaye cyane muri 2017 rwanyuze muri firime yamafirime yuburengerazuba bwa Afrika yepfo 5 \"Fingers For Marseilles\" hamwe ninshingano 'Officer De Vries'. Muri 2013, yagaragaye kuri film \"Long Walk to Freedom\" ahanganye na Idris Elba. Muri 2018, yakinnye nka 'Ajax', umurwanyi w'Ubugereki muri BBC na Netflix mini-seriyeri \"Troy: Fall Of A City\" (2018).\nAzwiho kandi gukina amakinamico yamateka nka \"Mandela:Long Walk to Freedom\", \"Winnie Mandela\", \"Verraaiers\" and \"Goodbye Bafana\". Usibye uruhare rukomeye, Garth yanagaragaye mu nshingano zo gusetsa, cyane cyane muri seriveri ya \"Hammerhead TV\", irimo abakinnyi bazwi cyane Bevan Cullinan, Brendan Jack na Chris Forrest "}
{"id": "9644", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9644", "title": "Veena Sood", "text": "Veena Sood (yavutse 21 Ugushyingo), ni umuturage wa Kenya ariko uba Canada,akina filime afite Indian Punjabi mubisekuru bye. Veena azwi cyane mubikorwa byikinamico no gusetsa mu mwuga umaze imyaka irenga 3. \nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nYavutse ku ya 21 Ugushyingo i Nairobi, muri Kenya. Se yari umuganga na nyina, umuforomo. Igihe yari afite imyaka 7, bimukiye muri Kanada. Afite imyaka 16, yarangije amashuri yisumbuye nyuma afite imyaka 20, arangiza kaminuza afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse y\u2019ubuhanzi.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMurumuna we Manoj Sood nawe ni umukinnyi, mugihe murumuna we mubyara we Ashwin Sood (mbere yashakanye numuririmbyi uzwi cyane Sarah McLachlan) numucuranzi. Umwishywa we Kama Sood ni umukinnyi wa firime ufite icyicaro i Vancouver, BC. \nYashakanye na J. Johnson ku ya 30 Kanama 2008.\nUmwuga.\nNyuma yo guhabwa impamyabumenyi ihanitse y\u2019ubuhanzi mu bijyanye n\u2019ikinamico rya Drama, Veena yafashije mu gushinga 'Loose Moose Theatre Company' ya Calgary hamwe na shebuja Improv Keith Johnstone, nyuma aza gukorana na Vancouver TheatreSports League. Mu 1991, yatsindiye igihembo cya Jessie kubera ibikorwa by'indashyikirwa kubera uruhare rwe muri Green Thumb Theatre ikina \"2 B Wut UR\". Mu mwaka wa 2006, yahawe igihembo cya Leo kubera Abashyitsi bitwaye neza n\u2019Umugore muri Dramatic Series yatsindiye kubera 'Preety' mu gice cya Godiva cyitwa \"Flipping Switches\". \nYagaragaye muri firime nyinshi; Imagine Entertainment's \"Wedding Season\", \"Welcome to Marwen\" (Robert Zemeckis), Corner Office, \"The X-Files\", \"BattleStar Galactica\", \"Caprica\", \"Stargate\", \"Away\", \"Peacemaker\", \"Lucifer\", \"A Million Little Things,\" na firime nyinshi za tereviziyo. Afite impano mubikorwa bye byo gusetsa, Mu mwaka wa 2006, yakinnye muri filime \"Nina's Heavenly Delights\" aho avugana n\u2019imvugo ya Scottish / Ubuhinde. Hagati aho, yagaragaye kuri tereviziyo y'Abanyamerika, cyane cyane kuri filimi 3 zikurikirana za siyanse yo muri Amerika y'Amajyaruguru: \"X-Files\" mu 1993, \"Stargate SG-1\" mu 1997 na \"Smallville\" mu 2001. Uruhare rwe muri filime \"Touch of Pink\", yakiriwe neza muri Festival ya Sundance.\nAkenshi avugwa nkumukinnyi wikinamico wamamaye wakinnye muri firime zizwi nka \"The Accused\", \"Loyalties\", \"The Women of Marwen\".. Yitwaye neza kandi muri serivise za tereviziyo:: \"Ghost Wars\", \"The Indian Detective\", \"Corner Gas\" \"Animated\" ndetse no murubuga rwa \"Yoga Town\". \nYakiriye icyubahiro cyinshi muri Alliance ya Sinema yo muri Kanada, Televiziyo na Radiyo harimo igihembo cya Lorena Gale Woman Of Distinction Award mu Gushyingo 2017 ndetse n\u2019igihembo cya Sam Payne kubera uruhare mu bantu no kuba inyangamugayo mu 2014. Muri 2019 yahawe igihembo n'ikigega gishinzwe ubuhanzi ku nkombe y'Amajyaruguru (FANS) igihembo cy'umuhanzi w'icyubahiro kubera kumenyekana ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu ikinamico. "}
{"id": "9645", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9645", "title": "Fadia Stella", "text": "Fadia Stella (yavutse 30 Ukuboza 1974), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Kenya. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime Caramel (film) na \"D\u00e9j\u00e0 mort\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 30 Ukuboza 1974 i Nairobi, muri Kenya. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1998, yakinnye bwa mbere muri filime \"D\u00e9j\u00e0 mort\" afite uruhare ruto nka 'inshuti ya Alain'. Nyuma muri 2007, yakinnye cyane muri firime \"Caramel\". Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 20 Gicurasi muri 2007 Iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes mu gice cy\u2019abayobozi ba Fortnight. Nyuma, film yakinnye no muri \"Cam\u00e9ra d'Or\". Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi ikwirakwizwa mu bihugu birenga 40. "}
{"id": "9646", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9646", "title": "Ruth Ndulu Maingi", "text": "Ruth Ndulu Maingi (yavutse 22 Gicurasi 1983), ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Kenya. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"18 hours\",\"The Distant Boat\" na \"Midlife Crisis\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 22 Gicurasi 1983 i Machakos, muri Kenya nk'uwa kane mu muryango hamwe na bavandimwe be batandatu. Yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Kathiani na Township School Primary School i Machakos. Yarangije impamyabumenyi mu bwishingizi nyuma y'amashuri yisumbuye. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga we wo kubyina. Ariko, nyuma yaje kwimukira mu buhanzi kugira ngo akore umwuga maze yinjira mu ishuri ry\u2019imyidagaduro ry\u2019igihugu cya Kenya imyaka ibiri. Muri 2007, yinjiye mu bitaramo bya Kigezi Ndoto. Hanyuma muri 2008, yimukiye mu Buhinde \"akinira\" \"Sauti Kimya\" na Githaa. \nMuri 2011 yakinnye bwa mbere muri firime na \"Marshal yo muri Finlande\". Muri uwo mwaka, yatoranijwe kugira ngo ayobore muri televiziyo \"Lies that Bind\", byatangiye kuri televiziyo. Muri uruhererekane, yakinnye 'Salome', umugore wa gatatu n'urukundo nyarwo rwa Richard Juma, n'umugore wa gatatu. Noneho muri 2013, yakinnye mu ikinamico izwi cyane ya Swahili \"Mama Duka\" afite uruhare runini. Ku ruhare rwe, yaje guhabwa icyubahiro muri 2014 Magic Magic Viewers Choice Awards 2014. \nYagize uruhare runini nk'umutoza muri serivise ya tereviziyo \"The Team\", hamwe na Media Focus kuri Afrika yakozwe na Dreamcatcher. Muri 2014, yakinnye muri firime ebyiri: \"The Next African Film Maker\" na \"Orphan\". Muri 2018, yakinnye bwa mbere muri Nollywood muri firime \"Family First\" iyobowe na Lancelot Imasuen. "}
{"id": "9647", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9647", "title": "Anthony Oseyemi", "text": "Anthony Oluwakayode Oseyemi (yavutse 17 Mutarama 1977), ni umwongereza akaba umukinnyi wa filimi muri Afurika yepfo ukomoka muri Nigeriya. Azwi cyane ku ruhare muri firime na teleserial ', ' and \"Isidingo\".. Usibye gukina, ni n'umwanditsi, umucuranzi na producer. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 17 Mutarama 1977 mu Bwongereza mu muryango wa Nigeriya. Nyuma yaje kwimukira muri Afurika y'Epfo. yakuye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu bijyanye n'ubuhanzi muri kaminuza ya Londere y'Amajyaruguru. Yarangije icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu Bwongereza. Amaze kwiga, yasubiye muri Afurika y'Epfo arahatura. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga wo gukina kuri stage mu rwego rwo gukinisha urubyiruko rwa Lewisham. Hanyuma yakoze ibitaramo byingirakamaro kumugezi murwego rwo kwerekana imurikagurisha mpuzamahanga ryabereye i Londres. Yakinnye kandi muri Tricycle theatre na Albany hamwe na Project Phakama. Hagati aho, yagize uruhare runini mu ikinamico \"Amen Corner\" yakozwe na James Baldwin. Yafatanije kandi gukina \"Performance\" hamwe na Multi media production aho yanagize uruhare. Muri kiriya gihe, yanagize uruhare mu bashyitsi kuri televiziyo nka ITV ya \"The Bill\" (2003) ndetse n'ikinamico ry'ubuvuzi rya \"Holby City\" (2005). \nKuva 2002 kugeza 2003, yagize uruhare rugaruka muri serie \"Is Harry On the Boat?\" no muri 2005, yakinnye umushyitsi mugice cyiswe \"Viva Liberty\" murukurikirane \"rwurwenya Coming Up\" kuri seri ya 4. Nyuma kubona arts impamyabumenyi ye Performing, akora inshingano iya mbere mu filimi nyinshi harimo: \"Jacobs musaraba,\" \"Room 9,\" \"Traffick\" na \"Isidingo.\" Yakinnye kandi muri seri, \"Wild at heart\", \"The runaway\", \"Strike back\", and \"The Book of Negroes\". Muri 2012, yagaragaye mugice cya e.tv ya antologiya ya \"Mzansi Urukundo: Ekasi Style\". \nMuri 2017, yakinnye cyane muri 'Congo' muri filime \"Five Fingers for Marseilles\" muri Afurika yepfo y\u2019iburengerazuba bwa Marseilles iyobowe na Michael Matthews. Nyuma yaje kwerekanwa mu gice cya Discovery mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto 2017 kandi ryishimiwe cyane. Hagati aho, yanakinnye muri comedi y'urukundo \"Hectors Search for Happiness\", hanyuma muri Amerika yerekana amashusho \"Team 8: Behind Enemy Lines '.\" \nUsibye gukina, yanditse kandi ibiganiro bya tereviziyo ya Afrika yepfo \"Tempy Pushas\" kuri SABC 1. Hanyuma yanditse urukurikirane rw'icyumba \"cya 9\" rumuha ibihembo bya Filime na Televiziyo bya Afurika y'Epfo muri 2014 ndetse anaba umunyamuryango wa mbere. "}
{"id": "9649", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9649", "title": "Joy Alphonsus", "text": "Joy Anwulika Alphonsus (yavutse 31 Kanama 1987), uzwi cyane nka Joy Alphonsus, ni umukinnyi wa filimi wavukiye muri Nigeriya. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwa titre muri firime \" yatsindiye ibihembo.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 31 Kanama 1987 muri Nijeriya. Ubu aba muri Otirishiya.\nUmwuga.\nYagaragaye bwa mbere muri sinema muri 2018 hamwe na firime yerekana \" muri Otirishiya iyobowe na Sudabeh Mortezai. Muri filime yakinnye umwanya wa titre. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 30 Kanama 2018 mu rwego rwo kwerekana iserukiramuco rya Filime rya 75 rya Venice. Filime yaje gutumirwa mu gice cya Giornate degli Autori. Filime yerekanwe kandi itangwa mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Mu Gushyingo 2018, Alphonsus yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Seville. Muri Mutarama 2019 yahawe igihembo cya Max Oph\u00fcls muri Saarbr\u00fccken kubera uruhare rwe; muri uwo mwaka, yatsindiye igihembo cyo gukina Diagonale. Muri 2020, yahawe igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza wumugore muri Australiya. "}
{"id": "9650", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9650", "title": "Aubrey Poolo", "text": "Aubrey Poolo (yavutse 30 Ugushyingo 1976), ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Afurika yepfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime ', ' and \"Madiba\".. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 30 Ugushyingo 1976 i Attredgeville, umujyi wa Pretoria, Afurika y'Epfo mu muryango w'abanyapolitiki. Yarezwe na nyirakuru abifashijwemo n'abasaza ba Pan Africanist Congress of Azania (PAC). \nUmwuga.\nAkiri muto cyane, yinjiye muri gahunda ya tereviziyo \"Legae la bana\". Muri 2010, yakinnye bwa mbere muri firime \"\". Filime yerekanwe mu gice cya Un Certain Regard mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2010. Yatoranijwe kandi nk'iyinjira muri Afurika y'Epfo muri Filime nziza y'ururimi rw'amahanga mu bihembo bya 83 hanyuma ikora urutonde rwa nyuma rwatangajwe muri Mutarama 2011. Intsinzi ya firime, yatoranijwe muri televiziyo yo muri Amerika yo muri 2017 ya \"Madiba\" kugira ngo agire uruhare ruto.\nMuri 2017, yakinnye cyane 'Unathi' muri firime yo muri Afrika yepfo yuburengerazuba bwa firime yitwa \"Fingers for Marseilles\" iyobowe na Michael Matthews. Nyuma yaje kwerekanwa mu gice cya Discovery mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto 2017 kandi ryishimiwe cyane. "}
{"id": "9651", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9651", "title": "Mduduzi Mabaso", "text": "Mduduzi Mabaso (yavutse 1 Mata 1976), ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Afrika yepfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime na teleserial \"Blood Diamond\", \"Machine Gun Preacher\" na \"Hotel Rwanda\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1976 i Alexandra, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yamaze imyaka 3 y'ubwana bwe muri Transkei. \nYabanje gushyingiranwa na Veronica Maseko kandi bombi bafite abana babiri. Nyuma yashakanye na mugenzi we bakina filime, Fatima Metsileng. Mabaso yamusanze mugihe cya shampiyona ya kabiri ya \"Zone 14\" muri 2007. Bashyingiwe nyuma yimyaka mike babyara abana babiri. Rero, afite abana bane: Ntokozo, Mpumi, Njabulo na Zolile. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1992, yagaragaye bwa mbere mu ikinamico \"Divide na Rule\". Mu 2004, yatangiye gukina filime muri firime y'Abanyamerika \"Hotel Rwanda\" iyobowe na Terry George. Iyi filime yari ishingiye kuri jenoside yo mu Rwanda, yabaye muri mata 1994. Hanyuma yakinnye mubikorwa byinshi byunganira muri firime, \"Catch a Fire\", \"Heartlines\" and \"Blood Diamond\". Yakinnye kandi mumikino yo kuri stage: \"Cry The Beloved Country\", \"Madiba\u2019s Magic\", \"Behind the Curtains\", \"Shaka Zulu\" and \"Tasha On The Rocks\". \nMuri 2006, yagize uruhare runini muri make \"Sekalli le Meokgo\" iyobowe na Tebho Mahlatsi. Iyi filime yaje guhabwa Filime ngufi nziza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Durban 2007. \nMu 2007, yatumiriwe gukina mu isonga kuri televiziyo yo muri Afurika y'Epfo \"Rhythm City\". Yakinnye nka 'Suffocate Ndlovu'. yakoze premier yayo kuri tereviziyo yubusa kuri televiziyo e.tv ku ya 9 Nyakanga 2007. Uruhererekane rugenda rwerekanwa muri Afrika yepfo hamwe nibisobanuro byiza. Hagati aho, Mabaso yatsindiye igihembo cya Golden Horn igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza mu isabune ya TV hanyuma igihembo cya Golden Horn kikaba umukinnyi mwiza muri Filime yerekana uruhare rwe 'Ndlovu' muri serial."}
{"id": "9652", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9652", "title": "Amr Arafa", "text": "Amr Arafa (yavutse 9 Ukuboza 1962), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Egiputa. Ufatwa nk'umwe mu bakora amafilime meza muri sinema yo mu Misiri, Arafa azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa filime zatsindiye ibihembo bya \"Africano\", \"Zahaymar\", \"Helm Aziz\" na \"Akher Deek Fi Masr\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 9 Ukuboza 1962 i Cairo, mu Misiri. Se Saad Arafa nawe yari umukinnyi wa firime cyane. Saad yavutse ku ya 1 Mata 1923, apfa ku ya 1 Nyakanga 1998. Yakoze firime nyinshi zizwi mu gisekuru cye nka \"Al E'iteraf\", \"Marzooka\" na \"Demoua 'Fi Lailat El Zefaf\". \nMukuru wa Amr, Sherif Arafa nawe ni umukinnyi wa firime uzwi cyane mu Misiri. Yavutse ku ya 25 Ukuboza 1960. Muri firime ze zizwi cyane harimo, \"Birds of Darkness\", \"Mafia\", \"Halim\" na \"Welad El Am\".\nMu 2005, Arafa yimukiye muri Amerika kugira ngo arangize amashuri. Hanyuma yamaze igihe kinini muri Amerika imyaka 11 mumashuri yigihe gito. Yashinze kandi isosiyete ye bwite ishinzwe imicungire y\u2019ubucuruzi, nyuma yizeza ikarita y\u2019icyatsi mu 2015. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga wa sinema mu 1983 akurikiza inzira ya se. Mu 1991, Amr yashinze uruganda rwe bwite, FinalCut Film Production. Kuva icyo gihe, yakoze kandi ayobora firime nyinshi, iyamamaza, serivise za televiziyo na documentaire. \nMu 2001, yayoboye kandi atunganya filime ye ya mbere ya \"Africano\". Iyi filime yafatiwe muri Afurika y'Epfo kandi yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 11 Nyakanga 2001 mu Misiri. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza nyuma ikerekanwa mu bihugu bya Afurika byegeranye ndetse no mu Burayi. Muri Koweti, iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 31 Ukwakira 2001 mu gihe mu Bugereki, yasohotse muri Archive Film Archive ku ya 28 Gashyantare 2012. \nNyuma yo gutsinda filime yumukobwa, yakomeje gukora umwuga wo kuyobora neza muri firime: \"Akher Deek Fi Masr\" (2017), \"Men 30 Sana\" (2016), Urukurikirane rwa TV \"Saraya Abdeen\" (2015), \"Abu El Nil\" (2013), \"Helm Aziz\" (2011), \"Zahaymar\" (2010), \"Ibin el-Qunsul\" (2009), \"El Shabah\" (2008), \"Gaaltany Mogreman\" (2006) na \"El Sefara Fel Emara\" (2004). "}
{"id": "9653", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9653", "title": "Likarion Wainaina", "text": "Likarion Wainaina (yavutse 20 Kanama 1987), ni umuRussiya uturuka Kenya ukina filimi. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa filimi ngufi izwi cyane \"Between the Lines\" na \"Bait\" ndetse na filime ya Kenya yahawe ibihembo byinshi mu mateka, \"Supa Modo\". Usibye gukora firime, ni n'umukinnyi wa sinema, umwanditsi na producer. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 20 Kanama 1987 i Moscou, mu Burusiya ku babyeyi bava Kenya. Igihe yari afite imyaka ine, yimukiye muri Kenya n'umuryango we. Afite mushiki we na barumuna be babiri. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye akora firime hanyuma yimukira mu ikinamico. Yabaye umunyamuryango wa theatre ya Phoenix Players i Nairobi kuva 2007. Nyuma yaje gukora nk'umuyobozi w'ikinamico. Hagati aho, yanakoraga mu nganda za firime nka gaffer na cinematografi. Nkumukinnyi wa cinemateri yakoraga kuri documentaire nyinshi, kwamamaza no kuri televiziyo. Muri 2013, yashinze isosiyete Kibanda Pictures. \nMuri 2013, yakoze firime ngufi \"Between the Lines\" yaje kuba Filime ya mbere yo muri Kenya yerekanwe kuri ecran ya IMAX muri Kenya. Muri make yakiriwe neza hanyuma atorwa muri AMCVA awards 2015 igihembo cyiza cya Media Media Award. Hanyuma yayoboye filime ngufi \"Bait\" muri 2015, yatoranijwe mu iserukiramuco rya Filime Amasaha 48. Ifoto yatsindiye kandi ibihembo byinshi birimo Umuyobozi mwiza, ibihembo byabateze amatwi hamwe nigihembo cyabacamanza. Yatoranijwe kandi nka imwe muri firime ngufi zerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2016. Muri 2018, yakoze firime ngufi, \"My Faith\", yatsindiye Filime Nziza yo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Mashariki. \nMuri 2018, yatangiye gukina filime ya \"Wavamizi\". Hanyuma muri uwo mwaka, yerekanwe bwa mbere muri firime na \"Supa Modo\", yamamaye cyane. Filime yagaragaye bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya 68 rya Berlin. Nyuma yaje gutoranywa nkumunyakenya winjira muri Filime nziza yindimi zamahanga mu bihembo bya 91 bya Academy, ariko ntibyatoranijwe. Hamwe nibi bihembo byose, film ibaye firime yahawe ibihembo byinshi muri Kenya kandi ikunzwe nabanegura. \nYakoraga kuri tereviziyo yamamaza amata ya Pascha na Santa Maria. Yayoboye Filime icyenda za Magic Magic Original Films (AMOF) hamwe na sitcom ya TV yitwa \"Classmates\". Muri 2016, yakoze filimi \"Auntie Boss!\" cyanyuze kuri NTV nyuma y'urupfu rw'umuyobozi wambere Derrick Omfwoko Aswani. Hagati aho, yari umukinnyi wa sinema amashusho yindirimbo za Sarabi Band yakoze 'Tumechoka' na 'Haujali' ndetse na cinematografi mumashusho yindirimbo 'Loneliness' yaririmbwe na Liron. "}
{"id": "9654", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9654", "title": "Hamilton Dhlamini", "text": "Hamilton Dhlamini (wavutse ku ya 15 Ukuboza 1969), rimwe na rimwe nka Hamilton Dlamini, ni umukinnyi wa filimi Afurika y'Epfo, umwanditsi w'amakinamico ndetse n'umukinnyi wa filime. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime na \"teleserial Isithembiso\", \" The King's Messenger\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 15 Ukuboza 1969 mu mudugudu wo mu cyaro i Sebokeng, muri Afurika y'Epfo mu muryango ufite ubukungu bubi. \nYashakanye ninzobere mu mirire, Martha, aho bafitanye abana batatu. Yabanje guhura na Marita muri lift. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga wo gukina mu ntangiriro za 1984 abinyujije mu ikinamico. Yakinnye kandi nk'umucuruzi muri Koreya muri SABC 1 sitcom \"Mzee Wa Two Six\". Mu ntangiriro za 2008, yagize uruhare runini mu biganiro bigufi kuri SABC1, byahujwe \"n\u2019ikinamico ya King\" Shakespeare ya William Shakespeare. Nanone, yakinnye cyane kuri SABC 2 sitcom \"Stokvel\" hamwe n \" Mojo Khumalo '. Muri 2008, yakinnye muri serie \"Ten Bush\" iyobowe na Mncedisi Shabangu. Ku ruhare rwe, nyuma yaje gutsindira igihembo cya Naledi Theatre igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza. Hanyuma muri 2009, yakoranye na William Kentridge hamwe na Handspring Puppet Company kuri \"Woyzeck muri Highveld\". \nMuri 2006, yakinnye muri firime ya Regardt van den Bergh \"Kwizera nk'ibirayi\". Kuri iyi nshuro, yatsindiye ibihembo bya Filime na Televiziyo byo muri Afurika yepfo (Safta) kubera umukinnyi ushyigikiye neza uruhare rwe. Muri 2007, yatsindiye igihembo cya Zahabu kubera Umukinnyi witwaye neza muri Filime. Muri 2018, yakinnye 'Banzi Motaung' muri televiziyo izwi cyane \"Isithembiso\". Muri uwo mwaka, yongeye gutsindira igihembo cya Golden Horn igihembo cyumukinnyi mwiza muri opera yisabune ya TV 'Isithembiso'. \nYashinze kandi uruganda rwe rukora ibicuruzwa, 'Ndlondlo Productions'. "}
{"id": "9655", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9655", "title": "Jacqueline Muhongayire", "text": "Hon. Jacqueline Muhongayire wavutse kuwa 28 kanama 1961 ni umwe mu badepete bahagarariye u Rwanda mu muryango w'ibihugu bya Afurika y'iburazirazuba kuva 2007 kungeza 2012, yagiye atorerwa manda ya kabiri ikaba yari kuzarangira muri 2017 aho yari afite icyicaro i Arusha muri Tanzania kandi ni umunyapolitike mu ntekoshinga amategeko y'u Rwanda\nIbikorwa Ya Koze.\nHon. Jacquline Muhongayire yabaye Minisitiri wa EAC mu gihe kingana n'umwaka umwe kuva muri Nyakanga 2013. Mbere yaho yari imaze igihe kingana n'imyaka itanu ari umwe mu bagize Inteko ishinga Amategeko umutwe wa Afurika y'iburasirazuba (EALA), Mbere yuko yereka muri (EALA) Hon. Jacquline Muhongayire yari amaze imyaka cumi n'ibiri (12) akora nk'umudepite, Kandi yari umwe mu bagore 12 bari mu inteko ishinga amategeko y'inzibacyuho.\nImpamyabumenyi (Amashuri yize).\nHon.Jacqueline Muhongayire ku myaka 60, afite impamyabumenyi ya Kaminuza mu icungamari, kandi afite indi mpamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye no gucunga imishinga, kandi ndetse Hon. Jacqueline Muhongayire Yize ibinganye na politike ndetse n'ububanyi n'amahanga muri kaminuza ya (Free University) y'iburuseli mu Bubiligi.\nUbuzima Bwite.\nHon. Jacqueline Muhongayire arubatse kandi afite abana batatu(3)."}
{"id": "9656", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9656", "title": "Maryam Touzani", "text": "Maryam Touzani (yavutse ku ya 18 Nyakanga 1980), niUmukinnyi wa firime muri Maroc. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime yamamaye cyane \"Adam\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nTouzani yavutse mu 1980 i Tangier. Mu 2003, yabonye impamyabumenyi ya Masters mu Itumanaho n'Itangazamakuru i Londres. Hanyuma yatangiye umwuga we nkumunyamakuru yibanda kuri sinema. \nYashakanye na mugenzi we bakorana amafilime n\u2019igifaransa-Maroc Nabil Ayouch. \nUmwuga.\nUbwa mbere, yakoraga nk'umwanditsi w'amashusho hanyuma akayobora firime ngufi na documentaire. Muri 2011, yakoze \"Quand ils dorment\". Yatsindiye ibihembo 17, harimo nk'abacamanza badasanzwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Huesca, iserukiramuco ryujuje ibisabwa na Oscars. Hanyuma muri 2014, yakoze documentaire ye ya mbere \"Sous Ma Peau Vieille\". Filime yamenyekanye cyane muri Maroc, yaganiriye ku buraya muri Maroc. Intsinzi yiyi documentaire, yayihinduye muri firime yerekana izina \"Much Loved\" byasohotse muri 2015. Filime yayobowe numugabo we Nabil Ayouch mugihe yakoze inyandiko. \nMu mpera za 2015, yakoze \"plage ye ya kabiri Aya va \u00e0 la plage\". Filime irazenguruka mubindi bice byimibereho, kuriyi nshuro yerekeranye no gukoresha abana bato nkabakozi bo murugo. \nMuri 2017, yanditse filime \"Razzia\" hamwe n'umugabo we, umuyobozi Nabil Ayouch. Yakinnye kandi 'Salima' muri filime. Hanyuma, muri 2019, Touzani yayoboye filime ye yambere, \"Adam\". Filime yatoranijwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes mu gice 'Un Certain Regard'. Noneho nyuma muri Festival ya 12 International du Film Francophone de Namur ya Angoul\u00eame. Yatoranijwe nkuwinjiye muri Maroc muri Filime Nziza Mpuzamahanga Mpuzamahanga mu bihembo bya 92 bya Academy, ariko ntiyatowe. \nMuri uwo mwaka, yabaye umunyamuryango wa Academy ya Oscars. "}
{"id": "9657", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9657", "title": "Nashwa Mustafa", "text": "Nashwa Mustafa (yavutse 15 Ukwakira 1968), ni umukinnyi wa firime mu Misiri. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"El-Rehla\", \"El-Farah\" na \"Mahmoud the Egyptian\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 15 Ukwakira 1968 i Cairo, mu Misiri.\nYashakanye na Mohammed Emad, wabaga muri Amerika igihe kirekire. Icyakora yagarutse muri Egiputa gukora ubukwe bw'idini akurikije imigenzo yabo. Bashakanye mu 1993 babyarana abana babiri, Maryam na Abdulrahman. Umuhungu we Abdulrahman yashakanye muri Nyakanga 2019. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga wa tereviziyo mu 1991 akoresheje \"Conscience of Teacher Hikmat\". Yakinnye 'Abeer' muri uru rukurikirane. Hanyuma mu 1999, yatangiye gukina filime na \"El-Farah\". Mu 2001, we yakoze mu ikundwa Misiri Adventure comedy film \"Africano\", aho yagize uruhare 'Zainab'. Iyi filime yasohotse mu ikinamico kandi yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 11 Nyakanga 2001 mu Misiri. \nMuri 2013, yakiriye porogaramu ya tereviziyo \"Cash Tagisi\", yari verisiyo yo mu Misiri yerekana imikino mpuzamahanga yo mu Bwongereza \"Cash Cab (umukino w\u2019Abongereza)\". Gahunda yatambutse kuri MBC Masr. \nMuri 2017, yakoze gahunda ya tereviziyo\"Three in One\". Muri 2018, yakoze ikinamico ya \"Selfie Ma'a el-Mot\", yakinwe bwa mbere kuri Theatre ya Miami. Mbere ikinamico yitwaga \"Selfie Ma'a Sayedna\", ariko nyuma yaje guhinduka kubera inshingano zishami rishinzwe kugenzura itangazamakuru. "}
{"id": "9658", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9658", "title": "Christine Nkurikiyinka", "text": "Ubuzima bwo hambere.\nAmbasaderi Christine NKULIKIYINKA yavutse ku ya 1 Gashyantare 1965. Ni umudipolomate w\u2019u Rwanda akaba n'umukozi wa Leta.\nYize muri kaminuza ya Ludwigshafen y'ubumenyi ngiro kandi abona impamyabumenyi mu bucuruzi.\nKuva mu 1991 kugeza 2005, yakoraga muri Ambasade y'u Rwanda mu Budage, abanza kuba umuyobozi, nyuma aba umunyamabanga wa mbere akaba n'umujyanama wa Ambasade ya kabiri. Amaze gukorera muri Minisiteri y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga i Kigali, yatangiye akazi ko kuba umujyanama n\u2019umusemuzi kugeza mu 2006.\nIndimi avuga: Avuga Ikidage, Icyongereza, i Kinyarwanda, n\u2019Igifaransa.\nIndi mirimo ya Politiki yakoze\n6. Inama y'Abaminisitiri yashyizeho abayobozi bakuru ku buryo bukurikira:\nKuba Ambasaderi:.\n\"NKURIKIYINKA Christine\": Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda i Berlin\nRUGIRA Amandin: Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda i Kinshasa:\nAmbasaderi KAMALI KAREGESA: Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda muri Pretoriya;\nAmbasaderi GASANA Eugene: Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda i New York;\nAmbasaderi NSENGIMANA Joseph: Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda muri Etiyopiya n' Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019Afurika, Addis Abeba;\nNTWARI G\u00e9rard: Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda i Buruseli"}
{"id": "9659", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9659", "title": "Muhongayire Jacqueline", "text": "Muhongayire Jacqueline\nMuhongayire yavutse kuwa 28 Kanama 1961, yari umwe mu badepite bahagarariye u Rwanda mu Muryango w\u2019Ibihugu bya Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba kuva mu mwaka wa 2007 kugeza muri 2012. Yagizwe \"ushinze ibikorwa by\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Ibihugu bya Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba kuri uyu wa kane 11 Nyakanga 2013.\"\nAmashuri.\nMuhongayire afite impamyabumenyi ya kaminuza mu icungamari, ndetse n\u2019impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye no gucunga imishinga.,Yize kandi ibijyanye na politiki n\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga muri Kaminuza ya Free University y\u2019i Buruseli mu Bubiligi.\nUmwuga.\nKuri uyu wa Kane tariki ya 11 Nyakanga 2013, \"Perezida wa Repubulika y\u2019u Rwanda Paul Kagame yagize Muhongayire Jacqueline Minisitiri ushinze ibikorwa by\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Ibihugu bya Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba. Muhongayire asimbuye Mukaruriza Monique wayoboraga iyi Minisiteri kuva yajyaho. Muhongayire yari umwe mu badepite bahagarariye u Rwanda mu Muryango w\u2019Ibihugu bya Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba kuva mu mwaka wa 2007 kugeza muri 2012, aho yaje gutorerwa manda ya kabiri ikaba yari kuzarangira muri 2017 aho yari afite icyicaro Arusha muri Tanzania. yabaye mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y\u2019u Rwanda imyaka igera kuri 12 mbere yo kujya muri Muryango w\u2019Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba, ndetse yagiye anashyirwa mu myanya ikomeye, kuko mu mwaka w\u20191995 yari umwe mu bagore 12 bari mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y\u2019inzibacyuho mu Rwanda. Icyo gihe yari igizwe n\u2019abadepite 70. Muhongayire, mbere y\u2019uko ajya mu Nteko y\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Ibihugu bya Afurika y\u2019Iburasirazuba.yabaye muri Forumu Nyarwanda y\u2019abagore bari mu Inteko Ishinga Amategeko,\""}
{"id": "9660", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9660", "title": "Murangwa Ndangiza Hadidja", "text": "Ubuzima bwo hambere.\nHadija Ndangiza Murangwa (wavutse 1975) numunyapolitiki wu Rwanda. Yari umujyanama ushinzwe ingamba mu kigo cy\u2019abacungamari ba Leta bemewe mu Rwanda (ICPAR). Ni umusenateri mu nteko ishinga amategeko muri Sena y'u Rwanda, yashyizweho nu Rwanda.\nAfite impamyabumenyi ihanitse (Masters) mu by'amategeko mpuzamahanga y\u2019ubucuruzi yakuye muri kaminuza ya McGill (2003) Montreal, muri Kanada\nImwe mu mirimo yakoze.\nHadija yari umunyamuryango wa Kigali International Arbitration Centre (KIAC) afite icyemezo cya Associate of the Chartered Institute of Arbitration (London). \nYari umujyanama ushinzwe ingamba no gutekana k'w inzego mu kigo cy\u2019abacungamari ba Leta bemewe mu Rwanda (ICPAR).\nHadija Ndangiza Murangwa ni impuguke mu by'imisoro, n\u2019umwuga mu by'amategeko, afite uburambe buhagije mu bijyanye n\u2019ubujyanama bw\u2019imisoro haba mu Rwanda ndetse no hanze yarwo aho yagiye agira inama inzego nyinshi zo mu karere nka \"TradeMark\" Afurika y'Iburasirazuba ndetse n'Ubunyamabanga bwa Afurika y'Iburasirazuba.\nNi umunyamuryango w\u2019Ikigo Mpuzamahanga cy\u2019Ubukemurampaka cya Kigali (KIAC). Yakoze akazi k\u2019ubujyanama mu bigo mpuzamahanga nka International Finance Corporation (IFC), Umushinga wo guhuza imisoro muri EAC n\u2019ibindi.\nYagiye mu nama z\u2019ubutegetsi z\u2019ibigo bitandukanye mu Rwanda nko muri Banki Itsura Amajyambere (BRD), Ishami rishinzwe ubuvuzi mu gisikare (MMI) no mu Kigo cy\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe Ubuzima (RBC)"}
{"id": "9661", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9661", "title": "Zethu Dlomo", "text": "Zethu Dlomo-Mphahlele (yavutse ku ya 31 Werurwe 1989), ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Afurika yepfo. Azwi cyane ku ruhare 'Madi' muri televiziyo y'Abanyamerika \"y'Abirabura\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 31 Werurwe 1989 i Lenasia, intara ya Gauteng, Afurika y'Epfo. Nyuma yaje gukurira muri Mmesi Park, Dobsonville, Soweto. Yabanje kwiga mu Ishuri ryigihugu ryubuhanzi. Mu mwaka wa 2010, yarangije Impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu buhanzi bwa Dramatic muri kaminuza ya Witwatersrand. \nMuri Nzeri 2018, yashakanye na mugenzi we umaze igihe kinini bakundana Lebogang Mphahlele. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2012, yagize uruhare runini muri televiziyo ya sci-fi Televiziyo \"Room 9\" kuri SABC 1. Yakinnye nka 'Detective Alice Kunene' murukurikirane. Hagati aho, yagiye agaragara ku bitaramo mpuzamahanga byinshi; nka HBO ikurikirana \"numero ya mbere\" yabategarugori bashinzwe iperereza muri 2008 nka 'Baone Magasane'. Hanyuma muri 2013, yagaragaye muri firime yaje 'Kwihangana' muri firime \"yamashusho Mary na Martha\" iyobowe na Phillip Noyce. \nMuri 2014, yanagaragaye mu gitabo cy\u2019Abanyakanada Broadcasting Corporation (CBC) na BET International (BET) mu \"gitabo cya Negro\" aho yakinnye nk'umushumba utwite 'Sanu'. Muri 2014, yatangiye gukina filime \"muri Lobola ya Fanie Fourie\" nka 'Dinky Magubane'. Ku bw'uruhare rwe, yatsindiye ibihembo bya Filime na Televiziyo byo muri Afurika y'Epfo (SAFTA) muri 2014 ndetse na \\ ibihembo bya Filimi na Televiziyo bya Afurika y'Epfo (SAIFTA) mu mwaka wa 2013 mu cyiciro cya 'Umukinnyi mwiza muri Filime Yerekana'. Nyuma yumwaka, yagize uruhare runini muri saison ya 1 ya \"serivise Ayeye\" nka 'Sibongile'. Muri 2015, yatowe kubera umwanya wa 'Madi' muri saison ya gatatu ya \"Black Sails\", urukurikirane rwa Starz Network. Yakomeje gukina ibice 16 mu bakinnyi basubiramo afite umwanya wo kuba umukobwa wa Bwana Scott, Madi kugeza shampiyona irangiye. Urukurikirane rwamumenyekanye ku rwego mpuzamahanga. \nHagati aho, Dlomo yatsindiye igihembo cya 'Brett Goldin Nziza Nziza' mu bihembo bya Naledi Theatre 2014/2015 kubera abantu benshi bakinnye mu ikinamico \"Wabonye Zandile?\" iyobowe na Khutjo Green. Muri 2017, yimukiye muri Afurika gukina muri telenovelas izwi cyane muri Afurika yepfo \"Isibaya\". Muri serial, yakinnye nka 'Nonhlanzi' bita 'LethuHlatshwayo'. Hanyuma, yagaragaye mumikino ibiri: \"Jero\" iyobowe na Dominique Gumede, hanyuma muri \"Play\" iyobowe na Khutjo Green. \nMu mpera za 2017, yagaragaye muri filime ya mbere yo muri Afurika yepfo y\u2019iburengerazuba yitwa 5\"Fingers for Marseilles\". Yakinnye imico nka 'Lerato'. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere ku isi mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto nyuma ryasohotse muri sinema muri Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika muri Nzeri 2018. Muri 2018, Dlomo yakinnye muri firime ya \"Mandela's Gun\" iyobowe na John Irvin. Yakinnye nka Winnie, muka Nelson Mandela muri film. Filime yari ifite umwanya wa mbere ku isi i New York, Harlem NY. Nyuma muri uwo mwaka, yinjiye mu ikinamico rya Mzansi Magic Ku cyumweru nimugoroba \"Ubushyo\" afite uruhare 'Lwandle'. \nMu mwaka wa 2020, yakoze muri firime ngufi \"Hotel on the Koppies\" yanditse kandi iyobowe na Charlie Vundla. Hanyuma yinjiye hamwe na SABC 1 mini-serie yitwa \"Amazing Grace\" hamwe ninshingano za 'Sarah'. Amaherezo mbere y\u2019icyorezo cya COVID-19, yakinnye 'Lindo Cele' mu rukurikirane rw'ikinamico \"Erased\" telecast binyuze kuri Moja Rukundo. "}
{"id": "9662", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9662", "title": "Fawzi Saleh", "text": "Ahmed Fawzi Saleh (yavutse 1 Mutarama 1981), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Egiputa. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa film izwi cyane \"Poisonous Roses\". Usibye gukora firime, Saleh numuntu uharanira imibereho myiza. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 1 Mutarama 1981 i Alegizandiriya, mu Misiri. Yabonye impamyabumenyi mu mateka yakuye muri kaminuza ya Suez Canal hanyuma abona impamyabumenyi yo gufata amashusho mu Ishuri Rikuru rya Sinema rya Cairo mu 2009. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2008, yabaye umuyobozi wungirije wa Rashid Masharawi. Ku buyobozi bwa Masharawi mu 2010, Saleh yakoze \"filime ye ya mbere ngufi ya Living Skin\" yerekanwe bwa mbere muri 2011. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yerekanwa mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime.\nHamwe nitsinzi yumukobwa mugufi, yahise akora poisonus rose muri 2018. Iyi filime yagaragaye bwa mbere ku Isi mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya 47 Rotterdam mu gice cya Bright Future. Iyi filime yaje guhitamo nkumunyamisiri winjira muri Filime nziza ya International Feature muri 92 Awards Awards, ariko ntiyatowe. \nYatanze kandi nk'umukorerabushake mu bikorwa byinshi by\u2019imiryango iharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu mu Misiri. "}
{"id": "9663", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9663", "title": "Nadim Tabet", "text": "Nadim Tabet (wavutse 1982), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Libani. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime izwi cyane \"Imwe muriyi minsi\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1982 i Beirut, muri Libani. \nUmwuga.\nKuva akiri muto, yakundaga gukora firime. Yatangiye gufata amashusho hamwe nibihimbano bibiri bigufi muri videwo, iyambere \"Caravane\" muri 1997 hanyuma \"Kodak colr\" muri 1998. Nyuma yimukiye mu Bufaransa mu 1999 kugira ngo akomeze amasomo ye mu bumenyi bwa muntu na sinema muri kaminuza ya Sorbonne. Hagati aho, ayobora ikabutura \"Histoires extraordinaires du cin\u00e9matographe\" mu 1999. Yakomeje kuyobora ikabutura mu myaka yakurikiyeho, nka \"Martine et Alia\" mu 2001, \"Pass\u00e9 pr\u00e9sent futur\" mu 2002, na \"L'Arche de No\u00e9\" mu 2003. Muri 2005, yakoze \"Violante\" ngufi, na \"Le Liban en automne\" muri 2006. Bombi bakiriye neza kandi Tabet yakoze ubutaha bwa\"Jeunes et innocents\" muri 2007. Hanyuma muri 2008 yakoze \"Spring 75\" na \"Souvenirs d'un \u00e9t\u00e9\" muri 2011. Muri 2014, yakoze \"Et\u00e9 91\" ngufi.\nMu 2001, Tabet yashinze iserukiramuco rya sinema ryo muri Libani. Kuva mu 2011, yabaye umwe mu bagize komite ishinzwe gutoranya iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Oberhausen. Amaze gukora filimi ngufi yamamaye cyane, yayoboye filime ye yambere yumukobwa\"One of These Days\" muri 2017. nyuma yaje gutsindira igihembo cyiza cyambere cyambere muri Festival ya 22 yabarabu. Muri 2019, yayoboye urukurikirane rwa \"Faraya\" hamwe nundi mukinnyi wa firime wo muri Libani Mounia Akl. "}
{"id": "9664", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9664", "title": "Nadia Al-Iraqia", "text": "Nadia Al-Iraki (yavutse Faten Fathy ; 3 Kanama 1963 \u2013 16 Gicurasi 2021) yari umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Iraki. Yagize uruhare muri firime \"Africano\", \"Can't Complain\", \"Theyab Al-Lail\" na \"Dokkan Shehata\". \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga wo gukina umwuga mu 1997 hamwe na televiziyo ya \"Theab Al-Lail\". Urukurikirane rwamenyekanye cyane kuri tereviziyo aho yakinnye nka 'Fatima'. \"Intsinzi yuruhererekane\", yakiriye serivise nyinshi za tereviziyo mumyaka yakurikiyeho, harimo: Zeezinya mu 2000, \"Leqaa ala al hawaa\" muri 2004 na serial izwi cyane \"Raya wa Sekina\" muri 2005. Hagati aho, yari yakoze mu Misiri Adventure comedy film \"Africano\" tuyoborwa Amuri Arafa. Yagize uruhare runini nka 'Customer' muri film. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yerekanwa mu birori byinshi bya firime. \nHanyuma Nadia yakinnye muri \"serivise za tereviziyo: Al-andaleeb hikayt shaab\" muri 2006 na documentaire \"Ntishobora Kurega\" muri 2007. Muri uwo mwaka wa 2007, yatumiriwe gukina filime yerekana \"Keda Reda\", ibaye umukinnyi wa mbere wa sinema uzwi cyane. Nyuma yuruhererekane rwa tereviziyo nyinshi, yamenyekanye cyane kuri televiziyo ya \"Selssal El Dam\" na \"Al Qaserat 2013\".\nYapfuye ku ya 16 Gicurasi 2021, nyuma yo kwandura COVID-19. "}
{"id": "9665", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9665", "title": "Georges Schoucair", "text": "Georges Schoucair numu producer ukomeye wa Libani. Schoucair ufatwa nkumwe mubatunganya amafilime atanga ikizere muri sinema yo mu burasirazuba bwo hagati, yakoze firime nyinshi zamamaye kandi zatsindiye ibihembo. Yagize uruhare runini mu iterambere rya sinema muri Libani ndetse na sinema nyafurika. \nNiwe washinze inzu n\u2019umusaruro we bwite, 'Abbout Productions' yashinzwe mu 2003. Icyakora, isosiyete yashinzwe mu 1998 na Joana Hadjithoma na Khalil Joreige. Uretse ibyo, ni na we washinze iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Maskoon Fantastic i Beirut, rifatwa nk'ibirori bya mbere bya firime ya sinema mu bihugu by'Abarabu. \nUmwuga.\nNkumuproducer, yakoranye nabayobozi batsindiye ibihembo barimo: Kaouther Ben Hania, Vatche Boulghourjian, Jean Luc Godard, Alain Gomis, Joana Hadjithomas, Annemarie Jacir, Khalil Joreige, Mohammad Malas, Lucrecia Martel, Shirin Neshat, Asli Ozge, Rafi Pitts, Bill Plympton, Ghassan Salhab, Elia Suleiman na Apichatpong Weerasethakul. \nUsibye Abbout Productions, Schoucair yashinze isosiyete ikora firime ya indie 'MC Distribution'. Kuva mu 2008, ni na visi-perezida wa sinema yonyine y\u2019ubuhanzi i Beirut: 'Metropolis'. Afatwa nkumuntu washinze isosiyete ikora firime yindie 'Schortcut Films' mumwaka wa 2016 aho yakoraga nka producer muri firime nyinshi zizwi \"F\u00e9licit\u00e9\" (2017), \"Wajib\" (2017), \"Rafiki\" (2018), \"Beauty &amp; The Dogs\" (2018), \"It Must Be Heaven\" (2019) and \"A Son\" (2019 "}
{"id": "9666", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9666", "title": "Sudabeh Mortezai", "text": "Sudabeh Mortezai (yavutse 1968), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Otirishiya wavukiye muri Iran kandi aaba na producer. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime zizwi cyane \"Macondo\" na \"Joy\" zatsindiye ibihembo mpuzamahanga mu birori bya firime. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1968 i Ludwigsburg, mu Budage ku babyeyi ba Irani. Yabayeho mu bwana bwe n'ubuto muri Vienne na Tehran. \nUmwuga.\nYimukiye i Vienne yiga ikinamico, firime n'itangazamakuru. Nyuma yize filime muri kaminuza ya Californiya, Los Angeles (UCLA) i Los Angeles. Muri kiriya gihe, yakoze firime zitandukanye kandi ngufi zirimo documentaire \"Children of the Prophet\" 2006. Yibanze ku mihango y'icyunamo ya Irani kuri Imamu Hossein, umwuzukuru w'Intumwa Mohammad. \nMuri 2009, yakoze \"Im Bazar der Gender\" isobanura umuco wo gushyingirwa by'agateganyo muri Islamu y'Abashiya. Nyuma muri 2014, yakoze filime ye ya mbere ya \"Macondo\". Filime nigishushanyo cyumuhungu wimpunzi ya Chechen. Yatumiwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya 64 rya Berlin (amarushanwa ya Berlinale), ahatanira igihembo cya Golden Bear Award.\nNyuma yo gutsinda kwa filime, yakoze filime ye ya kabiri \"yishimye\" muri 2018. Irazenguruka inkuru yumugore wo muri Nigeriya murugendo rwo gushaka umudendezo. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Filime yatumiwe mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya 75 rya Venice mu gice cya Giornate degli Autori. Hanyuma yatsindiye Europa Cinemas Label nka Filime nziza yu Burayi mu gice cya Giornate degli Autori mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Venice. Hagati aho, yashinze isosiyete ikora firime 'FreibeuterFilm'. Iyi filime kandi yatsindiye igihembo cya mbere cya Hearst Film igihembo cyumuyobozi mwiza wumugore. \nMu Kwakira 2018, filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Filime Nziza muri BFI London Festival Festival. Mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya Chicago rya 54, filime yatsindiye igihembo cyihariye cya Jury cya Silver Hugo. Hanyuma mu Kuboza 2018, filime yakiriye Goldeb Star ya filime nziza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Marrakech "}
{"id": "9667", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9667", "title": "Samba Gadjigo", "text": "Samba Gadjigo (yavutse 12 Ukwakira 1954), ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Senegal kandi akaba umwanditsi wa filimi. Azwi cyane nkumuyobozi wa firime \"Sembene izwi cyane!\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 12 Ukwakira 1954 i Kidira, muri Senegali. Yarangije muri kaminuza ya Dakar na Ecole Normale Sup\u00e9rieure de Dakar. Hanyuma yabonye impamyabumenyi ya PhD muri kaminuza ya Illinois muri Urbana-Champaign. Kugeza ubu akora nka Porofeseri w\u2019igifaransa muri Mount Holyoke College, Massachusetts kuva 1986. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2015, yayoboye filime \"Sembene!\" hamwe na Jason Silverman. Iyi filime yari ishingiye ku buzima bw'umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Senegal Ousmane Semb\u00e8ne bakunze kwita se wa sinema nyafurika. Filime yerekanwe bwa mbere kumugaragaro muri Sundance Film Festival muri Utah. Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi ndetse no gushimirwa mubirori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Iyi filime yabaye uwanyuma kuri Kamera d'Or mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes ndetse yegukana igihembo cya Jury mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Luxor African 2016. Yatsindiye kandi Prix de la Jeuness muri Escales Documentaires de Libreville 2017 hanyuma yegukana igihembo cya Paul Robeson mu iserukiramuco rya Filime ryabirabura rya Newark 2016. Filime yaje kubona igihembo cyinyandiko nziza muri Emerge Film Festival. \nMuri 2016, Gadjigo yahawe igihembo cy'ishami rya Bourse. Usibye gukora firime, ni n'umwanditsi wamamaye kandi yagize uruhare \"muri Sinema nyafurika nuburenganzira bwa muntu\", \"ubushakashatsi mubuvanganzo nyafurika\", \"nintererano mubushakashatsi bwabirabura\". Muri Werurwe 2016, yahawe igihembo cya Meribeth E. Cameron Igihembo cya Bourse yo muri Mount Holyoke College. "}
{"id": "9668", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9668", "title": "Cecilia Zoppelletto", "text": "Cecilia Zoppelletto, ni umuyobozi w'amafilime (filmmaker) ukomoka mu gihugu cya Itali (Italy). Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa dokimanteri (documentaire) yitwa '\"La Belle At The Movies\"'. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye kandi akurira i Padua, mu Butaliyani. Kuva mu 1994, yabereye i Londire (London). Afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga ya PhD muri kaminuza ya 'Westminster'. \nUmwuga.\nNk'ubushakashatsi bwe, yakoze 'Decolonisation' akoresheje 'Amajyambere ya Filime': Kubaka no kongera kubaka Umwuka wa 'Zairian' kuri Film. Yanakoze ubushakashatsi ku bubiko bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo ndetse n\u2019ishusho ya firime y\u2019igihugu nyuma y\u2019ubwigenge. \nYakoze nka producer wamakuru muri societe yigihugu yo mubutaliyani RAI. Hagati aho, yakoraga nka televiziyo akaba n'umwanditsi kuri neti yo mu Butaliyani 'Antenna Tre Nordest'. Muri 2015, yakoze documentaire \"La Belle Kuri Sinema\". Iyi filime yamenyekanye cyane kandi yerekanwa muri Amerika, Ububiligi, Ubwongereza na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Noneho muri 2017, yakoze firime ngufi \"Falling\". "}
{"id": "9669", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9669", "title": "Francois L. Woukoache", "text": "Francois L. Woukoache (yavutse ku ya 16 Gashyantare 1966), ni umukinnyi wa firime wa Kameruni uba mu bubiligi akaba n'umwanditsi. Yakoze firime zigera kuri makumyabiri hamwe nuruhererekane rwinkuru zabana ndetse na gahunda za tereviziyo.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 16 Gashyantare 1966 i Yaound\u00e9 mu muryango ufite barumuna icyenda. Nyuma y\u2019amasomo yisumbuye, yakurikiranye amasomo yo mu rwego rwo hejuru. Yize mu kigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe ubuhanzi i Buruseli (INSAS). \nUmwuga.\nMu 1991, yakoze filime ye ya mbere yitwa \"Melina\". Mu 1995, yakoze documentaire \"Asientos\" ivuga ku bucuruzi bwabacakara. Filime yerekanwe mu birori byinshi bya firime kandi irashimwa cyane. Hanyuma yakoze indi filimi ngufi \"The smoke in the eyes\" 1997 i Buruseli. Mu 1998, Woukoache yayoboye \"Fragments de vie\". Iyi filime itavugwaho rumwe yasobanuye ibyiciro bya Afurika yo mu mijyi no mu rusaku, iy'utubari na clubs z'umujyi muri Afurika ya Ekwatoriya. Muri uwo mwaka, yayoboye filime \"We no longer died\" yari ishingiye ku buzima nyuma ya jenoside yabaye mu Rwanda. \nKuva mu 1998, yagiye mu bikorwa byo guhugura no gutunganya amajwi n'amashusho mu Rwanda. Nyuma yaje kuba umwarimu mu Ishuri ry\u2019itangazamakuru n\u2019itumanaho muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. Muri kiriya gihe, yagenzuye ikorwa rya firime ebyiri za mbere zu Rw0anda mu 1999: \"Kiberinka\" na \"Entre deux mondes\". Muri 2000, yakoze documentaire \"Nous ne Sommes Plus Morts\". Filime yatsindiye Jury Mention mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Zanzibar. \nHagati ya 2003 na 2005, yari umuhuzabikorwa wumushinga \"Iguku n'Urumuri watangijwe nkintangiriro\" ya sinema mumashuri yu Rwanda. Muri 2009, Woukoache yayoboye film ngufi \"The lady of the 4 th floor.\" Hagati ya 2013 na 2016, yahujije umushinga \"Faces of Life\". Binyuze muri uwo mushinga, yahuguye abagore bo mu Rwanda gukoresha ubuhanzi bugaragara nk'uburyo bwo kuvuga no guhindura imibereho. Nyuma yaje kuyobora film, \"Ntarabana\". "}
{"id": "9670", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9670", "title": "Eric Kabongo", "text": "Eric Kabongo Ilunga (yavutse ku ya 21 Gicurasi 1984), ni umukinnyi wa filimi mububiligi n\u2019umuririmbyi ukomoka muri Kongo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime Welcome toGerany, \"Sawah\" and \"Third Wedding\".. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 21 Gicurasi 1984 i Kinshasa, muri Zayire (muri iki gihe Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo). Afite imyaka 13, yaje mu Bubiligi bitewe nuko nyina yashakanye n\u2019umubiligi maze atura mu mudugudu wa Flemish mu nkengero z\u2019Ububiligi. Kuri ubu atuye i Waregem, muri West Flanders. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga we nk'umuraperi ufite izina rya stage 'Krazy-E'. Muri 2013, yabaye umukinnyi ufite uruhare rutemewe nkumugenzi wa gari ya moshi muri film ya \"The Fifth Estate\". Mu 2014, Kabongo yagaragaye muri \"D5R\" hanyuma bahabwa uruhare mu kunenga yitirirwa Bubiligi film \"Black\". \nMu mwaka wa 2016, yatumiwe mu Budage gukina nk'impunzi 'Diallo' muri filime isetsa welcome to Germany. Hamwe na firime, yabaye umukinnyi ukomeye mu Burayi. Muri 2019, yakinnye muri filime \"Sawah\" aho yatsindiye igihembo cya Golden Palm igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya film rya Queen Palm. Muri uwo mwaka, yakinnye muri seriveri \"Rivallen und Rebellen\". \nMuri 2014, documentaire What about Eric? yarekuwe bijyanye n'ubuzima bwe. Nyuma documentaire yatsindiye ibihembo bya Best documentaire nziza. Hanyuma documentaire \"Ensor\" yatsindiye igihembo cya Best Flemish documentaire, nyuma yaje kwegurirwa Kabongo nabayobozi Lennart Stuyck na Ruben Vermeersch. "}
{"id": "9671", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9671", "title": "Aboubakr Bensaihi", "text": "Aboubakr Bensaihi (wavutse 1996), ni umukinnyi wa firime mububiligi akaba n'umuririmbyi ukomoka muri Maroc. Azwi cyane nka Marwan muri filimi yasohotse 2015 film \"Black\". \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nYavutse mu 1996 akurira muri Molenbeek. Yarangije amashuri mUbuholandi mu kigo cya Imelda. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2014, Bensaihi yahiswemo muri film \"Black\" na abayobozi Adil El Arbi na Bilall Fallah. Hanyuma yakinnye imbere yumugabo 'Marwan' muri film \"the black\". Filime yamamaye cyane kandi yerekanwa mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Nyuma yaje gutorwa muri Ensor Best Debut Award muri Ostend Film Festival mu 2016 ndetse nigihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza muri Magritte Awards muri 2017. Iyo filime igenda neza, yinjiye mu ikinamico \"yitwa Thuis\" yitwa 'Junes Bakkal' muri 2017. Muri 2018, yinjiye muri televiziyo \"Daidj\". \nUsibye gukina, Bensaihi n'umuririmbyi n'umuraperi. We ubwe yaririmbye indirimbo \"Do You Hear Me\". Yanditse kandi indirimbo munsi yizina rya 'Bakr'. Indirimbo ye ya mbere yari \"Sac \u00e0 dos\" yakurikiwe \"nindirimbo nziza Elle a\". Hanyuma yasohoye indirimbo \"Tomber dans ton love\". Muri 2016, Bensaihi yabaye umwe mu bahembwa 10 ba Molenbekenaar y'umwaka. "}
{"id": "9672", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9672", "title": "Martha Canga Antonio", "text": "Marita Canga Antonio (yavutse 1995), ni umukinnyi wa firime mu Bubiligi akomoka muri Angola. Azwi cyane muri film yamamaye cyane \"Umukara\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1995 i Mons mu Bubiligi ku babyeyi bava Angola. Yakuriye i Li\u00e8ge, ubu akaba atuye i Mechelen. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2014, yize gucunga itumanaho muri Erasmushogeschool, Bruxelles. Muri icyo gihe, yari Bahiswemo gukina nka 'Mavela' mu gatsiko thriller film \"Black\" iyoborwa na Adil El Arbi na Bilall Fallah. Yatoranijwe kuranga mubakandida 450. Mbere ya firime, ntabwo yari afite uburambe bwo gukina. Icyakora yakinnye uruhare rwamenyekanye cyane kandi rurashimwa cyane. Filime yaje kwerekanwa iminsi mikuru mpuzamahanga ya firime. Mu Gushyingo 2015, Martha yagizwe umukinnyi wa filime mwiza mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Tallinn Black Nights. Ukuboza k'umwaka umwe, yatorewe kuba Shooting Star mu Burayi muri 7 Magritte Awards kubera film imwe. \nUsibye gukina, ni n'umuririmbyi wamamaye watangiye umwuga nkumunyamuryango \"witsinda\" ryumuziki Soul'Art. Muri 2018, yatangiye umwuga we wo kuririmba wenyine ku izina rya 'Martha Da'ro' maze asohora indirimbo imwe ya \"Summer Blues\". "}
{"id": "9673", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9673", "title": "Mukayijore Suzanne", "text": "Mukayijore Suzanne ni umugore akaa umunyarwandakazi uba muri politike, kuri ubu Suzanne ni Umudepite watowe kuba mu nteko ishinga amategeko mu Umutwe w\u2019Abadepite ndetse aza no gutorwa n'abadepite bagenzibe guhagararira u Rwanda mu nteko Ishinga Amategeko Nyafurika (PAP).Suzanne akaba yari na Visi Perezida w' Ishyaka ry\u2019Ukwishyira Ukizana (PL) mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyaruguru y'u Rwanda. \nAmasomo.\nSuzanne yabonye impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu icyungamari n'icungamutungo. Mukayijore Suzanne mbere yo kuza mu inteko inshinga amategeko yari asanzwe akora muri banki aho yari umuyobizi mukuru. \nUmwuga.\nSuzanne yatorewe kuba Umudepite mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko Nyafurika (PAP) tariki ya 23 Nyakanga 2020, yasimbuye Nyirarukundo Ignatienne wahinduriwe imirimo akaba ari Umunyamabanga wa Leta ushinzwe imibereho mwiza y\u2019abaturage muri Minisitere y\u2019Ubutegetsi bw\u2019Igihugu. Inteko Ishinga Amategeko Nyafurika (PAP) ikaba yarashyizweho mu kugira ngo igire uruhare mu iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu n\u2019imibanire y\u2019abatuye ku mugabane wa Afurika. ikaba ifite icyicaro i Midrand muri Afurika y\u2019Epfo, ikaba igizwe n\u2019abadepite batorwa mu Nteko zishinga amatego mu bihugu bigize umugabane wa Afurika."}
{"id": "9674", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9674", "title": "Ndangiza Madina", "text": "Ndangiza Madina ni umugore akaba Umunyarwandakazi uba muri politike, yahoze ari umunyamabanga mukuru w'ishyaka Ideal Democratic Party (P.D.I) rikaba riri no mu bumwe bw'amashaka mu Rwanda, ndetse akaba abarizwa mu inteko ishinga amategeko yu Rwanda mu mutwe w'abadepite, Ndangiza Madina ahagarariye abagore mu inteko. \nAmasomo.\nNdangiza Madina yabonye impamyabumenyi y\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza yakuye muri Kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda mu mategeko. Ndangiza Madina kandi yatorewe kuba Visi Perezida wa Komisiyo y'abadepite bagize komisiyo y\u2019uburezi, ikoranabuhanga, umuco n\u2019urubyikruko mu inteko inshinga amategeko.\nAkazi.\nNdangiza Madina yagiye akora akazi gatandukanye harimo:"}
{"id": "9675", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9675", "title": "Napomuceno's Will", "text": "Napomuceno's Will ni filime yerekana ikinamico ya Cape Verdean yasohotse 2017 iyobowe na Francisco Manso, ishingiye ku gitabo cyitwa \"The Last Will and Testament of Senhor da Silva Ara\u00fajo\" cyanditswe na Germano Almeida. \nIcegeranyo.\nNapumoceno da Silva Ara\u00fajo, umucuruzi ukize wa Cape Verde, yarapfuye kandi atunguranye ategura mwishywa we, asiga umutungo we ku mukobwa utemewe. Amusigira kandi icyegeranyo cya kaseti aho amubwira amateka y'ubuzima bwe, uko yavuye mubukene agera ku ntsinzi no mu rwego, ndetse n'abagore benshi yakundaga mu nzira. \nKurekura.\n\"Napomuceno's Will bwerekanwe bwa\" mbere muri Festival de Gramado, Burezili muri Kanama 1997. \nYakiriye ibitekerezo byiza, \"Variety\" ishima Chico D\u00edaz byumwihariko. Kuri \"Chronicle ya San Francisco\", Mick LaSalle yanditse ko \"[Araujo ya Xavier] ari clown, ariko imwe ifite imbaraga kandi ifite igitekerezo kimwe kuburyo byumvikana impamvu akurura abagore kandi agatsinda mubucuruzi. Hamwe nubwitonzi bwibutsa Roberto Benigni, akoresha ijwi rye nkigikoresho gisetsa gitangaje, akazamuka akagera kumatwi mugihe cyo kwiyemera no gukabya. Muri icyo gihe, Xavier aduha ibihe byo kwambika ubusa umutima, igihe Araujo yiyitiriye, kandi tubona mu bubabare bwe. \" \nMuri \"Filime Nyafurika Yitwa Lusophone\", Paulo de Medeiros yinubiye ko iyi filime yirengagije ibivugwa mu bukoloni mu gitabo cy\u2019umwimerere, yerekana ko hamwe n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019Abanyaportigale hamwe n\u2019abayireba, iyi filime ikubiyemo ibitekerezo bya \"Lusotropicaliste\" cyangwa igamije kwibagirwa ubukoloni. "}
{"id": "9676", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9676", "title": "La Negrada", "text": "La Negrada izwi mpuzamahanga nka Black Mexicans, yasohotse 2018 ni filime yo muri Mexique iyoborwa na Jorge P\u00e9rez Solano afatanyije na C\u00e9sar Guti\u00e9rrez Miranda na Tirisia Cine. Niyo filime ya mbere yo muri Mexique yimpimbano hamwe hagati ya Africa na Mexico bose bakinnye muri Mexico. Filime yafatiwe mu mijyi mito no muri Costa Chica, Oaxaca. \nIyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 18 Kanama 2018 muri Amerika. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza nyuma iza gutsindira igihembo cyiza cya Sinema mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Guadalajara 2018. "}
{"id": "9677", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9677", "title": "Bukky Abaniwonda", "text": "Bukky Abaniwonda, uzwi cyane ku izina rya Bukky Wonder, ni umukinnyi wa filime ukomoka muri Kanada na Nigeriya. Azwi cyane muri firime \"Bridges\",\"Awkward Things About Losing Weight\" and \"The Carperdian\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye muri Kanada nkuwa kabiri mu muryango. Yabayeho mu bwana bwe i Abuja. Afite barumuna be na bashiki be babiri. Yize Command Day Secondary School, Abuja kugirango yige amashuri yisumbuye. Hanyuma yarangije icyiciro cya comptabilite muri kaminuza ya Bowen. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2017, yakinnye cyane muri film \"Bridges\" iyobowe na Rogers Ofime. Hanyuma yakinnye muri film \"The End\". \nMu 2020, Abaniwonda yayoboye filimi ya mbere hagati ya Africa na Canada \"African Family\" yakorewe muri black production. yafatiwe amashusho i Calgary. Muri aba bakinnyi harimo abakinnyi b'Abanyafrika baturutse muri Nijeriya, Congo na Angola. "}
{"id": "9678", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9678", "title": "Germaine Mukabalisa", "text": "Germaine Mukabalisa yavutse 1988,ni umudepite uhagarariye abagore mu Nteko Ishinga Amategeko y'u Rwanda yatowe muntara yamajyepfo y'u Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nGermaine yari umujyanama mu byamategeko muri World vision guhera 2018 kugeza atorewe kuba umudepite. yabaye umujyanama mu byamategeko muri Miisiteri y'ubucuruzi n'Inganda, yahoze anigisha amategeko muri, akaba nanone yari umwe mu bagize inama y'ubutegetsi y'ikigo cy'ubushakashatsi n'iterambere ry'inganda (NIRDA). Germaine asimbuye Nyirarukundo Ignatienne wagizwe Umunyamabanga wa Leta muri Minisiteri y Ubutegetsi bw Igihugu, ushinzwe Imibereho Myiza y Abaturage."}
{"id": "9679", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9679", "title": "Fumani Shilubana", "text": "Fumani N Shilubana (yavutse 22 Werurwe 1980), ni umukinnyi wa firime muri Afrika yepfo umuyobozi na producer. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime zizwi cyane Zama Zama, Father`s War na \"Kalushi: Inkuru ya Salomo Mahlangu\". Uwashinze PadiriFigureZA, Fondasiyo ishaka kwinjiza umuntu mu muryango na Chairman wa Midrand Heat Basketball Club.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nYavutse ku ya 22 Werurwe 1980 mu mudugudu muto Shiluvana, Tzaneen, Limpopo, Afurika y'Epfo. Se Clifford Shilubana yari umuyobozi w'ishuri mu ishuri ribanza rya Mlungisi na nyina Nsatimuni Mundhlovu akaba umunya Mozambike / Afurika y'Epfo yari umuforomo mu Ibitaro bya Shiluvana. Afite bashiki be babiri: Labani Mgimeti na Kumani Shilubana na musaza we Tebogo Maake. \nUbuzima bwite.\nKu ya 31 Ukwakira 2016 mu Mudugudu wa Joppie yishyuye lovola ku mugore we ubu naho muri 2017 Ukuboza 22 we na Nomathemba Olivia Ngobeni bakoze ibirori byihariye kuri African Pride Mount Grace i Magaliesburg. Ni se w'umuhungu umwe, Vulani n'umukobwa umwe Nganakati-Nsuku.\nShilubana yize mu 1998 muri Mathews Phosa College Mpumalanga, yiyandikisha muri kaminuza ya Venda mu 1999 yiga Impamyabumenyi ya siyansi (BSc) mu buhinzi atarangije maze mu 2000 yiyandikisha mu by'inganda muri kaminuza ya Tekinoroji ya Tshwane. ntibyakunze kandi igihe yashakaga gukurikirana imideli mu Butaliyani, na we ntiyagiye nyuma yo kwiyandikisha muri gahunda yo kuvuga no gukina amakinamico muri Leta ya Afurika y'Epfo abifashijwemo n'umwanditsi Mpumelelo Paul Grootboom.\nYatangiye gukina Basketball afite imyaka 15, yamenye iby'umukino nyuma yuko nyina amuguriye igitabo cy\u2019amategeko ya Basketball, ku myaka 19 yitabira ibizamini bya Basketball muri kaminuza ya Limpopo maze atoranyirizwa guhagararira Intara ya Limpopo mu ikipe nkuru y\u2019abagabo muri SASSU imikino mu marushanwa ngarukamwaka muri Cape Town.\nUmwuga.\nAzwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe nka producer numukinnyi muri telenovela \"Giyani: Igihugu cyamaraso\". Muri uruhererekane, yakinnye 'Vukosi Moyo'. Nyuma yo gusoza urukurikirane, yagaragaye muri serie \"Mafanato yakoze\" kandi ayobora. \nYakinnye kandi muri serivise zizwi cyane: \"Soul City\", \"Generations\" and \"Isidingo\". Mubisanzwe avuga muri Xitsonga kuri tereviziyo, arirwo rurimi rwe kavukire. Yakinnye uruhare ruzwi cyane 'Detective Dabula' ku isabune ya SABC3 \"Isidingo\".\nShilubana yerekanwe bwa mbere na Khomelela, film yakoze kandi bafatanya kwandika nayo yakoze. Uyu mushinga wari mubutumwa bwe bwo kubona film za Xitsonga kumurongo munini. Yakusanyije amafaranga 40 000 ya firime kandi yarashe 95% ya firime ahitwa Hlovani River Lodge naho ayandi mumujyi wa Nkowankowa. Filime yerekanwe kuri Hall Hall ya Nkowankowa. \nShitshembiso Mabasa, Fumani N. Shilubana, hamwe naTeleti Khosa, batunze Xiculu Multimedia, isosiyete ikora itangazamakuru ryirabura 100% yashinzwe mu Kuboza 2019. Igikorwa cyibanze cya Xiculu nugukora no gukwirakwiza ibirimo Xitsonga kandi basohoye urukurikirane rwa Mafanato kuri Showmax, KubaTsongaInSA. doccie seriveri yerekana ibyasangiwe na Vatsonga muri republika ya afurika yepfo, Minkoka Mimbirhi,Umunsi hamwe na Tsonga Legend kuvuga show, Nyambondzwani filimi ngufi, Sivara series na COVID-19 Xitsonga rushinge mu bufatanyeXitsonga.org bose mu 2020.\nIbihembo.\nShilubana yatowe mu 2005 mu bihembo bya Naledi Theatre Awards kubera uruhare rwiza rushyigikirana \"Inkuru zo mu mujyi\". Ku cyumweru tariki ya 19 Gashyantare 2006, umuhango wuzuye inyenyeri wabereye muri kaminuza ya Johannesburg.\nMu mwaka wa 2010 yahawe Igihembo cya Mama Beka kubera kuzamura ubwoko bwe n\u2019ururimi Xitsonga ku bitangazamakuru bisanzwe. \nYatorewe igihembo cye cya mbere cyo gukina igihembo cyumukinnyi mwiza wumuhanga wurukundo muri Ibihembo bya FAME 2016. "}
{"id": "9680", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9680", "title": "Majdi Smiri", "text": "Majdi Smiri (wavutse 1983), akunze kwitwa Maguy, ni umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Tuniziya. Yatangiye umwuga we nk'umuraperi, bidatinze Smiri yabaye umuyobozi ukunzwe wa filimi zizwi cyane za televiziyo \"Talaa Wala Habet\", \"Lilet Chak\" na \"Case 460\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1983 i Tuniziya, muri Tuniziya. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga we nk'umuraperi ku izina rya Maguy. Yanditse, arahimba nyuma akora Njoum Ellil muri duet hamwe numuririmbyi Ines Chkimi. Mu 2006, yagaragaye bwa mbere muri sinema hamwe na firime \"Making of\" iyobowe na Nouri Bouzid. Nyuma yaje kubona impamyabumenyi mu Ishuri ry'Ubuhanzi na Sinema muri Tuniziya. Hanyuma yimukiye mu Bufaransa maze akora umwaka umwe mu ruganda rukora ibicuruzwa. Amaze gusubira muri Tuniziya, yashinze uruganda rwe rukora amajwi n'amashusho, 'Underground Skills', mu 2007. Binyuze muri sosiyete, yayoboye amashusho yindirimbo nyinshi hamwe niyamamaza. Hanyuma yayoboye ibiganiro bya tereviziyo nka \"Koujinitna\" kuri tereviziyo y'igihugu, \"Urban Fen\" kuri TV ya Hannibal na \"Ser El\" Benna kuri TV ya Coujina. \nMuri 2009, yakinnye nka 'Farid', umukanishi n'umuraperi, muri ikinamico \"Njoum Ellil\" iyobowe na Madih Bela\u00efd. Muri 2012, yakoze filime ye yambere \"yumukobwa, Fausse Note\" aho yari umwanditsi akaba na producer. Muri 2015, Smiri yahawe igihembo cyerekezo cyiza cy'ikinamico \"Lilet Chak\" muri Romdhane Awards, yatanzwe na Mosa\u00efque FM. Muri 2015, yanditse amagambo ya Lilet Chak, yahimbwe na Yacine Azaiez kandi yaririmbwe na Chkimi. Muri 2016, yayoboye urukurikirane rwa tereviziyo \"Bolice\" yatsindiye igihembo cyurukurikirane rwiza muri Romdhane Awards. "}
