{"id": "9729", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9729", "title": "Mohcine Malzi", "text": "Mohcine Malzi (nanone Mouhcine Malzi) ni Umukinnyi wa firime muri Maroc. \nUmwuga.\nMalzi yakinnye nka \"Abdelkader\" muri firime ya Faouzi Bensa\u00efdi, \"Volubilis\", inagaragaramo Nadia Kounda na Nezha Rahil. Iyi filime yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Venice hagati ya 30 Kanama kugeza ku ya 9 Nzeri 2017, bivugwa ko byari biteganijwe ko izasohoka mu nzu y'imikino ya Maroc kugeza uwo mwaka urangiye. Icyakora, \"amaherezo Telquel\" yatangaje ko isohoka muri sinema izaba ku ya 3 Ukwakira 2018. \nMuri 2018, niwe wegukanye umwanya wa \"Umukinnyi mwiza\" mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Tangier (TNFF). Muri 2019, yakinnye muri filime isetsa-ikinamico ya Saidi Bensa\u00efdi, \"Tagisi Bied\", ari kumwe na Mohamed El Khyari, Sahar Seddiki, Anas El Baz, Hassan Foulane na Saida Ba\u00e2di. Yagaragaye muri filime, \"L'balisa\", anagaragaramo: Ahmed Yreziz na Jalila Tlamsi. Yagaragaye no muyindi filime itarashyirwa ahagaragara na Faouzi Bensa\u00efdi yitwa, \"Summer Days\". "}
{"id": "9730", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9730", "title": "Mohcine Besri", "text": "Mohcine Besri (wavutse 1971) ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Maroc, umwanditsi, Producer n'umuyobozi wazo. \nUmwuga.\nMu mwaka wa 2011, yanditse kandi ayobora filime, \"The Miscreants\" (izina ry'umwimerere ry'igifaransa: \"Les m\u00e9cr\u00e9ants\"), ayikora kandi hamwe na Michel Merkt, Micha\u00ebl Rouzeau na Nicolas Wadimoff. Iyi filime yayikinnye na Jamila El Haouini, Maria Lalouaz, Amine Ennaji, Abdenbi El Beniwi, Rabii Benjhaile n'abandi. Bivugwa ko iyi filime yasohowe na serivise yo kuri interineti Filmatigue ahagana mu 2017. \nMuri 2018, yayoboye film, \"Urgent\" (Umutwe wumwimerere \"wigifaransa: Une urgence ordinaire\"), ayikina na C\u00e9cile Vargaftig. Yakozwe na Elisa Garbar, Lamia Chraibi na Michel Merkt, ikagaragaramo abakinnyi nka Rachid Mustapha, Fatima Zahra Bennacer, Youssef Alaoui, Ayoub Layoussifi n'abandi. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Marrakech 2018 (MIFF) no mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Palm Springs na Tangier National Film Festival 2019. Mu birori bya 15 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards (AMAA) mu 2016, yatowe mu cyiciro cya \"Umuyobozi mwiza\" kubera filime \"yihutirwa\". Filime kandi yabonye izindi nomination enye. \nBiracyaza muri 2018, yanditse kandi ayobora firime yerekana ikinamico yitwa \"Laaziza\". Muri filime hagaragayemo abakinnyi nka Fatima Zahra Benacer, Omar Lotfi, Rachid Elouali na Zakaria Atifi. Bivugwa ko iyi filime yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya 40 rya Cairo. "}
{"id": "9731", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9731", "title": "Ti\u00e9coura Traor\u00e9", "text": "Ti\u00e9coura Traor\u00e9 numukinnyi wa filimi muri Mali. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2006, yagaragaye nka \"Chaka\" muri filime yikinamico ya Abderrahmane Sissako \", Bamako\". Abandi bakinnyi barimo: A\u00efssa Ma\u00efga na H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Diarra. Muri filime ngufi ya Daouda Coulibaly ya 2010, \"Tinye So\", yagaragaye nka \"Man with traditional clothes\". Mu mwaka wa 2012, yagaragaye muri filime ya Dominique Phillipe, \"Tourbillion \u00e0 Bamako\", anagaragaramo Fatoumata Coulibaly, Chek Oumar Sidib\u00e9, Mama Kon\u00e9, Babou Thembely. "}
{"id": "9732", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9732", "title": "Bokang Phelane", "text": "Bokang Phelane ni umukinnyi wa filime ukomoka muri Lesotho no muri Afurika y'Epfo, akaba producer n'umwanditsi wa filimi. \nUbuzima n'uburere.\nPhelane yavukiye i Maseru, muri Lesotho. Yize amashuri yisumbuye mu mujyi yavukiyemo, nyuma akomereza muri kaminuza ya Monash muri Afurika y'Epfo aho yakuye impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor of Arts muri Psychology. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2016, Phelane rwaravuzwe muri series comedy televiziyo,\"Single Guys,\" gukina uruhare, \"Fezeka\". Yagaragaye kandi mu biganiro bya televiziyo, \"Shuga\", byasohotse mu 2018, aho yakinnye nk'umugore wa Andile \"Fezeka\". \nMuri Nyakanga 2017, yakinnye nka \"Pula\" muri Season 1 ya telenovela yo muri Afrika yepfo,\"Keeping Scores\", yerekanwe kuri SABC2. Yakinnye nka \"Lily\" mu rurimi rw'Abazulu Sci-Fi TV-seriyeri, \"Emoyeni (Netflix)\", yasohotse ku ya 22 Nyakanga 2018. Yagaragaye mu mvugo y\u2019ururimi rwa Sotho, \"Isipho Sothando\", yerekanwe muri Werurwe 2020 ndetse no muri \"Ho Kena Ho Eona,\" yerekanwe muri Mata 2020 haba kuri DSTV. Niwe uyoboye urukurikirane rw'ibiganiro bya televiziyo nyafurika, \"Blood Psalms\", azasohoka hamwe na ba producer Showmax na Canal + International mu 2021, akina nka \"Zazi\", umwamikazi w'ingimbi ukabije. "}
{"id": "9733", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9733", "title": "H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Diarra", "text": "Ma\u00efmouna H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Diarra, na Helena Diarra (yavutse 1955 - yapfuye ku ya 10 Kamena 2021) yari umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Mali uzwiho gukina inshingano z\u2019abagore bakuze kuva akiri muto. Ni umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigega mpuzamahanga gishinzwe iterambere ry'izabukuru (FIDRA). Ni Visi Perezida w'ishyirahamwe ry'umwuga rya gahunda yo kwegereza abaturage ubuyobozi bwa C\u00f4te d'Ivoire (Apsfd-CI). \nUbuzima bwambere nuburere.\nDiarra yavutse mu 1955 i Segou, muri Mali ariko aba impfubyi akiri muto kandi arerwa na nyirarume na nyirakuru. Mu 1975, yinjiye mu kigo cy\u2019igihugu gishinzwe uburezi cya Diplome y\u2019ubushakashatsi bwibanze (DEF) mu mwuga wo kwigisha. Nyuma yo guhindura siporo, hagati ya 1975 na 1977 yakiniye ikipe ya basketball ya Bamako Reds. Mu 1981, yabonye impamyabumenyi mu buhanzi bw'ikinamico mu kigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe ubuhanzi (INA). \nUmwuga.\nMu 2000, yagaragaye nka \"Aminate\" muri firime yikinamico ya Michael Haneke, \"Code Unknown\". Abandi bakinnyi barimo: A\u00efssa Ma\u00efga, Juliette Binoche, Thierry Neuvic, Josef Bierbichler n'abandi. Mu 2004, yagaragaye muri filime y'ururimi rwa Bambara ya Ousmane Semb\u00e8ne, Moolaad\u00e9, akina nka \"Hadjatou\". Abandi bakinnyi barimo: Fatoumata Coulibaly na Salimata Traor\u00e9. Filime yerekanwe muri Ebertfest 2007. Yatorewe igihembo cya \"Filime Nziza\" mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes. Mu 2006, yakinnye muri filime y\u2019ikinamico ya Abderrahmane Sissako, Bamako (film), aho yakinnye nka \"Saramba\". Abandi bakinnyi bagaragaye barimo: A\u00efssa Ma\u00efga na Ti\u00e9coura Traor\u00e9. "}
{"id": "9734", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9734", "title": "Catherine Kamau", "text": "Catherine Kamau Karanja (yavutse Gashyantare 3, 1987) ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Kenya, uzwi nka \"Celina\" (cyangwa \"Selina\") na \"\"Kate Actress\".\" \nYaje kumenyekana kubera uruhare rwe muri TV ya Citizen TV,\"Mother In-Law\" aho yakinaga nka Celina. Yagaragaye no mu zindi filime nka \"Sue na Jonie\" (2017-2019), \"plan B\", na \"Disconnect\".\nCatherine yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Chogoria aho yinjiye mu ikinamico maze amenyekana cyane kubera impano ye, mbere yo kwimukira i Loreto Convent Msongari aho yatsindiye igihembo cya 'Miss Loreto'.\nAfite Impamyabumenyi mu Itumanaho, yiga ibijyanye n'imibanire rusange na Kenya College of Communication and Technology yazamuwe muri kaminuza ya MultiMedia yo muri Kenya.\nKamau ni ambasaderi wikirango muri Harpic Kenya na Nice na peteroli nziza ya Jelly.\nUmwuga.\nKamau yakinnye nka Selina (cyangwa Celina) muka Charlie (Patrick Oketch) kuri serivise yikinamico ya \"Mother In-Law\" yatangiye mu 2006. Yahise ava mu gitaramo yerekeza kuri televiziyo yo mu rurimi rw'igiswahiri \"Sue Na Jonnie\", aho yakinnye nka Sue. \nYatsindiye Umukinnyi witwaye neza kurusha abandi mu cyiciro cya TV Drama Series mu bihe bya Kalasha Awards 2017 yongera guhabwa nomination muri 2018, kubera uruhare rwe muri \" \"Sue Na Jonnie\" \". Yatowe mu bakinnyi bitwaye neza mu cyiciro cya Filime cya komisiyo ishinzwe amafilime ya Kenya Kalasha Awards 2018 kubera uruhare yagize muri filime \"Disconnect.\"\nYakinnye nka Joyce muri filime yo gusetsa y\u2019urukundo ya 2019, \" \"Plan B\" \", yakozwe na Sarah Hassan kandi iyobowe n\u2019umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Nijeriya, Dolapo Adeleke (Lowladee). Kubera uruhare rwe nka Joyce, yongeye gutorwa nk'umukinnyi witwaye neza kurusha abandi mu cyiciro cya Filime ku nshuro ya 9 ya Kenya Film Commission ya Kalasha Awards 2019. \nCatherine Kamau aherutse no kwerekana muri firime ebyiri The Grand Little Lie (GLL) mu rwego rwo gukina. Filime yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 1 Ukwakira 2021. Iyi firime yakozwe na Phil it Production isosiyete ifitwe numugabo we Philip Karanja. Indi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere ni Nafsi, iyi ikaba ari filime ya Multan Production Limited iyobowe na Reuben Odanga.\nNiwe kandi ukora ibintu hamwe na YouTuber. Ku rubuga rwe rwa YouTube, avuga ku myambarire, imiterere, gukina, imibereho ndetse na nyina. Afite ishyaka ku kibazo cyo gutwita kwingimbi. Kuba yarabaye umubyeyi w'umwangavu, kandi afite interuro yiswe 'Abagabekazi bagomba gutegereza', aho ashishikariza abakobwa bato gutegereza mbere yo gufata icyemezo cyo kuba ababyeyi. \nUbuzima bwite.\nKamau yashakanye na Phillip Karanja (\"uzwi ku\" izina rya Phil cyangwa Melvin), umuyobozi wa firime ndetse n'uwahoze ari \"umukinnyi wa filimi ya Tahidi High\" kuva ku ya 17 Ugushyingo 2017. Ukwezi kwa buki kwizihirijwe muri Seychelles. Mu mibanire yabanje igihe yari muri kaminuza mpuzamahanga ya Kampala muri Uganda, afite imyaka 19, yibarutse umuhungu we wa mbere, Leon Karanja, mu 2006 Phillip yareze. Muri Nzeri 2019, ibitangazamakuru byinshi byatangaje ko we n'umugabo we bategereje umwana wabo wa mbere. Uyu mukinnyi w'amafilime kandi ngo yakiriye umwana mu Kuboza uwo mwaka kugirango yishimire inda yari yarahanuwe ko ari umwana wumukobwa. Bagiye muri babymoon muri Malidiya. Yababwiye uburyo yari hafi kureka gusama. Nyuma yaje gutangaza ku ya 15 Ukuboza 2019, ko umwana wa mbere w\u2019umugabo we ari umwana w\u2019umukobwa Njeri (\"Baby K\"). "}
{"id": "9735", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9735", "title": "Jasmine Baroudi", "text": "Jasmine Jamila Baroudi (yavutse ku ya 16 Nzeri) ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Gana. Yize Psychology muri kaminuza ya Gana. \nUmwuga.\nYaravuzwe muri Ghana kuri TV Series, \"pome Adamu\" (2011 - 2012) yakoranye nabakinnyi ba Ghallywood nka Majid Michel. Nyuma yaje gutorwa mu cyiciro \"cyiza cya Discovery\" muri Gana Movie Awards 2011 muri uru rukurikirane rwa TV. Muri 2014, yakinnye muri filime iyobowe na Mikki Osei-Berko yise, \"Broken Mirror\", inagaragaramo Jackie Appiah, James Gardiner, Fred Amugi na Roselyn Ngissah, kandi yakozwe na David Owusu. Hagati ya 2014 na 2015, yagaragaye nka \"Tilly Walsh\" muri Shirley Frimpong-Manso -yerekanwe kuri Televiziyo, \"V-Repubulika\". Izindi nyenyeri zirimo: Nikki Samonas, Joselyn Dumas na Christabel Ekeh. Yatowe mu bihembo bya Filime bya Gana 2014 mu cyiciro cya mbere cy\u2019abakinnyi ba \"serivise nziza\" \", kuri TV, Heart Break Hotel\" kuri TV3 Gana. Niwe wegukanye igihembo \"cyumukinnyi witwaye neza -\" Icyiciro cya Drama cya Golden Movie Awards 2019 (GMA). Yakinnye muri filime, the Cell muri uwo mwaka. Yakinnye muri film ya 2019, \"A New Flame\". Abandi ba star bo muri Gana bagaragaye barimo: Richard Asante (Kalyboss) na Edinam Atatsi.\nImpaka.\nBaroudi yatanze umuburo ukaze ku bagabo atera ubwoba \"izina n'ikimwaro\" bamwoherereje amashusho y'ubugabo bwabo kuri interineti, babona ko ari igikorwa cyo gutoteza kuri interineti. \"Graphic Showbizz\" yatangaje ko yavuze ko gukoresha abakinnyi badafite umwuga ari benshi bituma inganda za firime zidatera imbere, asaba ko abaproducer bashyira abujuje ibyangombwa kuri ecran gusa. \nUbuzima bwite.\nAfite umwana wumukobwa hamwe na Williams Ofori Atta, umukunzi we akaba nri nawe umutoza fitness ubu. "}
{"id": "9736", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9736", "title": "Mehret Mandefro", "text": "Mehret Mandefro (wavutse 1977) ni Umunyetiyopiya-Umunyamerika utunganya firime / seri za televiziyo, umwanditsi, umuganga na antropropologue. Ni umuyobozi w'itsinda rya Indaba Africa, akaba yarashinze ikigo cya Realness Institute akaba ari nawe washinze Truth Aid Media akaba n'umwe mu bagize inama y'abajyanama mu Harvest Fund. Yahawe kandi igihembo cya Paul &amp;amp; Daisy Soros Fellowship kubanyamerika bashya (2001) maze muri 2007 yicara nkumwe mubantu 41 bazwi cyane muri Amerika. Muri 2016, yahawe icyubahiro na Carnegie Corporation ya New York nk'umwe mu Bimukira bakomeye bo muri Amerika. \nUbuzima n'uburere.\nMandefro yavukiye i Addis Abeba, muri Etiyopiya mu 1977, akurira muri Alegizandiriya, muri Virijiniya, muri Amerika. Se, Ayalew Mandefro, yari Minisitiri w\u2019ingabo muri Etiyopiya na nyina Tsedale K. Mandefro. Umuryango we wahungiye muri Amerika nyuma y\u2019ubutegetsi bwa gikomunisiti bwa Etiyopiya bwagerageje kwica se. Yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya siyansi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga rya Thomas Jefferson arangiza icyiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza n\u2019ubuvuzi muri kaminuza ya Harvard. Yakomeje impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu buzima rusange bw\u2019abaturage ku ishuri ry\u2019i Londere ry\u2019isuku n\u2019ubuvuzi bwa Tropical nka Scholar ya Fulbright. Yasoje gahunda ya Robert Wood Johnson Foundation Health and Society Scholars Program muri kaminuza ya Pennsylvania yibanda ku mibereho y\u2019ubuzima akomeza gukurikirana impamyabumenyi ya PhD muri Anthropologie y\u2019umuco muri kaminuza ya Temple aho yarangirije igitabo cyerekeye ishingwa ry\u2019ubuzima bw\u2019Abanyamerika. politiki muri guverinoma ihuriweho na leta. Aragenda ku kumenyereza muri internal medicine muri Montefiore Medical Center na Albert Einstein College of Medicine aho bakurikirana ubushakashatsi ku ubusumbane SIDA mu bagore \nMandefro kandi yari Umukozi wa White House mu butegetsi bwa Obama. \nUmwuga.\nMandefro numwe mubahawe icyubahiro muri 2009 muri Black Girls Rock Awards, ahabwa igihembo cyumuganda. Muri Werurwe 2014, yari umwe mu bagore bubashywe mu birori byo kwizihiza umunsi mpuzamahanga w\u2019abagore mu mujyi wa New York, na WomenWerk. Muri 2014 kandi, yakoranye na firime \"Difret\", iyobowe na Zeresenay Berhane Mehari. \nYakoranye firime na Zeresenay Berhane ya 2019 yitwa,\"Sweetness in the Belly\", hamwe na Adrian Sturges, Laura Bickford na Fiona Druckenmiller. Muri uwo mwaka, documentaire yayoboye yise \" \"The Loving Generation\" \", yatorewe igihembo cya Webby People Voice Award. Iyi filime yemejwe ku mugaragaro ko izerekanwa ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi rya Toronto (TIFF). \nMu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2019 ryabereye muri Palais Des Festivals, i Cannes, mu Bufaransa, yagiriye inama abakora amafilime yo muri Afurika kubaka ubufatanye bufatika bakorana, agaragaza ko ibindi bihugu bya Afurika bishobora kwigira kuri Nollywood kugira ngo biteze imbere mu nganda zabo. \nWe, hamwe n\u2019umuyobozi wa firime, Abraham Gezahagne, muri Gashyantare 2020 yari ahagarariye Etiyopiya muri Berlinale Africa Hub, aho yerekanaga amahirwe aboneka hamwe n\u2019ibibazo byugarije inganda za firime na televiziyo mu gihugu. \nWe, afatanije na Alicia Keys, Lacey Schwartz Delgado, Elliott Halpern na Elizabeth Trojian, umuyobozi mukuru bakoze documentaire,\"How It Feels To Be Free\", ishingiye ku gitabo cya Ruth Feldstein,\"How It Feels To Be Free: Black Women Entertainers and the Civil Rights Movement,\" ziyobowe na Yoruba Richen kandi zigomba kwerekanwa bwa mbere mu itumba 2021 na PBS na WNET. "}
{"id": "9737", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9737", "title": "Dina Emam", "text": "Dina Emam ni Umunyamisiri-American film producer. Yahawe igihembo cya 10 Variety Producers \"yo muri 2018\". Aba i Cairo mu misiri no mu mujyi wa New York. \nUburezi.\nYarangije muri Kaminuza ya Columbiya na MFA mu guhanga udushya. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nEmam yavukiye muri Alegizandiriya, mu Misiri akurira i Brooklyn, New York.\nUmwuga.\nEmam yabanje gukora kuri MTV Networks, Umujyi wa New York, mu Isoko rya Televiziyo Ubushakashatsi no gucunga umusaruro. \nMuri 2018, filime yakoze yise \"Yomeddine\", yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes mu Bufaransa, aho yatsindiye igihembo cya Francois Chalais. Yaba we na mugenzi we icyo gihe, umuyobozi / umwanditsi wa film, Abu Bakr (AB) Shawky bari bahari mbere yo kurisha ibirori. Nyuma iyi filime yaje gutoranywa kumugaragaro muri Egiputa mu cyiciro \"cyiza cya Filimi Cyiza Cy\u2019ururimi rw\u2019amahanga\" mu gihembo cya Academy ya 2019. Yitabiriye kandi iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya El-Gouna (GIFF) 2018. \nfiYakoze mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya 36 rya Cairo nk'umuyobozi wungirije ushinzwe ubuhanzi ndetse anayobora mu minsi mikuru y\u2019inganda za firime za Cairo 2019 ku nsanganyamatsiko igira iti: \"Hariho Ubuzima Nyuma yo Gukorana?\". "}
{"id": "9738", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9738", "title": "Solange Yijika", "text": "Solange Yijika ni umukinnyi wa firime muri cameroon ukomeye cyane kandi agaragara cyane mu makinamico ya Nigeria ni producer wa film, ndetse aharanira uburenganzira bw'umugore n'umwana. Niwe mukinnyi w'amafirime uzwi cyane mu karere ka Afurika yo hagati akaba n'umuntu ukomeye mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Kameruni (CAMIFF). \nUbuzima n'uburere.\nYijika akomoka mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Kameruni. Yarangije muri kaminuza ya Yaound\u00e9 II, Soa, Kameruni. \nUmwuga.\nYijika yari isura ikomeye mubikorwa bya firime ya Kameruni kuva yagaragara bwa mbere nko mumwaka wa 2005. Mu byapa bibiri byo kurwanya malariya muri Kameruni byatewe inkunga na \"Global Fund yo kurwanya Malariya, Igituntu na SIDA\", yakoreshejwe nk'icyitegererezo muri ibyo byapa. Ni n'umurwanashyaka uharanira ubutabera ku isi ku bagore n'abana. Yabaye ambasaderi ku nshuro ya 1 iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Kameruni (CAMIFF) mu 2016. \nYijika yari yagaragaye mu nganda za sinema zo muri Kameruni mu bicuruzwa byinshi bigera kuri 20 kandi ni we uhabwa ibihembo byinshi birimo ibihembo bya AMAA na NAFCA. \nYakinnye muri \" \"Ibigeragezo Byifuzo\" \" 2006 bya TV byerekanwe kuri CRTV, aho yakinnye nka \"Diana\". Nyuma yaje muri 2008 yagaragaye muri \" \"Mark of the Absolute\" \", filime Asaba Ferdinand yayoboye akanayikora. Hakurikiraho \" \"Igihugu\" Cy'igicucu\" 2009, filime yakozwe na Agbor Gilbert Ebot ikayoborwa na Zack Orji na Neba Lawrence. Muri filime kandi hagaragayemo Jim Iyke. Muri uwo mwaka, yongeye kandi kugaragara muri filime \" Excess pain \" iyobowe na Neba Lawrence, hanyuma, muri uwo mwaka agaragara muri \" \"Royal Destiny\" \", filime yo muri Kameruni yanagaragayemo Emeka Ike na Tonto Dikeh, abakinnyi babiri ba Nollywood. Mu mwaka wa 2012, yagaragaye muri \" \"Troubled Kingdom\" \", filime iyobowe na Neba Lawrence, ifatanije na producer wa firime ukomoka muri Amerika Mairo Sanda hamwe na Fred Keyanti ukomoka muri Afurika y'Epfo - bashimye ubuhanga bw'uyu mukinnyi. \nMu mwaka wa 2012, yakinnye muri filime ya Nollywood \", \"Blood or wine\" \", yakozwe na Henry Neba Awantoh na Jim Iyke kandi iyobowe na Neba Lawrence, yanditswe na Ruth Kadiri. Muri 2013, yatorewe ibihembo bya SONNAH.\nYagaragaye muri filime, \" \"Decoded\" \", yakozwe na Brenda Elung - nawe umukinnyi wa filime kandi iyobowe na Akim Macaulay na Enah Johnscott mu 2013, aho yakinnye hamwe nabakinnyi ba Gana na Kameruni nka Van Vicker, Jeffery Epule na Desmond Wyte. \nYabaye umwe mu bayobozi babiri baganiriye ku nama nyunguranabitekerezo mu mwaka wa 2016 mu birori byo gutanga ibihembo bya African Achievers Awards, byabereye ku ya 8 Nyakanga mu kigo mpuzamahanga cy\u2019inama, Abuja, muri Nijeriya hamwe na Richard Mofe Damijo, umukinnyi wa politiki akaba n'umunyapolitiki. \nMuri filime yo muri 2017, \" \"show ability to save\" \", iyobowe na Musing Derick Tening kandi yakozwe na Tessy Eseme, yakinnye nka \" \"Jazmine Juma\" \". Filime yerekanwe bwa mbere i Londres. \nYatorewe igihembo mu nshuro ya 2 ya CAMIFF Awards, yabaye hagati ya 24-29 Mata 2017 i Buea, muri Kameruni hamwe nabandi bakinnyi ba Camerwood na Nollywood nabo batowe. Yari umwe mu baterankunga ba CAMIFF 2018 hamwe na Ramsey Nouah wa Nollywood. "}
{"id": "9739", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9739", "title": "Edith Pikwa", "text": "Edith Pikwa Boma (yavutse ku ya 3 Mutarama) ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Kameruni, utuye i Houston, muri Texas muri Amerika. \nUmwuga.\nYatowe muri \"Best Actress /Most Promising Actres\" - Diaspora igihembo cya filime, message to \"Brian\", aho yagaragaye mu bihembo bya Golden Icons Academy Movie Awards 2014 (GIAMA). Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere i Houston, muri Texas. Yakinnye muri filime, \"Ndolor na Senateri\", yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 31 Mutarama 2016 i Houston, muri Texas. Filime yakozwe na Mbango Adambi ikayoborwa na Gordon Che yagaragayemo muri Nollywood ndetse nabakinnyi nka Mbango Adambi, Kelechi Eke, Frank Artus, Sunnyfield Okezie, Jasmine Roland, Eko Leonel, Ruth Taku, Bareh Mildred, Samson Tarh na Beatrice Nwana. \nFilime ye, \"Kiss of Death\", niyo filime yatangije mu birori bya CAMIFF 2017 ku ya 24 Mata. Yabaye umukinnyi wa mbere muri firime ya Kamerwood 2018, \"Tenacity\", anagaragaramo Libota McDonald, Mat Atugon, Vugah Samson na Eyo Eyo Michael. Iyi filime kandi yatsindiye igihembo \"cyiza cya Filime nziza\" muri CAMIFF Awards 2018. "}
{"id": "9740", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9740", "title": "Brenda Elung", "text": "Brenda Shey Elung ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri cameroon na film producer. Ni Visi Perezida w\u2019uruganda rukora cinema zo muri Kameruni (CFI). Yitwa kandi \" \"Madam Brenda\" \". \nUmwuga.\nBrenda yagize uruhare mu nganda za firime zo muri Kameruni kuva mu 2010. Yatunganije kandi akina muri filime \" \"Decoded\" \", iyobowe na Akim Macaulay na Enah Johnscott, yasohotse mu 2013. Iyi filime yafatiwe muri Kanama 2012 ahitwa Limbe, muri Kameruni, hagaragaramo umukinnyi wa Gana, Van Vicker hamwe n\u2019abakinnyi ba firime muri Kameruni nka Solange Yijika, Jeffery Epule na Desmond Wyte. Yari umwe mu bakinnyi ba sinema bateraniye i Buea mu mahugurwa y'iminsi itatu (31 Kanama - 2 Nzeri 2016) kugira ngo baganire ku ivugurura ry'inganda za firime zirwaye muri Kameruni. \nMuri 2017, ibiganiro bye bya TV, \" \"SAMBA\" \" yakoze, yakinnye nabakinnyi ba Camerwood nka Jeffery Epule, Kelly Ade, Nsang Dilong, Marie Nyna, Solange Yijika, ubwe, nabandi; cyanditswe na Proxy Buh Melvin; kandi iyobowe na Enah Johnscott, yarekuwe. Filime nyuma ajya imbere gutsinda gihembo \"Official guhitamo\" mu FESPACO ibihembo wa 2017, na \"Best Series\" igihembo mu Ecrans Noirs ibihembo mu 2018. I Accra, muri Gana, mu gihembo cya Golden Movie Awards Africa (GMAA) 2017, televiziyo izwi cyane yahawe ibihembo bitatu; na \"Best Actress\" igihembo agiye Ade Kelly, \"Best Actor\" igihembo Libota McDonald na film kwinjiza \"Best TV Series\" igihembo. \nKu nshuro ya karindwi ibihembo bya AMVCA byabereye muri Eko Hotels na Suits i Lagos, muri Nijeriya ku ya 14 Werurwe 2020, ni we wenyine wari uhagarariye Inganda za Filime Kameruni (CFI) mu bihembo aho yagaragaye yambaye neza. \nKwihangira imirimo.\nNiwe washinze Omega One Entertainment, isosiyete ikora firime. Yaserukiye inyungu z\u2019isosiyete mu kiganiro mpuzamahanga cya TV cyo muri Nijeriya cyabereye i Paris (13-14 Mata 2018). \nKunegura.\nMuri 2018, yakiriye ibitero bikaze by\u2019abafana ku mbuga nkoranyambaga nyuma yo kugaragara yambaye ikanzu nziza y\u2019Uburusiya yakozwe ku nshuro ya gatanu ya AMVCA, amushinja ko yanze gushyigikira abashushanya imuhira bakoresheje imbuga mpuzamahanga nka AMVCA, we we birengagijwe. Icyakora, yahisemo gushyira mu bikorwa ibyo basabye mu nshuro ya karindwi yerekana ibihembo mu mwaka wa 2020 aho yagaragaye mu myambarire ya Limbe yakozwe na TAS Design. "}
{"id": "9741", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9741", "title": "Odile Sankara", "text": "Odile Sankara n'umuhanzi, umwanditsi ndetse n'umukinnyi wa filimi muri Burkina faso. Yagizwe Perezida wa R\u00e9cr\u00e9\u00e2trales akaba mushiki muto wa nyakwigendera umuyobozi w'impinduramatwara ya Burkina Faso, Thomas Sankara. \nUmwuga.\nSankara yagaragaye muri firime ya Iara Lee ya 2018, \"Burkinab\u00e8 Rising: ubuhanzi bwo guhangana muri Burkinafaso\". "}
{"id": "9742", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9742", "title": "No Gold for Kalsaka", "text": "Nta Zahabu kuri Kalsaka (Igifaransa: Pas d'or pour Kalsaka) ni film documentaire ya Burukina Faso ya 2019 yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Michel K. Zongo kandi afatanije na Florian Schewe. \nUmusaruro.\nGufata amashusho byakorewe mu ntara ya Yatenga muri Burukina Faso. Yakozwe na Michel K. Zongo muri Diam Production [bf] na Florian Schewe muri Film Five GmbH. \nUmugambi / Icegeranyo.\nKuva kera, mu gihugu cya Afurika cya Burukina Faso, abaturage bo mu mudugudu muto wa Kalsaka bari baracukuye kandi bakoresha zahabu mu rwego rwo kubatunga. Hamwe n\u2019ishirahamwe ry\u2019abongereza rishinzwe ubucukuzi bw\u2019amabuye y\u2019amahanga, ariko, ibyo byaje kurangira kuko abaturage bari barahawe akarere kavuye mu bucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro mu butaka bwabo. Umuganda wumudugudu, nyamara, uyobowe na Jean-Baptiste, urwana cyane kugirango ugarure ibye. \nAmashimwe.\nFilime yabonye igihembo cyicyiciro \"cyiza cya Documentaire\" muri Awards Africa Awards Awards 2019. \nKwakira.\nKu ya 15 Ugushyingo 2019 ku bufatanye n\u2019iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya documentaire rya Montreal (RIDM), iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere na Sinema Politica Concordia i Quebec. Iyi filime yemejwe ko ari imwe muri filime zihindura isi kandi byari biteganijwe ko izerekanwa bwa mbere muri Ceki muri Autumn 2020 na \"One World\". \nKurekura.\nNk\u2019uko IMDb ibitangaza ngo iyi filime yasohotse ku ya 24 Gashyantare 2019."}
{"id": "9743", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9743", "title": "Burkinab\u00e8 Rising", "text": "Burkinab\u00e8 Rising (nanone Burkinab\u00e9 Rising): \"ubuhanzi bwo guhangana muri Burkinafaso\" ni film ndende ya 2018 yerekanwe kandi ikorwa na Iara Lee. \nUmusaruro.\nIyi documentaire yakozwe na Cultures of Resistance film, muri Burkinafaso, Buligariya na Amerika mucyongereza, Igifaransa na Moor\u00e9 ikamara iminota 72. \nUmugambi / Icegeranyo.\nIyi documentaire yerekana abahakanamana batagira urugomo nabenegihugu ba Burkinafaso berekana inzira basezeranye, kumunsi mushya muri politiki yigihugu cyabo. Hemce, yerekana urugero rukwiye kwiganwa kumugabane wa Afrika ndetse nisi yose. Iyi filime igaragaramo abantu bafite umwuka w\u2019impinduramatwara umeze nkuwahoze ari umuyobozi (1983-1987), Thomas Sankara, yiciwe muri Coup d'etat n\u2019inshuti ye yamusimbuye, Blaise Compaor\u00e9, akoresheje umuziki, film, ibidukikije, ubuhanzi bugaragara nubwubatsi. Compaor\u00e9 wategetse imyaka 27 nyuma yukwakira 2014 yakuweho nubwigomeke bukomeye bwamamaye, umwuka uguma hamwe nabantu kugeza ubu.\nKuzenguruka igihugu cyose gufata amashusho ya documentaire, \"BURKINAB\u00c8 RISING the art of resistance in Burkina Faso\", umuyobozi wayo, Iara Lee yahuye nitsinda rishimishije ryabahanzi, abahanzi ndetse nabaharanira inyungu, bagamije guteza imbere umuco wubuhanzi binyuze mubuhanzi. igihugu kizwiho. Uyu muraperi, Joey le Soldat, avuga ku rugamba rw\u2019urubyiruko rukennye muri Ouagadougou ndetse n\u2019abahinzi baruhira mu gihugu; umuhanzi wa graffiti, Marto, yamaganye akarengane atanga ibishushanyo mbonera by'amabara ku nkuta z'umujyi; uharanira uburenganzira bw'umugore, Malika la Slameuse, ahereye ku gitsina gore ku buhanzi bwiganjemo abagabo akora ibisigo; umubyinnyi, Serge Aim\u00e9 Coulibaly, kuva kubyina bye ashishikariza abamureba gufata ingamba za politiki.\nIyi filime kandi yerekana iserukiramuco ryubuhanzi butunganyirizwa hamwe no kubaza amatsinda y'abahinzi barwanya kwangiriza ubuhinzi bwibigo. Muri rusange, film irerekana abantu batandukanye mubyiciro bitandukanye bashakisha amahoro nubutabera hakoreshejwe imvugo. \nKwakira.\nIyi filime yerekanwe na Suns Cinema, Washington DC ku bufatanye n\u2019umuco ku ya 16 Ukwakira 2018. Yerekanwe kandi mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Semb\u00e8ne ku ya 25 Werurwe 2019. \nIyi filime yahawe igihembo \"cyiza cyaBest Documentary Film\" kandi ihabwa igihembo cy\u2019amanota \"meza y\u2019umwimerere\" n\u2019umuyobozi \"w\u2019umugore w\u2019indashyikirwa\" mu mujyi wa New York ku nshuro ya 7 ngarukamwaka y\u2019imyidagaduro mpuzamahanga ya Filime (WFAIFF) mu mwaka wa 2018. "}
{"id": "9744", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9744", "title": "Lindiwe Chibi", "text": "Lindiwe Chibi (1976\u20132007), yari umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Afrika yepfo. Babona ari umwe mubakinnyi ba film kabuhariwe muri Afurika y'Epfo, azwi kuruhare 'Doobsie' muri seri yakunzwe cyane \"Muvhango.\" \nAmasasu n'urupfu.\nKu ya 30 Mata 2005, umukunzi we Dan Mokoena, yamurashe mu maso igihe Chibi yari kwa nyina. Amasasu yarashwe hafi, yinjira mu itama asohoka inyuma y'umutwe. Yahise ajyanwa mu bitaro bya Garden Clinic, amara ibyumweru bitatu muri koma. Amaze guhaguruka ava muri koma, yamugaye iburyo bw'umubiri we. Igihe yari amaze gukira ibikomere byica, yapfuye azize umusonga mu bitaro bya Chris Hani-Baragwanath i Soweto mu 2007 afite imyaka 31. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1995, yatangiye umwuga wo gukina umwuga wo gukina ikinamico \"Ekuseni yakinwaga\" kuri Civic Theatre. Hanyuma yakinnye nka \"Game wo\" kuri Windybrow Theatre, aho yakiriye igihembo cyumukinnyi mwiza. Hanyuma yakinnye nka 'Stella Kowalski' mumikino gakondo, \"A Street Car\" Yitwa Desire ndetse no muri \"The Pen na Molora\". Yakoze umugizi wa nabi uzwi cyane 'Doobsie' muri seri ya televiziyo \"Muvhango\". Nyuma y'urupfu rwe, uruhare rwe rwatangajwe ko yeguye. Ku ya 3 Kanama 2018, Isoko rya Theatre Foundation ryiswe icyubahiro cya Chibi. "}
{"id": "9745", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9745", "title": "Randall de Jager", "text": "Randall de Jager (4 Mata 1971 - 22 Ukuboza 2001), yari mukinnyi wa filimi muri Afurika yepfo. Yamenyekanye cyane kubera uruhare rwe muri serial izwi cyane \"Egoli: Place of Gold\" na 7de Laan. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 4 Mata 1971 mu nkengero za Bishop Lavis, Cape Town, Afurika y'Epfo. Afite imyaka 17, yabaye umwarimu watozaga abandi ku cyumweru kandi yegeranye cyane nitorero. Yakuranye na nyina, Jean kandi afite bashiki be babiri: Juanita, Angelique na murumuna we Roger. Yakundanye kuva kera n'inshuti ye y'umukobwa, Kim Nichols.\nUrupfu.\nMu ntangiriro za 22 Ukuboza 2001, Jager yakomerekejwe bikomeye n\u2019ubujura bwitwaje imbunda mu nzu iri mu nkengero z'umujyi wa River Club, i Sandton, mu majyaruguru ya Johannesburg. Yapfiriye mu bitaro bya Johannesburg. Yari kumwe n'inshuti ye n'umukinnyi wa filime Helene Lombard mugihe cy'ubujura. Yarashwe mu maso hatangaza ko ubwonko bwangiritse cyane. \numubirir we wimuriwe gushyingurwa i bishop Lavis i Cape Town. Umuhango wo kwibuka wabereye mu rusengero rushya rw\u2019Intumwa ku ya 29 Ukuboza. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1992, yakinnye mu ikinamico ikinamico \"Paradise iri hafi\". Mu 1998, yabaye umwanditsi, aho yanditse ikinamico \"Moenie Gerageza Nie\". Azwiho uruhare rwa 'Hector' muri opera yisabune ya tereviziyo \"Egoli: Place of Gold\". Yakinnye kandi nk'umufasha wibitabo Aubrey Rudolph muri seri izwi cyane ya televiziyo \"7de Laan\"."}
{"id": "9746", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9746", "title": "Nicholas Nkuna", "text": "Sipho Nicholas Nkuna numukinnyi wa filimi n'umuririmbyi wo muri Afrika yepfo. Azwi cyane ku ruhare rwe muri seri izwi cyane 7de Laan nka Fikani no kuri \"Erfsondes\" nka Nkululeko \"Freedom\" Nkosi \". \"\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 18 Kanama 1988 i Mbombela, Mpumalanga, Afurika y'Epfo aho yakuriye mu nzu ya nyirakuru. Yarangije impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu buhanzi yakuye muri kaminuza y\u2019ikoranabuhanga ya Tshwane, Pretoria kabuhariwe mu ikinamico. Hanyuma yagiye muri Ball State University, Indiana muri Amerika, yiga gukina. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga wo gukina mumyaka ya kaminuza, aho yakinnye mumikino myinshi yikinamico nka \"Parade\", \"Inzozi Zabakobwa\", \"Shaka Zulu\", \"Sophiatown\", \"Oliver Twist\", \"Gukodesha\", na \"Assassins\". Yakinnye kandi mu makinamico nka Simba mu ikinamico yitwa Yanakinnye mu ikinamico \"Ntare King\" aho yazengurutse Irlande n'Ubwongereza akina. Ku myaka 22, Nkuna abaye umukinnyi wa kabiri wa Afurika wakinnye mu ikinamico izwi cyane ya \"Phantom ya Opera\". \nMuri 2015, yerekeje kuri televiziyo, \"Skeem Saam\", abinyujije kuri agent, biba televiziyo ye ya mbere. Muri serial, yakinnye nka 'Sakhile'. Muri 2017, yafashe ikiruhuko cy'imyaka 3, aho yongeye kwerekeza mu Kwakira 2020. Muri uwo mwaka, yitabiriye urukurikirane rw'amarushanwa yo gukina BET, \"Top Actor Africa\". Mu marushanwa, yagaragaye nkuwakabiri. Nyuma yaje kugaragara muri opera yisabune \"Roer Jou Voete\" akina nka 'Shakes Mbebe' mu mpera za 2015. Muri 2016, yagaragaye muri serial \"Keeping Score\", kandi yagize uruhare ruto nkumukinnyi wa congo 'Issac'. Muri uwo mwaka, yatumiriwe kugira uruhare mu bashyitsi kuri serial izwi cyane ya \"Rhythm City\". \nKuva muri 2017, akina uruhare ruzwi cyane 'Fikani Chauke' murukurikirane \"7de Laan\". Yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza kurusha abandi muri Afurika y'Epfo Broadway Awards 2016 kubera uruhare rwe 'Mingus' mu ikinamico \"Sophiatown\". Hanyuma yakinnye muri serie \"Erfsondes\" nka 'Ubwisanzure'. Usibye televiziyo, yanakinnye muri filime, \"Love by Chance\" and \"Meet the Radebes.\" \nUsibye gukina, ni n'umuririmbyi wamamaye. Indirimbo ebyiri mu ndirimbo zagaragaye muri filime yakinnye na Khanyi Mbau \"Icyumba gitukura\" naho indirimbo ye Thando igaragara kuri Meet the RAdebes. Nicholas uzwi kandi ku izina rya Nicksoul afite igihembo cy'umuziki wo muri Afurika y'Epfo kubera alubumu ye ya mbere / r &amp; b yise Therapy yasohotse muri 2018."}
{"id": "9747", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9747", "title": "Quinne Brown", "text": "Quinne Brown (yavutse ku ya 9 Kamena 1979) ni umukinnyi wa firime m muri Afurika yepfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime \"Ouma se Slim Kind\", \"Sedona's Rule\" and \"This Is Charlotte King\".. \nUbuzima bwite.\nBrown yavukiye i Johannesburg, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Amaze kwiga, yize geografiya na antropologiya muri kaminuza ya Johannesburg. Yagiye i San Francisco mu 2003 gushyingura se, aho yahuriye n'umugabo we Ryan Huffman. Yashakanye na 2006 kandi bombi babaga i San Francisco. Nyuma abo bashakanye bimukiye i San Diego, aho babyaranye abakobwa babo bombi, Charlotte na Lara. \nMu masomo ye, Brown yabonye amahirwe yo kwinjira mu bakinnyi bikinamico ya \"7de Laan\". Muri uruhererekane, yakinnye ari \"Connie van der Lecq\". Usibye gukina, anakora nkuwatanze ikiganiro kuri SABC2. Mu 2003, Brown yafashe ikiruhuko cy'isabato nyuma y'urupfu rwa se muri Mata 2003. \nYakoze kandi mu ikinamico, filime no kwamamaza bishingiye kuri San Francisco. Muri 2008, yatangiye kwigisha abana mwishuri ryimikino ryabana. Nyuma yimyaka icumi muri Amerika, yasubiye muri Afrika yepfo hamwe numuryango. Mu mwaka wa 2016, yongeye gukina mu bakinnyi ba '7de Laan', anagaragaza imico ye 'Connie'. "}
{"id": "9748", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9748", "title": "Nobuhle Mahlasela", "text": "Nobuhle Mimi Mahlasela (yavutse 10 Mata 1982), ni umukinnyi wa filime numumodel muri Afurika y'Epfo na model. Azwi cyane mu gukina uruhare rwa Aggie Ngwenya-Meintjies muri serial izwi cyane \"7de Laan\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nMahlasela yavutse ku ya 10 Mata 1982 mu bitaro bya Baragwanath i Soweto, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Mu 1999, yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Waverley Girls i Johannesburg. Hanyuma yize ikinamico muri Pretoria Technikon, ubu ikaba izwi nka Tshwane University of Technology (TUT). \nUmwuga.\nMbere yo kwinjira muri, yabanje kujya yamamaza kuri ABSA. Muri 2012, yakinnye bwa mbere muri firime ya \"Mad Buddies\" kandi akina uruhare ruto rwumupolisi wumugore. Muri 2016, yakoze uruhare rwa Nthati muri filime \"Data's War\". Yakinnye nka Aggie Ngwenya-Meintjies muri filimi izwi cyane \"7de Laan\" kuva mu 2010. Imiterere yamenyekanye cyane, kandi kubwibyo yaje gutumirwa gukina filimi ibihe byinshi mubakinnyi basanzwe."}
{"id": "9749", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9749", "title": "Hykie Berg", "text": "Hykie Berg (yavutse 2 Gicurasi 1978), ni umukinnyi wa filimi Afrika yepfo. Azwi cyane ku ruhare rwa 'Darius du Buisson' muri televiziyo ya \"Egoli: Place of Gold\" n'uruhare 'Conrad Bester' mu ikinmico, \"Binnelanders\". Muri 2011, yatsindiye igihembwe cya kane cyamarushanwa yukuri \"Survivor South Africa\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 2 Gicurasi 1978 i Pretoria, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yize kugeza mu cyiciro cya 8 mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Die Wilgers aho yatangiye gukoresha ibiyobyabwenge. Hanyuma yize mu 1998. Afite imyaka 19, yabaye umusinzi. Nyuma yaje gukira ibiyobyabwenge mu bitaro by\u2019indwara zo mu mutwe bya Weskoppies, Cape Town. \nKuva mu 1997 na 1999, yarangije Impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubucuruzi mu kwamamaza - Umwaka wa kabiri, Kwamamaza / Kwamamaza ibicuruzwa muri kaminuza ya Pretoriya. Hanyuma yarangije impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor muri Dramatic Arts mu buhanzi, imyidagaduro, no gucunga itangazamakuru muri kaminuza ya Stellenbosch hagati ya 1999 na 2002. \nYashyingiranywe mbere na Melissa Jacobs mu 2013 ariko batandukana muri 2018. Hanyuma, yasabye inshuti ye yumukobwa Gerridene ku ya 23 kamena 2019 aho amaherezo bashyingiranywe muri Werurwe 2020. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye kuri tereviziyo mu rukurikirane rw'urubyiruko ruzwi cyane \"muri Res\" mu 2003. Hanyuma muri 2004, yagize uruhare runini muri serial \"Plek van Meats\". Muri 2007, yakinnye bwa mbere muri firime muri \"Ouma se Slim Kind\". Mu 2004, yinjiye mu bakinnyi ba shampiyona 13 ya \"seri ya tereviziyo Egoli: Place of Gold\" kandi yakinnye nka 'Darius du Buisson' aho yatsindiye igihembo cya Crystal. Yakinnye ibihe bitatu kugeza muri saison 15 muri 2007.\nMuri 2018, yabaye umwanditsi aho yasohoye igitabo \"Hykie Berg: Ultimate Survivor\". Igitabo kivuga ku buzima bwe bw\u2019ibiyobyabwenge ndetse n\u2019urupfu hafi y\u2019umwuga we wo gukina, aho amaherezo abasha kwisubiraho no kugera ku ntsinzi nyuma. "}
{"id": "9750", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9750", "title": "Thami Mngqolo", "text": "Zeke Elakhe Lungelo Mngqolo (yavutse ku ya 9 Nzeri 1982), uzwi cyane nka Thami Mngqolo, ni umukinnyi wa filime akaba n'umuyobozi wa filimi muri Afurika y'Epfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe muri seri izwi cyane g\"enerations\", \"State Enemy No.1\" and \"Greed and Desire\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 9 Nzeri 1982 i Johannesburg, muri Afurika y'Epfo nk'umwana wa kabiri w'umuryango. Afite mukuru we Uvolethwu Mngqolo, witabye Imana mu 2016. \nYagiranye igihe kirekire na mugenzi we bakinana Jo-anne Reyneke. Bashakanye mu 2008 babyarana abana babiri Uvolwethu (wavutse muri 2013) na Lungelo (wavutse 2015). Muri 2018, Mngqolo yirukanwe mu rugo rwabo na Reyneke nyuma yuko bivugwa ko yabonye videwo ibangamira kuri mobile ye. Nyuma yaje gutabarwa n'inshuti ye, Matli Mohapeloa. Batandukanye mu 2018. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2003, yagaragaye muri seri ya televiziyo yitwa \"Generations\" akina ari ' Senzo Dlomo ', umugabo wigitsina gabo. Muri 2016, yahagaritse gukina seri, mugihe abakinyi bayo bose birukanwe kubera ko basabye umushahara munini. Yagaragaye kandi mu bakinnyi ba \"State Enemy No.1\". Yakinnye kandi nka 'resepteptiste' muri ikinamico ya \"Muvhango\". Ugushyingo 2020, yinjiye mu bakinnyi ba telenovela \"Isono\". Muri seri akina nka 'Maradona'. "}
{"id": "9751", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9751", "title": "Meshack Mavuso", "text": "Meshack Mavuso Magabane (yavutse ku ya 8 Mata 1977), ni umukinnyi wa filime akaba n'umuyobozi wa filimi muri Afurika y'Epfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri seri izwi cyane \"Heist\", \"Isidingo\", \"Yizo Yizo\", Isithembiso na Durban gen. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 8 Mata 1977 i Mandagsoek Limpopo, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Arubatse, ni se w'abana bane.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1998 yakoze umwanya wa mbere 'Vusi Moletsane' mu ikinamico \"Isidingo\" yamenyekanye cyane. Hanyuma, yagaragaye mu ikinamico \"Yizo Yizo\" yerekanwe kuva 1999 kugeza 2004 afite uruhare 'Jabulani \"Javas\" Nyembe'. \nYamenyekanye kandi ubwo yinjiraga muri Mzansi Magic telenovela Isithembiso yerekanwe bwa mbere ku ya 3 Mata 2017, aho yakinnye imico ya Keromemang Mtimande, se wa Tshepo, wabitswe na se na nyina kugeza igihe yavumbuwe mu buryo butangaje. gira umwana numukunzi we Chlodea ubu bakundana numwanzi we.\nYatangiye umwuga we nka Meshack Mavuso akina 'Simiso Mtshali' mu gice cya kabiri n'icya gatatu cy'urukurikirane rw'abapolisi \"Zero Tolerance\" yerekanwe muri SABC2. Mbere yizo nshingano zashimwe cyane, yakinnye imico itandukanye mu gice cya mbere. Mu mwaka wa 2008, yari umwe mu babyinnyi b'ibyamamare mu Kubyina umwaka mushya, ku ya 31 Ukuboza 2008. \nMuri 2009, yagaragaye ashyigikiwe nigihembwe cyambere cyuruhererekane rwerekana ibisekuruza \"Who Do You Think You Are?\" cyari gishingiye ku ruhererekane rw'Abongereza. Urukurikirane rwaciye kuri SABC2 muri 2009. Muri 2014, yagarutse kuri tereviziyo akina visits mu bice bibiri by'ikinamico ya Sida \"City\" yakinnye nka 'dogiteri'. Muri 2015, ku nshuro ya mbere, yakoresheje izina Mavuso Magabane mri seri \"Zabalaza\". Muri seri, yakinnye Visits mugice kimwe. Muri 2016 yakoze umwanya wa kabiri ayoboye muri e.tv ikinamico \"Heist\" hamwe ninshingano ya 'Chairman'. \nMuri 2020 nyuma yigihe gito muri serial \"The River\", yinjiye mu bakinnyi ba serial \"Durban Gen\" aho akina imico ya Dr Thabo Dlamini ugaragara nkumugore kandi akaba yarashakanye na Dr Precious Dlamini. "}
{"id": "9752", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9752", "title": "Fikile Mthwalo", "text": "Fikile Mthwalo (yavutse ku ya 13 Mata 1989), ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Lesotho wavukiye muri Afurika y'Epfo akaba n'umwanditsi wa firime. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe muri seri zizwi, \"Isidingo\" na \"Gold Diggers\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 13 Mata 1989 Lesotho kwa se wa Mosotho na nyina wa Kenya / Tanzaniya. Afite murumunawe utuye Cape Town. Kuva mu 2001 kugeza 2005, yize muri Machabeng International College ifite icyicaro i Maseru. Nyuma yimukiye i Bloemfontein, muri Afurika yepfo arangiza Matric muri 2007, mu ishuri rya St Michael Girls. Mu 2009, yinjiye muri kaminuza ya Cape Town arangiza impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor of Arts Film na Video Production. Nyuma muri 2012, yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye na Filime mu ishuri ry\u2019ubuhanzi rya Tisch muri kaminuza ya New York. Amaze kubona impamyabumenyi, yimukiye i Johannesburg. \nYashakanye na mugenzi we wo muri Afurika yepfo Atandwa Kani kuva ku ya 24 Ukuboza 2015. Yahuye na Kani mugihe cya tereviziyo aho basezeranye barashyingirwa nyuma yumwaka. Bateguye ubukwe bwabo gakondo 'Lobolo' nyuma yubukwe bwabo. Atandwa ni umuhungu wa John Kani na Mandi Kani. Mbere yubukwe bwabo, Kani yari afitanye umubano numuntu witangazamakuru, Thembisa Mdoda. Bombi baratandukanye nyuma yimyaka itatu. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga wo gukina mu ikinamico izwi cyane izwi cyane, \"Isidingo\". Yabaye umwe mu barangije hejuru 24 mu 'O Access Presenter Search' amakuba zicishwa kuri umuyoboro O. Mu 2015, yatumye we mbere televiziyo iya uruhare na gukina imico 'Ipeleng' mu serial \"It\u2019s Complicated.\" Usibye ibyo, yinjiye mu matangazo yamamaza kuri tereviziyo harimo Metropolitan, PEP, Omo, Shoprite, Etiselat Nigeria, Ibidendezi, Hi-Malt Nigeria na Nivea UK. Yagaragaye muri telenovela \"Gold Diggers\" aho yakinnye nka 'Hlengiwe'. \nUburezi.\nFikile yabonye impamyabumenyi ya Bachelors muri Film na Video Production yakuye muri kaminuza ya Cape Town (UCT), ari naho yarangirije icyubahiro muri 2012. Muri 2015 yahawe buruse yuzuye yo kwitabira gahunda yo gukina amanota ya kaminuza ya New York (NYU). Muri 2018 yarangije Masters mu buhanzi (MFA) mu gukina."}
{"id": "9753", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9753", "title": "Judy Ditchfield", "text": "Judith Angela Broderick (wavutse 22 Nyakanga 1963), uzwi cyane ku izina rya Judy Ditchfield, ni umukinnyi wa filime akaba n'umuririmbyi wo muri Afurika y'Epfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe muri seri zizwi cyane \"The Story of an African Farm\", \"Cape Town\" na \"Hoodlum &amp; Son\". Ni n'umucuruzi ukomeye akaba yarabihuguriwe mu bwongereza \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 22 Nyakanga 1963 i Pretoria, muri Afurika y'Epfo nyuma akurira muri Irene. Afite imyaka itandatu, yimukiye i Kimberley hamwe n'ababyeyi be. Noneho afite imyaka 13, umuryango we wongeye kwimukira i Pietermaritzburg. Kuva mu 1984 kugeza 1987, yamaze i Durban hanyuma yimukira i Johannesburg. Yize amashuri menshi: Ishuri ryisumbuye rya Belgravia na Herlear Primary i Kimberley kumashuri abanza. Hanyuma yize amashuri abanza ya Pelham kuri Standard 5. Hanyuma yarangije ibizamini bya matriche muri Pietermaritzburg Girls High School, Pietermaritzburg. \nHanyuma yabonye impamyabumenyi ya BA muri Psychology na Drama muri kaminuza ya Natal, Pietermaritzburg. Kuva 1984 kugeza 1987 arangije, yakoraga muri Natal Performing Arts Council (NAPAC). \nYashakanye n'umukinnyi n'umucuranzi Paul Ditchfield. Abashakanye bafite abahungu babiri: Keaton na Tom. Keaton yavutse 1991 kandi ni umukinnyi. Tom yavutse 1996 yiga amategeko ya B.Com muri kaminuza ya Wits. \nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga wo gukina amakinamico hamwe na Loft Theatre Company, ishami rya NAPAC. Muri kiriya gihe, yakinnye mu ikinamico \"Boo To the Moon\" yakozwe na Paul Slabolepszy,\"Tales From The Pleasure Palace\" by Janice Honeyman, \"Kwamanzi\", \"Every Good Boy Deserves Favour\", \"Hambe Kahle\", \"Maid In South Africa\", \"Mistakes Of An African Night To Conquer\", \"En Dit Was More\", \"In The War\" and \"Kitchen Tea\". Hanyuma yakinnye mu ikinamico ya \"Macbeth\" kuri Theatre ya Leta i Pretoriya ndetse no mu ikinamico \"Ibintu Dukorera Urukundo\" na \"bagenzi ba Arms\" byakozwe na Anthony Ackerman. Muri 2001, yabonye ibihembo bya Kwazulu-Natal Vita kuba Umukinnyi witwaye neza mu bakobwa. \nUsibye gukina, ni n'umuririmbyi wamamaye kandi yamenyekanye cyane kandi agaragara muri muzika: Christian; Neill Solomon Rock Concert; Bursting Out; Soundcraft; The Last Great Drive-In Movie Picture Show; It's All Fright By Me; It's Still Rock And Roll To Me; Tarts; A Touch Of Tonic; the smash hit Richard Loring production A Touch Of Webber, A Taste Of Rice; Snow White And The Seven Dwarves; Buddy: The Buddy Holly Story; Fiela's Child: The Musical; The Night They Invented Champagne; and Queen: The Concert at the Sandton Convention Centre. \nKuva mu Kwakira 2006 kugeza Werurwe 2007, yakinnye muri Menopause: The Musical for Showtime Management yaberaga kuri Theatre ya Montecasino i Johannesburg. Muri kiriya gihe, yahawe igihembo cya Naledi Theatre Award 2006 cyo kwerekana ibihembo byiza byurwenya (Umugore) kuriyi gakino. Hagati aho, yagaragaye kuri tereviziyo nyinshi zirimo \"Umukino wa II\", \"Sonnekring II\", \"Suburban Bliss\" na \"Streaks I na II\". Yakinnye kandi uruhare runini muri seri; \"Hooded Angels\",\"Hoof Of Africa\", \"Zeru Tolerance\" na \"Yizo Yizo\". Muri 2012, yagaragaye muri tereviziyo ya sitcom \"Ses'Top La\" maze akina nka 'Madamu. Rabinowitz '. \nMuri 2019, yakinnye nka 'Stella Fouche' mu isabune izwi cyane \"Isidingo\". Yagaragaye kandi muri firime, \"Kwizera Inguni\", \"Icyubahiro Glory\", \"Cape Of Good Hope\" na \"Stander\". "}
{"id": "9754", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9754", "title": "Jo da Silva (actress)", "text": "Jo da Silva, numukinyi wamafirime muri Afrika yepfo n'umunyamakuru kuri tereviziyo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri seri zizwi cyane \"Gabri\u00ebl\", \"Operation Delta Force 3: Clear Target\" na \"Arsenaal\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nDa Silva yarangije muri kaminuza ya Wits mu 1990 afite impamyabumenyi y'icyubahiro mu buhanzi bw'ikinamico. Afite kandi impamyabumenyi ya mwarimu mu myigire yimikino. \nDa Silva yashakanye n'umukinnyi wa Afurika y'Epfo Eckard Rabe kuva 1996 kugeza 2007. Abashakanye bafite umukobwa umwe, Caitlin. Muri 2010, Da Silva na Rabe bombi bagize uruhare mu isabune yo muri Afrika yepfo, \"7de Laan.\" \nUmwuga.\nDa Silva yatangiye umwuga we mu ikinamico kandi akomeza imyaka myinshi mu ikinamico. Yagaragaye muri sabune opera \"Isidingo\" akina nka 'Natasha Wallace'.\nHanyuma yakinnye nka 'Gita McGregor' kuri televiziyo \"7de Laan\". Ku mirimo ye nka Gita McGregor, Da Silva yatowe mu cyiciro cya \"Umugore w\u2019indashyikirwa\" mu birori byo gutangiza ibihembo bya Royalty Soapie mu 2013. Muri 2015, yatorewe igihembo cya Royalty Soapie Award mu cyiciro cya \"Umugore w\u2019indashyikirwa\" kubera uruhare rwe kuri \"7de Laan.\" Da Silva kandi yatowe mu cyiciro cya \"Umukinnyi mwiza w'isabune nziza\" kubera ibikorwa yakoze kuri \"7de Laan\" muri 2016 \"Huisgenoot\" Tempo Awards. Da Silva yavuye muri 7de Laan mu 2016, yimukira i Cape Town kumarana igihe n'umukobwa we no gukora akazi k'ubuntu. \nUsibye izo nshingano, Da Silva yanakinnye kuri televiziyo nyinshi zirimo \"Gabriel\", \"Arsenaal\", \"Madam &amp; Eve\", \"Suburban Bliss\" na \"Egoli\". Guhera mu 2007, yakinnye nka 'Olivia Fitzgerald' muri televiziyo izwi cyane ya \"Erfsondes\". \nNyuma yo kuruhuka igihe kirekire avuye mu ikinamico, amaherezo yagarutse kuri stage akina ibintu bibiri mu ikinamico \"Present Laughter\" rwanditswe na No\u00ebl Coward. Ikinamico yerekanwe kuri Theatre ku Kigobe. Hanyuma yakinnye mu ikinamico, \"Fatal Attraction\", yerekanwe kuri Theatre kuri Bay na Pieter Toerien's Monte Casino Theatre i Johannesburg. Usibye gukina, yanatunganije, afatanya kuyobora ndetse anerekana ikinyamakuru M-Net show 'Showbuzz'. Yabaye kandi umuyobozi wumugore mukinamico yicyongereza,\"It rained last night\".. "}
{"id": "9755", "revid": "14088", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9755", "title": "Zakeeya Patel", "text": "Zakeeya Patel (yavutse ku ya 6 Mutarama 1988), ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Afurika yepfo akaba n'umunyamakuru. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe muri serial izwi cyane \"Isidingo\", \"7de Laan\" na \"High Rollers\". \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nPatel yavukiye i Durban, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Ni muryango wakomokaga mu Buhinde ku ruhande rwa se Yarangije afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ikinamico no mu bitaramo yakuye muri kaminuza ya Cape Town.\nUmwuga.\nMu 2005, yakinnye nka 'Samantha Sharma' muri opera yisabune ya televiziyo \"Isidingo\". Igitaramo cyaje gukundwa cyane. Hagati aho muri 2006, yabaye nyampinga wa Season 6 muri South African competition \"Dancing with the Stars\". Muri 2012, yagaragaye muri firime yo gusetsa \"Material\" kandi akina nka 'Aisha Kaif'. Noneho muri 2013, yagaragaye muri Show \"High Rollers\". Muri 2014, yagaragaye akina ikinamico \"Emotional Creature\" aho yaboneyeho umwanya wo gukorana n\u2019umunyamerika uzwi cyane akaba n'umwanditsi Eve Ensler. \nMuri 2018, yakinnye muri filime \"The Docket\" Muri 2019, yagaragaye muri Netflix yumwimerere \"Shadow\". Muri uwo mwaka, yakinnye muri filime ishimishije ya Showmax \"The Girl from St. Agnes\". Mu mpera za 2019, yagize uruhare runini muri film \"3 Days to Go\". Muri 2020, yakinnye mu rukurikirane rwa filime \"Material\" \"2012 yitwa New Material\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nPatel yashakanye n\u2019umukungu w\u2019ubukungu Rob Price mu birori by\u2019amadini atandukanye mu Gushyingo 2017. Bimukiye i Los Angeles, muri Californiya mu Kuboza 2019. "}
{"id": "9756", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9756", "title": "Cecile Nkomeje", "text": "Cecile Nkomeje.\nmu mwaka wibihumbi bibi na kane 2004 nibwo hashinzwe ikigo gikomeye gishinzwe gutunganya imiti\nnibikoresho bya Laboratoire kizwi nka Pharmalab ltd kiyobowe na Madamu Cecile Nkomeje iki kigo cyashinzwe murwego rwo gukwirakwiza \nibikoresho by'ubuvuzi na Laboratoire mu Rwanda ndetse no mukarere ruherereyemo. Pharmalab Ltd\nni uruganda rukora cyane ibikoresho byifashishwa mu buvuzi munzu batangiramo ibizamini Laboratoire\nharimo nk' udutibe batangiramo amaraso,inkari,umusarane nibindi. \nAmateka.\nMadamu Cecile Nkomeje ni Umuyobozi mukuru wa Pharmalab Ltd uru ruganda rukora ibikorwa by'indashyikirwa.\nrwatangiye mu mwaka wa 2004 nkuko twabisobanuye haruguru batangiye batumiza ibikoresho hanze y'igihugu\nariko bakabifashwamo na Leta yu Rwanda. muri 2014 bakoze urugendo shuri mugihugu cya Tanzaniya mu rwego \nrwo kungera ubumenyi ari naho baherewe inyigisho zo gukora ayo ma tube. mu mwaka a 2015 nibwo batangiye\nkubaka aho bazajya batunganyiriza ayo ma tube Imasoro mu cyanya k'Inganda. 2016 nibwo batangiye gushyira\nmubikorwa ubumenyi bwabo batangira gukora ibikoresho ari nabwo basurwaga n'ikigo gishinzwe gutsura \nubuziranenge RSB (Rwanda standards board). Minisiteri y'ubuzima na Laboratoire Nationale basanga ibikoresho\nbakora byujuje ubuziranenge\nUmusaruro.\nkurubu ibikoresho byavaga mu mahanga nka Inde, Chine, na Europe byarahagaritswe uru ruganda \nPharmalab nirwo rutanga ibikoresho byose bikoreshwa mu bitaro bitandukanye ibigo nderabuzima na ma clinique \nzigenga mu Rwanda. umuyobozi wa Pharmalab Cecile Nkomeje avugako kuva ibikoresho byatangira\ngukorerwa mu Rwanda aribwo igiciro kiri hasi cyane kuko bahisemo gufata inyungu nke ariko kubintu byinshi.\nIngano yibikoresho bakora.\numubare wibikoresho bakora mu mwaka ungana na millioni 25 kandi\nbavugako hakenerwa ibikoresho biri hagati ya millioni 8 ni 10 mu mwaka\nbavuga kandi ko icyuho kibyatumizwaga hanze cyagabanutseho 36% ndetse igipimo\nkibyoherezwa mu mahanga kigabanukaho 69%. \nInshingano.\ninshingano yabo ni ugutanga ibikoresho byinshi bikoreshwa mubuvuzi ndetse nibikoresho\nbya Laboratoire byujuje ubuziranenge kwisoko kandi bifite ireme kandi kugiciro\nkiza ndetse na serivice inoze.\nIbihembo.\nMadamu Cecile Nkomeje yatsindiye igihembo gitangwa na RDB Bussiness Excellene Awards\nmuri 2017 nku mugore wihangiye imirimo kandi akiteza imbere kurwego rushimishije\nCecile kandi yavuzeko kuva yahabwa icyo gihembo iterambere rye ryikubye ubugira kabiri."}
{"id": "9757", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9757", "title": "Arno Marais", "text": "Arno Marais (yavutse 19 Mata 1984), ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Afrika yepfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe muri \"seri\" zizwi cyane Stroomop, \"Die Boekklub\" na \"Reconnect\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 19 Mata 1984 i Bloemfontein muri Afurika y'Epfo. Nyina ni Corrie Viviers.\nUmwuga.\nMu 2009, yakinnye nk'inzobere mu by'ikoranabuhanga 'Benjamin le Roux' muri opera izwi cyane \"Isidingo\" aho igice cye cyanyuze ku ya 20 Ugushyingo. Muri 2016, yagaragaye muri serivise yikinamico ya kykNET \"Die Boekklub\" akina nka 'Herman Mouton'. Mu mpera za 2016, yagize ikiruhuko cyimyaka ibiri kuva \"Isidingo\". Muri kiriya gihe, yinjiye mu bakinnyi ba televiziyo ya \"Sokhulu &amp; Partners\" maze akina nka 'Adv. Nick Edwards '. Hanyuma yagaragaye kuri serial \"7de Laan\" muburyo bugaruka. Hanyuma muri 2017, asubira muri \"Isidingo\". \nImpanuka.\nKu ya 28 Nyakanga 2010, yagize impanuka y'imodoka yahitanye Kobus Venter, umwangavu. Marais yarakomeretse cyane aguma muri koma ibyumweru bine mu bitaro by\u2019amasomo bya Steve Biko i Pretoria. Nk\u2019uko amakuru aturuka mu bitaro abitangaza, ngo yabyimbye mu bwonko mu gihe cya koma ndetse no kuva amaraso imbere. Yasize ibihaha yarajanjaguwe, bityo akoresha ubuhumekero. Yamaze ibyumweru bitandatu mu bitaro. Mu mwaka wa 2012, yitabye urukiko bwa mbere muri Pretoria ku bijyanye n'impanuka. \nImpaka.\nMuri 2018, yashyizeho Tweets nyinshi yibasira Abayisilamu kandi yatanze ibitekerezo bimwe bikemangwa kuri Islam. "}
{"id": "9758", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9758", "title": "Soso Rungqu", "text": "Sonwabise 'Soso' Rungqu (yavutse ku ya 24 Gicurasi 1983), ni umukinnyi wa filime akaba n'umuririmbyi wo muri Afurika y'Epfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri serial izwi cyane \"Isidingo\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 24 Gicurasi 1983 i Amalinda, mu Burasirazuba bwa Londre, Afurika y'Epfo. Mu 1991, yize mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Clarendon ry\u2019abakobwa. Yarangije afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu buhanzi bwa muzika muri kaminuza y\u2019ikoranabuhanga ya Tshwane, Pretoria. Se yapfuye mu 2015. Arubatse kandi ni nyina w'umuhungu.\nUmwuga.\nMu 2007, yakinnye bwa mbere mu ikinamico mu ikinamico \"coin n\u2019izindi nkuru\" zakorewe kuri Civic Theatre, (ubu izwi ku izina rya Theatre Johannesburg). Soso yakoze ijwi ryamamaye hejuru yimiterere ya animasiyo 'Smartycat' kumyerekano y'abana \"Cool Catz\" kuva 2008 kugeza 2010. Hagati aho, yanakinnye mu ikinamico y'amashuri yisumbuye ndetse n'amashuri abanza. Hanyuma yakoranye nishami ryubuhanzi numuco imyaka mike. Uruhare rwe rwa tereviziyo ya mbere rwaje nko muri PHD Inyigo Yumwana Kubuzima bwa Mindset Network.\nUbwa mbere, yagaragaye cyane kuri tereviziyo zizwi cyane: \"love of Mzansi\", \"Scandal!\" Town \"(Urukurikirane rwa TV)\", \"Sokhulu &amp; parteners\" na \"7de Laan\". Hagati aho, yagaragaye muri televiziyo \"HeartLaughs\" mu rwego rwa DVD \"Indangagaciro mu bikorwa\". Muri 2014, yagaragaye muri firime ngufi \"Awakening\" hanyuma muri firime \"Munsi yubuhanzi\" muri 2015. Muri uwo mwaka, yavuze uruhare kuri radio ikinamico \"uHambolwethu yanyuze\" kuri TruFM. \nMuri 2016, yamenyekanye cyane ku ruhare 'Kau Morongwa' kuri opera \"Isidingo\". Yakomeje gukina kugeza muri 2018 aho yaretse kwerekana kugira ngo arebe se urwaye. "}
{"id": "9759", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9759", "title": "Le silence de la for\u00eat", "text": "Le guceceka de la for\u00eat ni filime yerekana ikinamico yo muri Central Afurika na Kameruni yo muri 2003 iyobowe na Bassek Ba Kobhio na Didier Ouenangare. mu mateka ni filime ya mbere yerekanwe muri Sinema yo muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique Iyi filime kandi yakorewe hamwe muri Gabon na Kameruni. Filime yahinduwe ishingiye ku gitabo cyanditswe na \u00c9tienne Goy\u00e9mid\u00e9 gifite umutwe umwe \"Le silence de la for\u00eat\". Iyi filime yari ishingiye ku moko mato ya Pygmies nyafurika kandi ni nayo filime ya mbere ivuga ku ivangura rishingiye ku moko ry\u2019Abanyafurika bigezweho ku bwoko bw\u2019abasangwabutaka bo muri Afurika (Biaka people). \nIcegeranyo.\nGonaba (Eriq Ebouaney), umugenzuzi w\u2019uburezi mu karere muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique yumva acitse intege nyuma yo gukora mu butegetsi bwa gisirikare imyaka irenga icumi. Bidatinze, ashishikajwe no kunganira ubwoko bw\u2019abasangwabutaka bwitwa Baaka muri rusange birengagizwa kandi bagafatwa nabi muri sosiyete kandi ubuzima bwabo bukaba bubangamiwe n\u2019imijyi n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu. \nAbakinnyi.\nIyi filime yabanje gutangazwa ko izayoborwa gusa n\u2019umukinnyi wa filime ukomoka muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique Didier Ouenangare nkumushinga we wa mbere. Yatangiye kuyobora bwa mbere binyuze muri uyu mushinga afite imyaka 50. Icyakora umuyobozi wa filimi muri Kameruni Bassek Ba Kobhio yinjiye mu gufata amashusho kandi ashinzwe ibijyanye na tekiniki yo kurasa. Bassek yaje kuba umuyobozi mukuru wa film mugihe Didier yamubereye umuyobozi wa film. Bombi bumvikanye gukorana kandi film yatewe inkunga cyane na Kameruni na Gabon. Iyi filime yakorewe muri CAR mu gihe igihugu cyahuye n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019ubukungu hamwe n\u2019ubutegetsi bwa gisirikare mu 2003. Byagaragaye ko umukinnyi wa firime Didier yakiriye inkunga ingana na 50000 FF na Agence intergouvernmentale de la francophonie mugihe cy'ibirori bya Amiens. \nBenshi mubagize itsinda hamwe nabatekinisiye mugikorwa cyo gufata amashusho bashakishijwe mubihugu bituranye birimo Kameruni na Gabon. Umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Kameruni, Eriq Ebouaney yatoranijwe kugira ngo agire uruhare runini kandi yagombaga kwiga ururimi rwa Sango rukaba ari rumwe mu ndimi zemewe za Repubulika ya Centrafrique. Umuhimbyi w\u2019umuziki wamamaye muri Kameruni, Manu Dibango, yinjijwe mu muziki wa filime. Umuyobozi wa firime Didier nawe yakiriye opposition no kunengwa kuba adahisemo abanyafurika yo hagati ngo bakore iyo film. \nKurekura.\nIyi filime yerekanwe mu gihugu muri Repubulika ya Centrafrique yarahungabanye kubera ko sinema yonyine mu gihugu yari ifunze icyo gihe. Filime yatoranijwe kumugaragaro kugirango yerekanwe mu minsi mikuru mike ya firime kandi ifunguye muri rusange ibitekerezo byiza byatanzwe nabanegura. Iyi filime yerekanwe ku gice cy\u2019umubumbe wa Afurika muri 2003 Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto 2003. Yatoranijwe kandi kugirango yerekanwe mu gice cy\u2019abayobozi ba Fortnight igice cya Festival ya Cannes 2003. Iyi filime kandi yakiriwe cyane mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime 2003 ryitwa Francophone de Namur (FIFF). "}
{"id": "9760", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9760", "title": "Abbas Kaijuka", "text": "Abbas Kaijuka numu moderi wo muri Uganda, umunyamideli hamwe nuwakusanyije imideli uzwi muri \"kuranga Kai's Divo\". Niwe wahawe igihembo cy\u2019umwaka w\u2019abagabo berekana imideli y\u2019abagabo bo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba muri 2020 East Fashion Awards ndetse na Fashion Designer of the Year igihembo cya Abryanz Style na Fashion Awards 2016 kandi yahawe ibihembo bitandukanye harimo na East African Designer of the Year. igihembo mucyumweru cyimyambarire ya Swahili 2017. "}
{"id": "9761", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9761", "title": "Malaika (actress)", "text": "Malaika Tenshi Nnyanzi uzwi cyane mwizina rye nka Malaika numukinnyi wa filimi muri Uganda, umunyamakuru n'umunyamideli. Azwi cyane kubikorwa bya radio kuri D'Mighty Breakfast show kuri KFM na Malaika na Oulanya kuri Capital Fm ndetse nakazi yakoraga kuri Veronica's Wish, Bed of Thorns, The Honourables and Mela. \nUmwuga.\nKwerekana imiterere.\nMalaika yatangiye umwuga wo kwerekana imideli i Nairobi muri Kenya. Yayoboye kandi isosiyete icunga icyitegererezo hamwe numugabo kandi yerekanaga ibikorwa byabo mubirori byinshi birimo icyumweru cyimyambarire ya Swahili. Yavuye i Nairobi yimukira muri Uganda aho yakomereje umwuga we wo kwerekana imideli hamwe n'ibikorwa by'imyidagaduro. Ni ambasaderi wikirango Nice Vine. \nRadiyo na televiziyo.\nAgarutse muri Uganda avuye muri Kenya, Malaika yinjiye muri Televiziyo ya Urban Group ya Vision Group nk'umufatanyabikorwa hamwe na Gaetano Kagwa mu kiganiro cya mu gitondo cyitwa Urban Today. Nyuma yaje kuva muri Urban Today yakira Fashionista mbere yuko ava muri Televiziyo ya Urban mu Gushyingo 2016. Yinjiye kandi mu muyoboro w\u2019imyidagaduro wo muri Afurika yepfo Rockstar Group nk'isura nshya ya televiziyo yitwa SHOOOOSH! Malaika yatangiye umwuga we wo gukora kuri radio muri KFM i Kampala muri Mata 2017. Yafatanije nabandi mu ikiganiro cya mugitondo, D'Mighty Breakfast show hamwe na Brian Mulondo. Muri 2019, yavuye muri KFM yinjira muri Capital Fm atangira kwakira \"Malaika na Oulanya\" hamwe na Oulanya Columbus asimbuye Gaetano na Lucky mumwanya wabo wa Overdrive. \nGukina.\nMalaika yerekanye umwuga we wo gukina filime ya Nisha Kalema yo muri 2018 yerekana ikinamico ya Veronica's Wish akina nka Bankia. Yakiriye abahatanira ibihembo bibiri mu ruhare mu cyiciro cyiza cyo gushyigikira umukinnyi wa filime muri 2018 Uganda Film Festival Awards na ZAFAA Global Awards muri 2019. Nyuma yaje gukinishwa nka Stella muri 2019 Eleanor Nabwiso yayoboye film. Kuri uru ruhare, Malaika yatowe kandi yegukana igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza muri 2019 Uganda Film Festival Awards. Yakinnye kandi nk'umukinnyi wa Mela Katende mu rukurikirane rw'amakinamico rwa Nana Kagga rwa Mela maze yinjira muri Honourables mu 2019 nk'umunyamuryango ukomeye.\nUbuzima bwite.\nMalaika yavukiye Malaika Nnyanzi ku babyeyi bava Uganda i Nairobi muri Kenya, aho se wahoze ari ingabo za Uganda yari yarajyanywe mu bunyage. Umuryango we wasubiye muri Uganda utura i Kampala. Yagiye ku ishuri ry\u2019incuke rya Safari, Ishuri ry\u2019ababyeyi rya Kampala, Ishuri ryisumbuye rya Gayaza na Makerere College mbere yo gusubira muri Kenya aho yarangirije impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bucuruzi mpuzamahanga muri kaminuza nkuru y\u2019Amerika yo muri Amerika. Muri 2018, ubwo yaganiraga na Crystal Newman kuri show ye \"Crystal 1 Ku ya 1\", Malaika yaje gusohoka ameze nk'uwahohotewe na mugenzi we bakorana kubera igicuri, ikintu yari amaze imyaka irenga icumi yiherereye kandi kimutera kwiheba. "}
{"id": "9762", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9762", "title": "Julie Mutesasira", "text": "Julie Nalujya uzwi cyane nka Julie Mutesasira ni umuririmbyi wa gospel wo muri Kanada uvuka Uganda uzwi muri Uganda ndetse no muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba kubera indirimbo ze nka Nkulembera, Lwana Nabo, Ekikunyumira na Bamuyita Yesu, ubufatanye na Iryn Namubiru. Julie yavuye muri Uganda yimukira muri Kanada nyuma yo gutandukana n'umugabo we Steven Mutesasira babyarana abana babiri abo bakaba ari Esther na Ezekiyeli, abatsindiye muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba Got Talent season 1 2019. \nYabonye igihembo cy\u2019umugore muri GOSPEL song ye \"Saba\" muri 2014 ndetse n\u2019indirimbo nziza y\u2019amadini kubera indirimbo ye Mukama mu 2015 kandi yatorewe kuba Indirimbo nziza y\u2019idini kubera indirimbo ye Kijja Kugwa mu 2016 ku nshuro ya gatatu, iya kane n'iya gatanu HiPipo Ibihembo bya Muzika. Yatsindiye igihembo cy'indirimbo y'umwaka muri Olive Gospel Music Awards mu 2012, igihembo cy'umuhanzi w'umwaka muri VIGA Awards 2016, Diva Collabo Award ya Yani, ubufatanye na Iryn Namubiru muri DIVA 2011"}
{"id": "9763", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9763", "title": "The Ship and the Sea (2019 film)", "text": "Ubwato n'Inyanja (Igiporutugali: O Navio eo Mar) ni Filime ya documentaire yanditswe na Lara Sousa, iyobowe na Lara Sousa na Everlane Moraes kandi yakozwe na Lara Sousa na Matheus Mello. \nUmusaruro.\nfirime yafotowe kandi ikorerwa muri Berezile na Mozambique, namasosiyete akora: Kulunga Filmes (Mozambique), Pattaki Audiovisual na Port\u00e1til (Berezile). Imiterere ya firime iri mumabara, Digital / Digital 5.1, Imiterere ya Dolby Stereo. Umusaruro uracyatezwa imbere. \nUmugambi / Icegeranyo.\nIcyemezo cyafashwe na Everlane na Lara bo muri Berezile na Mozambique, bombi bakaba ari abakora amafilime y\u2019abirabura, kugira ngo berekane indorerwamo bazenguruka igihugu cyabo mu buryo bwambukiranya imipaka, hanyuma bareba filime za buri wese kugira ngo bamenye imico yazimiye mu biranga umwirondoro wabo kumpande zombi kugirango wuzuze icyuho cyabuze. \nKwakira.\nIyi filime yatoranijwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya 11 rya Durban (DIFF 2020) ryabaye hagati ya 10 na 20 Nzeri, kuri interineti, hamwe n\u2019izindi filime zigera kuri 30 nka imwe mu mishinga y\u2019Ihuriro ry\u2019Imari. \nIbihembo.\nIyi filime yatsindiye kandi muri Durban FilmMart ya 2020, Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime Amashusho Amsterdam (IDFA) Igihembo cy\u2019Ubuholandi. "}
{"id": "9764", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9764", "title": "Danieline Moore", "text": "Danieline Moore Kamya numukinnyi wa filimi muri Liberiya na rwiyemezamirimo. Mu 2007, yabaye Miss Liberia muri USA. Ni n'umuvugizi wa Africa Environment Watch. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYashakanye na Kamya, umufasha we kuva kera kuva 2017. \nUmwuga.\nAmarushanwa y'ubwiza.\nYitabiriye amarushanwa y'ubwiza ya Miss Liberia yo muri Amerika 2006 nka \"Miss Maryland\" ariko yaje ku mwanya wa kane. Yatsinze irushanwa umwaka ukurikira. \nGukina.\nMoore yagaragaye muri firime, \" \"crazy in love\" \", yakinanye kandi nabakinnyi ba Nollywood nka Jim Iyke Altorro Black na Crystal Milian. Filime yerekanwe bwa mbere i Beltsville, Maryland, muri Amerika. Ibirori byari byitabiriwe nabastar benshi ba Nollywood barimo Ramsey Nouah. \nUbucuruzi.\nAcuruza imitako bambara ; Nalu Couture na Glitz na Nalu, yitiriwe umukobwa we. Niwe kandi washinze Cosmetics ya DKM n'umurongo wimyenda ya VIXEN muri Liberiya, kandi ari no mubukorikori bwa kalendari. "}
{"id": "9765", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9765", "title": "Bibi Nshimba", "text": "Bibi Nshimba kandi Bibi Amosi (yavutse Kanama 18, 1976) ni umukinnyi wa filime uvuka Congo ariko utuye American, akaba producer n'umwanditsi. \nUmwuga.\nMuri serivise za TV zakozwe na Shane Brennan, \"NCIS: Los Angeles\", yasohotse bwa mbere muri 2009 ikagaragara kuri CBS, yagaragaye nka \"Receptiste\" mu gice cya 1, 2014. Mu mwaka wa 2012, yanditse, akora kandi akina muri firime ngufi, \"Ben na Becca\", nka \"Rebecca\", umunyeshuri w\u2019ubuvuzi ukomoka muri Afurika. Muri iyi filime kandi hagaragayemo Brian Krause nka \"Ben\" kandi iyobowe na Victor Alferi. \nYagaragaye mu biganiro bya televiziyo 2016 byayobowe na Neil Druckmann na Bruce Straley bise, \"Uncharted 4: end of thief\", nk'imwe mu \"Amajwi y'inyongera\". Muri 2018, yafatanije kuyobora filime ngufi yerekana ikinamico, \"Ukwizera nyakuri\", hamwe na Prince Steven Obeni Bottan aho yakinnye nka \"Angelica\". Abandi bakinnyi barimo Vanessa Bisono, Andrey Bereza na Tito Londole. "}
{"id": "9766", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9766", "title": "Jordan Riber", "text": "Yorodani Riber ni umukinnyi wa filimi kubijyanye no kuziyobora no kuzitunganya muri Zimbabwe yavukiye Tanzaniya,kandi akora nka Screenwriter, Producer, Editor na Sound engineer. \nUbuzima n'uburere.\nRiber yavukiye mu muryango w'umuhungu John na Louise Riber, bombi niba ari abakora amafilime, akurira i Harare, muri Zimbabwe. Igihe kinini yamaranye muma firime no mubikoresho byo kubyara nyuma yo gukura. Yarangije mu 2004 muri Fairhaven College, Western Washington University, Bellingham, Washington, Amerika, aho yize Filime. Kuva mu 2005, yari umukinnyi wa firime ukora umwuga wa injeniyeri na injeniyeri y'amajwi i Dar es Salaam, muri Tanzaniya. \nUmwuga.\nMu mwaka wa 2012, yayoboye kandi ahindura \"Siri ya Mtungi\", ikiganiro cya televiziyo y\u2019ururimi rwigiswahiri cyamasaha nigice, yakinnye na Cathryn Credo, Beatrice Taisamo, Yvonne Cherrie nabandi. Yatorewe ibihembo bya \"Televiziyo Nziza - Urwenya / Ikinamico\", \"Filime Yururimi Kavukire / Urukurikirane rw'igiswahili\" hamwe na \"Best Sound Editor\" mu bihembo bya Afurika Magic Viewers Choice Awards 2014 (AMVCA). \nMuri 2017, yayoboye film, \"Hadithi za Kumekucha: Tunu\". \nMuri 2018, yayoboye, atunganya kandi ahindura filime ye ya kabiri yerekana, \"Hadithi za Kumekucha: Fatuma\", yakinnye kandi na Cathryn Credo, Beatrice Taisamo na Ayoub Bombwe. Muri uwo mwaka, yayoboye kandi akora \"Bahasha (Ibahasha)\", filime yikinamico, irimo Ayoub Bombwe, Godliver Gordian, Omary Mrisho na Cathryn Credo. \nMu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Zanzibar 2018 (ZIFF) ryatoranijwe ku mugaragaro, \"Bahasha ya Riber niyo filime yatangije\" yerekanwe bwa mbere, hamwe na \"Fatuma\" bashyizwe mu cyiciro cya \"Long Feature\". Muri ibyo bihembo, yabonye \"Umuyobozi\" \"mwiza na Cinematografiya nziza\", mu cyiciro cyihariye cya Sinema. "}
{"id": "9767", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9767", "title": "Memry Savanhu", "text": "Memry Savanhu (nanone Memory Savanhu) ni umukinnyi wa filime wa Nollywood wavukiye muri Zimbabwe, Umukinnyi wa firime na Rwiyemezamirimo, utuye burundu i Lagos, muri Nijeriya nyuma yo kwimurwa i Londere mu Bwongereza. Yatangiye bwa mbere muri filime, \"Intera Hagati\", mu 2008 kandi kuva icyo gihe, yakinnye mu bintu byinshi bya Nollywood \"One Fine Day\", \"On Bended Knees\" na \"76\". Niwe washinze Memkay Productions, imyambaro yo gutunganya film. \nUbuzima n'uburere.\nBivugwa ko Savanhu yavukiye muri Zimbabwe \"maze ahishurira ikinyamakuru Guardian\" cyo muri Nijeriya ko akomoka mu bwoko bwa Zezuru. Yize ikinamico i Londres no muri New York Film Academy i Abu Dhabi, UAE yize gukora firime. \nMuri 2015, yatorewe igihembo cya Zimbabwe International Women Awards (ZIWA) cyabereye i Birmingham mu Bwongereza mu Kwakira k'uwo mwaka nk'uko byatangajwe na \"The Herald\" of Zimbabwe. Iki gihembo ni icy'uruhare yagize muri Nollywood nk'uko \"Umudugudu w'Urubyiruko ubitangaza\". "}
{"id": "9768", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9768", "title": "Jesesi Mungoshi", "text": "Jesesi Mungoshi (nanone Jesese Mungoshi) numukinnyi wa filimi muri Zimbabwe. Yagaragaye bwa mbere mu 1989, muri filime yitwa, \"African Journey\". \nUmwuga.\nMu kugaragara hakiri kare, Mungoshi yagaragaye muri verisiyo yo mu 1989 ndetse no mu 1990 yakurikiyeho ibice bibiri bya filime y\u2019umuryango wa televiziyo ya George Bloomfield, \"African Journey\", nayo yakinnye: Jason Blicker, Katja Blomquist, Allan Jordan, Ulla Mahaka n'abandi. \nMu 1991, yagaragaye muri filime ya Godwin Mawuru yise \"Neria\", aho yakinnye nka \"Neria\". Abandi bakinnyi ni Dominic Kanaveli na Violet Ndlovu mubandi. Yagaragaye kandi muri filime ngufi ya 1993 na Farai Sevenzo yise, \"Rwendo\", yakinnye na Yemi Ajibade, Ben Daniels, Eldinah Tshatedi na Frank Windsor. \nMuri 2017, yagaragaye muri filime isetsa-y'urukundo, \"Cook Off\", iyobowe na Tomas Brickhill, aho yakinnye nka \"Gogo\". Iyi filime ikaba yarakozwe bwa mbere muri Zimbabwe nyuma y\u2019ubutegetsi burebure bwa Robert Mugabe, yerekanwe bwa mbere mu Bwongereza ku ya 27 Nyakanga 2019. \nMu rwego rwo gushimira uruhare rwe mu nganda za firime Zimbabwe, yahawe igihembo cya Lifetime Achievement Award na Kaminuza Nkuru ya Zimbabwe muri Gicurasi 2017 i Masvingo. Filime ya 2020, \"Shaina\", aho afatanije nabandi bakinnyi ba Zimbabwe nka: Marian Kunonga, Charmaine Mujeri nabandi bagaragaye, bakiriwe neza mumahanga. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYashakanye n'umwanditsi, umukinnyi n'umusizi wa Zimbabwe, Charles Mungoshi, nk'uko ikinyamakuru \"The Zimbabwe Mail\" na \"Uyu ari\" abanyamakuru bo muri Afurika, yapfuye ku ya 16 Gashyantare 2019 i Harare, muri Zimbabwe nyuma y'uburwayi yari amaze imyaka 10 afite imyaka 71. Ubukwe bwahiriwe n\u2019abana batanu: Farai, Graham, Nyasha, Charles, na Tsitsi, kandi igihe yapfaga bari bafite abuzukuru barindwi. Abashakanye bari kumwe numuhungu wabo, Farai bose bari gukina film. "}
{"id": "9769", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9769", "title": "Leila Nakabira", "text": "Leila Nakabira, na Leilah Nakabira (wavutse 1993) ni umukinnyi wa filime ukomoka muri Uganda, akaba Umwanditsi wa filimi n\u2019umugore uharanira inyungu z'igitsinagore. Ni umuyobozi mukuru wa Lepa Africa Films akaba yarashinze Leilah Nakabira For Charity Foundation. \nUburezi.\nNakabira yize Quantitative Economics muri kaminuza ya Makerere, Kampala, Uganda, ari naho yarangirije. Nyuma yigihe runaka mubikorwa bya firime, yahisemo gusubira kwiga amashusho. \nUmwuga.\nYakiriye ibihembo bitatu byumukinnyi \"mwiza wa Zahabu (Ikinamico)\", \"Umukinnyi wa\" Zahabu wizewe cyane na \"Golden Discovery Actor\" ibihembo byigihembo cya Golden Movie Awards Africa 2018 (GMAA) cyabaye ku ya 2 kamena, amazina yabatowe yitwa Palaise de la culture, Treichville, Abidjan, C\u00f4te d'Ivoire, kubera filime yakinnye yitwa, \"The Forbidden\", yakozwe na Nampala Claire. Mu Zulu Afurika Film Academy Awards (ZAFAA) 2018, arabyuka bahatanira mu \"Best Actor Female\" category kuko filime imwe. Yari bahatanira na yegukanye \"Best Actress\" igihembo mu Film Festival Awards UDADA y'abagore yabereye ku ya 20 Ukwakira, 2018 muri Kenya kuko filime imwe. Yari yongeye bahatanira mu \"Best Actress\" category ku African Film Festival (Arta'atu) Awards 2019, kuko filime imwe. Ibirori byabaye ku ya 30 Kamena muri salle ya Moody Performance, 2520 Street Street, Dallas, Texas, Amerika. Kuko hasigaye film imwe, mu kiyaga cya International Film Festival (LIPFF) Awards yabereye Ugushyingo 6-9, 2019 mu Kenya, yari ku rutonde byiciro bibiri igihembo: \"Best Child bakoze\" na \"Best Actress.\" \nMu munsi w\u2019abagore muri Afurika 2019, yagiriye inama abagore kutagira ubwoba bakurikirana intego zabo. "}
{"id": "9770", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9770", "title": "Godliver Gordian", "text": "Godliver Gordian ni filime yo muri Tanzaniya. Ni umwe mu bagize umuryango w\u2019ubutabazi ushingiye i New York, Global Medical Relief Fund, kandi yafashije abarangije muri albino kubona akazi bavugana n\u2019abakoresha mu izina ryabo, hatitawe ku bwoba bujyanye na albinos muri Tanzaniya. \nUmwuga.\nGordian yari ingenzi cyane muri Jordan Riber 2012 isaha n'igice ya Swahili language TV Series, \"Siri ya Mtungi\", aho yagize uruhare \"Cheusi\". Muri iyi filime kandi hagaragayemo nka Beatrice Taisamo, Yvonne Cherrie n'abandi. \nMuri 2015, yakinnye cyane muri firime yikinamico yo muri Tanzaniya ya Chande Omar yitwa, \"Aisha\". \nMu 2016, yari ku rutonde African Film na Arts Festival (Arta'atu) ibihembo mu \"Best Actress\" category, kubera uruhare yagize muri filimi, \"Aisha.\" Kuko uruhare kimwe no film, yari ku rutonde kuko Azam Bongo Movie Awards mu \"Best Actress\" category ku 2016 Zanzibar International Film Festival (ZIFF), bikaba yatsindiye. \nYagaragaye kandi muri filime yo gusetsa-ikinamico ya 2016 na Seko Shamte yitwa, \"Gutaha\". \nYabaye umuyobozi wa casting muri 2017 yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi byamafirime yo mu bwoko bwa Tanzania y\u2019igiswahili yakozwe na Amil Shivji yise, \"T-JUNCTION\", yakinnye: Magdalena Christopher, Hawa Alisa (Hawa Ally), Cojack Chilo. \nMuri 2018, yakinnye muri filime y\u2019ikinamico y\u2019ururimi rw\u2019igiswahili ya Jordan Riber, \"Bahasha (Ibahasha)\", aho yakinnye nka \"Hidaya\". Izindi nyenyeri zigaragara zirimo Ayoub Bombwe na Godliver Gordian. \nYagaragaye kandi muri \"Binti\" ya Seko Shamte, filime ikinamico yo muri Tanzaniya iteganijwe gusohoka mu 2021. Yakinnye nka \"Roza\". "}
{"id": "9771", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9771", "title": "Marwa Zein", "text": "Marwa Zein ni umunya Sudani ukora ibintu byinshi harimo umuyobozi wa firime, umwanditsi wumwanditsi hamwe nuwatunganya film. Niwe mwanditsi wa documentaire ya 2019, \"Khartoum Offside\", akaba n'umwunganira uburenganzira bw'umugore binyuze mu mirimo ye. Niwe washinze ORE Production, isosiyete ikora firime ya Khartoum ishingiye kuri Khartoum akaba n'umwe mu bakinnyi ba firime barindwi batoranijwe baturutse hirya no hino ku isi kugira ngo yitabe iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Cannes 2019 n'ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga rya Emerging Film Talent Association (IEFTA). \nUmwuga.\nKu mushinga we wo gutanga impamyabumenyi, Zein yanditse, ayobora kandi akora filime ngufi ya documentaire, \"A Game\", mu 2009, ihindurwa mu ndimi eshanu kandi itangwa nk'umuntu watoranijwe ku mugaragaro mu minsi mikuru mpuzamahanga 30. mu Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Dubai 2016 (DIFF), film ye ngufi, a week\", two days\", yakinnye na Yasmin Raies na Amro Saleh, yerekanwe bwa mbere. Yagaragaye no mu bindi birori bitandukanye bya firime. \nMu gutunganya iyi filime, yamaganye imyifatire mibi ya guverinoma ya Sudani ku ruhare rw\u2019abagore mu gukina filime. Nubwo atigeze ahura n\u2019umubiri ku buryo butaziguye mu gihe cyo gukora iyi filime, yakiriye iterabwoba rya kamera cyangwa ibikoresho bishoboka ko byangirika. Amaherezo ariko, yabonye uruhushya rukenewe rwo gufata iyi firime. Nyuma y\u2019impinduka za politiki zazanywe n\u2019impinduramatwara ya Sudani yo muri 2018/19, iyi filime yerekanwe ubwo hafungurwaga iserukiramuco rya sinema ryigenga rya Sudani i Khartoum muri Mutarama 2020. "}
{"id": "9772", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9772", "title": "Khartoum Offside", "text": "Khartoum Offside ni filime ya documentaire ya siporo yo muri Sudani ya 2019 yibanda ku bakobwa bakiri bato muri Sudani, yakozwe, yanditswe kandi iyobowe n\u2019umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Sudani Marwa Zein. Yerekanwe ku isi yose mu ihuriro rya Berlinale rya 2019 mu Budage kandi ni imwe muri filime eshatu zizwi cyane zo muri Sudani zo muri 2019. nkubutumwa bukuru kuri documentaire. \nUmusaruro.\nByatwaye Zein imyaka ine yo gukora iyi documentaire. Bitewe n\u2019imyumvire mibi y\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu bw\u2019umugore muri Sudani mbere y\u2019impinduramatwara ya Sudani yo muri 2018/19, Zein ntabwo yigeze ahura n\u2019umubiri, ahubwo yakiriwe n\u2019ubuyobozi bwa Sudani bwo gusenya kamera. Nubwo bimeze bityo ariko, film yafatiwe ahitwa Khartoum, muri Sudani, ikorwa na Marwa Zein muri ORE Productions na Hendrik Underbjerg kuri Stray Dog Productions, Copenhagen, Danemark na Oslo, Noruveje. \nInkuru n'amateka.\nHamwe n\u2019icyemezo gikomeye, itsinda ry\u2019abakobwa bakiri bato i Khartoum bagiye gukina umupira wamaguru wabigize umwuga, kubera ko leta y\u2019abasilamu bo muri Sudani yabujijwe. N\u2019ubwo Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umupira wamaguru mu gihugu ryakira amafaranga ya FIFA yagenewe amakipe y\u2019abagore, iyi kipe ikomeje guhezwa. Ariko, hariho urumuri rwicyizere, mugihe amatora mumashyirahamwe yerekana ko bishoboka kuvugurura sisitemu yose. Nubutwari nubutwari, barwanira kumenyekana kumugaragaro nkikipe yumupira wamaguru yabategarugori ya Sudani, bahanganye cyane nintego zabo. \nKapiteni Sara (Sara Jubara), umukirisitu ukiri muto, wavukiye mu majyaruguru ya Sudani, yerekana imitekerereze ya rwiyemezamirimo, kandi ashakisha imishinga y\u2019ubucuruzi kugira ngo inzozi zabo zibe impamo, ubwo akoranya ikipe ya Sudani mu gikombe cy\u2019isi cy\u2019abagore. Usibye gukenera gushaka inkunga, hari ibibazo byingenzi byabaturage bagomba guhura nabyo. \nMu kiganiro cye 'Gerageza kuba umugore ukina umupira w'amaguru muri Sudani', umunyeshuri Steve Howard yanditse kuri iyi filime ati: \"Abakinnyi b'umupira w'amaguru ni itsinda rivanze n'Abanyasudani na Sudani y'Amajyepfo ese abagore bakorera mu mibereho nk'abakozi bashinzwe kwita ku nyubako, abanyeshuri bo mu mashuri yisumbuye, abadandaza., na Bisa. Abanyamuryango barimo abagore bo mu misozi ya Nuba, akarere gakandamijwe cyane hafi y\u2019amajyaruguru yumupaka mushya. Kandi mu byo bahanganye harimo imbaraga z'abagize itsinda rya Sudani y'Amajyepfo imbaraga zo kuguma muri Sudani, aho ubu bakeneye uruhushya rwo gutura nyuma yo gutandukana kwa Sudani zombi mu 2011. \" \nKurekura no kwakirwa neza.\n\"Nk\u2019uko IMDb\" ibitangaza ngo iyi filime yasohotse ku ya 13 Gashyantare 2019. Bukeye bwaho, yerekanwe muri Forum y'Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Berlin, nyuma iza no muyindi minsi mikuru, nka Visions du R\u00e9el mu Busuwisi, CPH: DOX Copenhagen,Sheffield Doc / Fest na IDFA Amsterdam. Yerekanwe kandi mu Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya documentaire rya Hot Docs ryo ku ya 26 Mata 2019. Iyi filime yerekanwe kuri interineti ibinyujije kuri Zoom hamwe n'indi filime y'abagore b'Abanyafurika n'Abarabu yitwa \"The Bleaching Syndrome\" (2020), mu Cyarabu ifite insanganyamatsiko y'icyongereza, na Dardishi ku ya 24 Ukwakira 2020. I Khartoum, yerekanwe bwa mbere mu gufungura iserukiramuco rya sinema ryigenga rya Sudani muri Mutarama 2020. \nAkimara kwerekanwa bwa mbere i Berlin, uwanenze amafilime Vladan Petkovi\u0107 yise \"inyandiko ishishikaje, ikora ku mutima kandi rimwe na rimwe, ibisigo byerekana ibisigo\" maze Joseph Fahim yandika mu isubiramo rye kuri Berlinale 2019: \"Ubushake bukomeye, bwisanzuye kandi bwisanzuye kandi bukabije. yigenga, umupira w'amaguru wa Zein urwanya imyumvire nyamukuru y'abagore bo muri Sudani. \" \nMu gihe cyo kwerekanwa mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Afurika ryabereye i New York mu Kuboza 2020, ku rubuga rwa YouTube, ikiganiro kijyanye no gukora documentaire hagati ya Marwa Zein n\u2019umukinnyi wa filime ukomoka muri Sudani n\u2019umunyamerika Sarra Idriss Muri iki kiganiro, Zein yasobanuye intera ndende ya documentaire ze:\"I wanted to tackle many aspects about being Sudanese...Are we Arabs or not? Are we still classified based on the colour of our skin, the last name of our family? \u2013 Sexuality, the political situation, inequality of women and men, religion \u2013 all of this, I wanted to tell a story about.\""}
{"id": "9773", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9773", "title": "Toka McBaror", "text": "Toka McBaror ni producer wa filimi n'indirimbo muri Nigeria, ndetse ajya akora nk'Umuyobozi wa filimi na music video yavutse, yazuye na ishingiye mu Kaduna, Kaduna Leta, Nigeria ariko ukomoka Delta State. Afatwa na benshi nka jack na shobuja wamayeri yose yo gukora firime nubucuruzi. Ibihembo byinshi byatsindiye, byabyaye umusaruro kandi bigamije ubuhanga bwo guhanga udushya, umutoza wo gukina amafilime akaba n'umujyanama mu bijyanye no gutunganya amafilime, McBaror avugwa cyane nka Encyclopedia of Filmmaking hamwe n'ibihembo byinshi kuri kitty ye, harimo no gutanga ibihembo kuri \" Kada River \" muri 2018 \"Toronto International Nollywood Film Festival\" mu canada, 6 igihembo imikino kuko filime, Lotanna harimo: \"\"Best Film\",\" \"\"Best Director\",\" \"\"Best Cinematography\",\" \"\"Best Art Director\",\" \"Best Costume\" no \" \"Umwanditsi mwiza w'ijwi\" \" muri ibihembo bya zahabu ya 2017. \nAgomba kandi ibihembo bye, \"Filime Nziza Nyafurika\" na \"Umuyobozi mwiza wa Nollywood\" kuva mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime mpuzamahanga rya Nollywood 2018, TINFF, ryabereye i Toronto, muri Kanada. muri firime, Ikirwa, yongera gutorwa mu byiciro bya \" \"Cinematografi Nziza\" \" na \" \"Umuyobozi mwiza\" \" mu bihembo bya ZAFAA Global Awards, kubera filime ye ya Lotanna 2017. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2011, Mcbaror yayoboye umuririmbyi wo muri Nijeriya, amashusho y'indirimbo ya J'odie, \" \"Kuchi Kuchi\" (Oh Baby)\". \nKu wa gatanu, tariki ya 10 Gashyantare 2017, yayoboye filime \"Umugore wa Blogger\", yasohotse muri sinema zo muri Nijeriya. Iyi filime yakozwe na Seun Oloketuyi, igaragaramo abakinnyi ba Nollywood ndetse nabakinnyi nka Segun Arinze, Adejumoke Aderounmu, Deyemi Okanlawon, Ijeoma Grace Agu na Adeniyi Johnson. Muri 2017, filime \"Kada River \" yakozwe na we yatorewe igihembo mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Nollywood ryabereye i Toronto, muri Kanada. Mu bihembo bya Golden Movie 2017, yatowe mu byiciro bitandatu, birimo: \" \"Filime Nziza\" \", \" \"Umuyobozi mwiza\" \", \" \"Sinema nziza\" \", \" \"Umuyobozi w\u2019ubuhanzi bwiza\" \", \"\"Imyambarire myiza\" \", \" \"Umwanditsi mwiza w\u2019amajwi\" \".\nMuri Kanama 2018, filime yayoboye yise \" Ikirwa \" yahawe \"Filime Nziza Nyafurika\" na we ubwe, \"Umuyobozi wa Nollywood Nziza\" mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime mpuzamahanga rya Nollywood, TINFF, ryabereye i Toronto, muri Kanada. Muri Nzeri muri uwo mwaka, yayoboye filime, \" Merry Men: The Real Yoruba Demons \" ya Ayo Makun, umunyarwenya uzwi cyane wo muri Nijeriya. Yongeye gutorwa mu byiciro bya \" \"Cinematografi Nziza\" \" na \" \"Umuyobozi mwiza\" \" muri ZAFAA Global Awards, kubera filime ye, Lotanna 2017.\nMuri 2019, yasohoye igikorwa cyicyaha cya TV cyitwa, \"Paper Boat\". \nMu ntangiriro za 2020, yayoboye filime ya mbere y\u2019umwaka yitwa Lilian Afegbai \"yise \"Imirongo ibiri\" \". Nyuma ku ya 22 Gashyantare mu kiganiro n\u2019abanyamakuru i Abuja, yatangaje ko hagiye gukorerwa filime nshya ye yise \"Red Caravan\", azayobora kandi afatanyirize hamwe, hamwe n\u2019ikiguzi cya N61\u00a0miliyoni, kandi agomba kurasirwa muri Leta ya Kaduna. Filime yibanze ku gicuri kandi yashyizweho mu myaka ya 1880, mugihe ubucuruzi bwabacakara bwateye imbere kandi bugomba gukinishwa nabakinnyi nabakinnyi bagera kuri 600. Mu gihe cya Covid-19, McBaror yasohoye urubuga rwa firime ngufi zitwa, \"The Chronicles\", zigamije gukwirakwiza abaturage ku ndwara ya Coronavirus. \nBy 2021, we mbere kugerageza ku n'ikinya movie umusaruro, filimi yise \"uhindishwa ubuzima Hano\" yari trailer yayo mugaragaro kurekurwa mu Mutarama Star Afeez Oyetoro, Nancy Isime, Bimbo Ademoye ex Big Brother Naija (season 3) housemate Temidayo Adenibuyan bita Teddy A, Beverly Osu, na Mike Godson. Muri Gashyantare twabonye bwa mbere kuri Filime ya \"Underbelly\" ikinamo ibikorwa bya Nollywood nka Stan Nze, Femi Adebayo, Ali Nuhu, Maryam Booth na Kunle Coker."}
{"id": "9774", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9774", "title": "Meg Otanwa", "text": "Meg Otanwa (yavutse ku ya 14 Gashyantare) ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Nigeriya kandi wahoze ari umunyamabanki. Yavuze ko akunda indimi kandi bivugwa ko avuga bitanu neza. Yatangiye gukinira Nollywood muri 2011 muri filime, \"Nzatwara Amahirwe yanjye\" kandi yari yagaragaye muri firime nka \"1 Ukwakira\" (2018), \"Ojuju\" (2014), \"Kpians: Umunsi mukuru w'ubugingo\" (2014) n'abandi benshi. Yabaye igicapo cyo mu Gushyingo 2006 cya Zen Magazine. \nUbuzima n'uburere.\nOtanwa ukomoka kuvuga karere Idoma ya Benue Leta, Nigeria, gukura igice mu Lagos. Akomoka mu muryango ufite abagore benshi kandi avuga indimi eshanu zirimo Icyongereza, Yoruba, Igifaransa, Hausa, ururimi rwe kavukire Idoma na Espagne. Yahawe impamyabumenyi muri kaminuza ya Ahmadu Bello, muri Zariya aho yakuye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu rurimi rw'icyongereza, hanyuma akomeza kubona impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye no gucunga abakozi muri kaminuza ya TIME, Tuniziya, Tuniziya, nyuma yaho, aba Master of Business Administration impamyabumenyi muri kaminuza ya Jean Moulin, Lyon, mu Bufaransa. \nUmwuga.\nNyuma yakoze mu kiringo kirekire ku Banki Nyafurika Itsura Amajyambere, Tunis, Tunisia, Otanwa yeguye kandi atora umwuga mu gukora, gufata we Nollywood gukinira mu 2011, featuring mu kubyina drama film by Emem Isong, \"I\u2019ll Take My Chance\". Muri 2014, yakinnye muri filime ya Kunle Afolayan, ku ya 1 Ukwakira ; mu rukurikirane rw'amakinamico ya Bodunrin Sasore, \"Mbere ya 30\", yakinnye nka \"Aisha\"; no muri firime ya Charles Novia \", Atlanta\". \nYakinnye muri Afrika Magic 2016 ya mbere ya telenovela \", Hush\" ya Nollywood, nka \"Koko Ogunbiade\". Hagaragaye kandi Richard Mofe Damijo, Thelma Okoduwa na Rotimi Adelegan. \nYahawe igihembo muri Afurika Magic Viewers Choice Awards 2017 kugirango abone \"Umukinnyi witwaye neza mu\" cyiciro cya Drama ndetse nigihembo cyo kumenyekanisha AMVCA kubera serivise y'umwimerere MNET yatsindiye, kubera uruhare yagize muri thriller telenovela, \"Hush\". Uyu mukinnyi w'amafilime kandi yari yitabiriye kuri tapi itukura y'ibirori bya 2018. \nMuri filime ya Tosin Igho 2018 yise, \"Eva\", yakinnye nka \"Yewande\", akina nabakinnyi nabakinnyi nka Beverly Naya, Hauwa Allhabura, John Okafor nabandi. \nMuri filime ya 2020, \"Kuri Maria Ebun Pataki\", iyobowe na Damilola Orimogunje, yakinnye nka \"Derin\". \nYari featured nk'uko \"Angela\" mu Dimeji Ajibola wa sci-fi thriller, \"Ratnik\", ngo kurekurwa Ukuboza 1, 2020 na featuring Osas Ighodaro, Karibi Fubara, Pawulo Utomi n'abandi. "}
{"id": "9775", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9775", "title": "Plan B (2019 film)", "text": "Plan B ni filime yo gusetsa y\u2019urukundo ya Kenya na Nigeriya yasohotse 2019 yanditswe, iyobowe kandi ikosorwa nuwakoze firime ya Nigeriya, Lowladee. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo umukinnyi wa filime ukomoka muri Kenya akaba na producer Sarah Hassan, Catherine Kamau Karanja, hamwe n\u2019umukinnyi wa Nigeriya Daniel Etim Effiong bakinnye. \nIyi filime yatsindiye igihembo cyiza cya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba muri Afurika ya Magic Viewers 'Choice Awards (AMVCAs). \nUmusaruro.\nIyi filime yakozwe na Lowladee ku bufatanye na Alfajiri Productions, uruganda rukora ibicuruzwa muri Kenya. \nUmugambi.\nGutandukana na Ethan we (Lenana Kariba), Lisa Waweru (Sarah Hassan) yagiye kunywa mu kabari, ahahurira n'umugabo udasanzwe. Guhagarara ijoro rimwe hamwe n\u2019umuntu utazi maze aratwita. Nyuma y'amezi atanu, umunyamurwango wacitse, Lisa, yamenye ko umugabo atwite ari umuyobozi mukuru wa Nigeriya muri Afrika yuburasirazuba akwirakwiza isosiyete ishingiye kuri Nairobi, Dele Coker (Daniel Etim Effiong). Kuruhande rwinshuti ye, Joyce (Catherine Kamau Karanja), gahunda nziza yageze kugirango Dele asabe inshingano zo gutwita. Iyi gahunda igomba rwose guhinduka ubuzima burambye kuri bose. \nKurekura.\nFilime yasohotse ku munsi w'abakundana, ku wa gatanu 14 Gashyantare 2019. Yerekanwe kuri NTV (Kenya) ijoro ryabanjirije gusohoka kwisi. "}
{"id": "9776", "revid": "15375", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9776", "title": "15th Africa Movie Academy Awards", "text": "Africa Movie Academy Awards yo muri 2019. Ni ibirori byabaye ku cyumweru tariki ya 27 Ukwakira 2019 ijoro ritazibagirana kuri Event Centre muri muri Nigeria. \nIbirori byitabiriwe n'Abayobozi, Abakinnyi, n'Abanditsi ba filme. Iri joro ryo gutanga ibihembo ryayobowe na, na Funnybone, ni nyuma yo kwakira inyandiko zigera kuri 700 zatanzwe hagati y'itariki ya 21 Ukwakira 2018 na 26 Mutarama 2019. \nAbateguye ibirori batangaje Abatoranijwe ku ya 19 Nzeri 2019. Filime nka na nizo zari ziyoboye izindi muri 13 zatanzwe mu cyiciro naho \"The Burial Kojo\" na \"Redemption\" byakurikiranye n'izindi 10. \"\" yatsindiye mu byiciro bitandukanye nka Best film, achievement in costume design no muri Achievement in makeup ndetse n'igihembo cy'umukinnyi mwiza. Filime ishingiye kuri politiki yitwa yatwaye ibihembo bitatu(3) muri iryo joro rimwe, harimo ibihembo by'umukinnyi witwaye neza mu nshingano zunganira (best actress in supporting role), umukinnyi wa filime mwiza, ndetse na filime nziza yo muri Nigeriya. \nAMASHAKIRO;"}
{"id": "9777", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9777", "title": "Festival du Cin\u00e9ma Africain de Khouribga", "text": "Iserukiramuco du Cin\u00e9ma Africain de Khouribga (FCAK) cyangwa iserukiramuco rya sinema nyafurika i Khouribga ni iserukiramuco rya sinema nyafurika ryabereye i Khouribga muri Maroc. Ryashinzwe mu 1977, ni rimwe mu minsi mikuru ya firime ya kera kandi ikomeye muri Maroc. \nAmateka.\nKuva mu 1967, club ya sinema yariho muri Khouribga, ifite abanyamuryango 200 bakora kandi berekanwa buri cyumweru. Mu 1977, iyobowe na Noureddine Sa\u00efl, ihuriro ry\u2019igihugu ry\u2019amafirime ya sinema muri Maroc (FNCCM) ryafashije gutunganya Rencontres Cinematographiques de Khouribga. Ikipe ya sinema yaho yemeje ko ikomeza kubaho. Kubera ko inganda zikomeye za Khouribga ari Ubucukuzi bwa fosifate, iyi club yabonye inkunga mu biro bya Fosifati. Iyobowe n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga wa Sinema ya gatatu, club ya sinema yemeje ko iserukiramuco ryibanze kuri Afurika. \nInama ya gatatu ya Afurika ya Film ya Khouribga yabaye kuva ku ya 2\u20139 Mata 1988. Hateganijwe ingengo y\u2019imari 900.000 (amafaranga 630.000), ubutumire bwahawe abenegihugu 100 n\u2019abanyamahanga bagera kuri 30 baturutse mu bihugu by\u2019abarabu, Uburayi na Afurika. Abaminisitiri bane ba guverinoma bitabiriye iryo funguro rikomeye, kandi abitabiriye nibura 50.000 bareba firime zo mu bihugu 14. Inama ya kane yabaye ku ya 17-24 Werurwe 1990. Inama ya gatandatu yabaye kuva ku ya 26 Werurwe kugeza ku ya 2 Mata 1994. \nKuva mu 2004 FCAK iyobowe na Fondasiyo, Nourddine Sa\u00efl aba Perezida na Lahoussaine N'douf nk'umuyobozi mukuru. "}
{"id": "9778", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9778", "title": "Cinema of Botswana", "text": "Amateka ya Sinema ya Botswana (cyangwa sinema muri Botswana) agizwe no gukora film mu gihugu cya Botswana muri Afrika yepfo, haba mbere na nyuma ya Botswana. Sinema ya Botswana ni imwe muri sinema nyinshi zo muri Afurika zirimo na sinema z'igihugu cya B\u00e9nin, Misiri, Kenya, Nijeriya na Afurika y'Epfo, n'ibindi.\nInganda za firime zaho muri Botswana ziswe \"Botswood\" na bamwe, bisa nuburyo uruganda rwamafirime rwitwa \"Bollywood \", umunya Nigeriya \" Nollywood \", naho umunyamerika \" Hollywood \".\nAmateka ya mbere.\nNk\u2019uko umuhanga mu by'amateka Neil Parsons abivuga, kopi ya mbere izwiho kurokoka ya firime yanditswe muri Botswana guhera mu 1906 na 1907. Ku bwe, isosiyete ikorera mu mujyi wa Londere mu Bwongereza ifitwe n\u2019umugabo witwa Charlie Urban yohereje kamera kugira ngo bafate amashusho yerekeranye n\u2019urugendo rwa gari ya moshi ya Bechuanaland i Victoria Falls, urugendo rwa gari ya moshi rwanyuze mu karere k\u2019igihugu cya Botswana muri iki gihe. Umunyamerika witwa Rudolf P\u00f6ch ukomoka muri Otirishiya yaje kuza akora urukurikirane rwa firime ngufi mu gihugu cya Afurika, cyarimo amajwi n'amabara kandi kigaragaza umusaza w'imyaka mirongo itandatu, Kubi. Parsons yafataga Kubi \"umustar wa mbere wa Botswana\". \nMu 1912, Umunyamerika uzwi ku izina rya W. Butcher yabonye uruhushya rwo kujya mu burasirazuba bwa Botswana gufata amashusho y'urugendo rw'abasirikare ba Bangwato; ibi byabereye mu mujyi wa Serowe. Kuva mu Ntambara ya Mbere y'Isi Yose kugeza mu Ntambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose, ibihangano bya firime bya Botswana byiganjemo documentaire zivuga ku baturage bo mu karere ka Botswana y'iburengerazuba ndetse n'amakuru yerekeye ibintu bibera mu burasirazuba.\nBivugwa ko, Umukinnyi wa mbere wa Filime ukomoka muri Botswana yari umugabo witwa Molefi Pilane, umuturage waho, umutware w\u2019amoko bivugwa ko yanditse abagore boga bakoresheje kamera ntoya. Umugore uzwi ku izina rya \"Miss Muichison\" yafashe amashusho yerekana amasaha agera kuri abiri, asobanura imikorere ya African Auxiliary Pioneers Corps ; ibice bibiri bizwi ko bizarokoka naho icya gatatu gikekwa ko kiriho muri Botswana. \nFilime yitwa Bechuanaland Protectorate yakozwe mu gihe cy'Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose kandi ikaba ifitanye isano n'abasirikare ba APC basubiye mu rugo baturutse muri Afurika y'Amajyaruguru nyuma yo gutsinda urugendo rwo gusubira muri Botswana. Muri firime hagaragaramo umutware wimiryango Bathoen II.\nUmukinnyi wa firime muri Afurika y'Epfo, Bill Lewis yaje mu karere ka Botswana mu 1947 gufata amashusho y\u2019uruzinduko rwa cyami mu murima abasirikare ba APC bari. Umunyamerika Tom Larson nawe yaje mu mpera za 1940; yafashe amashusho ya documentaire ebyiri, imwe yiswe \" Abakora imvura ya Okavango \" yasohotse mu 1948. \n1950 kugeza 1960.\nUmunyapolitiki waho, uzaba Perezida wa mbere wa Botswana Seretse Khama Umwirabura, yashakanye na Ruth Williams Khama, Umuzungu ukomoka mu Bwongereza, mu 1948, bituma Botswana yitabwaho n\u2019amahanga kubera amategeko ya Apartheid yo mu karere; ibi byatumye amasosiyete menshi atunganya firime akora movietone reels kubashakanye. Ibigo byafashe amashusho biranga Paramount Pictures hamwe namakuru yisi yose. Filime zerekeye aba couple zakomeje gukorwa neza nyuma yo kuva muri Botswana gutura mubuhungiro.\n1953 yabonye umusaruro \" Remmants mu isiganwa badapfuye \", yakozwe na Molepolole utuye Louis Knobel, a White umuntu wakoraga kuko Afurika y'Epfo Serivisi z'amakuru. Iyi filime irambuye ubuzima bwabaturage ba San batuye mubutayu bwa Kalahari, burimo igice cya Botswana. Yakozwe munsi yizina rya \"Kalahari Films\" kandi imara iminota 17. \n\" Abahigi \", filime yo mu 1957 yakozwe n\u2019umunyamerika John Marshall na yo yerekanaga ku bantu batuye i Kalahari, kimwe n\u2019ikiganiro cya BBC, \" Isi Yatakaye ya Kalahari \", cyerekanwe naLaurens van der Post wakiriye Afurika y'Epfo.\nIgitaramo cyo muri Amerika \" Mugenzi wa Omaha's Wild Kingdom \" nacyo cyaje gukina amashusho hirya no hino muri Botswana mu myaka ya za 1960. \nBotswana yabonye ubwigenge mu 1966, izana impinduka muri politiki, imibereho myiza n\u2019umuco muri ako karere, harimo n\u2019uburyo amafilime yakozwe ndetse akanatezwa imbere mu gihugu gishya cya Afurika.\nAmateka ya vuba.\nMu 1980, John Marshall yafashe amashusho yandi mashusho menshi ya Botswana ajyanye na Botswana, \" N\u01c3ai, Inkuru y Umugore wumugore \", kubyerekeye urugamba rwa a ! Umugore wa Kung, N! Ai, washakanye ku gahato afite imyaka umunani n'umuvuzi wimiryango.\nUrwenya rwo mu 1981, \"The Gods Must Be Crazy \" rwashyizwe muri Botswana maze ruba icyamamare mpuzamahanga; ryakwirakwije umwe mu bakozi batatu ndetse n\u2019ibice bitatu bitemewe: 1988 \" The Gods Must Be Crazy II \" nayo yakunzwe cyane, filime zombi zituma umukinnyi wa Namibiya N\u01c3xau \u01c2Toma azwi cyane muri firime, naho \" Crazy Safari \" yo mu 1991 niyo yambere mubikurikiranye bitatu bitemewe. byakozwe na societe ya firime ikorera muri Hong Kong yitwa Orange Sky Golden Harvest, nayo yakinnye na N\u01c3xau \u01c2Toma. Abandi bombi ba nyuma, \"Umusazi muri Hong Kong\" (1993) na \"Imana igomba gusetsa mubushinwa\" (1995) ntabwo bafatiwe amashusho muri Botswana.\n2000 yakozwe na Disney\"\"Whispers: An Elephant's Tale \" yafatiwe amashusho muri Botswana, yakinwe na Angela Bassett wamamaye muri Hollywood. Nyuma yaho, muri 2009, muri Botswana ibice bya firime ya M. Saravanan yo mu rurimi rwa Tamil, \" Ayan (film) \" byafashwe amajwi.\n\"Ubwongereza \" bwamamaye cyane, buvuga ku nkuru y'urukundo nyarwo rwa Seretse Khama na Ruth Williams, yafashwe amashusho igice hagati ya Botswana na London, Ubwongereza maze isohoka ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu 2016.\nAmasosiyete ya sinema.\nBotswana ifite amasosiyete menshi ya sinema na sinema, harimo na New Capitol Cinemas na Gaborone Cine Centre. "}
{"id": "9779", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9779", "title": "Gloria kamanzi uwizera", "text": "Gloria kamanzi uwizera.\nGloria kamanzi uwizera ni umunyarwandakazi akaba ari we washinze Glo creations Ltd ndetse akaba n'umunyamuryango wa Women Entrepreneurship programme(AWEP Rwanda).\nUmwuga.\nGloria kamanzi uwizera yatangije Glo creations Ltd muri 2008 iherereye mu Kiyovu, aho akora imyambaro n'imitako yo mu nzu. Yifashisha batik akaba ari uburyo akoresha akora ibihangano bye akoresheje amaboko."}
{"id": "9780", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9780", "title": "Motlatsi Mafatshe", "text": "Motlatsi Mafatshe (wavutse 1984), ni umukinnyi wa filimi n'umucuranzi wa Afrika yepfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime zizwi cyane za \"Leta\" \"yihohoterwa\", Sokhulu na \"Partners II\" na \"Zama Zama\". Usibye gukina, ni n'umucuranzi uzwi cyane wakoze inshuro zirenga 400. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1984 i Soweto, muri Afurika y'Epfo mu muryango wa politiki. \nYashakanye na Millicent Nkangane, umunyamideli kuva mu Gushyingo 2014. Bahuriye bwa mbere mu rusengero. \nUmwuga.\nYakinnye 'Sechaba' ku isabune izwi cyane ya SABC 3 \"Isidingo\" muri 2010. Amaze gukina imyaka irenga icyenda, yaje kwinjira kumugaragaro mu itsinda ryayobora iki gitaramo muri 2018. Muri 2019, yatsindiye igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza mu bakinnyi ba mbere muri Royalty Soapie Awards. \nYakinnye kandi nka 'Wandile Dhlomo' mu ikinamico y'umupira w'amaguru \"Shooting Stars\". Hanyuma yagaragaye afite uruhare 'Casper' murukurikirane \"Iyo Twari Umwirabura\". Muri 2018, yafatanije gukora romcom \"Love Lives Here\". \nKu ya 3 Gashyantare 2006, yibasiwe n'umuhanzi wa hip hop Thulani Ngcobo uzwi ku izina rya 'Pitch Black Afro' mu birori bya mbere bya Afurika y'Epfo kuri televiziyo ya \"Tsotsi\"."}
{"id": "9781", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9781", "title": "Khulu Skenjana", "text": "Mkhulu Malusi Manqoba Skenjana (yavutse 6 Mata 1982), uzwi Khulu Skenjana, ni umukinnyi wa Afurika y'Epfo. Azwi cyane ku ruhare rwe muri televiziyo izwi cyane ya \"Machine Gun Preacher\", \"Zulu\" na \"Zama Zama\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 6 Mata 1982 i Soweto, muri Afurika y'Epfo.\u00a0\nYashakanye na mugenzi we bakina filime Mona Monyane. Bashakanye muri 2016 bamarana imyaka ine hamwe nabana babiri. Umwana we wa kabiri Amani-Amaza Wamazulu Skenjana yavutse ku ya 16 Ugushyingo 2017 apfa nyuma y'iminsi irindwi avutse. Umukobwa we w'imfura ni Ase-Ahadi Lesemole Mamphai Skenjana wavutse muri Kanama 2016. \nUmwuga.\nKuva mu myaka ya za 2000 yatangiye gukina abashyitsi batagaragara muri serivise za tereviziyo nka \"Ahantu hitwa Urugo\", \"Binnelanders\" na \"Generations\". Hagati aho, yagaragaye muri televiziyo izwi cyane ya \"All Access Mzansi\" maze ahindura nk'umuhanzi w'ijwi. Hanyuma yagaragaye muri serial \"Entabeni\" akina 'Kumkani Modise'. \nMuri 2008, yakinnye nka 'Mandla' muri mini-serie ya \"Nowa\" kuva muri Nyakanga kugeza Kanama. Muri uwo mwaka, yagize uruhare rukomeye muri NBC ya \"The Philanthropist\". Maze mu 2010, we yagize uruhare 'Dawidi Tabane' mu \"biganiro yimije Game.\" Hagati aho, yagaragaye afite uruhare rwa 'Thomas' mu rukurikirane rwa \"Hola Mpinji\". Yagaragaye kandi muri \"serivise nyinshi zizwi nka\" \"Sokhulu &amp; Partners\", \"Rhythm City\", \"Hola Mpinji\", \"A Place Called Home\" and \"Jozi-H\". \nMu mwaka wa 2011, yatangiye gukina filime afite uruhare 'Max' muri filime \"48\". Muri uwo mwaka, yagaragaye muri filime \"Machine Gun Preacher\". Muri 2013, yakinnye cyane 'Themba' muri film \"Zulu\". Muri uwo mwaka, yinjiye muri saison ya kabiri ya \"Intersexions\" hanyuma muri \"Tempy Pushas\". "}
{"id": "9782", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9782", "title": "Louw Venter", "text": "Louw Venter (yavutse ku ya 16 Kanama 1975), ni Umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Afurika yepfo akaba n'umukinnyi wa firime. \"Azwi cyane mubuyobozi\" bwe no kwandika muri firime zizwi cyane \"Igiti\", Konfetti na \"Swartwater\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 16 Kanama 1975 i Cape Town, muri Afurika y'Epfo.\nUmwuga.\nMu 2001, yakinnye bwa mbere muri firime na \"Final Solution\" aho yagize uruhare ruto nk 'umunyamuryango wa Paramilitary. Mu 2002, yakinnye 'Marco' muri filime yo mu Butaliyani \"The Piano Player\" iyobowe na Jean-Pierre Roux. Mu 2003, yakinnye muri firime ebyiri: \"Adrenaline\" na \"Citizen Verdict\".\nUsibye gukina, ni n'umwanditsi w'inyandiko wanditse filime yatsindiye ibihembo bya \"Konfetti\" yayobowe na Zaheer Goodman-Bhyat. Usibye ibyo, yari umwanditsi wa \"serivise za tereviziyo: Rugby Motors\" na \"Vinkel &amp; Koljander\". Muri 2015, yerekanwe bwa mbere na firime ngufi \"Leemte\". Nyuma yo gutsinda kwa firime, yakoze televiziyo \"Vinkel &amp; Koljander\" muri 2016. Muri 2016, yamenyekanye cyane muri firime \"Kalushi: The Story of Solomon Mahlangu\", yari ishingiye ku nkuru y'impamo. Muri filime, yakinnye uruhare rwa 'Van Heerden'. Filime yagenze neza kandi itangwa mubirori byinshi bya firime.\nVenter yakoze kandi urwenya hamwe na mugenzi we wo gusetsa muri Afurika yepfo Rob Van Vuuren. Bombi bagaragaye nk'abantu bavugwa Corne (Venter) na Twakkie (Van Vuuren) murukurikirane rwa videwo ya YouTube na gahunda yitwa \"The Amazing Show\". Venter yakinnye kandi murumuna wa Van Vuuren muri comedi ya \"Van der Merwe\" muri 2017.\nMuri 2020, yayoboye kandi yandika filime ye ya mbere yitwa \"Stam\" yasohotse kuri BoxOffice ya DStv mu Kwakira. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere ku isi yose mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Durban muri Nzeri 2020. Yerekanwe kandi muri 18 ya Tofifest International Film Festival 2020 muri Polonye. Iyi filime yatsindiye igihembo cyiza cya Afurika yepfo mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Durban 2020 (DIFF). "}
{"id": "9783", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9783", "title": "Thabo Rametsi", "text": "Thabo Andrew Rametsi II (yavutse 17 Nyakanga 1988), azwi nka Thabo Rametsi, ni umukinnyi wa firime na producer muri Afurika y'Epfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri serial zizwi cyane\"The Giver\", \"The Gamechangers\" and \"Kalushi: The Story of Solomon Mahlangu\"\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 17 Nyakanga 1988 i Umlazi, KwaZulu-Natal, Afurika y'Epfo. Nyuma yaje kwimukira muri Kempton Park yiga mu ishuri ribanza rya Norkem Park nyuma yiga mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Norkem. Mu gihe cy\u2019ishuri, yateje imbere ubuhanga bwe bwo gukina, anakina amatangazo yamamaza kuri tereviziyo. Nyuma yaje kurangiza impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri UNISA. \nMuri Mutarama 2019, ngo yaba yarahohotewe n'itsinda ry'abanyamuryango ba Johannesburg's Community Policing Forum (CPF). \nUmwuga.\nMu 2010, yakoze ibihuje gukinira na SABC1 gukina amarushanwa series \"ishuri Act.\" Hanyuma muri 2011, yakinnye nka 'David' muri serivise ya \"Wild at Heart\". Mu mwaka wa 2012, yatangiye gukina sinema na \"Lobola ya Fanie Fourie\" akina 'Motlatsi. Yagaragaye kandi kuri televiziyo nka \"High Rollers\" nk'impfubyi 'Muzi Khuzwayo' mu 2013. \nMuri 2014, yagize uruhare mu bashyitsi mu kiganiro cya televiziyo mpuzamahanga izwi cyane mu \"gihugu\". Nyuma yaje gukina filime ya tereviziyo \"The Gamechangers\" anakina nk'umwicanyi ruharwa ' Devin Moore ' ari kumwe n'abakinnyi mpuzamahanga bazwi cyane Daniel Radcliffe na Bill Paxton. Muri 2016, yamenyekanye cyane muri firime yerekana \"Kalushi: The Story of Solomon Mahlangu\", yari ishingiye ku nkuru y'impamo. Muri iyo filime, yakinnye cyane ' Solomon Kalushi Mahlangu ', wishwe na guverinoma ya apartheid afite imyaka 23. Muri Nzeri 2016, yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza kubera uru ruhare mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya BRICS mu Buhinde. \nMuri 2017, yakinnye nk'umunyamakuru ushinzwe iperereza 'Tebogo Ramolang' mu gihembwe cya kane cya televiziyo \"Hard Copy\". "}
{"id": "9784", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9784", "title": "Sandy Mokwena", "text": "Sandy Mokwena (26 Kamena 1949\u201324 Mutarama 2018), yari umukinnyi wa filimi muri Afrika yepfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe muri serial izwi cyane \"gushyingura\" abicanyi, \"T\u00f6dliche Gesch\u00e4fte\" na \"Scandal!\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 26 Kamena 1949 i Soweto, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yashakanye na Grace Mokwena. Abashakanye bafite umukobwa umwe, Keabetswe. \nYapfuye ku ya 24 Mutarama 2018 mu gitondo azize ibintu bisanzwe afite imyaka 68. Umuhango wo gushyingura wabereye mu rusengero rwa Grace Bible i Soweto ku ya 26 Mutarama 2018. Nyuma yashyinguwe ahitwa Intwari Acre mu irimbi rya West Park, Johannesburg. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1972, yakinnye mu \"ikinamico Iphi Ntombi\" akina 'Cappie'. Hamwe n'ikinamico, yazengurutse ku rwego mpuzamahanga akomeza gukina kugeza mu 1984. hanyuma muri televiziyo \"Going Up\". \nMuri 2005, yatorewe kuba umukinnyi 'Bra Eddie Khumalo' muri opera yisabune ya televiziyo ya \"Scandal!\". Iki gitaramo cyamenyekanye cyane aho Sandy yakomeje kugira uruhare kugeza apfuye muri 2018. Umuhango wo kwibuka wabereye kuri Scandal! sitidiyo ku wa gatatu mu rwego rwo kubahiriza imyaka 17 yamaze muri serial. Hagati aho, yakinnye nka 'Ken Mokoena' muri serial \"Yizo Yizo 1\". \nUsibye \"Scandal!\", Yatanze ibiganiro byinshi kuri tereviziyo nka \"Generations\", \"Khululeka\", \"Soul City\", \"Ubutabera kuri Bose\" na \"Tolerance Zero\". Hagati aho, yakoraga muri filime: \"Taxi to Soweto\" (1992), \"The Principal\" (1996), \"Dead End\" (1999) and \"Scarback\" (2000) "}
{"id": "9785", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9785", "title": "Masasa Mbangeni", "text": "Masasa Lindiwe Mbangeni ni umukinnyi wa firime muri Afurika y'Epfo. Azwi cyane ku ruhare rwe nka \"Thembeka Shezi\" muri televiziyo izwi cyane ya \"Scandal!\". \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nYavutse ku ya 6 Werurwe 1987 i Port Elizabeth, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Nyuma yaje kwimukira i Johannesburg kugira ngo yige.\u00a0\nUmwuga.\nYabonye buruse ya Mandela Rhodes yo kwiga muri kaminuza ya Witwatersrand nyuma arangiza impamyabumenyi ye ya Bachelor of Arts Degree muri Dramatic Arts kabuhariwe mu kwerekana no kuyobora. Yagize yakinnye Umushyitsi ku serials televiziyo ebyiri: nk'uko 'Eunice' ku BBC icyaha drama \"Akira Abahamya\" kandi 'wungirije bwite Jackie wa' ku soapie M-Net, \"Egoli.\" \"Yakinnye kandi mu makinamico\" atatu kuri Theatre yisoko ya Johannesburg: Nogogo, \"Sundjata\" na \"Amen Corner\", iyobowe na James Ngcobo. Hagati aho, yazengurutse iserukiramuco rya Grahamstown hamwe \"n\u2019ikinamico Oedipus @ Koonu\".\u00a0\nMuri 2013, yinjiye mu bakinnyi ba televiziyo izwi cyane ya \"Scandal!\" kandi yakinnye nka 'Thembeka Shezi'. Uruhare rwamenyekanye cyane, nubwo, yavuye ku nshingano mu 2016. Icyakora, yahawe ibihembo bibiri byumukinnyi witwaye neza mu Isabune ya TV yakuye muri South African Film and Television Awards (SAFTA) muri 2014 na 2015 kubera uruhare. Muri icyo gihe, yahawe igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza muri DStv Mzansi Magic Viewers Choice Award. Nyuma ya \"Scandal!\", yagaragaye muri saison ebyiri za \"serivise za\" tereviziyo ya Thola kuri televiziyo SABC2. Hanyuma yakinnye nka 'Celia' murukurikirane rwo \"Gusarura\".\u00a0 Nyuma yaho asubira biganiro hanyuma Inyuguti yarashwe bapfuye, gufata Mbangeni wa gusohoka kabiri mu kwerekana. \nMuri 2011, yakinnye muri firime ya \"Machine Gun Preacher\". Usibye gukina, yitabiriye ubukangurambaga bwambaye ubusa bwa Marie Claire mu 2015 hagamijwe gukangurira abaturage ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina rikorerwa abagore n'abana.\u00a0"}
{"id": "9786", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9786", "title": "Lorcia Cooper", "text": "Lorcia Cooper-Khumalo (yavutse 9 Ugushyingo 1978), ni umukinnyi wa filime n'umubyinnyi muri Afurika y'Epfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri serivise zizwi cyane za televiziyo \"Lockdown\", \"Zulu Wedding\" and \"Hey Boy\" \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 9 Ugushyingo 1978 i Cape Town, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yashakanye na Mandla Khumalo. Abashakanye bafite umukobwa umwe n'umuhungu umwe. \nMuri 2019, yarwaye lymph node yabyimbye muri tiroyide. Kugira ngo avurwe, yatewe inshinge za karuboni ya dioxyde de puffness mu jisho. \nUmwuga.\nIgihe yari afite imyaka ine, ababyeyi be bamwandikishije mu ishuri ryo kubyina nyuma yo kubona ko akunda kubyina kandi yitabira amarushanwa yo kubyina yo muri Amerika y'Epfo na Ballroom. Afite imyaka itanu, yatsindiye amarushanwa ye ya mbere muri shampiyona yintara kubyina Ballroom ndetse nimbyino zo muri Amerika y'Epfo. Afite imyaka umunani, yize mu ishuri ry\u2019imbyino kandi yiga kubyina iyobowe n\u2019umukorikori uzwi cyane witwa Debby Turner, wabaye umujyanama n\u2019umuyobozi. Nyuma yaje kwinjira mu ishuri ry\u2019imbyino rya North West Arts Council aho yagize amahirwe yo kuba umwarimu mu myaka yashize. Igihe yari afite imyaka 19, yatsindiye igihembo cyiza cya FNB Vita. \nNyuma yaje kwifatanya numuyoboro wa SABC2 ahinduka Travel Xplorer. Muri kiriya gihe, yatumiriwe gukina 'Cindi' muri filime \"Hey Boy\" iyobowe na Andre Odendaal yerekanwe mu 2003. Muri 2008, yagizwe umwe mu bacamanza mu marushanwa yo kubyina, \"Dans!\" \"Dans!\" \"Dans!\" byerekanwe kuri ykNET. Mu mwaka wa 2008, yabaye umucuranzi wa koreografi n'umucamanza mu marushanwa nyayo, 'High School Musical: Spotlight Africa yepfo' yanyuze kuri M-Net. \nMuri 2017, yakinnye muri Mzansi Magic show, \"Lockdown\" afite uruhare rwa 'Tyson' muri saison yayo ya kane. Muri uwo mwaka, yakinnye 'Marang' muri firime ya \"Zulu\". Muri Werurwe 2019, yatsindiye igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza kurusha abandi muri SAFTA ibihembo kubera uruhare rwe muri \"Lockdown 2\". Muri Nzeri 2020, yagaragaye mu ikinamico ya Mzansi \"Abakozi bo mu rugo\" afite uruhare 'Mkhonto'. "}
{"id": "9787", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9787", "title": "Jarrid Geduld", "text": "Jarrid Geduld (yavutse 13 Mutarama 1990), ni umukinnyi wa firime murim Afrika yepfo. Azwi cyane ku ruhare rwe muri filime zizwi cyane \"10,000 BC\", \"Ellen: Die storie van Ellen Pakkies\" and \"Boy Called Twist\".\"t\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 13 Mutarama 1990 muri Afurika y'Epfo.\nUmwuga.\nMu 2004, yakinnye bwa mbere muri firime hamwe na \"Boy Boy Yitwa Twist\" kandi akina nk'umuhanzi wumwana. Hanyuma muri 2005, yagaragaye muri firime ebyiri: \"Icyumba cya Flyer\" na \"Interrogation\". Muri 2013, yatorewe igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza kurusha abandi muri Afurika y'Epfo mu bihembo bya Filime na Televiziyo byo muri Afurika y'Epfo kubera uruhare yagize muri filime \"Lucky Man\"..\nMuri 2018, yakinnye nka 'Abie Pakkies' muri film \"Ellen: Die storie van Ellen Pakkies\". Filime yabaye iyamamare kandi yakiriwe neza. Muri 2018, yahawe igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Silwerskerm kubera uruhare rwe. Noneho muri 2019, mu bihembo bya Filime na Televiziyo byo muri Afurika yepfo, yatsindiye igihembo cya SAFTA Golden Horn igihembo cyumukinnyi mwiza muri Filime Yerekana uruhare yagize muri iyi film. Muri uwo mwaka, yatsindiye igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza mu nshingano zunganira muri 15th Africa Movie Academy Awards."}
{"id": "9788", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9788", "title": "Colin Moss (actor)", "text": "Colin 'Cole' Moss (yavutse 9 Gashyantare 1976), ni umukinnnyi wa firime muri Afurika y'Epfo ahanini ugaragara mu Bwongereza, Amerika na Afurika y'Epfo cinema na televiziyo. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 9 Gashyantare 1976 i Johannesburg, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Ise Richard Moss ni umwongereza-Afurika yepfo aho sekuru yari isake. Nyina Veronica Salt yari afite amateka ya Irilande. Kubwibyo, Colin yavutse afite imico ivanze yabongereza, Irilande, Abadage na Afrika yepfo. Yatsinze ukulele na saxofone ikina.\nYashakanye n'umuyobozi wa Afrika yepfo, Tamarin Kaplan. Ubukwe bwizihijwe muri 2014 muri Stellenbosch.\nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga we wo gukina nkumunyarwenya uhagaze kuri Afrika yepfo yihagararaho. Yakomeje gukora urwenya hagati yimyidagaduro yo gukina imyaka myinshi. Nyuma yaje kurangiza impamyabumenyi yikinamico muri kaminuza ya Kwazulu-Natal mu 1996. Yatangiye gukina binyuze mu bitaramo bimwe na bimwe nka \"Fat Pig\" na \"My Zinc Bed\". Mu mpera z'imyaka ya za 90, yakinnye buri gihe na gahunda ye ya stage nk'umunyarwenya muri Afurika y'Epfo ndetse no mu minsi mikuru itandukanye yo gusetsa. a. no mu Bwongereza na Irilande. Muyindi nzira yumwuga we, Moss yakomeje gukora nkurwenya. Kuva mu 2003 umuyobozi w'itsinda risetsa 'Comedy All Stars Cape Town' muri Cape Town. Mu mwaka wa 2010, yakoze porogaramu ye yo gusetsa muri Stand Up Comedy Club mu mujyi wa New York.\nMu 1998, yerekanwe bwa mbere kuri tereviziyo na televiziyo \"Isidingo\" aho yakinnye nka 'Stewart Buller'. Yagaragaye muri uruhererekane kuva 1999 kugeza 2001 akunzwe cyane. Hanyuma yagiye i Cape Town, akora akazi ko gutanga ibiganiro kuri tereviziyo zitandukanye, harimo na TV \"Life City\" 2001. Mu 2002, yabaye umunyamakuru wa stunt show \"Fear Factor\". Muri 2003, 2005 na 2007 yafashe icyemezo cyo kwerekana imiziki nimpano ya 'Idols South Africa' in season 3 \nMu 2005, Moss yagize ijyana gabo uruhare mu ikinamico y'Epfo \"Number 10.\" Uyu yakinnye muri Afurika yepfo Horror \"Cryptid\" mu 2006 yafashe umwanya wa Mioss Dan Huevelman. Mu 2007, yinjiye muri filime yo gusetsa yo muri Afurika yepfo \"Big Fellas\" akina kimwe mu bintu bibiri by'ingenzi; 'umusore Jake Holmes'. Muri uwo mwaka, yakinnye muri filime \"yihishe\" y'Abongereza n'Afurika y'Epfo aho yakinnye nka 'Officer De Witt'. Muri 2008, yagize uruhare runini nka 'John' muri comediyo y'Ubutaliyani n'Abafaransa \"Ex\". Hanyuma yakinnye umukinnyi wa firime hamwe numunyamurwango 'Dexter \"Dex\" Simms' muri firime iteye ubwoba \"Surviving Evil\" muri 2009. \nBitewe nuburengerazuba bwe, yahisemo gukina amafilime mpuzamahanga nka: 'Ofisiye DeWitt' mu ikinamico \"The World Unseen\". Filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana ibihembo byinshi mpuzamahanga. Nyuma yaje kugira uruhare runini muri film \"Surviving Evil\" aho yakinnye na Billy Zane. Yakinnye kandi nka 'Max' mu guhuza BBC na DH Lawrence's \"Women in Love\". Moss yakinnye nka 'Kevin Fuller' muri filime \"Momentum ari\" kumwe na James Purefoy na Morgan Freeman.\nMuri Werurwe 2014, yagaragaye muri filime ya televiziyo ya ZDF \"Elly Beinhorn\". Muri 2015, yimukiye mu mujyi wa New York ahita asinywa na The Talent House. Nyuma yibyo, yakinnye inshuro nyinshi 'Justin Boden' kuri Marvel yakunzwe cyane na Netflix, \"Jessica Jones\". Hanyuma yakinnye nka 'Anthony' muri \"Black Mirror\" ya Netflix ndetse no muri seriveri ya David Simon yitwa \"Deuce\". Hagati aho, yagize uruhare runini muri filime \"Hanyuma Yaje Nawe\" hamwe n 'uruhare rwa' Drew Conrad 'muri filime \"Noheri mu gasozi\". "}
{"id": "9789", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9789", "title": "Makeroom", "text": "Make Room ni firime yo mu rurimi rwa Hausa yo muri Nigeriya 2018 yerekana isano iri hagati yurukundo no gukurikirana inzozi imbere yiterabwoba, iyobowe na Robert Peters kandi yakozwe na Rogers Ofime. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo abakinnyi n\u2019abakinnyi ba Kannywood nka Yakubu Muhammed, Sani Muazu, Rekiya Attah na Usman Uzee, bashyigikiwe na Adams Garba, Asabe Madake, Abba Zakky na Abubakar Maina. \nUmusaruro.\nIyi filime yakozwe ishingiye ku bikorwa by'inyeshyamba mu majyaruguru y'uburasirazuba bwa Nijeriya yagaragayemo abakinnyi bagera ku 3.000, abakinnyi 100 hamwe n'abakozi 100 batunganya, naho aho bakorewe ni Ijebu - Miango, Agace k'ubutegetsi bwa Bassa, muri Leta ya Plateau, muri Nijeriya. Umusaruro watwaye iminsi igera kuri 50 kugirango urangire, bitwara igereranyo cya N200 kugeza kuri miliyoni 300 nkingengo yumusaruro. \nUmugambi.\nNyuma yo gushimutwa hamwe nabandi bakobwa 245 bo mwishuri rye, umusore mwiza Salma (Asabe Madaki), umwana wenyine wababyeyi be bafite imyaka 17 nabandi bakorewe kubana nabaterabwoba mukigo cyabo. Ibi byamuviriyemo guhungabanya inzozi ze ariko we, nubwo, uko ibintu bimeze ubu yagumye mubyukuri mubuzima bwe. Goni, umwe mu nyeshyamba, araza maze bombi bakundana bidatinze barashyingirwa. Mugihe ubuzima bugoye, hamwe no kwamburwa urupfu numubabaro, inyeshyamba nabakunzi babo bidatinze. \nAmashimwe.\nIyi filime yatowe mu bihembo bya 15 bya Afurika Movie Academy Awards muri 2019. Mu bahatanira ibihembo harimo:"}
{"id": "9790", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9790", "title": "Made in Heaven (2019 film)", "text": "Made in Heaven ni filime yikinamico yo muri Nijeriya yo muri 2019 iyobowe na Toka McBaror ikorwa na Darlington Abuda. Ibiranga Nollywood's Richard Mofe Damijo, Jide Kosoko, and Nancy Isime, Ayo Makun, Toyin Abraham, Blossom Chukwujekwu, Lasisi Elenu, former Big Brother Naija housemate - Kemen, n'abandi. Filime yerekana abantu nyamukuru bashakisha ubufasha bwumwuka mubuzima bwabo bwa buri munsi. \nUmugambi.\nNyuma yo kubona ko umukunzi we amushuka hamwe ninshuti, isoni Richard yamusize inyuma yangwa muri club gusa ahura na Angela bahuye nkibyo. Muri iryo joro nyene, barapfuye hanyuma ku murongo uja ku Irembo ry'Urubanza, Angela asabwa gusubira ku Isi. Richard yahise ashakisha inzira aratoroka kurwanira urukundo rwa Angela, nubwo bibujijwe na malayika murinzi woherejwe nyuma ye hamwe nabadayimoni kugirango atazigera atsindira urukundo rwe muminsi irindwi, kunanirwa bikaba byaviramo ubugingo bwe gucirwaho iteka.\nUmusaruro.\nFilime yakozwe na Peekaboo Consulting Limited. Yakoranye na Newlink Entertainment Limited, NewOhens Limited na Corporate World Entertainment Limited. \nKurekura.\nIyi filime yemejwe ko izasohoka mu mpeshyi ya 2019. Yerekanwe ku cyumweru, tariki ya 15 Nzeri 2019 muri IMAX Theatre, Lekki, Lagos, Nijeriya. "}
{"id": "9791", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9791", "title": "Kevin Chuwang", "text": "Kevin Chuwang Pam (wavutse 1982) niwe wegukanye igihembwe cya 4 cya Big Brother Africa muri 2009. Afite Impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor mu Cyongereza yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Jos\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nChuwang yavutse 1982 akurira i Dogon Dutse, mu nkengero za Jos, umurwa mukuru wa Leta ya Plateau muri Belt Hagati ya Nijeriya. Afite barumuna be barindwi. \nUmwuga.\nChuwang mu ntangiriro za 2006 ubwo yakoraga muri gahunda y\u2019igihugu ishinzwe ibikorwa by\u2019urubyiruko i Lagos, yitabiriye \"The Next Movie Star\", ikiganiro cya TV cyo muri Nigeriya cyatewe inkunga na Haier Thermocool aho yaje ku mwanya wa kabiri. Mu cyagombaga kumuzana ku itara ryagutse, yinjiye mu irushanwa rya Big Brother Africa (season 4) hanyuma amaze gutsinda abandi 24 bahataniraga baturutse mu bihugu 14 bya Afurika bagaragara ko batsinze, batwara igihembo cy\u2019amadorari 200.000 ku ya 6 Ukuboza 2009. Se yari kumwe na we mu birori byo gusoza muri Afurika y'Epfo. \nMuri Nyakanga 2012, \"View Point Nijeriya\" yatangaje ko uwatsinze Big Brother Africa (BBA) 2009 ku wa gatanu tariki ya 12 Nyakanga 2013 i Jos yatangije igitaramo gishya cya muzika cyo guhiga televiziyo munsi y\u2019imyidagaduro, \"Down to Earth Projects Ltd\", ikigo cye, tagged \"Jos Uzane\", aho 20 batoranijwe bitabiriye ahantu hamwe mumujyi wa Jos guhatanira igihembo cya N500.000. \nNi umuyobozi mukuru wa \"Down2Earth Entertainment\" hamwe na \"Naija Pikin\", umuryango utegamiye kuri leta yashinze. Akora kandi ubujyanama bwimyidagaduro. \nUbuzima bwite.\nChuwang yashakanye na Elizabeth \"Liz\" Gupta, mugenzi we babana mu rugo bahuye mu 2009 mu nzu mberabyombi ya Big Brother Africa Revolution kuva mu 2011. Akomoka muri Tanzaniya kandi se wapfuye yari Umuhinde. Ubukwe bwabaye ku ya 26 Gashyantare 2011 i Abuja, muri Nijeriya. Abashakanye bafite umukobwa witwa Malika Savannah. \nMuri 2015, yasobanuriye \"Encomium Weekly\" umuryango we wimukiye i Jos. \nMuri Gicurasi 2016, Chuwang n'umugore we hamwe n'abahoze bitabira ikiganiro nyacyo cya Big Brother Africa, Uti Nwachukwu na Nkenna Iwuagwu bitabiriye ubukwe bw'undi mugenzi we, Geraldine Iheme i Lagos. "}
{"id": "9792", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9792", "title": "Katung Aduwak", "text": "Katung Aduwak (wavutse ku ya 21 Werurwe 1980) niwe wegukanye ibihembo bya mbere bya Big Brother Nigeriya kuri televiziyo byerekanwe hagati ya 5 Werurwe na 4 Kamena 2006. Akomoka muri Zonkwa, muri Leta ya Kaduna, muri Nijeriya kandi ni umwanditsi, umwanditsi kandi umuyobozi kimwe nuwarangije siyanse ya politiki. Yigeze kuba umunyamakuru mu ihuriro ry\u2019ishuri ry\u2019ubucuruzi rya Harvard kandi akora imyaka myinshi nk'umuyobozi mukuru wa MTV Base, Umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe guhanga udushya muri VIACOM International akaba n\u2019umuyobozi mukuru muri Chocolate City. Kugeza ubu ni umuyobozi mukuru wa One O Eight Media hamwe nabafatanyabikorwa ba Afrika muri Campfire Media.\nUmwuga.\n\"Big Brother Nigeriya\".\nAduwak w'imyaka 26 y'amavuko niwe wegukanye intsinzi muri ibyo birori byakiriwe na Michelle Dede na Olisa Adibua, shampiyona yambere cyane ku ya 4 Kamena 2006 hamwe nigihembo cyamadorari 100.000. Nyuma yimyaka 11, yatangaje ko urufunguzo rwo gutsinda muri iki gitaramo ari we kuri we, mu kuba wenyine ndetse no kuba ingamba. \nNyuma ya \"Big Brother Nigeriya\".\nNyuma yikiganiro nyacyo kuri TV, Aduwak yerekeje i New York kugirango akomeze amashuri ye muri Digital Film Academy, arangiza impamyabumenyi yubuyobozi maze ajya gukina film. \nGukora firime.\nIcyagombaga kuba filime ya mbere ya Aduwak ni\"Heaven's Hell\". Itariki yo gusohora nyirizina yari iteganijwe ku ya 23 Mutarama 2015. Iyi filime ariko ntiyasohotse kugeza ku ya 10 Gicurasi 2019. Amashusho ya firime yafashwe mu mwaka wa 2012 na One O Eight Media, afatanya na BGL na Hashtag Media House kandi bakinamo abakinnyi n\u2019abakinnyi ba Nollywood ndetse n\u2019umuhanzi Waje wo muri Nijeriya. \nMuri 2020, Aduwak yayoboye film ngufi yerekana amakimbirane hagati yabanyamerika nya diaspora nyafurika, yise \"Ntibikekwa ko Hano\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nAduwak yashakanye na Raven Taylor-Aduwak kandi afite umuhungu. "}
{"id": "9793", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9793", "title": "Kada River", "text": "Kada River ni filime yikinamico yo muri Nigeriya yo muri 2017 iyobowe na Toka McBaror ari nawe wayifatanije na Forinclay Ejeh hamwe nubuyobozi bwakozwe na Olakunle Churchill. Muri iyi filime hagaragaramo abakinnyi ba Nollywood n'abakinnyi nka Joke Silva, Keppy Ekpenyong, Rachel Oniga and Bayray McNwizu. Abandi barimo uwahoze ari murugo muri Big Brother Naija 2017 - TBoss (Tokunbo Badmus), Umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Gana - Fella Makafui, Chris Okagbue, James Blessing, Rakiya Attah and Oluchi Madubuko. Iyi filime ni epic yerekana ibibazo byugarije Leta ya Kaduna, inyito ikaba irindi zina ry'Umugezi wa Kaduna. \nUmusaruro.\nIyi filime yafatiwe hafi ya Kafanchan na Kagoro, ahabereye ubuzima nyabwo bwabereye ku ya 21 Gashyantare 2000 nkuko byavuzwe n'umuyobozi. Umusaruro wacyo watewe inkunga na Big Church Foundation. \nUmugambi.\nIyi filime yerekana ubushyamirane bwa kera hagati ya Boduas na Shawlains, bwarangije imvururu zikaze kandi ziva amaraso, hagati aho abakunzi babiri bato, Jerome (Chris Okagbue) na Nadia (Fella Makafui), baharanira gufasha guhindura urwango rukabije. kurera hagati y'amoko yabo. \nKurekura.\nIyi filime yerekanwe ku zindi filime icyenda mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Nollywood, ryabereye muri salle ya kaminuza ya Toronto, Toronto, Kanada. Nibwo filime yatangije ku nshuro ya mbere y'ibirori byabereye muri Imagine Cinemas no mu kigo cy\u2019ibirori byabereye i Toronto hagati ya 12 - 16 Nzeri 2017. "}
{"id": "9794", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9794", "title": "Girley Jazama", "text": "Girley Charlene Jazama ni umukinnyi wa filime wa Namibiya, umwanditsi w'amafilime akaba na producer wa firime. \nUmwuga.\nUmwuga wa Jazama wamafirime namakinamico watangiye kuva muri 2005. Yabaye Namibiya wa kabiri watowe muri \"Sotigui Awards\", nk'umukinnyi witwaye neza, nyuma ya Adriano Visagie wari watowe mbere kubera igitaramo cye muri \" \"Salute!\" \", Aratsinda. \nYagaragaye cyane mu bakinnyi bari muri \"\"The Lion King\" \", mu gihe yari yarize mu ishuri ryigenga rya Karibib. \nYakoranye umwete ku bufatanye na Pan-African Festival ya Sinema na Televiziyo ya Ouagadougou, mu rwego rwo kumenyekanisha impano mu gukina sinema nyafurika na diaspora. \nMu mwaka wa 2008, yari umwe mu banditsi barindwi batoranijwe na sosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa, Optimedia, kugira ngo yandike isabune nshya yise \"Amasano ahuza\", ku kigo cya Namibia Broadcasting Corporation. Uyu musaruro wabaye televiziyo ya mbere ya Namibiya. \nMu 2009, yakinnye nka \"Sch\u00fclerin\" muri filime yo mu kidage \", \"Liebe, Babys und der Zauber Afrikas\" \". \nJazama yari umukinnyi wa mbere muri firime ya 2019, \" \"Umurongo Wera\" \" aho yakinnye nka \"Sylvia\". Muri Nyakanga 2019, iyi filime yerekanwe ku rwego mpuzamahanga mu iserukiramuco rya sinema mpuzamahanga rya 40 rya Durban ndetse no mu yandi maserukiramuco menshi ya firime ku isi. \nFilime ye ya 2019 yiminota 29, \"Baxu and the Giants\" yakoranye na Andrew Botelle kandi iyobowe na Florian Schott, yizihijwe ninganda za firime za Namibiya nka firime ya mbere ya Namibiya kuri Netflix. Muri Werurwe 2020, iyi filime yatowe mu \"iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filimi RapidLion ryabereye\" i Johannesburg, muri Afurika y'Epfo igihembo cya \"Filime Nziza Nziza\". Nyuma yerekanwe muri Amerika mu \"iserukiramuco rya sinema ryigenga rya San Francisco\" hanyuma nyuma muri Nzeri muri uwo mwaka muri \"Namibian Theatre &amp; Film Awards 2019\", aho yakiriye nomination zirindwi. Nanone, filime yakiriye izindi nomination n'ibihembo. "}
{"id": "9795", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9795", "title": "Daniel Etim Effiong", "text": "Daniel Etim Effiong, nawe Daniel Etim-Effiong numukinnyi wa filimi muri Nollywood wo muri Nigeriya akaba numuyobozi wa film. \nUbuzima n'uburere.\nYavukiye i Jaji, muri Leta ya Kaduna, muri Nijeriya kandi yari atuye mu Benin City, Edo State; Lagos State and Abujaa. Papa we yari mu ngabo za Nigeriya. Se, wahoze ari Lt Col. Moses Effiong yahawe imbabazi ku mwanya wa perezida na perezida wa Nijeriya Muhammadu Buhari ari kumwe n'abandi batanu bakatiwe igifungo cya burundu mu 1986 nyuma y\u2019uko bivugwa ko byatsinzwe na Vatsa Coup ku butegetsi bwa Ibrahim Babangida bakurikiranyweho icyaha cyo guhisha ubutegetsi maze bakarekurwa mu 1993 ariko nta gutangaza ku mugaragaro kandi kugarura urwego nuburenganzira. \nMu myaka ye y'ubuto, yize mu ishuri ryigenga ryitiriwe Mutagatifu Mariya, Ikirwa cya Lagos, Lagos nyuma aza gukomeza amashuri yisumbuye muri kaminuza ya Leta, Ikorodu, Lagos. Nyuma yaho, yerekeje muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019ikoranabuhanga, Minna, muri Leta ya Nigeriya, aho yize kandi abona impamyabumenyi ya mbere mu bijyanye n\u2019imashini. Nyuma yigihe gito cyakazi mu nganda za peteroli na gaze nka injeniyeri, yahisemo guhindura imyuga maze atangira kwiga ibijyanye no gutunganya amafilime, kwandika no kuyobora mu ishuri ry\u2019amafirime rya AFDA muri Afurika yepfo nyuma akurikira amasomo muri kaminuza ya Johannesburg mu bijyanye no gukina amashusho. \nUmwuga.\nAmaze kureka akazi ka peteroli na gaze, yabaye progaramu ya NdaniTV. \nMuri 2017, yayoboye filime ngufi yiminota itanu yise \" \"Umuhigo\" \", yakozwe numugore we mushya, Toyosi, irimo Tope Tedala na Odenike Odetola. \nYagaragaye muri 2019 na \"Bland2Glam\" muri gahunda ye #Powerof7 yo kwizihiza imyaka irindwi akora mu bucuruzi bw'imyambarire. \nYagaragaye ari kumwe n'abakinnyi ba filime bo muri Kenya Sarah Hassan na Catherine Kamau Karanja muri filime isetsa ya 2019, \"Plan B\" aho yakinnye nk'umuyobozi mukuru wa Nigeriya w'ikigo gishingiye ku mujyi wa Nairobi, Dele Coker. Filime yamuhaye igihembo cyumukinnyi \"witwaye neza mu cyiciro cya Comedy (Movie / TV Series)\" mu bihembo bya 7 bya AMVCA \nYakinnye muri firime nyinshi za 2020. Yakinnye cyane muri firime, \" \"Fish Bone\" \", yakozwe na Editi Effiong yakinnye na Shaffy Bello na Moshood Fattah. Yagaragaye ari kumwe na Ike Onyema na Atteh 'SirDee' Daniel muri filime ngufi, \" \"Umuyaga\" \", yakozwe na Diane Russet kandi iyobowe na Michael 'AMA zaburi' Akinrogunde. Muri 2020, yayoboye documentaire yitwa \" \"Uruhu\" \", yakozwe na Beverly Naya. Byari biteganijwe ko byerekanwa kuri NETFLIX. \nUbuzima bwite.\nEffiong yari yarashakanye na Toyosi Phillips kuva ku ya 4 Ugushyingo 2017. Bahuye bwa mbere muri Kanama 2016 mugihe batunganya umushinga. Ukuboza 2018, bavugaga ko bategereje umwana. Ku ya 7 Mutarama 2019. Abashakanye bakiriye umwana wabo wa mbere, umwana w\u2019umukobwa. "}
{"id": "9796", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9796", "title": "Anita Ukah", "text": "Anita Ukah (yavutse 14 Kanama 1995) ni umukinnyi wa firime akaba n'umunyamideli muri Nigeria rwiyemezamirimo na Miss titleholder wari ikamba nk'uko wegukanye muri 2018 nk'Umukobwa mwiza cyane muri Nijeriya. Yambitse ikamba ry'umusimbura wa MBGN Umwamikazi Nyekachi Douglas muri 2019. Yaserukiye Nigeriya mu marushanwa ya Miss World 2018 yabaye ku ya 8 Ukuboza 2018 kuri Sanya City Arena i Sanya mu Bushinwa, aho yaje muri Top 30 mu marushanwa ya Miss World. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nUkah akomoka muri leta ya Imo kandi akomoka mu muryango w'abantu barindwi. \nUburezi.\nUkah ni umuhanga muri laboratoire yubuvuzi wize muri kaminuza ya Igbenedion, Okada arangiza muri 2016.\nAmarushanwa ya mbere ya Anita yari muri kaminuza ye aho yatsindiye irushanwa rya Miss Igbinedion University Okada (IUO) mu 2014. Muri 2018, Ukah yaserukiye leta ya Imo kumukobwa mwiza muri Nigeriya 2018. Kuri finale ikomeye yabereye muri Okara Cultural Centre i Yenagoa, Bayelsa, Yambitswe ikamba ryumukobwa mwiza muri Nijeriya. \nfurikaUkah uzwiho kuzamura ibicuruzwa byakorewe mu karere muri 2019, yashyize ahagaragara ibicuruzwa bye byerekana imideli yise The Uzo Brand. Isosiyete ikora ibicuruzwa bikozwe mu mpu biva mu bikoresho biva mu karere. Ikirango cyibanda cyane kumifuka. Munsi yikimenyetso, yasohoye icyegeranyo cye. "}
{"id": "9797", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9797", "title": "The Blessed (2017 film)", "text": "The Blessed, izwi kandi ku izina rya Les Bienheureux, ni filime yo muri Alijeriya yerekana umuryango ubayeho nyuma y'intambara ya Alijeriya izwi kandi ku izina rya 'the dirty war'. \nIcegeranyo.\nShyira mumasaha 24, firime yibanda kubashakanye bibaho kwizihiza isabukuru yimyaka 20 kandi bateganya itariki muri resitora. Abashakanye batumvikana ku bijyanye no kohereza cyangwa kohereza umuhungu wabo mu mahanga kwiga kandi bahitamo kubabaza inshuti zabo nijoro. Mugihe cyo kurya, ingingo irazanwa kandi birangira buri wese muri bo atekereza uko abona intambara n'ejo hazaza h'igihugu. \nIbihembo.\nIgihembo mpuzamahanga cya mbere [Nominee]"}
{"id": "9798", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9798", "title": "Can You Dig This", "text": "Can You Dig This ni film ya documentaire yabanyamerika 2015 iyobowe na Delila Vallot. Intego nyamukuru yiyi firime nubuhinzi bwo mumijyi nkumuntu nyamukuru atera umurima wibiryo murugo rwe. \nIcegeranyo.\nIyi nkuru nigitekerezo kigamije gushishikariza abantu ahantu hose gutera nkuko abantu bayobora batera ubusitani bwumujyi murugo rwe mumajyepfo ya Los Angeles. "}
{"id": "9799", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9799", "title": "Redemption (2019 film)", "text": "Redemption, izwi kandi nka Resgate, ni filimi yo muri Mozambike ya 2019 iyobowe na Mickey Fonseca. Iyi nkuru yibanda ku buzima bwubugizi bwa nabi kuko umuntu wambere ahitamo guhindura ubuzima bwe no kuba umubyeyi mwiza nyuma yimyaka ine ariko bikarangira agasubira mubuzima bwubugizi bwa nabi. Yatorewe ibihembo icyenda kandi yegukana bibiri muri byo muri Afurika Movie Academy Awards. \nIcegeranyo.\nUmugabo wagarutse avuye muri gereza amenya ko, mbere gato yo gupfa, nyina yafashe umwenda uteje akaga. Nubwo ashaka guhindura ikibabi gishya, ahatirwa kongera gusubira mubuzima bwicyaha kuko akeneye amafaranga cyane. "}
{"id": "9800", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9800", "title": "Lost in Time (2019 film)", "text": "Lost in Time ni film yo muri Kenya 2019 yanditswe na Edijoe Mwaniki. Ni mu mutwe thriller ryibanda ku kibazo mutwe. \nKugeza ubu, film imaze gutwara ibihembo bitanu bya Kalasha awards. Ibyiciro byo gutanga ibihembo birimo \"Filime nziza cyane\", \"umuyobozi mwiza\" (Peter Kawa), \"umukinnyi mwiza muri film\" (George Mo), \"amashusho meza\" (Edijoe Mwaniki) na \"amajwi meza\" (Karanja Kiarie). \nIcegeranyo.\nNyuma y'urupfu rwa nyina wa Sam, yagumye mu mutwe, kuko uwo munsi uba umunsi umwe yabuze umukobwa we. Ibi bimugiraho ingaruka mubitekerezo, kandi agerageza kurwanya ubwoba bwe. Yatangiye kuba mu nshuti ye ya Michael, ariko bidatinze abona ibintu bidasanzwe bibera mu nzu. Agerageza guhishura amabanga yerekeye inzu numugore udasanzwe winshuti ye, mugihe arwanya ubwoba bwe, bwaba ubwubu nubu. "}
{"id": "9801", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9801", "title": "Sprinter (film)", "text": "Sprinter ni firime yimikino ya 2018 izenguruka umukinnyi unyura mubibazo byumuryango, iyobowe na Storm Saulter. Will Smith na Jada Pinkett Smith bari abaproducer bayobora uyu musaruro. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere muIserukiramuco rya Filime y'Abanyamerika muri 2018 aho yatsindiye ibihembo bya Best Narrative Feature, Igihembo cyabaterankunga mu cyiciro cya Filime Nziza n\u2019Umuyobozi mwiza. \nIcegeranyo.\nUmwangavu wo muri Jamayike uremerewe na se udahungabana na musaza we udahungabana yizera ko izamuka rya meteorike mu isiganwa ry\u2019imirima rishobora kumuhuza na nyina, wabaga muri Amerika mu buryo butemewe n'amategeko mu myaka icumi ishize. "}
{"id": "9802", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9802", "title": "Triangle: Going to America", "text": "Triangle: Going to America ni filime yo muri Etiyopiya 2014 yanditswe kandi iyobowe na Theodros Teshome. Yatowe mu byiciro bitatu bitandukanye muri Afurika ya Movie Academy Awards 2015; Filime nziza mundimi nyafurika, Umuyobozi mwiza na Filime nziza. \nYatsindiye \"Igihembo cy'Abashinze Iserukiramuco- Narrative\" mu Iserukiramuco rya Filime nyafurika muri 2015 ndetse inegukana \"Igihembo cy'abaterankunga\" muIserukiramuco rya Sinema rya filimi mu Rwanda muri 2015. \nIcegeranyo.\nFilime yazengurutse imigabane itatu kandi ivuga ku kibazo cyo kwimukira muri Amerika mu buryo butemewe. Kaleab na Jemal bafite ubushake bwo gukora ibishoboka byose kugirango bagere muri Amerika ubuzima bwiza. Mu rugendo rutoroshye, bahura na Winta nziza (Mahder Assefa), mugenzi wabo wimukira uturutse muri Eritereya. Kaleab na Winta bakundana mugihe bava muri Afrika yuburasirazuba banyuze muri Libiya, Ubutaliyani, Mexico ndetse amaherezo bakerekeza muri Amerika. "}
{"id": "9803", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9803", "title": "The Perfect Picture: Ten Years Later", "text": "The Perfect Picture: 10 Years Later ni film yo muri Gana ya 2019 yakozwe kandi iyobowe na Shirley Frimpong-Manso na Ken Attoh. Ni kimwe na \"Perfect Picture\", yakozwe kandi yanditswe na Shirley Frimpong-Manso. \nIcegeranyo.\nFilime yumwimerere yari hafi yabagore batatu basunika imyaka mirongo itatu bagerageza gushira amanga kugirango bahindure ubuzima bwabo, ariko ibyateganijwe byari bifite izindi gahunda kuri bo. Noneho murukurikirane, abadamu baragarutse, iki gihe basunika imyaka mirongo ine. Nubwo bakuze kandi bafite ubwenge, bamenye ko ubu bafite ibibazo byinshi harimo nubusabane bwabo butari bwiza. "}
{"id": "9804", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9804", "title": "2019 Ghana Movie Awards", "text": "Ibihembo bya Gana Movie 2019 byari ibirori byabereye muri Theatre ku ya 20 Ukuboza mu mwaka 2019. Muri ibyo birori, umukinnyi wa filime Salma Mumin yakoze amateka kuko yatsindiye umudari we wa mbere kuko yitwaye neza mu cyiciro cy\u2019ibihembo. Umukinnyi Alphonse Menyo nawe yatwaye igikombe cye cya mbere cy'umukinnyi mwiza mu byiciro. Igihembo ngaruka mwaka cyerekana indashyikirwa mu nganda za sinema zo muri Gana kandi iyi yari inshuro ya cyenda(9). \nmu bakandida benshi bajya muri 'Gold Coast lounge', ' Away bus ', 'ABAD' hamwe n'itsinzi nyinshi zahawe filime ya 'Gold Coast lounge' hamwe n'abakinnyi bayo. \nIbigize;.\nMUSIC \"BY PASCAL AKA ISREAL DE-LIKE\"\nLYRIC \"BY REQUEL AMMAH\"\n\"MUSIC AND LYRICS\" BY BERNI ANTI\n\"MUSIC\" BY ENOCH BLEBOO\n\"LYRICS\" BY SOLOMON OTOO\n\"MUSIC AND LYRICS\" BY STEPHENIE BENSON\nPRODUCTION DESIGN BY JULIUS ELIKEM\nSET DECORATION BY PROP HAVEN\nPRODUCTION DESIGN BY GORDON GALOLO\nSET DECORATION BY ROBERT AYIM\nPRODUCTION DESIGN BY JAMES AVAALA\nSET DECORATION BY HORLA MANUVOR\nSCREEN PLAY BY PASCAL AKA\nSCREEN PLAY BY FRANKQUOPHY AWUKU HANYABUI\nSCREEN PLAY BY FOLAKE AMANFO\nSCREEN PLAY BY SOLAKE AMANFO &amp; RANDOLPH OBAH\nSCREEN PLAY BY KOFI ASAMOAH, YAW TWUMASI AND PETER SEDUFIA\nPRODUCER - ESI YEBOAH\nPRODUCER- ISAAC AGYAPONG\nPRODUCERS- ABDUL SALAM MUMUNI AND TONY RAMESH LACHMA\nPRODUCER- PASCAL AMANFO &amp; SELASSIE IBRAHIM\nPRODUCER- SELASSIE IBRAHIM\nPRODUCERS- KOFI ASAMOAH AND PETER SEDUFIA\nPRODUCER- YVONNE NELSON\nSALLAM MUMUNI"}
{"id": "9805", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9805", "title": "Alioune Ifra Ndiaye", "text": "Alioune Ifra Ndiaye (wavutse 1969/1970) 1969/1970\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nNdiaye ni umuhungu w'umujandarume, mukuru we ni umuyobozi wa firime Souleymane Ciss\u00e9.. Ndiaye yatewe inkunga na murumuna we, Ndiaye yimukiye muri Kanada yiga ibijyanye no gukina amafilime muri Universit\u00e9 du Qu\u00e9bec \u00e0 Montr\u00e9al. Yagarutse i Bamako mu 1997 kugira ngo abone impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu mateka. Mu 1998, Ndiaye yashinze itsinda ry\u2019ikinamico rya BlonBa ari kumwe n\u2019inshuti ye, umufilozofe w\u2019Abafaransa n\u2019umwanditsi Jean-Louis Sagot-Duvauroux. Yize kandi umubano wumuco muri Kaminuza ya Sorbonne Nouvelle Paris 3. Ndiaye yafatanije kwandika no gukora ibitaramo bitanu mu muco w'ikinamico ya kot\u00e8ba, kandi itsinda rya BlonBa ryatanze ibitaramo ijana muri Senegali, B\u00e9nin, Ubufaransa n'Ububiligi. Muri Mutarama 2007, BlonBa yafunguye umwanya w\u2019umuco, inzira yonyine y\u2019ikigo ndangamuco cy\u2019Abafaransa (CCF). Umwanya w\u2019umuco wahatiwe gufunga nyuma y\u2019ihirikwa ry\u2019ubutegetsi bwa Mali 2012, ariko ishami ry\u2019Ubufaransa ryemerera kuguma mu bucuruzi. \nNdiaye yayoboye kandi documentaire, firime zimpimbano, na videwo yindirimbo, maze ahimba igitekerezo cya telekot\u00e8ba. Yatoje porogaramu yo gutunganya amafilime i Paris, yitabira gutunganya TV kandi akora nk'umujyanama muri Tchad kugira ngo afashe kuvugurura imiyoboro isanzwe. Muri 2012, yasabye umwanya wo kuba umuyobozi mukuru wa Office de Radiodiffusion-T\u00e9l\u00e9vision du Mali, ariko ntiyatorwa. Muri 2013, Ndiaye yashinze umuyoboro we wa tereviziyo i Bamako, witwa W\u00f4kl\u00f4ni nyuma ya elve mu migani ya Mandingo. Yatangije umuyoboro n'amafaranga ye, ariko ntiyigeze abona uruhushya rwemewe na guverinoma. Ndiaye yayoboye igitaramo cyiswe \"Taynibougou, la cit\u00e9 des profiteurs\", anenga urwego rwa ruswa mu gihugu. Yasohoye igitabo \"Banyengo\" mu 2016, mu rwego rwo guteza imbere umuco w\u2019igihugu. Muri 2017, umwanya wumuco wa BlonBa wongeye gufungura. Ndiaye niwe waremye abahanzi hamwe Djin\u00e8 Ton. \nNdiaye ni we washinze umutwe wa politiki Wele Wele, ushaka gukangurira urubyiruko kwiyamamariza umwanya wa politiki. Ni anististe, kandi ntavugwaho rumwe muri Mali kubera ko adakurikiza Islam. Ndiaye afite abana bane, harimo impanga kuva yashyingiranwa bwa mbere. Ahuza amahugurwa yo kwandika ikinamico ngarukamwaka. "}
{"id": "9806", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9806", "title": "Dennis Bots", "text": "Dennis Bots (yavutse ku ya 11 Kamena 1974) ni umuyobozi wa firime wa Zambiya-Ubuholandi.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nDennis Bots yavukiye mu mujyi wa Kitwe wa Zambiya mu 1974. Ababyeyi be b'Abaholandi babaga muri Zambiya, aho se yakoraga. Akiri uruhinja, yimukiye mu mujyi wa Gemert wo mu Buholandi. Se wa Bots yari umukinnyi wa firime ukunda cyane, kandi Bots yakoze filime ye ya mbere, \"Shetani\", afite imyaka 12, yerekana igishusho cyo muri Afurika cyaguzwe muri Wereldwinkel kandi kirimo umwuka. Bots ivuga nka firime kuva mubwana bwe, nka \"Stand By Me\", \"E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial\" and \"The Neverending Story\". Yize muri Macropedius College kandi akora kuri tereviziyo yaho imyaka itari mike. Ku myaka 18, Bots yimukiye i Amsterdam kwiga film. \nMu 1996, Bots yahawe impamyabumenyi mu ishuri rya Filimi na Televiziyo yo mu Buholandi i Amsterdam. Yatangiye umwuga we akora kuri tereviziyo, ayobora ibice bya \"serivise za Goudkust\", \"Rozengeur &amp; Wodka Lime\", \"Goede tijden\", \"Slechte tijden\" na \"Trauma 24/7\". Muri 2005, Bots yayoboye filime ye ya mbere yerekana, \"Zoop muri Afurika\". Yibanze cyane kuri firime zabana kuva yatangira. Bots yayoboye \"Anubis en het Pad der 7 Zonden\", ikaba yarabaye firime yarebwaga cyane mu 2008 mu Buholandi. Yayoboye Achtste Groepers Huilen Niet mu 2012, ahuza igitabo yatekereje gukora kuva mu 1999. Inkuru ivuga kubyerekeye umwana wimyaka cumi n'ibiri urwara leukemia. \nMuri 2014, yayoboye \"Oorlogsgeheimen\" (\"Amabanga y'intambara\") yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Luxembourg mu 2015. Bots yakoze kandi kuri \"serivise ya Celblok H\" (2014) na \"Orpheus Project\" (2016). Muri 2017, yayoboye \"Storm:Letters van Vuur\", abaho mugihe cy'ivugurura ry'abaporotisanti. Iravuga amateka yumuyaga, umuhungu se yatawe muri yombi azira gucapa ibaruwa ya Martin Luther. Bots yayoboye \"Circus Noel\" muri 2019, kubyerekeye umukobwa winjiye muri sirusi. Byanditswe na Karen van Holst Pellekaan, Bots yakoranye na firime zabanje. Muri 2020, Bots yayoboye \"Engel\", ishingiye ku gitabo cyanditswe na Isa Hoes. Filime yanditswe na Ellen Barendregt ivuga amateka yumukobwa ushobora gukora ibyifuzo kubantu beza. Bots iba i Bussum. "}
{"id": "9807", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9807", "title": "Marcelin Bossou", "text": "Marcelin Bossou (yavutse ku ya 3 Gicurasi 1984) ni umuyobozi wa firime muri Togo, utunganya firime, akaba n'umwanditsi.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nBossou yavukiye i Lom\u00e9, muri Togo mu 1984. Yari umuhungu w'ababyeyi bo muri B\u00e9nin. Se wa Bossou yari umuyobozi w'ikigo cy'imikino.. Yakoraga kuri tereviziyo yigenga ya Radio T\u00e9l\u00e9vision Delta Sant\u00e9 nk'umutekinisiye nyuma aba umuyobozi. \nMuri 2008, yiyandikishije muri Ecole Sup\u00e9rieure des Arts Visuels i Marrakesh muri Maroc nyuma yo kubona buruse. Bossou yayoboye filime ye ya mbere ngufi, \"La Bourse ou la vie\" na \"L'inconnu\" mu 2010. Yabonye uruhushya rwe muri Film Studies, Directory option, muri 2012. Filime ya Bossou yahawe impamyabumenyi, \"Nuit de Noces\", yinjiye mu birori byinshi bya firime nka Mediterranean Short Film Festival ya Tangier, Iserukiramuco rya Filime nyafurika rya Luxor, hamwe na Festival ya Afrika ya Poitiers. \"Nuit de Noces\" yakiriye Grand Prix mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Atakpam\u00e9 i Togo ndetse nigihembo cyihariye cya Ren\u00e9 Monory mu Iserukiramuco rya Filime na Televiziyo bya Panafrican ya Ouagadougou. Irasuzuma imitwaro abagore bahura nazo iyo bashyingiranywe, harimo no kwerekana ubusugi bwabo. \nNyuma yo guhabwa impamyabumenyi, Bossou yayoboye \"L'anniversaire\". Yashinze isosiyete ikora amajwi n'amashusho Marbos Productions i Lom\u00e9 muri 2015. Intego nyamukuru yaryo ni ugutanga inkunga kubanyeshuri biga muri firime ya Togoliya kugirango bakore film zabo za mbere. Muri 2015, yayoboye \"Les deux fr\u00e8res\". Filime yahawe igihembo cyo gufotora neza mu iserukiramuco rya Clap Ivoire. Muri 2019, Bossou yakoze firime \"La vie de Daniel\" iyobowe na Gilbert Bararmna na \"Femme\" Eb\u00e8ne na Rachel Kpizing. \nKuri ubu Bossou arimo akora kuri firime ye ya mbere yerekana, \"Broken Drums\", biteganijwe ko izasohoka mu 2021. Yigisha isesengura rya firime, kwandika na tekinike mu Ishuri Rikuru rya Sinema i Lom\u00e9. "}
{"id": "9808", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9808", "title": "Samira Magroun", "text": "Samira Magroun (wavutse 24 Mutarama 1987) numukinnyi wa filimi muri Tuniziya.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nMagroun afite abavandimwe benshi. Akiri umwana, yashishikazwaga no kuba umukinnyi wa filime akanavugwa cyane ndetse akanavugwa cyane. Magroun yize icyongereza nyuma yishuri ryisumbuye. Nyuma yaje kwiga ishuri ryigisha indege Nouvel Air mbere yuko atangira umwuga we wo gukina Filimi. \nMagroun yatangiriye mu bucuruzi bwe muri Tuniziya Fehri yatangajwe cyane n'imikorere ya Magroun, maze atorerwa kuba Syrine muri \"Maktoub\", yatangiye mu 2008. Imico ye ni umugore utagira ubwenge ukoreshwa n'umukunzi we, Elyes, na Magroun bavuze ko abakobwa nka we ari benshi muri sosiyete. \nMu mwaka wa 2010, Magroun yakinnye muri sitcom \"Garage Lekrik\" nka Lobna, umukobwa ukunda ubutunzi ufite umubano utitiranya na Boulouna, yakinnye na Lotfi Abdelli. Amaze guhabwa inshingano, yahise abyemera kuko byari amahirwe meza kandi abakinnyi bari bafite abakinnyi beza. Muri Nzeri 2010, Magroun yakinnye muri serivise yo muri Siriya \"Takht Charki\" yanditswe na Yam Mach'hadi iyobowe na Racha Chabartji. \nMagroun yasezeranye numupira wamaguru Adel Chedli muri Mata 2012. Yabyaye umuhungu na Chedli, Koussay. Bombi bashakanye imyaka ibiri mbere yo gutandukana. Muri Gicurasi 2020, Magroun yibarutse umwana we wa kabiri, umukobwa Zayna. "}
{"id": "9809", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9809", "title": "Mel Gamb\u00f4a", "text": "Mel Gamb\u00f4a (yavutse ku ya 23 Gicurasi 1984) ni umukinnyi wa filime w\u2019umunyaromaniya utuye muri Angola, umunyamakuru, na producer wa televiziyo.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nGamb\u00f4a yavutse 1984 i Bucharest, muri Rumaniya. Umukobwa wa se wa Angola na nyina w\u2019umuromaniya, yatangiye gutaramira mu ikinamico mu 1998, yinjira mu itsinda ry\u2019ikinamico Horizonte Nzinga Mbandi nk'igikorwa kidasanzwe. Hagati ya 2001 na 2003, Gamb\u00f4a yabaga i Madrid maze yinjira mu itsinda ry\u2019ikinamico Los Sobrinos del Mago de Oz nk'umukinnyi wa filime akaba n\u2019umuyobozi wungirije w\u2019imikino y\u2019abana \"El Gnomo Jeromo\" na \"Los Evangelios Ap\u00f3crifos\" na Frank Huesca. \nMu 2004, yasubiye i Luanda yitangira ikinamico, yitabira amahugurwa menshi kandi yiga amasomo y'ubuhanzi. Gamb\u00f4a yinjiye muri societe yo muri iki gihe imbyino na percussion Man\u00e9sema mu 2006 nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe imibanire rusange n\u2019umuyobozi ushinzwe imihango. Mu 2007, yatangiye umwuga we kuri tereviziyo. Mu mwaka wa 2010, Gamb\u00f4a yashinze isosiyete ikorana na Multimedia Together Now, usibye gutanga serivisi zo gufotora no gufata amashusho, yashyizeho gahunda zamahugurwa kubakinnyi n\u2019amasomo ya \"Photography Angola\". \nGamb\u00f4a yabaye umuyobozi wa gahunda yimyidagaduro \"Tchilar kumuyoboro\" wa 2 wa Televiziyo rusange muri Angola. Muri 2012, yatangiye kwakira ikiganiro cya radio cyitwa \"Show da Mel\" kuri R\u00e1dio Despertar 91.0 FM. \nMuri 2017, Gamb\u00f4a yimukiye i Los Angeles kugira ngo arangize amashuri ye muri sinema. Kubera ibibazo by'amafaranga, yahatiwe gukoresha imbuga nkoranyambaga kugira ngo yishakire inkunga. \nGamb\u00f4a ni umunyamurwango uharanira inyungu z'umugore kandi yavuze ko abaturage badashobora kumenya ibibera muri politiki ya Angola. Yimenyereza tantra yoga no gufotora. Yize ibitabo bivuga ku idini ry'Ababuda. "}
{"id": "9810", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9810", "title": "Stefanie Sycholt", "text": "Stefanie Sycholt (wavutse 1963) ni umuyobozi wa firime muri Afrika yepfo, utunganya amafilime, akaba n'umwanditsi.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nSycholt yavukiye i Pretoriya mu 1963. Yize icyongereza munsi ya JM Coetzee ndetse na siyanse ya politiki na teoriya muriKaminuza ya Natal na kaminuza ya Cape Town. Sycholt yagize uruhare mu bikorwa byo kurwanya ivanguramoko kandi yabaye umuyobozi ushinzwe itangazamakuru mu ihuriro ry\u2019abanyeshuri bo muri Afurika yepfo. Marita yashoboye umusaruro ikipe Ava bikaba amasanamu Nelson Mandela's Welcome Home Rally mu Durban mu 1990. Sycholt yaje kujya mu Budage kwiga muri Kaminuza ya Televiziyo na Filime Munich. Yakoze mu ishami rishinzwe kwandika rya kaminuza ya firime na televiziyo i Munich ndetse n'umwanditsi n'umuyobozi. \nMu 2001, Sycholt yakinnye bwa mbere muri \"firime\" na Malunde, ivuga amateka yumuhungu witwa Wonderboy uba inshuti nuwahoze ari umusirikare mubutegetsi bwera. Yakiriye ibihembo bitandatu bya Avanti harimo umuyobozi mwiza, kandi igice cyinyungu cyagiye mumfashanyo ya Mandela kubana bo mumuhanda. Yayoboye filime isetsa yakozwe kuri TV \"Gwendolyn\" mu 2007. Mu mwaka wa 2010, yanditse, ayobora, afatanya na \"Themba\". Ukurikije igitabo kitazwi na Lutz van Dijk, ni ikinamico yo mu muryango ivuga amateka yumuhungu ukiri muto ukunda umupira wamaguru na nyina wanduye sida. \"Themba\" yahawe igihembo cya UNICEF Uburenganzira bw'umwana mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Zanzibar 2010. Sycholt yayoboye ibice byinshi byurukurikirane rwa \"Inga Lindstr\u00f6m\". \nSycholt yashakanye n'umukinnyi wa firime wo muri Arijantine kandi afite umuhungu umwe. Agabanya igihe cye hagati y'Ubudage, Arijantine, na Afurika y'Epfo. "}
{"id": "9811", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9811", "title": "Sofia Amara", "text": "Sofia Amara (yavutse ku ya 25 Gicurasi 1968) ni umunyamakuru w\u2019umufaransa wavukiye muri Maroc akaba n'umuyobozi wa firime.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nAmara yavukiye i Casablanca mu 1968. Yarangije muri kaminuza ya Yorodani afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bumenyi bwa politiki no muri IEP i Paris mu 1996. Amara yatangiye umwuga we wumwuga nkumunyamakuru muburasirazuba bwo hagati kumiyoboro itandukanye na radio. Yagaragaje ibyabaye nka Intifada ya mbere y'Abanyapalestine, igitero cya Koweti na Iraki, no kugaruka kwa Yasser Arafat muri Gaza. \nAmara yatanze raporo ku Isoko ry'Abarabu muri Egiputa, kandi afungwa kabiri hamwe n'abigaragambyaga i Cairo. Yakoze documentaire ku ntambara yo muri Siriya kuva yatangira mu 2011. Muri 2014, Amara yasohoye igitabo \"Infiltr\u00e9e dans l'enfer syrien: du Printemps de Damas \u00e0 l'Etat islamique\" aho yasabye ko igihugu cya kisilamu cya Iraki na Levant (ISIL) mubyukuri byari umufatanyabikorwa wa Bashar al-Assad. Mosul amaze kubohorwa muri 2017, Amara yabaye umwe mu banyamakuru ba mbere b\u2019abagore binjiye mu mujyi hamwe n\u2019ingabo za Iraki. \nMuri 2017, yayoboye documentaire \"Yabuze Abana ba Califa\", yerekanaga abana bafite imyaka umunani bogejwe n'ubwonko kandi bahabwa imyitozo yintwaro. Yakiriye igihembo cya AMADE mu iserukiramuco rya TV rya Monte-Carlo. Muri 2018, Amara yasohoye igitabo \"Bagdadi, Khalifa w'iterabwoba\". Harimo ibiganiro bye n'uwahoze ari umugore n'umukobwa wa Abu Bakr al-Baghdadi, umuyobozi wa ISIL. Igitabo cyasuzumye izamuka ry'ubutegetsi bwa al-Baghdadi n'ingaruka zaryo ku isi. \nAmara ifite icyicaro i Beirut. Muri 2019, yanenze Perezida wa Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika Donald Trump kuba adafite politiki yo mu burasirazuba bwo hagati kandi yirengagiza ihohoterwa rya guverinoma z'Abarabu. Amara yavuze ko umwanzuro uhangayikishije cyane mu mpeshyi y\u2019Abarabu ari uko \"hari abayobozi bashinzwe ibibazo bakora bashingiye ku nyungu zabo bwite zihinduka kandi rimwe na rimwe zikabarwa nabi.\" "}
{"id": "9812", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9812", "title": "Tezeta Abraham", "text": "Tezeta Abraham (yavutse 15 Gashyantare 1985) numunyamideli wumutaliyani ukomoka muri Etiyopiya.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nAbrahamu yavukiye i Djibouti kubabyeyi ba Etiyopiya. Yimukiye hamwe n'umuryango we mu Butaliyani afite imyaka itanu. Aburahamu yarwanije umwirondoro we akiri muto, akenshi akaba ari we mukobwa wenyine wumwirabura mwishuri rye. Mu 2002, yatsindiye irushanwa rya \"Miss Italy Africa\" ryamufashe ku isi yimyambarire. Nkumunyamideli, yakoraga mubirango Fendi, Gianfranco Ferre, Replay, Moschino, na Jean Paul Gaultier, nabandi. Abrahamu yakiriye impamyabumenyi ye nk'umujyanama mu bukerarugendo. Yagiye muri Miss Italy mu 2010. \nAbraham yashimishijwe nisi ya sinema maze atangira kwitabira amafilime afite imyaka 18, akenshi ahabwa inshingano. Mu isuzuma yabwiwe ko ari mwiza cyane, byaramutangaje. Muri 2012, Abraham yagize uruhare ruto muri film \"A Flat for Three\". Ukwezi kumwe nyuma yo kugenzurwa numuyobozi Ivan Cotroneo muri 2015, Abraham yahawe umwanya \"mubiganiro bya TV \u00c8 arrivata la felicit\u00e0\". Kuva mu 2015, yakoranye na Cotroneo kuri firime nyinshi na serivise. Muri 2017, Abraham yakinnye umunyeshuri wa kaminuza ashishikajwe nubuzima bwa Lord Byron na Mary Shelley, mubutaliyani muri film ngufi \"L'ultima rima\". Yakinnye umubyeyi muri firime ngufi ya 2018 \"La festa pi\u00f9 bellissima\". Muri 2019, Abraham yafashije gutangiza iserukiramuco rya Filime rya MiWorld. \nAburahamu afite umuhungu. Yamaganaga ivanguramoko mu Butaliyani, avuga ko abirabura baba ku nkengero za sosiyete ari umuco w\u2019Abagatolika. Abrahamu kandi ateza imbere ingendo nkinzira yo gufungura ibitekerezo mumico mishya. Ubu atuye i Roma. "}
{"id": "9813", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9813", "title": "Franco Sacchi", "text": "Franco Sacchi numukinnyi wa firime wumutaliyani akaba n'umwanditsi. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime zizwi cyane \"Iyi Ni Nollywood\", \"Inkone z'Abanyamerika\" no \"Gutegereza Harimagedoni\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye muri Zambiya akurira mu Butaliyani. \nUmwuga.\nMu 2003, yakoze documentaire ye ya mbere \"y'Abanyamerika Inkone\". Filime yerekanwe kandi itoranywa kumugaragaro muri International Documentary Film Festival Amsterdam (IDFA). Muri 2005, yakoze icyerekezo \"IThis Is Nollywood\",documentaire ivuga ibijyanye ninganda za firime. Filime yaje gutsindira igihembo cyabaterankunga mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Abuja. Iyo filime igenda neza, Franco yafatanije kuyobora no gufata amashusho \"Waiting for Armageddon\", yasohotse mu 2010. \nUsibye kuyobora firime, yabaye umwarimu mukuru muri Avid Technology kuva 1996 kugeza 2002. "}
{"id": "9814", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9814", "title": "Amin Sidi-Boum\u00e9di\u00e8ne", "text": "Amin Sidi-Boum\u00e9di\u00e8ne (yavutse ku ya 5 Werurwe 1982), ni umukinnyi wa filime wo muri Alijeriya ukomoka mu bufaransa. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa \"Al Djazira\" ngufi na firime \"Abou Leila\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 5 Werurwe 1982 i Paris, mu Bufaransa. Ariko, nyuma yakuriye mu Alger, Algeria. Yagarutse mu Bufaransa yiga chimie nyuma ya baccalaur\u00e9at. \nUmwuga.\nYabonye impamyabumenyi iyobowe na Conservatoire Libre du Cin\u00e9ma Fran\u00e7ais (CLCF) i Paris mu 2005. Noneho yakoze firime ye ya mbere \"Ejo, Algiers?\" muri 2011. Filime yatoranijwe mu birori mpuzamahanga bya firime. Hanyuma yakoze firime ye ya kabiri \"Al Djazira\", yafatiwe muri Algiers muri Nyakanga 2012. Yatsindiye Igihembo cya Filime Nziza y'Abarabu mu iserukiramuco rya filime rya Abu Dhabi. \nMuri 2014, yayoboye \"Serial ye ya gatatu ngufi K.\" Filime yerekanwe muminsi ya firime ya Bejaia. Nyuma yuruhererekane rwa firime ngufi zatsinze, yakoze filime yambere \"yumukobwa, Abou Leila\", film yijimye. Yarasiwe rwose mu gihugu cye cya Alijeriya. Filime yaje guhitamo kuri 58 Semaine de la Critique. Filime yasohotse mu makinamico ku ya 15 Nyakanga 2020. Yatoranijwe kandi kugirango yerekanwe mu cyumweru mpuzamahanga cy\u2019abanenga muri Festival ya Cannes ya 2019. Mu Gushyingo 2019, iyi filime yatsindiye igihembo cya Filime nziza ya mbere ya Diregiteri mu Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime mpuzamahanga rya 50. "}
{"id": "9815", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9815", "title": "Mirko Popovitch", "text": "Mirko Dragolioub Popovich (yavutse 1948), ni umukinnyi wa firime wo mu Bubiligi. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa film izwi cyane \"Tango Ya Ba Wendo\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1948 i Buruseli mu Bubiligi kandi akomoka muri Yugosilaviya. \nUmwuga.\nNiwe washinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa 'Zinneke Parade' i Buruseli. Mu 1993, yakoze documentaire ngufi \"Tango Ya Ba Wendo\" hamwe na Roger Kwami Zinga wo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. Amagambo magufi avuga ku buzima bwintangiriro yumuziki wa Zairian, Wendo, uzwi kandi nka Papa Wendo. Kuva 1966 kugeza 1980, Popovitch yakoraga nk'umucuranzi mumatsinda ya rock. Yakomeje gukora nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe ikigo ndangamuco cya Watermael - Boitsfort imyaka 28. Mu 1997, yabaye komiseri ushinzwe ibikorwa bya \"Na Nga Def Senegal\", aho yaje gukorera \"Laafi Burkina Faso\" mu 1999 na \"Alafia Benin\" mu 2004. \nUsibye sinema, ni n'umwanditsi mwinshi. Mu 2004, yanditse kandi asohora inkuru ngufi zatsindiye igihembo cya mbere cya Francit\u00e9 mu 2004 hanyuma yegukana igihembo cya RTBF Fureur de lire 2004. Mu mwaka wa 2008, yatorewe kuba Umuyobozi w\u2019umuryango udaharanira inyungu Africalia, aho yakomereje imyaka 7 hanyuma asezera ku ya 1 Mutarama 2013. Hamwe n'uburambe bwose yabonye muri iyi myaka, yatangije umurongo wa documentaire yakozwe nabakinnyi ba firime nyafurika kubijyanye numuco. "}
{"id": "9816", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9816", "title": "Ahmed Benaissa", "text": "Ahmed Benaissa, (1944-2022) ni umukinnyi wa firime mu Bufaransa ukomoka muri Alijeriya. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri firime zizwi cyane \"\u00c9toile aux dents ou Poulou le magnifique\", \"Amarembo yizuba\" hamwe \"n\u2019abanzi ba hafi\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye muri Alijeriya mu muryango w'abakobwa batanu n'abahungu bane. Se yari umurwanashyaka wafashwe agafungirwa muri Alijeriya. Icyakora yaje kurekurwa nyuma y'ubwigenge bwa Alijeriya. Nyuma yaje kwimukira i Paris mu Bufaransa. Yabayeho hafi imyaka 18 mu Bufaransa. Muri icyo gihe, yahawe amahugurwa mu Ishuri ry\u2019Ikinamico. \nArubatse, ni se w'abahungu babiri. \nUmwuga.\nMu 1971, Bena\u00efssa yatangiye umwuga we wa sinema akoresheje filime \"\u00c9toile aux dents ou Poulou le magnifique\" iyobowe na Derri Berkani. Yakinnye nka 'Jib\u00e9' muri iyo film. Iyo filime igenda neza, yakiriye filime nyinshi mu myaka yakurikiyeho nka filime yo muri Alijeriya \"Le\u00efla et les autres\" mu 1977 iyobowe na Sid Ali Mazif, \"Buamama\" mu 1985 iyobowe na Benamar Bakhti na comedi izwi cyane \"Le Clandestin\" mu 1989 iyobowe na Bakhti. \nYakinnye cyane muri 'Haroun', muri film L'Etranger de Camus. Yakinnye kandi anayobora kuri Theatre yigihugu ya Algiers, ndetse no muri Theatre ya Regional ya Oran. Yayoboye kandi Ikinamico y'akarere ka Sidi-Bel-Abb\u00e8s. Muri 2013, yatsindiye igihembo cyerekezo cyiza cya film \"Nedjma\". Bena\u00efssa yakinnye nka 'Rida' muri Ramzi Ben Sliman ya mbere yerekana filime \"My Revolution\". Yasohotse mu Bufaransa muri Kanama 2015. Kuri Theatre, urugendo na \"Meursaults\" rurakomeje mu Bufaransa muri 2017. "}
{"id": "9817", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9817", "title": "Abdelhamid Bouchnak", "text": "Abdelhamid Bouchnak (wavutse 1984), ni umukinnyi ukunzwe cyane wa filimi muri Tuniziya. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa filime \"iteye\" ubwoba yo muri Tuniziya Dachra. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1984 i Tunis, muri Tuniziya. Se Lotfi Bouchnak numuririmbyi uzwi cyane wo muri Tuniziya umukinnyi wa Oud uzwi cyane. Abdelhamid yize mu Ishuri Rikuru ry'Ubumenyi n'Ikoranabuhanga Ryashushanyije muri Tuniziya (ESAC) i Gammarth. Nyuma yize muri kaminuza ya Montreal arangiza afite impamyabumenyi yo kwiga film. \nUmwuga.\nAmaze kurangiza amashuri, yabaye umuyobozi muri sosiyete Shkoon Production. Ariko, ubanza yakoraga nka \"cinemateri\" murubuga rwa Ta7ana, hamwe na tereviziyo ya \"Hedhoukom\". Yagiye kandi muri firime ngufi nk'umukinnyi wa sinema muri \"Alliance\" muri 2011 hanyuma \"Le Bonbon\" muri 2016. Nyuma yimyaka mike, yayoboye inyandiko zamateka, \"Jadis Kerkouane\". \nMuri 2018, Abdelhamid yayoboye filime ye yambere \"yumukobwa\", Dachra, film iteye ubwoba. Iyi filime yakiriwe neza nyuma iza gutoranywa mu cyumweru mpuzamahanga cy\u2019abanenga mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Venice. Nyuma yo gutsinda kwa filime, yayoboye igihembwe cya 1 cya televiziyo \"Nouba cyanyuze\" kuri Nessma mu kwezi kwa Ramadhan muri 2019. Hanyuma yayoboye Season 2 \"yuruhererekane rumwe, yise Och\u00e8g Eddenia\" yatangajwe muri 2020. "}
{"id": "9818", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9818", "title": "Paul Onsongo", "text": "Paul Onsongo (yavutse 21 Nyakanga 1948), ni ni umukinnyi wakoze filimi nyinshi zikomeye muri Kenya. Azwi cyane ku ruhare muri filime \"Umusozi w'ukwezi\", \"K\u00fcken f\u00fcr Kairo\" na \"Flame Tree of Thika\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 21 Nyakanga 1948 i Mombasa, muri Kenya.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1974, yakinnye bwa mbere muri firime na \"Wilby Conspiracy\". Mu 1981, yatangiriye kuri tereviziyo ya mini na \"The Flame Tree of Thika\". Yakinnye uruhare rwa 'Juma' mubice bine byuruhererekane rwa mini. Muri uwo mwaka, yakinnye muri filime yerekana ubuzima bwa \"Rise na Fall ya Idi Amin\" aho iyi filime yatsindiye ibihembo bitanu, harimo n'umukinnyi mwiza, mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Las Vegas. \nHanyuma mu 1985, yagaragaye muri firime ishimishije \"K\u00fcken f\u00fcr Kairo\" aho yakinnye cyane nka 'Umucuruzi'. Mu 1987, yakinnye cyane muri Megitew muri firime ya tereviziyo \"Turi Abana\", aho yamenyekanye cyane. Mu 1989, yakinnye nk'umugome wa Abdullah muri filime \"Cheetah\". Mu 1990, yagaragaye muri firime yerekana ubuzima bwa \"Mountains of the Moon\" afite uruhare 'Sidi Bombay'. Uruhare rwe rwamenyekanye cyane. "}
{"id": "9819", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9819", "title": "Shamira Raphaela", "text": "Shamira Rapha\u00ebla (yavutse 1982), ni umukinnyi wa filimi wo muri Aruba ukomoka mu buholandi. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa documentaire \"Daddy and the Warlord\", \"Deal With It\" and \"Our Motherland\".\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1982 muri Karayibe, akurira muri Aruba kwa nyina w\u2019Ubuholandi na se wa Cura\u00e7ao. \nUmwuga.\nNyuma ya voorbereidend wetenschappelijk onderwijs (VWO), yimukiye mu Buholandi yiga ubuhanzi bwiza muri Gerrit Rietveld Academie. Nyuma yaje kubona impamyabumenyi yubuhanzi bwitangazamakuru muri kaminuza yubuhanzi ya ArtEZ. Ku ikubitiro, yatangiye gukora nk'umuyobozi wigenga aho yayoboye ibiganiro byinshi bya tereviziyo: \"Expeditie Robinson\" na \"Spuiten en Slikken\". \nMuri 2006, Raphaela yakoze kandi ayobora film ye ya mbere \"Yumunyu Mumaso Yanjye\". Amagambo magufi avuga abakobwa batatu ba Aruban. Nyuma yo gutsinda kwikabutura nyinshi, yakoze bwa mbere documentaire \"Deal With It\". Iyi filime yakiriwe neza nyuma iza gutangwa mu iserukiramuco rya sinema ry\u2019umujyi wa Los Angeles, iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Belize ndetse n\u2019iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Aruba. Iyi filime irazenguruka inkuru y\u2019abacuruza ibiyobyabwenge n\u2019abasinzi: se Pempy na murumuna we Andy, mubyukuri abo mu muryango we. Iyi filime yatorewe kuba umukinnyi wa mbere witwaye neza mu iserukiramuco rya Filime ry\u2019Ubuholandi (NFF) 2015. Muri 2017, iyi filime yahawe igihembo cya Lenno na Sunfish igihembo mpuzamahanga cy'amafilime mpuzamahanga ya Amsterdam (IDFA) kubera igihembo cyiza cy'urubyiruko. \nMuri 2017, yanditse filime \"Yamanutse ya Superwoman\" aho yatsindiye igihembo cya Karen de Bok muri IDFA, 2018. Muri uwo mwaka, yakoze \"Lenno na Angelfish\". Iyi filime yakiriwe neza kandi yegukana igihembo cy\u2019inyandiko nziza z\u2019abana b\u2019i Burayi mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Berlin mu 2019 hanyuma ihabwa igihembo cy\u2019inyandiko nziza z\u2019abana muri IDFA, 2018. \nMuri 2018, yakoze documentaire yerekana ubuzima bwa \"Daddy na Warlord\" izenguruka ku nkuru y\u2019umunyamakuru Clarice Gargard, wahoze ari umugabo w\u2019iburyo bwa Charles Taylor, wahoze ari perezida wa Liberiya. Filime yagaragaye bwa mbere muri Sinema Iserukiramuco rya film muri 2019. Nyuma, film yatsindiye Inyana ya Zahabu kubwinyandiko ngufi nziza mu iserukiramuco rya sinema ry\u2019Ubuholandi 2019. Ukuboza 2019, yakoze documentaire \"Ons Motherland\". "}
{"id": "9820", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9820", "title": "Talal Selhami", "text": "Talal Selhami (yavutse ku ya 11 Werurwe 1982), ni umukinnyi wa firime muri Maroke ukomoka mu bufaransa. Azwi cyane nk'umuyobozi wa firime zizwi cyane \"Mirages\", \"Achoura\" hamwe \"nabashushanyaga Ibiremwa - The Frankenstein Complex\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nyavutse ku ya 11 Werurwe 1982 i Neuilly-sur-Seine, Hauts-de-Seine mu Bufaransa nk'umuhererezi w'umuryango. Se, Mohamed Selhami ni umunyamakuru wa Maroc akaba ari nawe washinze ikinyamakuru Maroc Hebdo International. Yarangije icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza mu buhanzi no kwidagadura, inzobere mu gukora, muri kaminuza ya Paris 1 Pantheon-Sorbonne. \nUmwuga.\nMuri 2005, yakoze umukobwa we muto \"Sinistra\". Nyuma yo gutsinda muri make, yakoze \"Partir en umwotsi\" muri 2007. Mu mwaka wa 2010, yakoze filime ye ya mbere yerekana, \"Mirage\". Iyi filime ihagarariwe kumugaragaro mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Marrakech mu 2010 ndetse na Tangier National Film Festival muri 2011. Filime yaje gutsindira ibihembo bibiri: Kumashusho meza no Gusobanura neza Abagore. Mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Bruxelles (BIFFF) i Buruseli, 2011 yakiriye filime idasanzwe y'abacamanza.\nUkuboza 2018, yasohoye filime ye \"Achoura, La nuit des enfants\" nk'umusaruro uhuriweho na Franco-Maroc. Iyi filime yerekanwe mu minsi mikuru cumi n'itanu ku isi: harimo, iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya filime mpuzamahanga rya Paris, iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime ryiza ryabereye i Buruseli, iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime rya Bucheon (BiFan) muri Koreya y'Epfo ndetse na Neuch\u00e2tel International Fantastic Film Festival (NIFFF) muri Neuch\u00e2tel. Nyuma muri 2019, Talal yahawe igihembo cyumusaruro mwiza mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Tangier ndetse n\u2019abacamanza badasanzwe mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Sitges. Hagati aho, filime yanatanze igihembo cyiza cya Filime muri HARD: LINE International Film Festival mu Budage. "}
{"id": "9821", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9821", "title": "Lauren Roberts", "text": "Lauren Selmon Roberts ni umukinnyi wa firime ndetse akaba na producer ukomoka muri amerika. Ni umuyobozi wa \"Rainbow Town\", documentaire yibanze ku mfubyi muri Liberiya yatewe n'intambara. \nUmwuga.\nNi umukobwa wa Kathryn na Dewey Selmon wa Norman, Oklahoma. Yarangije impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu itangazamakuru ryamamaza muri kaminuza ya Leta ya California, Fresno muri Gicurasi 2005. Nyuma yaho, yahawe impamyabumenyi ihanitse y\u2019ubuhanzi bwiza yakuye muri College of Mass Communication and Media Arts of Southern Illinois University Carbondale. \nIgihe yari afite imyaka 14, yatangiye gukoresha kamera ya videwo. Roberts yakoze amashusho ye ya mbere, yinjira mubucuruzi bwa WNBA afite imyaka 15. Muri kiriya gihe, yatangiye gukina imirimo myinshi mwishuri nko gutanga raporo, kubyara, kurasa no gutunganya. Amaze kurangiza amashuri, yakoraga kumiyoboro yamakuru. \nHagati aho, yagiye muri Afurika y'Iburengerazuba gushaka documentaire. Nyuma yimyaka ibiri akorana nimpfubyi zintambara &amp; abahoze ari abasirikari babana muri Liberiya, yahisemo gukora documentaire ye yambere yuzuye, \"Umujyi wa Rainbow Town\" muri 2010. Yabaye kandi umukinnyi wa sinema akaba n'umwanditsi wa documentaire. Iyi filime irazenguruka inkuru yukuri yumugore warokoye ubuzima bwimfubyi zintambara zirenga 250 mugihe cyintambara yabenegihugu. Nyuma yo gushimwa cyane, iyi filime yanahawe igihembo n\u2019umuyobozi wa Guild of America. Nyuma yaje kwerekanwa muri New York Fashion Week, mu nzu ndangamurage ya Tolerance International Festival Festival ndetse nandi maserukiramuco ya firime mpuzamahanga. \nNyuma yo gutsinda kwa filime, yinjiye nka producer muri NBCUniversal uruganda rukora uruganda, 'Peacock Productions'. Kuva mu 2011, yakoraga nka producer wungirije, producer wungirije hamwe na producer nyobozi kuri serivise zitandukanye za tereviziyo, umwihariko wa TV hamwe na documentaire."}
{"id": "9822", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9822", "title": "Ayanda Daweti", "text": "Ayanda Daweti (wavutse 1990), umenyerewe nka Tuckshop Bafanaz, ni umukinnyi wa muzika wo muri Afurika y'Epfo akaba n'umucuranzi. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe 'Chumani Langa' muri televiziyo izwi cyane ya Scandal!. \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse mu 1990 akurira i Tsolo, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Nyina Nomalizo Daweti yapfuye azize indwara z'umutima asinziriye ubwo Ayanda yari afite imyaka 13. Nyuma y'urupfu rwa nyina, yimukiye i Mhlakulo, Tsolo mu burasirazuba bwa Cape hamwe na nyirasenge Stella Sondaba na nyirakuru Nomonde Sondaba. Nyuma yimyaka mike, yimukiye i Johannesburg. Amaze kurangiza amasomo ye, yimukiye i Cape Town yiga IT ndetse yiga n'ubuhanzi muri kaminuza y'ikoranabuhanga ya Tshwane, Pretoria. \nUmwuga.\nUruhare rwe rwa tereviziyo ruzwi cyane kandi ruzwi cyane rwanyuze kuri eTv isabune opera \"Scandal!\", aho yakinnye 'Chumani Langa'. Muri serial, yakinnye uruhare mubyukuri muto kurenza imyaka ye. Muri 2018 yatsindiye igihembo cya Golden Horn igihembo cyiza cya Filime ya TV muri Filime na Televiziyo yo muri Afrika yepfo kubera film ye \"Okae Molao\". Muri 2020, yatumiriwe kugira uruhare mu biganiro bya televiziyo \"Amaraso Zaburi\". \nUsibye gukina, ni n'umucuranzi yakoresheje izina rya stage 'Tuckshop Bafanaz'. Yatangiye umuziki kubijyanye na nyirasenge, aho yasohoye inzira itandatu ya mbere ya EP. Muri 2019, yasohoye alubumu yeguriwe nyina. Yakundanye n'umukobwa witwa Xola kuva 2007 kugeza apfuye azize impanuka ikomeye y'imodoka mu 2010. Nyuma, yeguriye indirimbo 'Xola' kugirango amwibuke.\u00a0"}
{"id": "9823", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9823", "title": "Tshepo Maseko", "text": "Tshepo Maseko (yavutse 7 Werurwe 1974), ni umukinnyi wa firime muri Afrika yepfo. Azwi cyane ku ruhare rwe muri serial izwi cyane \"Isidingo\",\"Vehicle 19\" and \"More Than Just a Game\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 7 Werurwe 1974 muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yabonye Impamyabumenyi y'igihugu muri Drama yakuye muri Pretoria Technikon ubu izwi ku izina rya Tshwane University of Technology. Nyuma yimyaka mike, yabaye Radio Itangaza kuri Motsweding FM. \nYashakanye na Masego Morapedi kuva 2013. Abashakanye bafite abakobwa batatu.\nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga we afite imyaka 13. Mu 1998, yatangiriye kuri tereviziyo ya \"Isidingo\" aho yakinnye nka 'Parsons Matabane' imyaka myinshi. Mu 2005, yagaragaye muri filime ngufi \"Blow\" akina 'Nick'. Hanyuma muri 2007, yakinnye bwa mbere muri firime hamwe na \"Poena Is Koning\". Muri 2008, yashizeho umurongo wimyenda witwa 'Phologolo Active Wear' (PAW). \nYakinnye kandi muri serial \"#Karektas\" nkumushyitsi wicyamamare hanyuma kuri serial \"Ba Kae?\" nka Nyiricyubahiro.\u00a0 Muri 2011, yatsindiye Igihembo cyumukinnyi witwaye neza mu isabune ya TV kuri SAFTA. Muri uwo mwaka, yarushanwe mu marushanwa ya M-Net yo \"kurokoka Afurika y'Epfo Survivor: Maldives\" nk'umuhanzi w'icyamamare. Muri 2013, yakinnye muri firime mpuzamahanga ya \"Vehicle 19\". Muri filime, yashyize ahagaragara 'Lieutenant'. \nYakiriye Igihembwe cya munani cyuburere bukuze bwerekana ukuri \"Kubuzima\" Bwerekanwe kuri SABC2. Hanyuma yagaragaye muri make \"Impeta\". Hagati aho, kuva 2012 kugeza 2013, yabaye umuyobozi wa gahunda yumuziki w\u2019amadini \"Gospel Classics yo\" mu gihe cya kabiri. "}
{"id": "9824", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9824", "title": "Michelle Beling", "text": "Michelle Beling-Pretorius, ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Afrika yepfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare muri serial izwi cyane \"Isidingo\",\"Egoli: Place of Gold\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavukiye kandi akurira mu burasirazuba bwa Cape, Afurika y'Epfo.\nUmwuga.\nYatangiye umwuga wo gukina akiri muto cyane. Yabanje kwinjira mu ikinamico yo muri Afurika yepfo anakina udukino twinshi mu gihugu hose. Mu 1999, yimukiye i Gauteng kugira ngo akore umwuga w'umwuga. Mubuzima bwe i Gauteng, yerekanye bwa mbere kumugaragaro muri \"Girl Talk 2000\". Hanyuma yagaragaye nk \" Patty 'ubabaza muri \"Sitade ya Grease\". \nYatangiye gukina kuri tereviziyo ya \"Egoli: Place of Gold\" muri 2009. Muri uruhererekane, yakinnye nka 'Candice (Candy) Botha Smith' kuva mu bihe 10 kugeza 18. Uwiteka yakoze umushyitsi muri serial \"Generations\". Yakinnye uruhare rwo gushyigikira 'Janine Cullanan' muri serie \"High Rollers\" hanyuma yinjira muri televiziyo izwi cyane kuri televiziyo \"Isidingo\" aho yakinnye nka 'Wendy'."}
{"id": "9825", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9825", "title": "Khanya Mkangisa", "text": "Khanya Mkangisa (wavutse ku ya 13 Werurwe 1988), ni umukinnyi wa filimi muri Afurika yepfo. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe muri serial izwi cyane \"Isidingo\",\"Shattered, Step Up to a Start Up\" and \"Harvest\".. Ni n'umunyamakuru kuri tereviziyo akaba n'umuhanzi wa DJ. azwi kuri YoTv kimwe no gukundana.\nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 13 Werurwe 1988 i Peddie, muri Afurika y'Epfo. Yarangije muri AFDA, Ishuri ryubukungu bwo guhanga.\nYakundanye n'umuraperi, J Molley kumurusha imyaka 10 aho ibihuha byatangiriye mu Kwakira 2019. \nUmwuga.\nAfite imyaka 14, yinjiye kuri tereviziyo maze aba umunyamakuru wa Yo YV. Yakomeje gukora mu musaruro imyaka itatu. Hanyuma yimutse kugirango yerekane siyanse \"yubumenyi yitwa Knock Knock\". Mu 2004, yerekanye televiziyo ye ya mbere \"yakinnye muri serie Mthunzini.\" \"Com\". Nyuma yaje gukina muri \"Lab1\" nka 'Refilwe' na \"Ugugu noAndile\". Nkumunyamakuru, yakiriye igitaramo cyo kubyina 'Shield Teen'. Hagati aho, yagaragaye cyane mu bitaramo bizwi cyane muri \"Zone 14\" muri 2011 na \"Intersexions\" muri 2012. Muri 2012, yakinnye muri BBC \"yise Mad Dogs III\" afite uruhare 'Anna'. Hanyuma muri 2013, yinjiye mu bakinnyi basanzwe ba serial \"Zabalaza\" akina 'Mpilo'. \nMuri 2019, yerekanye bwa mbere nk'umuhanzi wa DJ maze akora ibitaramo muri Jozi to Quilox weekend weekend i Lagos, muri Nijeriya. Muri 2020, yagaragaye bwa mbere muri sabune izwi cyane \"Muvhango\" afite uruhare rwa 'Mbali'. "}
{"id": "9826", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9826", "title": "Keabetswe Motsilanyane", "text": "Keabetswe 'KB' Motsilanyane (yavutse 8 Mata 1979), uzwi cyane nka KB Mamosadi, ni umuhanzi wo muri Afurika y'Epfo ukora ibitaramo, umuririmbyi, umwanditsi w'indirimbo, producer, umukinnyi wa firime, umubyinnyi ndetse n'umugore w'ubucuruzi. KB yakuze ashishikarira umuziki nubuhanzi muri iyo ntara. Yinjiye mu itsinda ry\u2019icyamamare muri Afurika y'Epfo, Crowded Crew, wamenyekanye cyane mu mpera za 90. Mu 2001, KB yinjiye muri e-TV isabune Backstage nka we, byahuriranye no kumurika alubumu ye ya mbere, Beautiful Vibrations (2002), yagaragayemo indirimbo yakunzwe cyane 'OA lla', imuha izina rya Mamosadi. Azwi cyane kubera uruhare rwe muri serie izwi cyane \"Backstage\", Mthunzini.com, \"Rhythm City\" and \"7de Laan\". \nUbuzima bwite.\nYavutse ku ya 8 Mata 1979 i Moruleng, muri Afurika y'Epfo\u00a0\nYigeze gushyingiranwa na Terry Pinana mbere yuko batandukana muri 2007. Ni nyina w'umuhungu umwe. \nUmwuga.\nKB ifite alubumu 6 kugeza ubu, zamugize umuhanzi uzwi cyane watsindiye ibihembo muri Afrika yepfo. Ni imyidagaduro yuzuye yasangiye stage n'abahanzi bakomeye nka: Eve, Sibongile Khumalo, Busta Rhymes, Beyonce, Prime Circle, Ashanti, Dwele na Brandy.\nYatangiye umwuga we wo gukina mu 1999 akina amakinamico. Azwi cyane mubyerekanwa \"Backstage\" aho yakinnye nka 'KayBee'. Kohereza urugendo rwe kuri iki gitaramo, nyuma yakinnye nka 'Lucilla Vilakazi' muri televiziyo izwi cyane ya \"Rhythm City\". Yabaye umukinnyi usanzwe muri uruhererekane kugeza igihe azagenda muri 2015. Muri 2017, yinjiye muri Afrika yepfo Afrika yisabune izwi cyane yisabune \"7de Laan\" kandi akina nkumunyamategeko ukomeye, 'Lesedi'. Yakinnye kandi muri saison ya kabiri \"yuruhererekane rwa Thola\" nka 'Dibuseng Makwarela'. Yakinnye kandi murukurikirane \"Mtunzini.com\" nka 'Phaphama Molefe'. KB yatsindiye ibihembo bibiri byigihembo cya Golden Horn igihembo cyumukinnyi mwiza mu isabune ya TV muri 2008 na 2011. \nIbihembo.\nYabonye ibihembo byinshi bya muzika: "}
{"id": "9827", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9827", "title": "Dyana Gaye", "text": "Dyana Gaye (wavutse 1975) ni umuyobozi w'amafirime mu bufaransa ariko aturuka muri senegali.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nGaye yavukiye i Paris mu 1975, umukobwa w\u2019abimukira bo muri Senegali, yiga muri kaminuza ya Paris 8 Vincennes-Saint-Denis yiga filime. Yakiriye inkunga ya Louis Lumi\u00e8re - Villa M\u00e9dicis inkunga mu 1999 kubera amashusho ye \"Une femme pour Souleymane\". Gaye yayoboye mu 2000, kandi yahawe igihembo kinini cya Jury mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Dakar. Mu 2004, yari umwe mu bahatanira umwanya wa Rolex Mentor na Prot\u00e9g\u00e9 Arts Initiative. Gaye yayoboye filime ngufi \"J'ai deux amours\", mu rwego \"rw'umushinga wa Paris la m\u00e9tisse\" mu 2005. Umwaka ukurikira, yayoboye \"Ousmane\", byagenze neza cyane. Yakiriye nomination ya Filime ngufi nziza muri C\u00e9sar Awards. Muri 2009, Gaye yakoze kandi ayobora \"Saint Louis Blues\", yari comedi yumuziki. Yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco rya Filime rya Lokarno na Sundance Film Festival, yari umwe mu batanu ba nyuma ba Filime ngufi nziza muri C\u00e9sar Awards. Filime yatoranijwe, iterwa inkunga kandi ikorwa mubice bigize gahunda yibanze ya Afrika. \nYabaye igihembo cya 2012 cyigihembo cya Gan Foundation. Gaye yayoboye \"Munsi ya Starry Sky\" muri 2013, abaye film ya mbere yerekana amashusho hagati ya Dakar, Turin, na New York City. Yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Toronto maze ahabwa igihembo kinini cya Jury hamwe nigihembo cyabateze amatwi muri Premiers Plans Angers Festival. Gaye yavuze ko iyi filime ari ugukomeza gukina filime ngufi zabanjirije iyi, no gukora ubushakashatsi ku ndangamuntu nyinshi ndetse n\u2019abinjira. \nGaye ni umunyamuryango wa Collectif 50/50, umuryango ufite intego yo kugira uburinganire hagati y\u2019abagabo n\u2019abagore mu nganda za firime, ndetse no guteza imbere ubudasa muri sinema. "}
{"id": "9828", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9828", "title": "Marina Niava", "text": "Marina Niava (wavutse 1985) ni umuyobozi wa firime ya Cote d'Ivoire, utunganya firime, n'umwanditsi.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nNiava ni umukobwa muto wa Pierre na C\u00e9cile Niava, bombi bigisha indimi. Yatangiye gukunda ubuhanzi nubuvanganzo kandi yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi byubuvanganzo. Yarangije muri Lyc\u00e9e Sainte Marie d'Abidjan ahabwa igihembo cya Series A Excellence Award. Niava amaze kubona impamyabumenyi ye mu itangazamakuru no gutunganya amajwi n'amashusho yakuye muri Institut des Science et Techniques de la Communication, Niava yatsindiye amarushanwa ayobowe na Radio JAM i Abidjan maze atangira umwuga we nk'umutoza. Nyuma yaje kuba umunyamakuru muri Afurika 24. Niava yateje imbere sinema mugihe cyo gufata amashusho yamamaza. \nKuva mu 2009 kugeza 2010, Niava yabaye umwanditsi umwe mu gihembwe cya 1 cya \"serivise Teenager\", yakiriye igihembo cy\u2019uruhererekane rwiza rwa Afurika mu iserukiramuco rya Vues d'Afrique ryabereye i Montreal. Yimukiye i Oslo, muri Noruveje mu 2010 aba umuyobozi ushinzwe itumanaho mu kigo ndangamuco nyafurika. Niava yagenzuye ibirori bya firime ya Kino Afrika 2010 na 2011 muri Oslo. Yabaye igihembo cya BENIANH International Foundation cyatsindiye igihembo cya buruse muri 2012. \nMu Kwakira 2012, yayoboye documentaire ye ya mbere, \"Noirs au soleil levant\", ivuga ku buzima bw\u2019abanyeshuri bo muri Afurika i Tsukuba, mu Buyapani. Filime ya mbere ya Niava ngufi, \"21\", yarangiye mu Kuboza 2013. Yatewe inkunga n'amafaranga yatanzwe n'Umuryango mpuzamahanga de la Francophonie. \"21\" ivuga kubyerekeye umukobwa ukiri muto udashobora kwihanganira umukunzi wa nyina kandi niwe filime yonyine yo muri Afrika yerekanwe mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Oakland. Niava yarayoboye gito mahano \"Worse\" muri 2014. Yakoze nkumuhuzabikorwa wihariye wa firime \"Advantageous\" 2015. \nNiava yarangije icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza cya Filime na Televiziyo muri Academy ya Art University. Muri 2017, Niava yanditse igitabo cye cya mbere, \"American Dreamer\". Yabaye finale ya 10 Prix Ivoire pour la Litt\u00e9rature Africaine d'Expression Francophone. "}
{"id": "9829", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9829", "title": "Magaajyia Silberfeld", "text": "Sarah Magaajyia Silberfeld (yavutse 30 Kanama 1996) ni umukinnyi n'umuyobozi wa filimi muri Nijeriya ariko akomoka mu Bufaransa\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nSilberfeld ni umukobwa w'umuyobozi wa firime Rahmatou Ke\u00efta n'umunyamakuru w\u2019umufaransa Antoine Silber. Yatangiye gukina kuri theatre yaho afite imyaka 11. Silberfeld yakuriye mu Bufaransa ariko agenda kenshi mu Bugereki, Nigeriya, na Mali, aba i Los Angeles imyaka itatu. Yatangiye gukina filime muri 2011, i \"La Lisi\u00e8re\". Silberfeld yize ibijyanye no gukina mu kigo cya Lee Strasberg mu 2013, muri Playhouse West Repertory Theatre muri 2014 ndetse no muri Studio ya Susan Batson mu 2015. Afite imyaka 18, yanditse kandi ayobora film ye ya mbere ngufi, \"Me Hano\" kandi afatanya kuyobora \"Ride cyangwa Die\" irimo Piper de Palma na Roxane Depardieu. \nMuri 2016, Silberfeld yagize uruhare rwe rwa mbere muri \"The Wedding Ring\", iyobowe na nyina kandi yatewe inkunga yose binyuze mumafaranga ya Afrika. Yakinnye na Tiyaa, umukobwa ukiri muto ujya kwiga mubufaransa agakundana numugabo ukomoka mubyubahiro. Filime ibaye film ya mbere ya Nigeriya yakinnye muri Awards Awards. Muri 2017, yayoboye filime ye ngufi \"Vagabonds\", yakinnye na Danny Glover. Muri uwo mwaka, Silberfeld yabonye impamyabumenyi ya filozofiya na Sorbonne. Mugihe cya kaminuza, yize icyongereza abinyujije muri firime zo muri Amerika. \nYabaye umuyobozi mu Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime ya Friborg 2019 kandi atera inkunga Amasezerano y\u2019uburinganire n'ubwuzuzanye. Silberfeld yerekanye documentaire ya nyina \"Al'l\u00e8\u00e8ssi.\" \".\" \".\" \"Une actrice africaine\" (2004), ifoto yumukinnyi wa Nigeriya Zalika Souley. "}
{"id": "9830", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9830", "title": "Roukiata Ouedraogo", "text": "Roukiata Ouedraogo (wavutse 1979) ni umwanditsi w'amakinamico ya Burkinab\u00e9, umukinnyi wa filime akaba n'umunyarwenya muri Burkinafaso.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nYakuriye muri Fada N'Gourma, umukobwa w'umukozi wa Leta. Se yari yagiye mu ikinamico ryaho kandi yari inshuti na bagenzi be b'umupira w'amaguru hamwe n'umukinnyi uzwi cyane Sotigui Kouyat\u00e9.. Se wabo ni umutware wa Mossi wa Soumiaga. Akiri muto, Ouedraogo yimukiye Ouagadougou kugirango akomeze amashuri. Mu mashure yisumbuye, yinjiye mu mugwi w'amakinamico yaho hanyuma azenguruka igihugu. Kugira ngo abone amafaranga, yafunguye salon ntoya yo gutunganya imisatsi hafi y'urugo rwe maze ategura imyenda. Nyuma yo guhabwa impamyabumenyi ye, Ouedraogo yimukiye i Paris mu 2000, aho musaza we yari atuye. Yari afite akazi kadasanzwe, kandi yirukanwe nk'umubitsi muri mini-market kubera ko yitiranyije amafaranga na CFA. \nYakoze nk'umuhanzi wo kwisiga no kwerekana imideli imyaka myinshi. Mu 2007, Ouedraogo yahisemo kwibanda ku ikinamico maze yemerwa muri Cours Florent nyuma y\u2019isuzuma. Mu rwego rwo gukora amasomo, yanditse kandi ayobora ikinamico ye ya mbere, \"Yennenga, icyamamare cya Moss\u00e9.\" Nyuma yo kwakirwa neza n'abamwigisha, ikinamico yabanje gukinirwa kuri teatre ya Com\u00e9die de la Passerelle mu 2008. Ishingiye kuri imwe mu migani yashinze muri Burkinafaso, kandi Ouedraogo yakinnye nk'umwamikazi wo mu kinyejana cya 11. Ku bwe, kwandika ikinamico byamufashije guhangana n'agahinda ko kubura se na murumuna we. \nMuri Nzeri 2010, ikinamico ye yakorewe bwa mbere mu kigo ndangamuco cya Gambidi muri Ouagadougou, kandi cyerekanwe kuri televiziyo y'igihugu. Kubaho kwa nyirarume muri iki gitaramo byari ikimenyetso cyo kwemeza inzira yumwuga ishobora gucibwa intege numuntu ukomokamo nka Ouedraogo. Ikinamico yongeye kugarurwa nka comedi yumuziki, hamwe nababyinnyi umunani nabacuranzi babiri. Muri Mata 2011, Ouedraogo yateguye ikinamico yo gutera inkunga ONG Fitima, ifasha abana bamugaye. Yakoranye mu gitaramo \"ingingo ya 13\" yitiriwe Itangazo ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ryita ku burenganzira bwa muntu, ryakozwe mu mwaka wa 2012 mu bitaramo byaberaga mu mihanda mu Bufaransa. Muri 2013, yakoze igitabo cyerekana ubuzima bw'umugore umwe yerekana \"Ouagadougou press\u00e9\", ku ngingo yo kwimukira mu Bufaransa. \nOuedraogo yatangiye gukina filime muri Nzeri 2013, muri filime ngufi \"Marie et les gargouilles\". Yagaragaye muri filime \"Samba\"2014. Muri uwo mwaka, Ouedraogo yegerejwe na Dani Kouyat\u00e9 kugira ngo akine mu rukurikirane \"rw'inyandiko L'Amour en cage\". Muri 2015, yakinnye mu ikinamico \"Roukiata tombe le masque\", urwenya ku gukebwa kwe. Yagaragaye mu gitaramo \"Le Parlement du rire\" kuri Canal +. Muri Mata 2017, Ouedraogo yatangiye kwandika inkingi kuri Inter Inter y'Ubufaransa. Muri 2018, yakinnye muri \"Je demande la route\", yerekanwe muri Festival Off d'Avignon. \nOuedraogo yashakanye na St\u00e9phane Eliard, umuyobozi wa firime. Avuga Igifaransa na Bambara. "}
{"id": "9831", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9831", "title": "Deolinda Kinzimba", "text": "Deolinda In\u00eas Caetano Kinzimba (yavutse ku ya 11 Gicurasi 1995) ni umukinnyi wa firime akaba aririmba ndetse ashobora kwandika indirimbo cyanwa filime Angola.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nKinzimba yavukiye i Luanda akurira muri Ingombota. Yavuze ko yagize ubuzima bwiza kandi ko ashishikajwe n'umuziki kuva akiri muto. Mubyo akora harimo Phyllis Hyman na Selena Quintanilla. Kinzimba yabaga muri Tanzaniya akiri ingimbi kuko yari afite mushiki we wakoraga kuri ambasade ya Angola. Yimukiye i Guimar\u00e3es, Porutugali mu 2014 kwiga no kugira amahirwe meza. Kinzimba yize amategeko muri Porto. \nMuri 2016, yatsindiye igihembwe cya gatatu cya Ijwi rya Portugal. Kinzimba yiswe \" Whitney Houston mushya\" ubwo yakoraga indirimbo yakunzwe cyane ya Houston \" \"I Have Nothing \" ashimwa cyane. Yakinnye \" \"I Will Always Love You \" ya Mariah Carey na \" A Moment Like This\" na Kelly Clarkson kurangiza. Kinzimba yongeye guhura na nyina, uwo yari amaze imyaka ibiri atabona. Kubera intsinzi, Kinzimba yasinyanye amasezerano na Universal. Muri Nzeri 2016, yakinnye mu gitaramo \"Dentro\". \nIndirimbo ye ya mbere, \"Primeira Vez\", yasohotse mu Kwakira 2016. Ugushyingo 2017, yashyize ahagaragara alubumu ye ya mbere yise. \"Deolinda Kinzimba\" yakiriye inyenyeri eshatu nigice ziva muri S\u00e1bado, ashima amarangamutima ya Kimzimba n'imikorere ye ariko anenga ibizaba byavuzwe. Nubwo bimeze bityo, iki kinyamakuru cyavuze ko ari umukino wambere hamwe nindirimbo nyinshi zikomeye. Yitabiriye Iserukiramuco RTP da Can\u00e7\u00e3o 2017, ku butumire bw'umwanditsi w'indirimbo Rita Redshoes, agera ku mukino wa nyuma w'ibyo birori. "}
{"id": "9832", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9832", "title": "Samantha Mugatsia", "text": "Samantha Mugatsia (wavutse 1992) ni umukinnyi w'amafirime muri Kenya.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nMugatsia yavutse mu 1992, umukobwa wa Grace Gitau. Yakuriye i Nairobi kandi akora nk'ingoma y'itsinda The Machine Machine. Yari yaranakoze akazi ko kwerekana imideli. Mugatsia yize amategeko muri Kaminuza Gatolika yo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba ariko ahagarika amasomo ye kugira ngo atangire umwuga we wo gukina. Mu Gushyingo 2016, yari yitabiriye pop-in y'abahanzi ubwo yamenyanwaga n'umuyobozi wa firime Wanuri Kahiu, amubwira ko yanditse inyandiko kandi ashaka kwerekana Mugatsia. Nubwo atigeze akora, Mugatsia yemeye uruhare. \nMuri 2018, Mugatsia yakinnye na Kena Mwaura, umwe mu bantu babiri bakomeye, muri \"Rafiki\" ya Kahiu. Iyi nkuru ishingiye ku gitabo cyitwa \"Jambula Igiti\" cyanditswe n'umwanditsi wa Uganda Monica Arac de Nyeko kandi kirasobanura urukundo ruteye imbere hagati y\u2019abakobwa babiri aho bibujijwe kuryamana kw'abahuje igitsina. Mu rwego rwo kwitegura uruhare, Mugatsia yafashe amezi menshi yamasomo yo gukina kandi yitoza gukoresha imyitozo yindorerwamo no kubaho mubitekerezo. Iyi filime yari itemewe muri Kenya, aho kuryamana kw'abahuje igitsina bitemewe. \"Rafiki\" abaye film ya mbere yo muri Kenya yerekanwe mu Iserukiramuco rya sinema i Cannes. Ann Hornaday wo muri Washington Post yise imikorere ya Mugatsia \"yitonze.\" Mugatsia yatsindiye igihembo cy'umukinnyi witwaye neza mu iserukiramuco rya FESPACO rya 2019 ryabereye i Ouagadougou, Burkina Faso kubera kwerekana Kena. Ihagarikwa rya filime ryakuweho nyuma gato yuko Kahiu atanga ikirego, kugira ngo yerekane muri Kenya kugira ngo yemererwe guhabwa ibihembo bya Academy. \nMugatsia yerekana ko ari iby'umwuka. Yanze kugira icyo atangaza ku mibonano mpuzabitsina ye, ariko agirira impuhwe umuryango wa LGBT. "}
{"id": "9833", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9833", "title": "Lucr\u00e9cia Paco", "text": "Lucr\u00e9cia Paco (yavutse 19 Ukwakira 1969) ni umukinnyi wamafirime muri Mozambike. Afatwa nk'umwe mu bakinnyi ba filime bazwi cyane muri Mozambike.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nPaco yakuriye i Maputo. Akiri umwana, yakundaga kuririmba no kubyina imiziki gakondo, yakandamijwe cyane muri kiriya gihe mbere y\u2019ubwigenge bwa Mozambique mu 1975. Paco yakubiswe ku ishuri azira gukoresha indimi gakondo. Nyuma y'ubwigenge, guverinoma y\u2019abasosiyalisiti yashishikarije amatsinda y\u2019ubuhanzi, kandi yitabira kuririmba, kubyina, no gusoma imivugo. \nMu gihe mu gihe cy'intambara yabenegihugu ya Mozambike, Paco yerekeje ibitekerezo ku ikinamico mu rwego rwa politiki. Yagaragaye muri documentaire ya \"Maputo Mulher\" 1984. Mu 1986, Paco yari umwe mubashinze itsinda rya Mutumbela Gogo, itsinda ryambere ryamakinamico yabigize umwuga muri Mozambike kugeza na nubu. Yayobowe na firime nyinshi z'Abasoviyeti yarebye, anakora udukino duto twerekana uko kuba Mozambike byari bimeze. Mu rwego rwo gushyigikira itsinda ryamakinamico, Paco nabandi banyamuryango bashinze imigati. \nPaco yafashe ikiruhuko cyimyaka itanu kuri stage kubera umunaniro. Paco yatumiwe na Instituto Ita\u00fa Umuco muri Berezile muri 2009. Yitabiriye umushinga wa Antidote mu mahugurwa mpuzamahanga ku bikorwa by\u2019umuco mu turere tw\u2019amakimbirane, akoresheje ikinamico Mulher Asfalto. Muri 2010, Paco yakinnye muri film \"Quero Ser uma Estrela\". Nyuma yaho gato, yakinnye nyamukuru muri \"Nineteens\", telenovela ya mbere ya Mozambike. "}
{"id": "9834", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9834", "title": "Nicole Amarteifio", "text": "Nicole Amarteifio (yavutse 1982) ni umuyobozi wa firime yo muri Gana, producer, n'umwanditsi.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nAmarteifio yavukiye muri Gana ariko yimukira i Londres nk'umwana w'amezi atatu kubera guhirika ubutegetsi mu gihugu cye, aba mu Bwongereza imyaka itandatu. Sekuru, komiseri w'akarere k'abazungu, yashakanye na nyirakuru muri Gana mu 1945. Nyuma yaje kwimukana n'umuryango we i Scarsdale, New York, ariko buri mwaka aruhukira muri Gana. Igihe yigaga mu ishuri ryisumbuye rya Scarsdale, umunyeshuri bigana yatanze igitekerezo cyo guturika Afurika kugira ngo ikibazo cya sida gikemuke. Ababyeyi ba Amarteifio basubiye muri Gana mu 1997. Yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri Afurika na Afro-Amerika yakuye muri kaminuza ya Brandeis mu 2004. Amaze kubona impamyabumenyi, yabonye akazi i Washington, DC nk'umujyanama mu iterambere ry'ubukungu bwa Afurika muri The Whitaker Group, akorera Rosa Whitaker. \nMu 2006, Amarteifio yimukiye i Accra, muri Gana, kugira ngo akore mu iterambere ry'ubukungu muri Fondasiyo Nyafurika. Nyuma gato yo kwimukira muri Afrika, yagize igitekerezo cyo gukora igitaramo nka \"Sex and the City\" i Accra. Amarteifio yasubiye muri Amerika kwiga kaminuza ya Georgetown maze ahabwa impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu itumanaho ry\u2019ibigo mu 2010. I Georgetown, yize munsi ya Mike Long, wamushishikarizaga kwandika amashusho. Amarteifio yabonye akazi muri Bank y'isi nk'umuntu wa mbere ushinzwe imbuga nkoranyambaga muri Accra. Amezi atari make nyuma yo gusubira muri Gana, yatangiye kumenyekanisha igitekerezo cye kubanyamwuga ba tereviziyo, banga gukora umushinga ariko bamutera inkunga yo kwandika igitaramo. \nAmarteifio yashyizeho bije maze amenya ko akeneye amafaranga ahagije kugirango atangire aho gutanga ibihe byuzuye. Kugira ngo yige kubyara umusaruro, yakurikiranye imirimo yabatunganya ibitangazamakuru byinshi hanyuma yiyandikisha mumasomo ya kaminuza yabaturage. Amarteifio yavumbuye inyandiko zijyanye \"Sex and the City\" hamwe n'ibiganiro bifitanye isano kuri interineti, maze abikoresha nk'icyitegererezo cyo kwandika, ndetse n'inkuru z'inshuti ze muri Afurika. Yabonye abakinnyi mu guhamagara, maze avugana na mugenzi we bigana, Maame Adjei, kugira ngo bakine Zainab. Adjei yagiye mwishuri muri Connecticut hamwe na Nana Mensah, Amarteifio yahisemo kumiterere ya Sad\u00e9. Yifashishije abakozi ba firime bo muri Gana, Amarteifio ahanini yarashe igitaramo cye muri wikendi nijoro kugirango atavuguruzanya nakazi ke muri Banki yisi. \nIgihembwe cya mbere cyerekana, \"Umujyi wa Afurika\", cyasohotse kuri Youtube muri Werurwe 2014. Bikurikirana ubuzima bwinshuti eshanu zari zasubiye muri Afrika nyuma yo gutura mumahanga no kugendana urukundo, umwuga, nubuzima bwa nijoro mumurwa mukuru wa Gana, hamwe nibiganiro byukuri kubyerekeye igitsina. Amarteifio yari igamije gukora ibiganiro kubyerekeye umunya nyafurika, no gukuraho kirazira. Urukurikirane rwanenzwe guhagararira abantu batoranijwe badafite byinshi bahuriyeho nabagore benshi bo muri Afrika. Amarteifio yakuyeho kunegura, abaza igitekerezo cyumugore usanzwe wumugore. Igihembwe cya kabiri cyerekanwa cyasohotse muri 2016. Urukurikirane rwe rwa kabiri rwa televiziyo, rukora politiki yiswe \"Repubulika\", narwo rwasohotse mu 2016, rushingiye ku manza zabayeho muri Accra. \nAmarteifio yiswe \" Shonda Rhimes yo muri Gana.\" Yiswe umwe mu bagore 100 ba OkayAfrica muri 2018. Filime ye ya mbere yakinnye, \"Mbere yimihigo\", yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Seattle muri 2018. Urwenya rwurukundo, rukurikira isano iri hagati ya Afua na Nii mugihe batekereza kurushinga. "}
{"id": "9835", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9835", "title": "Doria Achour", "text": "Doria Achour (wavutse ku ya 1 Werurwe 1991) ni umukinnyi ndetse n'umuyobozi wa firimi mu Bufaransa ariko akomoka muri Tuniziya\nUbuzima bwe.\nAchour ni umukobwa wumuyobozi wa firime wa tuniziya akaba n'umukinnyi wa filime Lotfi Achour na nyina w\u2019Uburusiya akaba umwanditsi w'amakinamico. Mukuru we ni umwanditsi w'amakinamico, kandi afite murumuna we. Achour yakuriye mu cyiciro cya 12 cya Paris mu kirere cyari \"icyerekezo cy'ubuhanzi, ariko ntabwo ari burugumesitiri.\" Akiri umwana, yaherekeje ababyeyi be mu myitozo yabo no mu bitaramo byabo. \nMu 2002, Achour yerekanye umukobwa wa Sergi L\u00f3pez muri \"Les Femmes... ou les enfants d'abord...\u00a0[fr]\", iyobowe na Manuel Poirier. Nyina yamufashije kubona uruhare, abona itangazo muri \"Lib\u00e9ration\". Nyuma yuruhare rwe rwa mbere, Achor yafashe amasomo yo gukina umwaka umwe muri Th\u00e9\u00e2tre des D\u00e9chargeurs. Yagize uruhare rwa kabiri muri firime nkeya, nka \"L'enemi naturel\" na \"L'\u00c9cole pour tous\". Kugira ngo yibanze ku myigire ye, Achour yahagaritse umwuga we wa firime imyaka myinshi. Achour yabonye impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubuvanganzo yakuye muri kaminuza ya Paris-Sorbonne nyuma aza kubona impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri sinema yakuye muri kaminuza ya Paris Diderot. \nMuri 2012, Achour yakinnye umusore Yasmeen muri \"La fille publique\", kandi imico ye yahumekewe nubuzima bwa mbere bwa Cheyenne Carron. Mu mwaka wa 2013, Achour yayoboye filime ye ya mbere ngufi, \"Laisse-moi finir\", ku ngingo y'ubuzima muri Tuniziya nyuma y'Isoko ry'Abarabu igihe abayisilamu bigaruriraga. Yerekanwe mu minsi mikuru myinshi kandi ihabwa igihembo cya Audience muri Made in Med marushanwa ya firime ngufi yo muri Kamena 2014. Imyitwarire ye muri \"La fille publique yakuruye\" umuyobozi Sylvie Ohayon, wakinnye uyu mukinnyi ukiri muto nka Stephanie muri film ya\"Papa Was Not a Rolling Ston\". Muri 2016, Achour yakinnye muri filime ye ya mbere yicyarabu, \"Yaka Ibyiringiro\". Yayoboye filime ngufi \"Le reste est l'\u0153uvre de l'homme\", yatsindiye igihembo cya Jury mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Sundance 2017. Yakinnye na Leila, umukobwa wabuze, muri Naidra Ayadi ya film ya \"Ma fille ya\" 2018. \nAchur ni agnostic. Ni umukunzi wibitabo byo hagati. "}
{"id": "9836", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9836", "title": "Maji-da Abdi", "text": "Maji-da Abdi (yavutse ku ya 25 Ukwakira 1970) ni umuyobozi wa firime na producer ukomeye muri Etiyopiya.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nAbdi yavukiye Dire Dawa, yabaga i Addis Abeba kugeza afite imyaka ine. Nyuma y\u2019impinduramatwara yo mu 1974, nyina wari warahukanye na se, ahungira hamwe na murumuna we i Nairobi, muri Kenya. Abdi yarangije amashuri abanza nayisumbuye muri Kenya. Afite imyaka 17, yimukiye muri Kanada n'umuryango we kwiga ubucuruzi. Abdi yiyandikishije muri kaminuza y\u2019iburengerazuba bwa Ontario, Abdi amenyera imico mpuzamahanga. Yumvaga atandukanye nabenshi mubanyeshuri bigana, bifuzaga kubona akazi kuri Wall Street, arangiza gahunda mubuvanganzo bwigifaransa. Nyuma yo guhabwa impamyabumenyi, Abdi yakoze imyaka itari mike mu itangazamakuru ndetse no gutunganya film. \nAbdi yari mu rugendo muri Nepal mu myaka ya za 90 ubwo yahuraga na Bernardo Bertolucci, wari mu gihe cyo gufata amashusho ya \"Buda\". Yahisemo kuba umuntu wimenyereza umwuga. Mu 2001, Abdi yasubiye muri Etiyopiya maze ayobora filime ye ya mbere yise \"\u201cUruzi rutandukanya\",\u201d yiga ku buzima bwa buri munsi bw'abagore b'Abanyetiyopiya mu gihe cy'intambara ya Eritereya na Etiyopiya. Filime yahawe igihembo cy\u2019uburenganzira bwa muntu muri Kanada. \nAbdi nawe yagize uruhare mugutunganya film. Mu 2001, yakoze firime ngufi ya \"Data\" na Ermias Woldeamlak, asuzuma umubano wumuryango nyafurika. Abdi yakoranye na Abderrahmane Sissako nk'umuproducer n'umushushanya w'imyambarire muri firime ye \"Gutegereza umunezero\" (2003) na \"Bamako\" (2006). Yakoze muri joriji ya firime ngufi na Cin\u00e9fondation muiserukiramuco rya sinema i Cannes muri 2013. Abdi ahangayikishijwe nibibazo byamazi kimwe nibidukikije muri rusange. Yashakanye na Sissako. \nMu mwaka wa 2010, Abdi yakoze iserukiramuco rya firime Amashusho Yingenzi, iserukiramuco rya mbere ryahariwe firime ngufi za Etiyopiya. Yari yarateguye gukora ibirori nk'ibi mu myaka itari mike ariko amaherezo ahabwa inkunga na Minisiteri y\u2019umuco ya Etiyopiya na Olivier Poivre d'Arvor. Mu iserukiramuco rya mbere, Abdi yakoze amahugurwa yo gufasha abakora amafilime bato kwitoza. Yavuze ko imyaka itandatu mbere y\u2019ibirori, sinema yo muri Etiyopiya yasigaye inyuma mu bihugu byinshi ariko urwego rw\u2019umusaruro rukiyongera. Usibye imirimo ya firime, Abdi akorera Orbs, ikinyamakuru cyibanda kuri siyanse, ubuhanzi numwuka. "}
{"id": "9837", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9837", "title": "Nomsa Manaka", "text": "Nomsa Kupi Manaka (wavutse 1962) ni umubyinnyi n'umukinnyi wa filime, umukinnyi wa koreografi wo muri Afurika yepfo\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nManaka yavutse 1962 i Orlando, mu mujyi wa Soweto muri Johannesburg, Afurika y'Epfo. Amaze gutozwa ballet ya kera, yigisha kubyina muri Funda Centre, yashinzwe numugabo we, Matsemela Manaka. Mu 1989, yakinnye mu ikinamico, \"Gor\u00e9e\", yashyize aha hantu hateranira imbata zerekeza muri Amerika, kandi zivuga ku rugendo rwo mu mwuka rw'umukobwa ukiri muto. Uyu mugore yiga kubyina nyafurika, bimuganisha ku kwishakira ibisubizo. Azenguruka umugabane arangirira i Gor\u00e9e, muri Senegali. Agezeyo, ahura n\u2019umugore ukuze, wakinwe na Sibongile Khumalo, amufasha kumenya umurage we nyafurika. \nMu 1991, Manaka yashinze ikinyamakuru cy'imbyino, \"Umukororombya w'Amizero\", maze akora choreografiya, harimo n'iya opera \"Umukobwa wa Nebo\", mu 1993. Mu bihangano bye bya koreografiya, ahuza imigenzo nyafurika ndetse nuburyo bwo kubyina byubu. Umugabo we, Matsemela Manaka, yapfuye mu 1998 azize impanuka y'imodoka. \nMu mwaka wa 2010, Manaka yagaragaye muri filime ngufi ya Tiisetso Dladla yayobowe na \"Exiled\", ivuga ku mugore wumvikanye mu buhungiro bwe muri politiki muri Amerika mu 1990. Mu myaka ya za 2010, yabanaga n'umucuranzi Hugh Masekela, wari urwaye kanseri ya prostate. We ubwe yari yarasuzumwe kanseri yintanga mu 2016. Yavuze ku kuntu babona iyi ndwara ati: \"Byari ngombwa ko twembi twohereza ubutumwa ko tugomba kwishimira ubuzima bwacu n'abo turi bo. Ntidukwiye kureka kanseri ikatumanura. \" Hugh Masekela yapfuye muri Mutarama 2018. Manaka yakize indwara nyuma y'amezi ya chimiotherapie. Mu gihe cyo gukira kwe, Manaka yazanye igitekerezo cyo kubyina kubyina \"Dance Out of Kanseri\", yaberaga kuri Theatre Joburg yo gukusanya amafaranga ku barwayi ba kanseri. "}
{"id": "9838", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9838", "title": "Cecil Moller", "text": "Cecil Moller (wavutse 1967) ni umuyobozi na producr wa firime muri Namibiya.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nMoller yavukiye muri Namibiya mu 1967 akaza muri Amerika kwiga ubuhanzi. Ashishikajwe no kumenya ibintu bifatika, yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu itumanaho yakuye muri Ramapo College. Moller yakoraga nka injeniyeri yijwi, cinematografi numwanditsi wibikorwa byinshi mbere yo kuyobora firime ye. Yatangiye gukina filime yerekanwe bwa mbere na \"No Plot\" mu 1991. Nibwo bwa mbere muri firime nyinshi zakozwe mu myaka ya za 90. Mu 2000, itegeko rya komisiyo ishinzwe amafilime ya Namibiya ryatowe kugirango rizamure abayobozi ba firime nka Moller. \nMu 2001, Moller yakoze ubushakashatsi ku mibereho yindaya muri Walvis Bay zishingiye ku bikamyo byoherezwa mu bihe byagenwe muri filime ngufi yatsindiye \"Inzu y'urukundo\". Yashakaga kumenya impamvu abo bagore, bamwe muri bo yari azi kuva ku ishuri, babaye abakora imibonano mpuzabitsina. Kuva 2004 kugeza 2007, yabaye umuyobozi wa komisiyo ishinzwe amafilime ya Namibiya. Moller yavuze ko Namibia yabuze 50% by\u2019amafaranga ashobora guturuka ku bicuruzwa mpuzamahanga mpuzamahanga mu gihugu nka \"Generation Kill\" kubera kubura ibikorwa remezo. \nMoller yakuye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye no gutunganya amashusho muri kaminuza ya Chapman mu 2010. Yasohokanye na firime ngufi \"Marvin na Stevie n'Imana\" nyuma gato yo kurangiza amashuri. Mu 2016, Moller bareganwa umusaruro Perivi Katjavivi i 'S Ikiranga mbere film \"bitaboneka,\" gucukumbura nsanganyamatsiko ya post-cy'ubukoloni Namibia ndangamuntu no existentialism. Yabonye igihembo cyiza cya Diregiteri wa Filime muri Namibian Film &amp; Theatre Awards 2017. "}
{"id": "9839", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9839", "title": "Nadine Ibrahim", "text": "Nadine Ibrahim (wavutse 1993/1994) ni umuyobozi wa firime ya Nigeriya.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nIbrahim yavukiye i Kaduna akurira ari Umuyisilamu. Nyina, Amina J. Mohammed yahoze ari minisitiri w\u2019ibidukikije muri Nijeriya akaba n'Umunyamabanga mukuru wungirije w\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye. Igihe yari akiri muto, yashishikajwe no kuvuga inkuru no gukina filime aho kuba amasomo gakondo. Yavuye muri Nijeriya yerekeza mu Bwongereza afite imyaka 14 yiga itangazamakuru no gutunganya amashusho muri kaminuza ya Gloucestershire. Mubindi bintu, yakoraga imishinga yumuryango w\u2019abibumbye na firime za Fictionless. Ibrahim yari producer wungirije wa \"Hakkunde\", hafi ya Nigeriya yepfo uhura numuco wamajyaruguru kunshuro yambere. \nFilime ye ngufi ya documentaire \"Through Her Eyes\" yasohotse muri 2017. Iravuga amateka ya Azeeza, umukobwa wimyaka 12 washimuswe ahinduka umwiyahuzi. Iyi filime yari kimwe cya kabiri kirangiza mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya Los Angeles kandi yatowe mu cyiciro cya filime ngufi mu Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime muri Afrika. Kubitsinda ryitangazamakuru EbonyLife firime na tereviziyo yakoresheje firime avuga inkuru zamoko yo mumajyaruguru ya Nijeriya, nka Hausa, Fulani, Igbira, Igala, Tiv na Gbagyi. Ni umuyobozi mukuru wa sosiyete ikorera mu gihugu cya Nigeriya, Nailamedia, yashinzwe mu 2017. Filime ye ya documentaire ngufi yitwa \"Marked\", yakoranye imyaka ibiri yatewe inkunga no gushyira ikimenyetso cya nyirasenge, yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco rya Ak\u00e9 ryabereye i Lagos muri 2019. Ireba inkovu gakondo, ikwirakwizwa muri Nijeriya ariko nanone ikaba kirazira, ariko, ubwiza bwayo nibyo Ibrahim yashakaga gutsinda. \nIbrahim yanditse Tyler Perry, Alfred Hitchcock, Spike Lee and Ang Leee nk'intangarugero. Iyindi ngaruka ikomeye avuga ni nyina, binyuze mu mirimo ye muri guverinoma yamenye ubukene na ruswa muri Nijeriya. Yagizwe umwe mu basore bakomeye ba firime bo muri Nigeriya bareba. Ibrahim yashakanye na Nasir i Abuja muri 2017. "}
{"id": "9840", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9840", "title": "Ngardy Conteh George", "text": "Ngardy Conteh George niUmuyobozi, umwanditsi, kandi atunganya firime ukomoka muri Siyera Lewone ariko yibera muri Kanada. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nNgardy Conteh George yavukiye iFreetown, Sierra Leone kandi ni umuhererezi mu bana bane. Mu bwana bwe, umuryango we wimukiye i Toronto, muri Kanada mu 1981. Conteh George yagiye mu ishuri rya Leta rya Jesse Ketchum (1981-1992), n'Amashuri yisumbuye y'Amajyaruguru (1992-1995) mbere yo kurangiza mu kigo cya Vaughan Road Collegiate Institute (1995-1997).\nKurikirana n'umurima.\nConteh George yize muri kaminuza ya New Orleans (1997-2001) kuri bourse yo gusiganwa ku maguru aho yitabiriye amarushanwa yo gusimbuka gatatu no gusimbuka hejuru. Conteh George yegukanye umwanya wa 3 mu gusimbuka hejuru muri Shampiyona yo mu nzu ya Sunbelt 1998. Mu 2001, Ihuriro rya Sun Belt ryatangaje ko Ngardy Conteh yari mu rutonde rw\u2019abakomiseri 2000-2001 na Academic Honor Roll. Urutonde rwabakomiseri ni icyegeranyo cyabakinnyi babanyeshuri bakomeje byibuze amanota 3,5 mugihembwe cyambere cyangwa bitatu bya gatatu.\nUmwuga wa film.\nNyuma yo guhabwa impamyabumenyi, Conteh George yibanze ku gutunganya amafilime no kuvuga amateka ya Diaspora nyafurika. Filime ye ya mbere yari \"Abasirikare kumihanda\" (yakozwe muri gahunda ya Momentum hamwe na NFB mu 2004) yasobanuye imbaraga za Ras King zo kwigisha no guha imbaraga urubyiruko.) mu 2005, Conteh George yari umuyobozi ushinzwe gutunganya inyandiko. urukurikirane rw'ibitabo \"bizima\", byakozwe na Frances Ann Solomon. Yayoboye ibice 3 kandi afatanya kuyobora kimwe muri byo. \nHamwe na sosiyete ye Mattru Media, Conteh George yakoze, ayobora kandi ahindura imishinga myinshi yo gutangaza no kugana abakiriya. Mu bicuruzwa harimo \"The Rhyming Chef Barbuda,\" igitaramo cyo guteka gihuza ibiryo hamwe na hip hop yakinnye numugabo we Philman George. Yasohoye ibihe bibiri byikinyamakuru cyimyidagaduro yerekana ikinamico hip-hop yerekana Cypher kuri TV ya AUX, igice cyisaha yisaha ya \"The Circle of Slavery\" yerekanwe bwa mbere mu iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya sinema rya Siyera Lewone, hamwe na documentaire ndende ya The Flying Stars (Yiswe ' Leone Stars ') \nInyenyeri ziguruka.\n\"Flying Stars\" (muburyo bwa \"Leone Stars\") iyobowe kandi ikorwa na Conteh George na Allan Tong hamwe nabandi ba producer ni Katarina Soukup wo muri Catbird Productions. Umushinga wakusanyije amadolari ibihumbi 20 kuri kickstarter kandi niyo documentaire yambere yatsindiye Telefilm Canada TIFF Pitch Iyi! amarushanwa. Nyuma yo gutsinda, film yakiriye inkunga yikigega cya Sundance Institute Documentary Film Fund. Mu mpeshyi ya 2012 film yatoranijwe muri Hoteri ya Hot Docs. Iyi filime yerekanwe bwa mbere ku isi muri RIDM ikomeza gukina mu Iserukiramuco rya Filime zabirabura harimo irya Toronto na Wilson Oakville, ndetse n'Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya firime rya Black Star. Iri serukiramuco ryasojwe nigihembo cyiza cya documentaire mu iserukiramuco rya sinema rya BronzeLens 2015 kandi ryatangajwe ku isi yose harimo Umuyoboro wa Documentaire muri Kanada, NHK mu Buyapani, DR muri Danimarike na Al Jazeera. Ubu iratemba kuri Kweli. TV ku isi hose. \nItsinda ry'itangazamakuru rya OYA.\nMu mwaka wa 2016, Conteh George yayoboye kandi ahindura inyandiko ngufi ya \"Dudley Avuga kuri njye\" mu rwego rwo kuyobora umushinga wa Akua Benjamin Legacy Project yakozwe na Alison Duke. Yakiriye Ikiganiro Cyiza cya Kanada mu Iserukiramuco mpuzamahanga rya Filime ya Karayibe. Abagore bombi barema bashizeho ubufatanye bushingiye ku guhuza indangagaciro maze bashinga uruganda rukora OYA Media Group. Itsinda rya mbere rya OYA Media Group ni \"Mr. Jane and Finch\"bayobowe na Conteh George kandi bafatanije kwandika / bafatanije na Conteh George na Duke. Iyi documentaire yashinzwe na CBC Doc POV ikazenguruka kuri Winston Larose, umukunzi w\u2019umukecuru w\u2019imyaka 80 ukomoka mu gihugu cya Giyane-Kanada ujugunya ingofero muri politiki y\u2019ibanze kandi ahura n\u2019ivanguramoko rishingiye kuri gahunda muri politiki ya Kanada. Iyi filime yatorewe igihembo cya Golden Sheaf kandi yahawe ibihembo bibiri bya Canadian Screen Awards: Igihembo cya Donald Brittain Award Cyiza Cy\u2019Imibereho Myiza ya Politiki no Kwandika neza kuri Documentaire. \nYashinzwe na Duke, abo bagore bombi bayobora kandi gahunda ya OYA Emerging Filmmaker (bisanzwe byitwa Black Youth Pathway to Industry) kubakiri bato barangije porogaramu za firime na tereviziyo. "}
{"id": "9841", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9841", "title": "Blanche Bilongo", "text": "Blanche Bilongo (yavutse ku ya 26 Mutarama 1974) ni umukinnyi wa filime, umwanditsi wa filimi wo muri Kameruni.\nUbuzima bwa Biografiya.\nBilongo akomoka muri Cameroni hagati Yize muri kaminuza ya Johnson muri Yaound\u00e9 akora ballet. Mu 1987, yatangiye kwitabira imyitozo yitsinda ryamakinamico ya Les Pagayeurs ya Andr\u00e9 Bang kandi yafashe mu mutwe imirongo yabigizemo uruhare. Umunsi umwe, ubwo umukinnyi wa mbere utari uhari, Bilongo yamusimbuye kandi imikorere ye yemeje abantu bose. Bilongo yaje kwinjira muri iryo tsinda. \nBilongo yatangiye gukina filime mu 2000, i \"Tiga, L'H\u00e9ritage\". Muri 2005, Bilongo yakinnye nka Sabine kuri opera yisabune \"N'taphil\". Muri 2007, yakinnye Pam muri firime ya \"Les Blessures Ingu\u00e9rissables ya\" H\u00e9l\u00e8ne Patricia Ebah. Imico ye ivuga kubura umugabo we akamenya ko ubuzima bwe bwabaye ibinyoma. Yabaye umwanditsi wa televiziyo CRTV mu 2009. \nMuri Gicurasi 2015, Bilongo yahawe izina rya Knight of the Order of Valor, nyuma y\u2019icyifuzo cya Minisitiri w\u2019ubuhanzi n\u2019umuco Narcisse Mouelle Kombi. Muri 2019, Bilongo yasohoye indirimbo ye ya mbere, \"Le temps de Dieu\". Yaririmbwe mu rurimi rwa Beti kandi yeguriwe nyina wapfuye. Muri 2020, yakinnye nka Marie Young muri comedi y'urukundo \"Coup de Foudre \u00e0 Yaound\u00e9\". "}
{"id": "9843", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9843", "title": "Francine Munyaneza", "text": "Francine Munyaneza ni umucuruzikazi n'umushabitsi w'umunyarwandakazi, washinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa Munyax Eco Ltd, isosiyete ikora ingufu zituruka ku mirasire y'izuba ikora kuva mu 2013 kandi ikorera i Kigali. Niwe washinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa La Maison Verte, umushinga wo kubaka ubusugire bw'ibidukikije. \nUburezi.\nMunyaneza yari yarigishijwe imari n'imicungire y'ubucuruzi mu Bubiligi kaminuza yitwa Universit\u00e9 Catholique de Louvain. \nUmwuga.\nUsibye impamyabumenyi ye, Munyaneza yahisemo gusubira mu rugo (mu Rwanda) kugira ngo atangire ubucuruzi bwe bw\u2019ingufu zishobora kuvugururwa kandi buhendutse kugira ngo akemure ibibazo by\u2019amashanyarazi mu cyaro ndetse n\u2019amazi ashyushye mu mijyi myinshi yo mu Rwanda. Ibyo byabaye nyuma yimyaka 20 yuburambe mu burasirazuba bwo hagati, Uburayi, Afurika, Aziya na Amerika akora ku nzego nkuru z'ubuyobozi hamwe n\u2019amasosiyete akomeye yo muri Amerika yo mu majyaruguru, ndetse n\u2019imiryango iharanira ubutabazi ya Komite mpuzamahanga ya Croix-Rouge (ICRC), M\u00e9decins Sans Fronti\u00e8res or Doctors Without Borders(MSF. Munyaneza yagaragaje ubusobanuro bw'ingufu z'izuba mu Rwanda. Rwanda ni igihugu kiri kuzamuka mubijyanye n'uburinganire, Munyaneza yaharaniye kuzamura ubushobozi bw'igitsinagore, kandi azwiho guha umwanya bagenzibe b'igitsinagore haba mu kazi ko gucuruza ndetse no mukubungabuka ihindagurika ry'ikirere. Kuva mu 2014, isosiyete ye Munyax Eco yatoranijwe na REG (Rwanda Energy Group, isosiyete ikora amashanyarazi mu gihugu) kugira ngo itange ingufu za Solar Water Heaters. Niyo mpamvu isosiyete ye yagiye ikurikirana sisitemu zirenga 800 za Solar Water Heating sisitemu kubakiriya barenga 1200 B2B &amp; B2C itanga ingufu kubantu barenga 10,000, inatanga amashanyarazi yizuba kuri sisitemu ya gride, Solar Street itara nibindi bikoresho byizuba (Solar Home Systems, Solar Cold Chain and other Solar productive use equipment). Nyuma y\u2019imyaka itanu ikora, Munyax Eco yamenyekanye n\u2019itsinda ry\u2019imigabane rya Londres ko iri mu \"ma business yihuta cyane muri Afurika \" muri raporo iheruka gukorwa na \"Companies to Inspire Africa\", yashyizwe ahagaragara muri Mutarama 2019. Munyaneza na ICU basinyanye amasezerano yo gutanga ibikoresho byubwubatsi bwa sisitemu yo gufotora mu Burundi mu rwego rwo kuzamura umusaruro w\u2019amashanyarazi hifashishijwe imirasire ishobora kongera ingufu muri Afurika. Munyaneza yigaragaje cyane akarere k'ibiyaga bigari hamwe n\u2019ubucuruzi bwe bushya bw\u2019ingufu zishobora kubaho binyuze mu ngorane zo kubona inguzanyo. \nIbyagezweho n'ibihembo.\nFrancine Munyaneza yatowe vuba aha muri AFSIA Solar Awards 2021 n\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019imirasire y\u2019izuba muri Afurika kandi yegukana igihembo cyitwa \u201cThe Residential Project of the year\u201d kubera ibikorwa by\u2019ubushyuhe bw\u2019izuba mu gihugu hose. Yatowe nkumukinnyi wumwaka urenga 30, abahatanira Founder of The Year Awards 2020 - muri Afrika yuburasirazuba. Munyaneza yakiriye inkunga muri ARIE 2021 binyuze muri USADF (Fondasiyo ya Amerika ishinzwe iterambere). "}
{"id": "9844", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9844", "title": "Dominique Uwase Alonga", "text": "Dominique Alonga ni umukobwa ukiri muto, rwiyemezamirimo, umwanditsi na blogger. Niwe washinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa Imagine We Rwanda, ububiko bwibitabo, inzu y\u2019ibitabo n\u2019isomero ryashinzwe mu 2014. \nUburezi.\nAlonga yize impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu itangazamakuru kandi azobereye mu mibanire rusange no gucunga ibirori muri Sri Bhagawan Mahaveer Jain College mu Buhinde. \nUmwuga.\nNyuma yo kurangiza amasomo ya Alonga, Dominque yasubiye i Kigali mu Rwanda maze atangira gukora mu ishami ry\u2019itumanaho rya Never Again Rwanda. Muri 2014, yinjiye mu marushanwa ya ba rwiyemezamirimo bashinzwe imibereho myiza bakora mu kuzamura imibereho y\u2019abana icyo gihe muri Kanama 2015, ahabwa igihembo cy\u2019amafaranga n\u2019umushinga udaharanira inyungu Reach for Change cyamuteye kureka akazi yakoraga maze atangira ku mugaragaro kwikorera. umuryango we utegamiye kuri Leta, Imagine We Rwanda. Bitewe no kutagira ibitabo byinjira mu ruhame hanze y\u2019isomero rusange rya Kigali, yatangije umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta agamije kongerera ubushobozi umuco wo gusoma no guhanga mu Rwanda. Alonga yemeza ko kimwe mu bikenewe cyane u Rwanda na Afurika bifite ari ugukunda ubuvanganzo kandi akoresha igihe cye n'umutungo kugira ngo atange umusanzu muto muri ibyo bikenewe. Alonga yatangiriye ku gitabo cy\u2019abana cyitwa \"ABC's\u202fof Rwanda, igitabo\" cyanditseho inkuru ngufi nka \"The Burden of the Saved a\" nd \"The Shape of Hypocrisyand Tracing the Cracks\", kimaze kumenyekana kuko gishingiye ku ihungabana ry\u2019ibisekuruza ndetse na Jenoside yo mu 1994. Yanditse inkuru nyinshi zibabaza kandi zisusurutsa umutima zakoze kubarwanda benshi nyuma ya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda 1994. Alonga ahugura urubyiruko kubijyanye no guteza imbere imishinga no kwitwara neza binyuze mumushinga wamateka, kandi yibanda ku mpano zibitabo, guhugura abashobora kwandika, no gusohora ibitabo. Alonga atezimbere gusoma no umuco wo kwandika mubanyarwanda ndetse no mumashuri ubaha ibikoresho bifatika bashobora guhuza no kwihesha agaciro kubasomyi ba Afrika. \nIbihembo.\nDominique Alonga yahawe ibihembo byinshi nkurubyiruko rwihangira imirimo harimo Tigo na Reach for Change Digital Changemakers Award 2015, One Hundred Most Influential Young Africans, UKAID\u2019s iAccelerator, Celebrating Young Rwandan Achievers(CYRWA) Award and Youth connect champion 2015,World Bank Blog for Development Award 2016, and Mandela washington fellow 2016 in the U.S \nUbuzima.\nDominique Alonga yavutse kuri nyina wo mu Rwanda Antoinette Nyirahuku na Christopher Alonga, se uva muri congo. Alonga yavukiye muri DRC ariko mu 1997 umuryango we wahunze Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DRC) ujya mu Rwanda bashaka umutekano. azwiho gukunda kwandika no gutangaza. Amarana umwanya munini nabana kugirango basome hamwe nibiganiro mbwirwaruhame. "}
{"id": "9845", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9845", "title": "Rosette Chantal Rugamba", "text": "Rosette Chantal Rugamba ni umucuruzikazi washoye mu bukerarugendo, washinze kandi Umuyobozi wa Songa Africa, sosiyete ikora ibijyanye n'ubukerarugendo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba akaba na nyiri Amakoro Songa Kinigi Lodge ikorera mu Rwanda. \nUburezi.\nRosette afite impamyabumenyi ya politiki (siyanse mbonezamubano) ya siyanse na sociologiya yakuye muri kaminuza ya Makerere, yize ibijyanye no kwamamaza mu Bwongereza kandi ni umuyobozi wa Aspen's global leadership -Ali East Africa of 2010. Niwe mwanditsi w\u2019isoko rusange ry\u2019iburasirazuba n\u2019Amajyepfo (COMESA) m'Ubukerarugendo burambye - ishingiro ryo gushyiraho ingamba n\u2019ubukerarugendo mu karere. \nUmwuga.\nRosette Chantal Rugamba ashishikajwe cyane n'ubukerarugendo kandi afite ubutunzi bwinshi bw'ubushishozi n'inzego za leta mu gukangurira ubufatanye bwa Leta n'abikorera guteza imbere ubukerarugendo neza. Rosette yagize uruhare runini mu nganda n\u2019ubukerarugendo mu myaka 24 ishize atangirana na EuroStar mu Bwongereza, hanyuma aba umuyobozi ushinzwe kugurisha no kwamamaza muri British Airways muri Uganda no muri central Afurika., yagiye akora nk'Umuyobozi mu Nama Nyafurika yikorabuhanga- Afurika y'Epfo. Ni perezida w\u2019Urugereko rw\u2019Ubukerarugendo, akaba n'umwe mu bagize inama y\u2019Urugereko rw\u2019Abagore mu Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abikorera. Kuva mu 2003, Rosette yagizwe umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ibiro by\u2019ubukerarugendo na parike y\u2019u Rwanda (ORTPN), aho yateje imbere ububyutse n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ubukerarugendo mu nyuma makimbirane y\u2019u Rwanda no kubungabunga parike eshatu z\u2019igihugu mu Rwanda. Kuva mu 2003 kugeza 2010, ubwo yari umuyobozi ushinzwe ubukerarugendo no kubungabunga ibidukikije mu Rwanda, umubare w\u2019abakerarugendo wiyongereye uva ku 13.000 ugera kuri 790.000 ndetse anaba uwa mbere mu kwinjiza amadovize. U Rwanda rwatoranijwe kuba intangarugero mu gukora ubukerarugendo bwa Afurika kandi rutsindira imurikagurisha ryiza rya Afurika mu imurikagurisha ry\u2019ubucuruzi rya ITB-tourism mu myaka 4 ikurikiranye. Rosette yamenyekanye nk'Ubunyamabanga bw'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba nk'umwe mu bashinzwe ubukerarugendo no kubungabunga ibidukikije mu karere. Yabaye umuyobozi mukuru wungirije ushinzwe ubukerarugendo no kubungabunga Ikigo cy\u2019iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda (RDB). Rosette Rugamba ashyirwa muri komite ishinzwe imyitwarire y\u2019ubukerarugendo bwa UNTWO-Global manda y\u2019imyaka ine yatangiye ku ya 17 Nzeri 2017 kandi akora nk'umujyanama wihariye w\u2019umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ushinzwe ubukerarugendo ku isi (UNWTO). Mu zindi nshingano za Rosette harimo gukorera mu Nama y'Ubucuruzi Mark East Africa (TMEA) na Sonarwa-Insurance Company. "}
{"id": "9846", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9846", "title": "Akaliza Keza Gara", "text": "Akaliza Keza Gara ni umunyarwakazi w'umuhanga mu ikoranabuhanaga n'itumanaho akaba n'umucuruzikazi. Afite uruhare runini mu guteza imbere abakobwa kandi yamenyekanye kubera ibikorwa bye n'ibihembo byatanzwe na guverinoma y'u Rwanda ndetse n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019itumanaho. Gara yashinze ubujyanama bwikoranabuhanga hamwe nisosiyete ikora urubuga hamwe na studio ya animasiyo. Yavuzweho kuba \"umwe mu bagore bake bo mu Rwanda bateye intambwe igaragara mu guhindura isura y\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu gihugu\" kandi akaba umunyamuryango w\u2019umuryango World Economic Forum\u2019s Global Shapers Community.\nUmwuga.\nAkaliza Keza Gara yavukiye muri Uganda kandi yabayeho mu bihe bitandukanye muri Afurika y'Epfo, Kenya, Amerika, Ubufaransa, Ubusuwisi, n'Ubutaliyani. Afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu buhanga bwa multimediya no gushushanya yakuye muri kaminuza ya Kent, Canterbury (UK). Yatuye i Kigali, mu Rwanda nyuma yo kurangiza icyiciro cye maze atsindira akazi ke ka mbere mu 2009 akoresheje isoko ryo guhatanira urubuga rw\u2019ubunyamabanga bwa Leta bwongerera ubushobozi abakozi ba Leta. Yari afite imyaka 23 y'amavuko kandi yagombaga kuguza mudasobwa igendanwa kugirango arangize akazi. Gara yashinze ubucuruzi bwa Multimedia Shaking Sun kugirango amwemere gutsindira imirimo myinshi mubijyanye no gushushanya, gukora imbuga na animasiyo no gutoza abana b'abanyarwanda. Isosiyete yakoze imbuga za Minisiteri y\u2019imari n\u2019igenamigambi mu Rwanda na Minisiteri y\u2019umutungo kamere. \nKuva muri Nzeri 2012, Gara yakoraga nk'umujyanama muri kLab, umuryango utanga ubufasha bw'ikoranabuhanga no gutanga inama ku bantu bo muri Kigali ndetse anakorana n'Abakobwa bo muri ICT Rwanda, umuryango uhuza abagore bakora mu bumenyi bw'ikoranabuhanga mu itumanaho kugira ngo bateze imbere ikoranabuhanaga nk'umwuga kubakobwa. Ni umunyamuryango wa Kigali hub umuryango wa World Economic Forum\u2019s Global Shapers Community. Muri 2012 Gara yahawe igihembo cya Rwiyemezamirimo w\u2019umugore witwaye neza muri ICT na Minisiteri y\u2019Urubyiruko na ICT. Muri uwo mwaka, yari umwe mu bagore bane bo mu Rwanda ba rwiyemezamirimo ba ICT bamenyekanye nk'indashyikirwa mu nzego zabo n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019itumanaho. Yatangiye gukoresha \"Abanyarwanda kuri Twitter\" (#RwOT) hashtag. \nMuri 2013, Microsoft yashyizeho Gara nk'uhagarariye urubyiruko muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, ku nshuro ya mbere Umunyarwanda ashyirwaho kuri uwo mwanya, kandi yari umwe mu bane bagize akanama ngishwanama k'urubyiruko muri gahunda ya 4Afrika. \nGara yashinze kandi Studiyo Yambi Animation. Arimo guteza imbere \"animasiyo ya African Tales\", izaba ikinamico ya mbere ya bana yakorewe mu Rwanda. Gara yakoze umushinga wa mbere wa cartoon mumwaka wa 2014, urukurikirane rwigisha abana, kandi yizera ko azateza imbere uwo mwuga hamwe nabana babanyaRwanda. \nMuri 2018, Gara yashyizweho n\u2019umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye Ant\u00f3nio Guterres kuba mu kanama gashinzwe ubufatanye bwa Digital. Muri ako kanama, Umunyamabanga mukuru yagize ati: \u201cIkoranabuhanga rya Digital rigira uruhare runini mu ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019iterambere rirambye kandi bagabanya umwihariko ku mipaka mpuzamahanga. Ni yo mpamvu, ubufatanye mu bihugu byose ndetse no ku mipaka ari ingenzi kugira ngo hamenyekane ubushobozi bw\u2019imibereho n\u2019ubukungu by\u2019ikoranabuhanga hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga ndetse no kugabanya ingaruka ziterwa no kugabanya ingaruka zose zitateganijwe. \u201d \nGara yasobanuwe nk \"umwe mu bagore bake bo mu Rwanda bateye intambwe igaragara mu guhindura isura y\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu gihugu\". Yitabiriye Amahoro Binyuze mu Bucuruzi ndetse n'Ishuri Rikuru ry'Ubuyobozi mu masomo yo guhangana no gutera imbere ndetse muri 2017 yarangije icyiciro cya kabiri cya siyansi mu bumenyi bw'ikoranabuhanga yakuye muri Kobe Institute of Computing. \nIcyubahiro.\nIcyubahiro cyakiriwe na Akaliza Keza Gara kirimo:"}
{"id": "9847", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9847", "title": "Lina Higiro", "text": "Mukashyaka Lina Higiro ni umucuruzikazi wo mu Rwanda kandi yabaye umuyobozi mukuru wa Banki ya NCBA mu Rwanda kuva muri Nyakanga 2018. mbere yuko ahabwa inshingano, kuva muri Nyakanga 2016, yabaye umuyobozi mukuru wa AB Bank Rwanda. Muri uru ruhare, yagenzuye imikorere ya banki, amabanki y\u2019ubucuruzi, iterambere ry\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019imari ya digitale. Mbere yibyo, Higiro yari umuyobozi w\u2019ingamba, igenamigambi n\u2019ubucuruzi muri I&amp;amp;M Banki, kandi mbere yaho yakoraga muri Guaranty Trust Bank (icyo gihe yari Fina Bank), nk'umuyobozi wa Banki, kuva muri 2007 kugeza 2011. \nAmavu n'amavuko.\nMukashyaka Lina Higiro yize muri kaminuza ya North-West University, muri Afurika yepfo, arangizanya impamyabumenyi y\u2019ubucuruzi. Nyuma, yabonye Master of Business Administration yakuye muri kaminuza ya Liverpool mu Bwongereza. Afite kandi icyemezo mu bucuruzi n\u2019itumanaho ry\u2019amasosiyete, cyatanzwe na kaminuza ya Ryerson, i Toronto, muri Kanada.\nIbihembo.\nLina Higiro yari mu bagore benshi bari kugira uruhare rukomeye mu guteza imbere no kuvugurura imikorere y\u2019Urwego rw\u2019Imari ku mugabane w' Afurika, hari abagore baturutse ku Mugabane wa Afurika mu bihugu nka kote divuwari, Kenya, Ibirwa bya Morise, Nigeriya, u Rwanda, Afurika y\u2019Epfo, Uganda, Zambiya na Zimbabwe aho yaje ku mwanya mwiza ku mwanya wa 3 ku rutonde rugaragaraho abagore bo muri Afurika bakora mu nzego zitandukanye z\u2019imari, zirimo ibigo by\u2019ishoramari, amabanki n\u2019ibigo by\u2019ubwishingizi bizwi nka Angaza Awards."}
{"id": "9848", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9848", "title": "Mireille Karera", "text": "Mireille Karera n'umucuruzi akaba na rwiyemezamirimo, washinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru wa KORA Coaching Group Ltd, isosiyete ikora ibya Coaching &amp; Consulting ikorera mu Rwanda icyo kigo cyatangiye muri 2013 i Dubai muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe z'Abarabu(United Arab Emirate -UAE) hanyuma muri 2015 mu Rwanda. Munyuma gihita kitangira ishuri yigisha abayobozi igatoza n'abandi kuba aba Coach mpuza mahanga nkawe. Icyo kigo cyitwa KORA Coaching &amp; Business Academy(KCA) cyantagiye muri 2018. \nUburezi.\nKarera yakurikiranye impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri Business &amp; Legal Translation kuri kaminuza i Cologne, mu Budage. ndetse no mu bwongereza muri kaminuza zitandukanye. Aba umutoza (Coach) guhera muri 2013.\nUmwuga.\nKarera yagarutse muri Afurika nyuma yo kumara imyaka irenga 20 hanze ya Afurika ari mumahanga atandukanye. Muri iyo myaka harimo imyaka13 akora nk'uwambere mu kugurisha, ingamba zo guteza imbere ubucuruzi ku batanga serivisi z\u2019imari ku isi nka Moody's Investor Services, EBS Dealing Resources (ubu ICAP) na Thomson Reuters i Londres, Dubai, Johannesburg na Nairobi. Yabaye Umuyobozi w\u2019Ihuriro ry\u2019Abagore ku Isi mu Rwanda kandi mbere yari Umuyobozi w\u2019Urugaga rw\u2019Abagore ruherereye i Dubai ruha imbaraga abagore mu nshingano z\u2019Ubuyobozi no kwiteza imbere ku kazi, yagize uruhare mu gushyiraho gahunda z\u2019ubujyanama bw\u2019umwuga ku bagore. Afite inkuru nyinshi zishishikariza abagore kwishora mubucuruzi. Ubufatanye bwe hagati ya KORA Coaching Group na Career Women Network Kigali bukemura ikibazo cyubumenyi hagati yabategarugori kugirango bahabwe amahirwe yo guhatanira akazi. Isosiyete ye KORA Coaching and Business Academy (KCA) yakwirakwije serivisi zayo mu bihugu bitandukanye bya Afurika. Mu by'ukuri, mu academy bituma abagore ba rwiyemezamirimo n'urubyiruko kubona uburenganzira business batoza no mentorship, ndetse ubumenyi gucunga ubucuruzi. \nIbihembo.\nMuri 2017, Karera yahawe igihembo \"Africa\u2019s Top 25 Distinguished Women in Business Excellence\" n'ikinyamakuru Africa Leadership Magazine &amp; Amazons Watch Magazine. \nMuri 2020, Karera yahawe igihembo \"101 Most Fabulous Global Coaching Leaders\" na World HRD i Mumbai mubuhindi.\nMuri 2022, Karera yahawe igihembo \u201c700 African Doers\u201d n'ikinyamakuru Tropics Magazine"}
{"id": "9849", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9849", "title": "Clarisse Iribagiza", "text": "Iribagiza Clarisse (yavutse 28 Mutarama 1988) ni umunyarwanda w'umuhanga mu bya mudasobwa. Ni umuyobozi mukuru akaba ari nawe washinze isosiyete ikora ibijyanye n\u2019ikoranabuhanga rya mobile HeHe Limited kandi ni umwe mubanyamuryango 7 ba UNCTAD \"eTrade y\u2019abagore bunganira abagore baturuka mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere\". Yabanje kwegukana ibihembo bya ba rwiyemezamirimo bo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba kuri televiziyo \"Inspire Africa\" Season 1. \nUbuzima.\nIribagiza yize muri kaminuza y\u2019ubumenyi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga ya kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda kandi yitabira gahunda ya incubation ya Massachusetts Institute of Technology (MIT). \nYashinze isosiyete ye mugihe akiri muto. Isosiyete ye yakuze ifite abakiriya miliyoni ebyiri. Isosiyete ikorana nabatanga isoko kandi babona uburyo bwo kugurisha kuri Internet ibicuruzwa byabo, kubarura no kwakira ubwishyu bwa digitale kubakiriya babo ba nyuma. HeHe Labs yafatanije na GirlHub muri gahunda igamije gushishikarira abakobwa bo mu Rwanda. Ntabwo babigisha ibijyanye na ICT gusa, ahubwo ikoranabuhanga nigishushanyo muri rusange no mubitekerezo binegura. \nIribagiza yari umwe muri \"20 movers and shakers of Africa\" bavuzwe mu nama nkuru hanyuma umwaka ukurikira Jeannette Kagame, Madamu wa perezida w'u Rwanda amuhemba muri gahunda y'imbuto foundation yiswe \"Celebrating Young Rwandan Achievers\".. \nMuri 2017 yatowe nk'umwe mu bagore 100 ba OkayAfrica. Irabagiza yicaye mu itsinda ry\u2019abajyanama ba Perezida wa Banki Nyafurika. \nKu ya 24 Nzeri 2019, Inama y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ishinzwe ubucuruzi n\u2019iterambere yatangaje \"eTrade y\u2019abagore bunganira\" baturutse mu bihugu biri mu nzira y'amajyambere. Irabagiza yarari kumwe nabandi nka Nina Angelovska, Nazanin Daneshvar, Xiaofei Yao, Patricia Zoundi Yao, Claudia de Heredia na Helianti Hilman. Byatangajwe kumusozo w\u2019Inteko rusange y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye i New York ariko Irabagiza yari umwe muri babiri batitabiriye ibirori byo gutanga ibihembo. "}
{"id": "9850", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9850", "title": "Aliane Umutesi", "text": "Umutesi Aliane.\nUmutesi Aliane ni umukobwa w\u2019imyaka 22 akaba ari umunyeshuri muri Kaminuza,akaba ari rwiyemezamirimo ukiri muto kandi w'umunyarwandakazi.\nInzozi za Aliane.\nAliane Umutesi, yari asanzwe afite inzozi zo kuzakora umwuga wo gucuruza,ibihe by'icyorezo cya COVID-19 byatumye mu ngamba zifatwa harimo ni uko abantu basabwaga kuguma mu rugo, nibwo Aliane yatekereje gushinga kampani \"'Lush Green Groceries\" ishinzwe guhahira ndetse no gushyikiriza abantu, ibiribwa byiganjemo imboga, imbuto, ibikoresho by'isuku mu ngo zabo."}
{"id": "9851", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9851", "title": "Joy Murekatete", "text": "Joy Murekatete ni umunyarwandakazi, akaba ari rwiyemezamirimo n'umucuruzi, yashinze isosiyete mu Rwanda yitwa Jotete Investments Ltd. \nUmwuga.\nMurekatete ufite ubucuruzi bwo kwakira abashyitsi, yatangiye isosiyete y' ubucuruzi mumwaka wa 2013, ikaba yaragize uruhare mu gukwirakwiza indabyo kubakiriya bayo batandukanye barimo amahoteri (ikigo cya Radisson blue na Kigali convention centre, Hill View iri i Kigali na Gisenyi, Ubumwe grande, Chocolate), amabanki (Banki nkuru yigihugu y'u Rwanda, Ambasade y'Amerika, DFID, Presidence,Parliament, Insengero(kigali english church, kibagabaga, God is able, Kanombe, Insurance company, saham, Khazan restaurant nahandi henshi. Murekatete avuga ko binyuze mu ihuriro, we nabandi bagore benshi bafite imishinga nkiye bazashobora kugera kuri byinshi bitandukanye harimo kwiga, kubona ubufasha bw'amafaranga bakeneye kandi gushobora kuzamura ubucuruzi bwabo no gukora neza.\nIbihembo.\nBanki ya Kigali ifatanije na Inkomoko Entrepreneur Development yatangaje ko Murekatete ari umwe muri ba rwiyemezamirimo batanu batsindiye kubona Inguzanyo zidafite inyungu biturutse kuri gahunda zabo zo kuzamura no guteza imbere ubucuruzi mu Rwanda binyuze muri 2020 BK Urumuri."}
{"id": "9852", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9852", "title": "Alice Umurerwa", "text": "Alice Umurerwa ni umunyarwandakazi akaba umuyobozi ushinzwe iterambere ry'isoko mu kigo cya ICDL Afrika. iki kigo gitanga amahugurwa ku bumenyi bwa mudasobwa "}
{"id": "9853", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9853", "title": "Jessie Kalisa", "text": "Jessie Kalisa Umutoni (wavutse 1973) ni rwiyemezamirimo w\u2019umugore wo mu Rwanda, umukire akaba n\u2019umuyobozi wa G-Mart Ltd isosiyete ikora kandi igapakira ingwa zikoreshwa cyane cyane mu mashuri yo mu Rwanda. Mbere yo gutangiza isosiyete ye bwite Kalisa yari umuyobozi ushinzwe abakozi n\u2019ubuyobozi muri Inyange iindustries kuva mu 2008 kandi mbere yaho yari umuhuzabikorwa muri MTN-Rwanda. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nKalisa yavutse 1973 nk'imfura mu muryango w'abakobwa barindwi n'abahungu babiri; ababyeyi be ni Andrew Kalisa na Violette Mukansanga wo muri Uganda ; ababyeyi be bari abarimu muri Uganda, aho yize amashuri abanza, ayisumbuye, nyuma yinjira muri Nkumba College (Nkumba University). Nyuma yo kurangiza amashuri yakoze imirimo itandukanye hanyuma nyuma yimyaka cumi n'ibiri asubira mwishuri aho yakuye impamyabumenyi ihanitse muri human resources. "}
{"id": "9854", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9854", "title": "Mushimiyimana Eug\u00e9nie", "text": "Mushimiyimana Eug\u00e9nie ni Umunyarwandakazi w\u2019umucuruzi, rwiyemezamirimo akaba n'umuyobozi wa ba rwiyemezamirimo b'abagore mu Rwanda. Azwi cyane ku nyubako 3 nini z'ubucuruzi afite i Kigali harimo M&amp;M Plaza inyubako y'amagorofa 7 i Gishushu, Remera muri Kigali.\nubuzima bwo hambere.\nEug\u00e9nie wavukiye mu Karere ka Ruhango, Intara y'Amajyepfo yakuriye iruhande rwa nyina byamuteye kuba umucuruzi. Nyuma yo gushyingirwa afite imyaka 27 yabuze umugabo we icyo gihe ubuzima buba bubi noneho ahitamo gukora no gutunga umuryango we. Mu ntangiriro yacuruzaga mu biribwa birimo ibishyimbo, umuceri, amavuta y'imikindo n'ibindi ubucuruzi bwe bwatangiye mu gihugu imbere nyuma bwambuka umupaka abukorera no hanze y'u Rwanda. nyuma yaje gucuruza peteroli na sima nyuma yimyaka 20 atekereza ku kiruhuko cyizabukuru nyuma yinjira mu mutungo utimukanwa kandi Eug\u00e9nie yabaye umuyobozi wungirije wa kabiri w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo mu Rwanda (PSF)."}
{"id": "9855", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9855", "title": "Zulfat Mukarubega", "text": "Zulfat Mukarubega ni rwiyemezamirimo w'umunyarwandakazi. Niwe washinze bwa mbere kaminuza y'ubukerarugendo mu Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2006, akaba anahagarariye mu by'amategeko iryo shuri rikuru ry\u2019ubukerarugendo rya RTUC (Rwanda Tourism University College). yashinze kandi ikigo cya Home Care Training Center(HCTC).\nAmashuri.\nMu myaka ya za 1970, Mukarubega yize ubuforomo imyaka itatu mubitaro bya Butare ari naho yabonye icyangombwa (certificat). Nyuma yaho, yahisemo gushaka akazi kugirango akomeze amashuri ariko ntiyakora umwuga w'ubuvuzi nubwo aribwo yari yarize ahubwo yabonye akazi muri garage y'abazungu i Kigali nk'umunyamabanga. Ubu ni umubyeyi wishimye ufite abana bane, umuhungu nabakobwa batatu.\nUmwuga.\nMukarubega afatwa nk'umwe muri ba rwiyemezamirimo bakomeye mu Rwanda ariko mukuzamuka kwe yaranzwe n'urugendo rwo kwihangana no kudacogora. Mu mwaka wa 1973, yashoye amafaranga 5000 yari yarazigamye ashinga resitora ntoya mu karere ka Kayonza, Intara y'Iburasirazuba. Iyo Resitora niyo yamubereye intangiro y'urugendo rumuganisha kwiterambere nkinzozi ze. Resitora imaze gukomera, yafunguye ubucuruzi muri Kigali akajya agurisha imyenda yabagabo. Muri 1979 nibwo yashyingiwe, afatanyije n\u2019umugabo we batangiza ishuri ryigisha tekiniki i Muhazi, akaba yari yungirije umuyobozi wungirije kuri iryo shuri. Yakomeje guhuza uburezi n'ubucuruzi. Mu 2002, yatangiye gukurikirana inzozi ze zanyuma, ashyiraho ishuri rikuru ry'ubukerarugendo no kwakira abashyitsi, risa n'iryari muri Kenya no muri Afurika y'Epfo. Muri 2006, iryo shuri rikuru nibwo ryakinguye amarembo abanyeshuri. Murwego rwo gukemura ikibazo cy'ubushomeri mu rubyiruko, cyane cyane mu rwego rwo kwakira abashyitsi, yasinyanye amazeserano na Quatar u Rwanda rukaba rugiye kohereza abarenga 600 barangije mu bukerarugendo no kwakira abashyitsi muri Qatar gukora mu gikombe cy'Isi cya FIFA kizabera muri Qatar giteganijwe muri ukuboza 2022. Yabaye umuyobozi wa MTN Foundation. \nIbihembo.\nMukarubega ni umwe muri batatu bahawe ibihembo na Minisiteri y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga ya Leta zunze ubumwe z\u2019Amerika mu Rwanda(U.S. Embassy in Rwanda) akaba ari ibihembo mpuzamahanga by\u2019abagore b\u2019ubutwari bagaragaje ibikorwa bidasanzwe mwiterambere. Muri 2011 yabaye umukozi wumwaka nka rwiyemezamirimo wumugore. "}
{"id": "9856", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9856", "title": "Barbara Umuhoza", "text": "Barbara Umuhoza ni Pasiteri mu Rwanda, umuhuza wa magambo, akora muri domene zitandukanye ari umusemuzi mu ndimi zitandukanye, Umunyamakuru kandi akaba umushyushyarugamba (MC). Ni nyiri \u00c9clat Communications Ltd, isosiyete itanga serivisi mubusemuzi, gutunganya ibintu no gukoresha imbuga nkoranyambaga. \nUmwuga.\nUmuhoza kandi ni umwe mu bashinze umuryango wa Lucia's Scashed Candles, isosiyete IKORA buji ihumura ikorerwa mu Rwanda kandi ikwirakwizwa mu gihugu. Umuhoza ni umunyamuryango wa Rwanda Leaders Fellowship yakira gahunda zo gutanga inama ku rubyiruko mu Rwanda. Yakiriye iserukiramuco rya sinema rya gikirisitu ryo mu Rwanda 2018, maze ayobora ubwo barangizaga icyiciro cya 2019 mu kigo gishinzwe guteza imbere ubukungu bw\u2019umugore (IEEW). Yagizwe moderator muri Alliance for Financial inclusion's 2019 Global Policy Forum. Muri 2020, yitabiriye inama y\u2019amahoro binyuze mu bucuruzi iyobowe n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe guteza imbere ubukungu bw\u2019umugore aho yagejeje ibitekerezo bye ku nshingano z\u2019ubushumba n\u2019uburyo byagize ingaruka ku cyorezo cya COVID-19. Umuhoza asangira ibitekerezo bye abinyujije kuri podcasts yakirwa kuri IHeartRadio. Umuhoza kandi yashinze Barbara Show kuri YouTube hamwe na videwo mu Kinyarwanda hamwe na rimwe na rimwe mu Cyongereza. Yasemuriye uwari igikomangoma cy'Ubwongereza Prince Charles (King Charles) muri Chogm 2022. "}
{"id": "9857", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9857", "title": "Anne Marie Kantengwa", "text": "Anne Marie Kantengwa ni rwiyemezamirimo w'umunyarwanda akaba ari umuyobozi mukuru wa Hotel Chez Lando.\nUbuzima n'Umwuga.\nAmaze kurokoka itsembabwoko ryakorewe abatutsi mu 1994, yacitse intege cyane atakaza icyizere cyo kubaho Nyuma yuko hafi ya bose mu muryango we bishwe harimo abayeyi be,abavandimwe be, umugabo we ndeste nabana be. Mu 1996, Kantengwa ni bwo yafashe umwanzuro wo gutangira kuvugurura Hotel Chez Lando, iyo hoteri ikaba yarashinzwe na musaza we Ndasigwa Lando wishwe muri Jenoside. Louise Mushikiwabo wahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019Ububanyi n\u2019Amahanga w\u2019u Rwanda ubu akaba ayobora Umuryango w\u2019Ibihugu bikoresha Ururimi rw\u2019Igifaransa, La Francophonie akaba murumuna wa Anne-Marie na Lando, yafashije mukuruwe kubyutsa iyo hoteri na resitora. Muri 2001, ubucuruzi bwa Kantengwa bwatangiye gutera imbere arinako yatangie kwegera no gufasha abantu batishoboye barimo imfubyi n'abapfakazi ba Jenoside. Nyuma y\u2019imyaka ibiri kuva mu 2003 kugeza 2008, yatorewe kuyobora Inteko Ishinga Amategeko (Lower Chamber of Parliament) mbere yuko asubira kwibanda ku bucuruzi bw\u2019amahoteri kugeza uyu munsi. Ku butegetsi bwe muri hoteri y\u2019umujyi, Kantengwa yagize uruhare runini mu iterambere ryayo nk'uko byemejwe na Jean Marie Vianney Gatabazi, minisitiri w\u2019ibanze.\nIbihembo.\nBinyuze muri porogaramu ya Peace Through Business, Kantengwa yahawe igihembo cy\u2019umuyobozi mwiza wa 2021 wateje imbere hotel ayoboye.Ni igihembo cyatanzwe n\u2019Umuryango uteza imbere ba rwiyemezamirimo b\u2019abagore \u2018Institute for the Economic Empowerment of Women: IEEW\u2019 "}
{"id": "9859", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9859", "title": "Nathalie Mpaka", "text": "Nathalie Mpaka, ni umucungamari akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru muri BK Group Plc (yahoze ari Banki ya Kigali), banki nini y'ubucuruzi mu Rwanda. Ni umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe imari muri BK Group. \nUburezi.\nMadamu Mpaka afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse y\u2019ubuhanzi mu icungamari yakuye muri kaminuza ya Birmingham City, i Birmingham, mu Bwongereza, mu 2006. Ni n'umucungamari wemewe, wemewe na Association of Chartered Certified Accountants (ACCA), bo mu Bwongereza. Byongeye kandi, ni umunyamuryango w'Ikigo gishinzwe ibaruramari ryemewe mu Rwanda (ICPAR). \nUmwuga.\nMu gihe yari akiri umunyeshuri wa kaminuza hagati ya 2004 na 2006, Nathalie yakoraga nk'umucungamari wungirije muri Parkwood Leisure Limited, isosiyete ikorera i Worcester mu Bwongereza, nko mu 50 kilometres (31\u00a0mi), mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bw'umujyi wa Birmingham. Yaje guhabwa akazi nk'umucungamari wemewe, na White Stuff Clothing, ihuriro ry'amaduka arenga 115 mu Bwongereza, ahakorera imyaka itanu kuva 2007 kugeza 2012. \nMu mwaka wa 2012, yimukiye mu Rwanda maze ahabwa akazi na Banki ya Kigali nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe imari, ahakorera imyaka ibiri. Ukuboza 2014, yazamuwe kuba Umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe imari, uyu mwanya aracyafite guhera muri Werurwe 2019. \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nMadamu Nathalie Mpaka ni umwe mu bagize inama y'ubuyobozi muri Banki ya Kigali ishami ry'Ubwishingizi Rusange, ishami rya BK Group Plc. Akora kandi nk'umunyamuryango w'itsinda rikuru ry'ubuyobozi muri banki. Ni n'umwe mu bagize Inama Nyobozi mu kigo cy\u2019abacungamari ba Leta bemewe mu Rwanda. "}
{"id": "9860", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9860", "title": "Alodie Ugirihirwe", "text": "Alodie Ugirihirwe ni umunyarwandakazi utuye mukarere ka Nyabihu \nAlodie Ugirihirwe akaba ahagarariye ishuri ndincukeke ndetse n' abanza muri ako gace.\nImirimo.\nUgirihirwe Alodie ahagarariye ishuri ryitwa Christ the King Nursery and Primary School, akaba yaragize \nigitekerezo cyo kwegereza abana n' ababyeyi iryo shuri bitewe nuko hari hasanzw hari ikicyibazo cyuko nta \nshuli riri hafi aho muri ako gace nditse bikagora cyane abana b'incuke kujya kwiga kure."}
{"id": "9863", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9863", "title": "Venantie Mukarivuze", "text": "Madam Venantie Mukarivuze ni rwiyemezamirimo w'umunyarwandakazi akaba ari n'umucuruzi, ni umuyobozi mukuru wa Biopharmacia Co Ltd.\nUmwuga.\nMukarivuze ni umuforomo watojwe akaba umubyeyi wabana batatu. Yakoze mu cyumba cy' ibitaro imyaka itanu arinaho yatangiye kwitegereza ibikoresho ibitaro byabaga byakiriye, rimwe na rimwe akababazwa nuko hari ibikoresho babaza bakabona babazaniye ibintu bidakwiriye,nyuma yaje gutekereza ko hari aho bigomba kunozwa kandi ko ari we ushobora kubikora. Urugendo rwe kuva mubuvuzi kugeza kuri rwiyemezamirimo rwavuye mubyifuzo byo gukorera abarwayi be uko ashoboye no gushaka ibicuruzwa byiza mubuvuzi ashinga sosiyete ye nto. Yabaye rwiyemezamirimo wegukanye ibihembo bitumiza mu mahanga no gukwirakwiza imiti binyuze muri sosiyete ye Biopharmacia, ifite icyicaro i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Biopharmacia yatsinze amasezerano akomeye yo gutanga ibikoresho byubuvuzi mugisirikare cy'u Rwanda ariko ntabwo yashoboye kubona inkunga yo guca icyuho kiri hagati yo kugura ibikoresho no kwakira ubwishyu. Mukarivuje yagaragaje ibibazo byubukungu bwubucuruzi bwibigo bito nuburyo sosiyete ya Kountable yabigabanya,agirana amasezerano yubufatanye na sosiyete ya Kountable bamugurira ibicuruzwa kandi bamufasha nomuburyo bwo gutanga amasoko yose."}
{"id": "9864", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9864", "title": "Bernadette Umunyana", "text": "Bernadette Umunyana ni umunyarwandakazi washinze ikigo kizwi kwizina rya\nDokmai Rwanda. Iki kigo kikaba ari ikigo kigenga gikorera mu Rwanda.\ncyashinzw mumwaka wa 2014 afatanyije n'umuryangowe, umugabowe ndetse n'umuhungu we.\nAmateka.\nBernadette Umunyana mbere yuko ashinga iki kigo mu Rwanda, yari atuye muri asia y'amajyefpo (South East Asia)\nafata umwanzuro wo kuva muri ibyo bihugu ngo aze mu Rwanda ahashinge iki kigo gikora ibijyanye n'uruhu rukomeye (leather)\nkandi bikozwe n'intoki ndetse bizwi kwizina rya Made in Rwanda\nImirimo ye.\nUmunyana Bernadette biciye kurubuga rwabo rwa DOKMAI Rwanda batangazako intego \nndetse n'imirimo yabo nyamukuru igameje kugaragaza isura nziza ndetse n'ubushobozi bw'urwanda mukugaragaza \nibyiza inganda z'abanyarwanda zabasha gukora ndetse bigakurura n'abanyamahanga kureba agaciro ka Made in Rwanda cyangwa \nIbikorerwa mu rwanda \nGuhanga ibishya.\nBernadette umunyana afatanyije na babiri bo mumuryangowe, bashinze iki kigo cya DOKMAI Rwanda batewe ishema \nno guteza imbirere ubunzi bw'ibikorwa n'intoki (handicraft activities) Ndetse bifite ubuziranenge bwo kurwego rwo hejuru\n(high quality leather fashion accessories).\nIbi bikaba bigamije guteza imbire ibijyanye n'imideri (Fashion) mu Rwanda.\nUbumenyi n'Ubunyamwuga.\nAba bashoramari bafite ubumenyi muribi bikurikira,Handicraft: design, production, marketing of handicraft imigeri ikozwe muri leather, ndetse na \nmulberry paper. Respecting Fair Trade principles and assuming social responsibility.\nkwita kubidukikije ndetse n'uburinganire (Respectful to the environment and to gender and youth issues in a nondiscriminator)\nmanner\nEducation: Primary school teacher, moderator, Bafite ubunararibonye muri (courses for professional development (see CV)\nComputer skills: MS Word, MS Excel, graphic programs, accounting.\nIndimi.\nKinyarwanda (mother tongue)\nFrench (fluent)\nEnglish (fluent)\nSwahili (speaking)\nLao (basic: speaking)\nArabic (basic: speaking)\nGerman (basic: reading, speaking)\nUmuryango.\nBernadette arubatse afite abana 2,Mukinyamakuru Jolie Tropisme yatangajeko ibiyanye n'ubwarimu yabikoze \nkugeza muwa 2014, ariko akaba yari yaratangiye kwihuza n'ibijyanye n'imideri bitewe n'uko uwo bashakanye yakoraga mubihugu bitandukanye\nbyo muri Afurika na Asia kandi bajyana aho hose, ibyo bigatuma amenya byinshi kubijyanye n'imideri. yatangiye ibikorwa bye bijyanye n'imideri\nmuri Burkina Faso aho avugako yahigiye byinshi ndetse birimo no kudoda(batik techniques) hanyuma abasha guhindura ibyo yakoraga mumideri \nnkamakanzu,amashati n'imipira. Umunyana kandi ygize uruhare muri porogaramu zimideri muri Ouagadougou."}
{"id": "9865", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9865", "title": "Phabiola Mukundente", "text": "Phabiola Mukundente ni rwiyemezamirimo w'umunyarwandakazi akaba ari umuyobozi mukuru wikigo yashinze cyitwa Women TV Studio. \nUmwuga.\nMukundente yakoze igikorwa gishyigikira abakobwa n'abagore bo mu Rwanda kuba baba abafotozi babigize umwuga,abafata amashusho, abashushanya, hamwe nabatunganya amajwi no gukora videwo. Digital Opportunity Trust (DOT) Rwanda yamenyekanishije Mukundente nk'umwe mubanyamuryango cumi na babiri bagize itsinda rya kabiri rya gahunda ya #DOTYouth Street Team. Mukundente yabonye inkunga yatanzwe na #DOTYouth Street Team kugirango abone amashuri yo gukoreramo. Atanga amahugurwa agamije guha imbaraga abagore n'abakobwa bo mu Rwanda n\u2019urubyiruko kuba abavuga inkuru bumwuga"}
{"id": "9866", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9866", "title": "Odette Kantesi", "text": "Odette Kantesi ni rwiyemezamirimo w'umunyarwandakazi, umutubuzi w\u2019imbuto y\u2019ibirayi mu murenge wa Gataraga mu Karere ka Musanze, umuyobozi wa sosiyeti yitwa SE&amp;KA itunganya imbuto zibirayi mu Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nMu nama yateguwe na AGRA ku bufatanye na TASAI tariki ya17 Nyakanga 2019, haganiriwe ku ishusho igaragaza aho ubutubuzi bw\u2019imbuto nziza buhagaze ndetse n\u2019ibikwiye kunozwa ngo zirusheho kugera ku bahinzi bazikeneye bose kandi zihendutse, Kantesi yishimiye ibyavuye mu bushakashatsi ariko avuga ko ibyaba byiza aruko ibipimo byabo byagenda byibanda ku musaruro uva kuri hegitari hatarebwe igihugu muri rusange kuko abona ko hari aho bagiye bagereranya u Rwanda n\u2019ibihugu bifite ubuso bunini cyane. Kantesi yagaragaye mu gikorwa cyo kumurika no kwita amazina imbuto nshya y\u2019ibirayi ku bufatanye n\u2019Ikigo k\u2019Igihugu Gishinzwe Ubuhinzi n\u2019Ubworozi (RAB), Ikigo Mpuzamahanga Gikora Ubushakashatsi ku buhinzi bw\u2019ibirayi (CIP) n\u2019Umushinga Hinga Weze. Avuga ko hari ikibazo cy\u2019imbuto za kera zitari zigitanga umusaruro ukwiye ariko noneho yizeza abantu ko musaruro uziyongera kandi hakaboneka ibirayi biryoshye kubera imbuto nshya."}
{"id": "9867", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9867", "title": "Aurore kayitesire", "text": "Aurore Kayitesire ni rwiyemezamirimo wo mu Rwanda, washinze Weya Creations Ltd, uruganda rukora imyenda."}
{"id": "9868", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9868", "title": "Rugera Jeannette", "text": "Jeannette Rugera ni rwiyemezamirimo w\u2019umugore wo mu Rwanda, Umuyobozi wungirije mu Rwanda rwo mu karere Rotary International 9150 kuva 2018; iri tsinda yizihiza imyaka irenga 50 ibaye mu Rwanda. Ni Umuyobozi wa Greenwich Hotel Ltd mu Rwanda\nUmwuga.\nRugera Jeannette umaze imyaka 3 akorera iyi itsinda\u00a0 rya Rotary Club yari ayoboye Kigali Mont Jali, imwe\u00a0 mwistinda arindwi ya Rotary mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "9869", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9869", "title": "Solange Murekezi Uwingabiye", "text": "Solange Murekezi Uwingabiye ni Rwiyemezamirimo wo mu Rwanda akaba ari nawe washinze AUX Delices Honey Ltd akaba na visi perezida wa gahunda yo kwihangira imirimo muri Afurika mu Rwanda \nMadamu Solange Murekezi yavutse kuya 3 /10/1972 akaba ari Rwiyemeza mirimo w umugore wamenyekanye cyane mu Rwanda kubera ibikorwa bye\nharimo nko kuba yariwe muyobozi wikirenga wa AUX DELICES HONEY LTD kurubu Solange ni umwe mu bagore bagira uruhare runini mubikorwa\nbyo guteza imbere ubucuruzi bw'abagore muri federasion ya PSF Rwanda Solange kandi yibanda cyane mu kubyaza umusaruro ubuki no \ngutunganya ubucuruzi bwe ndetse no kubugeza ku rwego rwo hejuru mu rwanda no mu Karere kibiyaga bigari.\nAmashuri yize n'ubumenyi.\nMadamu Solange yarangije amashuri muri Kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali (ULK) aho yakuye Impamyabumenyi \nmuby'amategeko. akaba kandi umuyobozi w'ubucuruzi wumuhanga w'umugore ufite diplpme nyinshi zo \nmugihugu ndetse no mumahanga akagira na seritifika yo kwihangira imirimo no guteza imbere ubucuruzi\nIFC-Bank yabanyamerika IVLP Alumni nibindi."}
{"id": "9870", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9870", "title": "Janet Nkubana", "text": "Janet Nkubana.\numunyarwandakazi Janet Nkubana akaba numwe mubashinze Gahaya Links afatanyije na mugenziwe Joy Ndungutse\nnyuma ya Genocide yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda nibwo igitekerezo cyo kwiteza imbere nk'umugore cyaje\nafata umwanzuro wo gushinga coperative yiswe Gahaya links akaba ari coperative yaje iboha uduseke\nmuburyo bugezweho ndetse no kudushushanyaho no kudushyira kumasoko mpuza mahanga.\nIterambere (empowement).\nKurubu Gahaya Links ibarirwamo abagore baboha uduseke kandi batunzwe natwo basaga ibihumbi bine 4000\nkuva nyuma ya Genocide abagore bazamuye ubuhanga bwabo mu kuboha uduseke twiza tugezweho babifashijwemo\nna Janet Nkubana umuyobozi wa Gahaya links afatanyije na mugenziwe Joy Ndungutse bateje imbere\nicuruzwa ry'uduseke mu Rwanda ndetse no mu mahanga. bafatanyije nka Macy's Walmat, Oprah Magazine, Anthropologie,\ncrate and Barrel na Kte spade. \nakaba ari igikorwa kindashyikirwa Janet Nkubana yagejeje ku bari nabategarugore bo mu Rwanda kuko byabafashije mu\nkwiteza imbere bibumbiye mu ma koperative mu Rwanda hose\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nJanet Nkubana umuyobozi wa Gahaya Links indetse na mugenziwe Joy ndungutse bavukiye mu \nRwanda bakuria mu inkambi y'igihugu cy'abaturanyi cya Uganda. kubera ibibazo bya Genocde \nyakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda \nUbukungu n'iterambere.\nMadamu janet Nkubana ni umwe mu badamu bafitiye igihugu akamaro mu iterambere ry'abagore muri rusange\nkuko coperative yashinze ariyo Gahaya links yogutunganya uduseke muburyo bugezweho ikoramo abagore\nbasaga 400 mu Rwanda bikaba byarabakuye mubukene no gusabiriza bakabasha kwigurira bimwe mu bikenerwa\nbya burimunsi utu duseke kandi twoherezwa hanze yu Rwanda bikabagirira akamaro"}
{"id": "9871", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9871", "title": "Eugenie Mushimiyimana", "text": "Eugenie Mushimiyimana.\nMadamu Eugenie ni Rwiyemezamirimo w'umugore ufite imiturirwa isaga itatu (3) mu mujyi wa Kigali harimo\nnumwe uzwi cyane nka M&amp;M PLAZA ugizwe namagorofa 7 uherereye ku gishushu.\nEugenie kandi ni Visi perezida wishyirahamwe ury'igenga (PSF) mu Rwanda.\nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nEugenie yavukiye mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo mu Karere ka Ruhango ahitwa i Bweramana akaba ari umu divantisite\nusenga kumunsi wa 7 akaba yari afite se witabye Imana witwaga Ndinkabandi akaba yari umushumba witorero\nry'Abadintantisite na Nyina witwa Mukarusanga Madellene akaba ari nawe asigaranye.\nEugenie kandi uvuga ko ibyo yagezeho abikesha umubyeyiwe mama we kuko nawe yari umukozi wibanda cyane \nkubuhinzi. \nEugenie kandi yatangiye acuruza imyaka yajyaga kurangura ahitwa Ikabuga no Kumayaga.\nAgashya.\nEugenie avugako Nyina umubyara umubyara ariwe wa muteye imbaraga zo gukora cyane kuko yamwigiyeho byinshi\nnko kumutuma,kumufasha ndetse no kumusigariraho mubyo yakoraga bikamutera imbaraga zo gukora\ncyane avugako ari naryo pfundo ry'ubukungu bwe kurubu. mu Rwanda\nEugenie kandi yize ubwarimu mu mashuri yisumbuye nyuma aza kuyahagarika arashyingirwa.\nIbyamugoye.\nMadamu Eugenie avugako byamugoye nyuma yo kubura byose yari yaragezeho mbere ya Genocide\nya korewe abatutsi mu Rwanda ndetse no kubura umugabo bari barashakanye gusa ntago yacitse intege\nyakomeje gukorana na Nyina umubyara kugeza ubwo bicaraga bagahiga ibyo bagomba kugeraho\nburi myaka 2. kuva mu mwaka wi 1998 kugeza muri 2005 bafite ibyo bagiye bageraho mumihigo\nbari bariyemeje yaburi myaka ibiri mu muryango ari naho bahereye bagura ibibanza mumujyi wa Kigali\nInama za Eugenie (empowerment).\nuyu mugore ufite ubutunzi butari bucye mu Rwanda kandi uzwiho kwicisha bugufi kubamugana bose \navuga ko ubutunze afite kugeza ubu atari ibintu byamugwiririye kuko kuva kera yahoraga irhande rwa nyina \numubyara amufasha gucuruza kuko nawe yakoraga ubucuruzi buciriritse ni umwe mu bagore bafite ubutunzi ndetse \nn'inyubako zakataraboneka mu Rwanda arinako agira inama abagore ndetse nabandi muri rusange mwibanga yakoresheje\nkugirango abe ageze aho ageze agira ati nukwigwa gukoresha amafaranga yose ubonye ndetse no kugira gahunda mubyo \nukora byose kuko biri muntwaro avuga ko yakoresheje mwiterambere rye mu Rwanda kugirango agere aho ageze ubu.\nImvune yahuye nazo.\nMadamu Mushimiyimana Eugenie yagize ibyago abura umugabo akiri muto ubwo yari afite imyaka 27 gusa. byaramubabaje\ngusantago byatumye acika intege nubwo yari asigaranye inshingano zikomeye wenyine zo kwita kubana yari amusigiye\nndetse nizindi nshingano.ahubwo byatumye akora cyane kurushaho kugirango abashe kusa ikivicya nyakwigendera\nyarakoze kugeza ubwo ari umwe mubagore bafatwa nk'ikitegererezo mu Rwanda biteje imbere kuko ari umwe mubagore\nbafite imwe mumiturirwa i Kigali"}
{"id": "9872", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9872", "title": "Claudine Kabageni", "text": "Claudine Kabageni ni umunyarwandakazi ufite uruganda akoranamo na bagenzi be bafite umushinga wo gutunganya urusenda rwitwa pilipili Mbuzi (farming project) ruba Musenyi mu Karere ka Bugesera mu Rwanda. Claudine we na bagenzi be bakaba bari gutegura ishami rindi ku Ruyenzi mu Karere ka Kamonyi bakora urusenda rufite ubuziranenge ruri kugiciro kibereye buri wese. "}
{"id": "9873", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9873", "title": "NADEGE BENIMANA", "text": "Nadege Benimana ni umunyarwandakazi, ni umuyobozi mukuru wa Nadole House yatwaye igihembo cyumugore wagize umushinga mwiza mumwaka wa 2020\nUbuzima Bwite.\nNadege yavukiye mu burundi aza mu Rwanda hamwe nu muryango we 1994, ni umwana wa 5 mubana 6. ni umubyeyi wabana babiri babahungu. \nAmashuri yize.\nNadege yarangije amashuri yicyiciro cyakabiri cya kaminuza mubijyanye no guteza imbere ubuzima bwa Rubanda."}
{"id": "9874", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9874", "title": "LILIANE UWUKURI", "text": "Liliane Uwukuri ni umunyarwandakazi, ni umuyobozi washinze Ivuriro Kira mu mwaka wa 2012. ryakuze rikaba ivuririo rinini ryitwa Benefactor David Clinic.\nNi muntu ki?\nLiliane ni umuforomokazi uterwa umuhate nibyo abanyarwanda bakeneye, cyane cyane mu gace kicyaro akita kumibereho yabyo. Liliane akaba kandi ari umwe mubasoje amahugurwa ya peace through business agenda abera ahantu hatandukanye kwisi.\nUmwuga.\nLiliane yatangiye muri 2012 ivuriro rito kira, nyuma yimyaka ine muri 2016, ivuriro kira ryarakuze rivamo ivuriro rinini ryitwa Benefactor David Clinic. Ivuriro Benefactor David Clinic riba Nyamata, Bugesera, Eastern Province, Rwanda. ryita kubuzima bwabantu bari mukiciro cyo hasi no hagati mumibereho mugice cyicaro. sibyo gusa ahubwo Liliane yagiriwe ikizere cyo gutorerwa kuba umujyanama muri njyanama y'akarere ka Bugesera aho yishimira ko agiye gufasha abaturage mu kubavuganira ngo imibereho yabo iterimbere"}
{"id": "9875", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9875", "title": "Joy Ndungutse", "text": "Joy numuyobozi mukuru nuwashinze Gahaya Links. Joy Ndungutse wavukiye mu Ntara y\u2019Uburasirazuba, yamaze ubuzima bwe ndetse n\u2019imyaka akuze akiri mu buhungiro kubera umutekano muke mu gihugu cye. Yakuriye mu nkambi y'impunzi muri Uganda, ahora ahura n'ingorane zikomeye abagore bihanganiye kwihangana no kwishyira mu mwanya wabo.\nUmwuga.\nBitewe no kwifuza, icyifuzo cya Ndungutse cyo guharanira iterambere ry\u2019umugore cyahinduwe muri gahunda yo kuboha ubwo yasubiraga mu Rwanda nyuma ya jenoside. Mugihe yakoraga hoteri nububiko bwa mbere bwibikoresho byo mu gihugu, yahuguye abagore baho mucyaro kandi ategura ibiseke, bigezweho muburyo ndetse no muburyo, abo bagore bashoboraga gukora bakoresheje ubuhanga nubuhanga gakondo. Mbere yuko abimenya, Ndungutse yari atangiye urugendo rurerure ruzabyara Gahaya Links. Uyu munsi, Ndungutse ni umubyeyi urera abana batatu, utuye Kigali. Ni Visi-Perezida / Umuyobozi w\u2019igihugu Isura Nshya Ijwi Rishya Rwanda Umutwe, Umunyamuryango washinze Alliance for Artisan Enterprises akaba Umujyanama wumukobwa Hub Rwanda."}
{"id": "9876", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9876", "title": "Christelle Kwizera", "text": "Christelle Kwizera nurubyiruko afite imyaka 25, ni injeniyeri yubukanishi mu\u00a0 Rwanda na rwiyemezamirimo.\nUmwuga.\nMu mwaka wa 2014, Christelle yashinze Water Access RwandaKwizera ni CFO y'abayobozi bakizamuka hamwe na ba rwiyemezamirimo bo mu Rwanda, urubuga rwo guhanga udushya mu rubyiruko, guhanga no kwihangira imirimo bashaka gushishikariza no gushishikariza urubyiruko, kubishakira ibisubizo bishya, ndetse no gutanga ubuvugizi ku bigo bya leta bireba. Kwizera yabaye umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe ibikorwa bya Isaro Foundation\nIbihembo yatsindiye.\nchristelle yatsindiye ibihembo by\u2019imishinga itanga imibereho itanga ibisubizo byihariye mu bijyanye no gukusanya, gukwirakwiza no kweza amazi. Uruganda rwahaye amazi abanyarwanda barenga 100.000 binyuze mumurongo wa boreho 95 na INUMA \u2122 micro isukuye amazi meza.\nUmwamikazi Elizabeth wa II w\u2019Ubwongereza, ku wa gatanu, tariki ya 30 Nyakanga 2014 yahaye rwiyemezamirimo w\u2019amazi meza yo mu Rwanda Christelle Kwizera na Commonwealth Point of Light, ishimwe ryahawe abakorerabushake b\u2019indashyikirwa, umurimo wabo ugira icyo uhindura mu baturage babo kandi inkuru ikaba ishobora gutera abandi inkunga guhanga udushya twibisubizo kubibazo byimibereho mumiryango yabo ndetse no hanze yacyo."}
{"id": "9877", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9877", "title": "Linda Mukangoga Ndungutse", "text": "Linda Mukangoga ni rwiyemeza mirimo wumunyarwankazi\u00a0 niwe washinze haute | baso mu Rwanda, arimo gukora ibicuruzwa bigezweho bishimira ubukorikori bwabanyabukorikori baho ndetse n\u2019akarere baturutse mu gihugu cye. Ibisubizo ni imbaraga, imbaraga, kandi nziza cyane.\nRwiyemezamirimo.\nLinda ari mubashinze haute | baso yavutse ashingiye ku gitekerezo kivuga ngo \"imitwe ibiri iruta imwe\". Turi abasore babiri b'abakobwa b'Abanyarwanda bashushanya imyizerere imwe ku mbaraga z'abanyabukorikori badasanzwe kandi bafite impano. haute | baso ikura imbaraga zayo mu mateka y\u2019u Rwanda kandi afite umuco, mu gihe wongeyeho gukoraho. Ibishushanyo byacu bihuza ubuhanga butandukanye bwabanyabukorikori, ibikoresho hamwe nuburyo bwo guhanga ibyara ibicuruzwa bidasanzwe bigurishwa.\nIbindi wareba.\nIduka rya Linda "}
{"id": "9878", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9878", "title": "Lydia Hakizimana", "text": "Lydia Hakizimana numunyarwanda kazi akaba rwiyemezamirimo i Kigali, mu Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nLydie ni Umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo nyafurika gishinzwe ubumenyi bw'imibare (AIMS). Niwe kandi washinze Drakkar Ltd, ikigo cy\u2019ibitabo byigisha uburezi mu Rwanda, Lydie afite uburambe bwimyaka 10 mu gukora no gukwirakwiza ibitabo. Binyuze mu mirimo ye i Drakkar, Lydie yahinduye kandi asohora imitwe 16 ya Kinyarwanda kandi atanga ibitabo birenga miliyoni. Ibitabo bya Drakkar byahawe amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye 3.800, agera ku bana miliyoni eshatu mu Rwanda. Yashinze kandi Happy Hearts Preschools muri 2015 kugirango itange uburezi bufite ireme kuri bose. Ubu umuyoboro wihuta cyane wigenga ryibanze ryibanze mu Rwanda,\nRwiyemezamirimo.\nLydie Hakizimana ni umwe mu bashinze kandi akaba n'umuyobozi wa Drakkar Limited, ucuruza kandi akanatanga ibitabo by\u2019uburezi mu Rwanda. Kuri Lydie, byose byatangiye mu 2006 ubwo ishyaka rye ryo gusoma ryatumaga afungura iduka rito ryibitabo. Bidatinze, ibyifuzo bye byo kwihangira imirimo byatumye agirana umubano n\u2019amasosiyete menshi yandika, amaherezo agirana amasezerano n\u2019umubwiriza wo mu Bwongereza, Pearson Education. Drakkar yahise ahinduka umucuruzi ucuruza ibitabo byuburezi mu Rwanda, aba intangarugero mu cyerekezo cy\u2019igihugu cye cyo kubaka ubukungu bushingiye ku bumenyi. Uyu munsi, Lydie ayobora abakozi 45 nabagabuzi b'igihe gito.\nAmateka.\nLydia\u00a0 numugabo we bashakaga ishuri ryumuhungu wabo ntibashobora kubona ishuri bifuzagako umuhungu umuhungu wabo yabo yakwigamo. Bahisemo rero gufungura ishuri ryabo rya Montessori kugirango bigishe umuhungu wabo, nabandi bana kwiga kwikorera ibintu ubwabo.\nIbihembo.\nMadamu Lydie Hakizimana yahawe igihembo na Meya wa Paris, Anne Hidalgo, muri Kongere ya 41 y\u2019abayobozi b\u2019aba Francophone yateguwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe mpuzamahanga ry\u2019abayobozi b\u2019aba Francophone (AIMF) i Kigali, mu Rwanda kuva ku ya 18 kugeza ku ya 21 Nyakanga 2021.\nReba Kandi.\nAIMS Latest News"}
{"id": "9879", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9879", "title": "Beatrice Bamurange", "text": "Beatrice Bamurange numugore w'umunyarwanda washinze akaba n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019ishuri ahitwa Rise to Shine School mu Rwanda. \nUbuzima bwo hambere hamwe nakazi.\nBeatrice yavukiye mu Burundi,nyuma yaje kugaruka mu Rwanda avuye mu Burundi. yifuje gufungura ikigo cy'amashuri maze aza kujya mu mudugudu wa Rusheshe, umurenge wa Masaka mu karere ka Kicukiro, mu mujyi wa Kigali,mu Rwanda, ahasanga abantu bakomeza gukora cyane kugira ngo babone ejo hazaza heza h'abana babo kuko Aba Bana ntibari bafite uburezi bufite ireme. kandi benshi muribo bavaga munzu zasenyutse hamwe nababyeyi batarangije amashuri yabo, kandi ntibasobanukirwe nagaciro k'uburere kumwana wabo. abona imbaraga zo guhagarara kuri abo bana mugihe atazi aho bahera, Beatrice yari azi ko umuhamagaro kumutima we waturutse ku Mana. yasanze hari icyo agomba gukora kugirango atange ibyiringiro kubana bo muri uwo mudugudu, nuko ahatangira ishuri ryitwa Rise to Shine, abanza kujya abigishiriza munsi y'igiti, iki kigo gitanga amasomo kubantu bose bashaka kujyamo, abana benshi batangira kwinjiramo. Muri 2011 bimuye ishuri munzu nto, bizeye ko bazakira abanyeshuri babo bose bashya. ariko icyifuzo cy'ishuri cyarenze inzu nto y'ibyumba bibiri maze abagabanyamo kabiri. aho abana ba Nursery bazaga mugitondo nuko Primaire ikaza nyuma ya saa sita. Muri 2014, binyuze mu gukorana n\u2019abaturage bakusanyije inkunga yo kugura isambu y\u2019ishuri no kubaka ibyumba bishya by\u2019ishuri. Muri 2015,inshuti ye yamuhuje na Wellspring's Abundant Leadership Institute (ALI) maze baramufasha. nuko Beatrice atangira kuyobora ishuri nkumuyobozi. Afite ubuhanga bwo gukorera no kuyobora abandi neza akoresha tekinike yize binyuze muri ALI."}
