{"id": "9882", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9882", "title": "Natacha Nduwimana", "text": "Natacha Nduwimana ni Rwiyemeza mirimo Mu Rwanda umuyobozi akaba Nuwanshinze\u00a0 Burundi Innovation Hub (Bihub) imaze icyumweru mu bikorwa byo kwigisha 'coding' mu bana ku mashuri y'i Bujumbura, Gitega na Ngozi.\nUmwuga.\nUmunyarwandakazi Rwiyemezamirimo\u00a0 Natacha Nduwimana afite ijisho rirambuye ku buryo burambuye no gusobanukirwa byimazeyo imbaraga zo kwerekana ibicuruzwa binyuze mu bikorwa, atanga ubunararibonye kandi bufite ireme mu bihugu akoreramo.\nUbuzima bwo hambere hamwe nakazi.\nRwiyemeza Mirimo Ntacha yakunze guhura nibibazo byubucuruzi kandi buri gihe yagiye agira ba rwiyemezamirimo kuva akiri ingimbi. yakoraga muri societe yinguzanyo muri Canada yagize uruhare mukwandika inguzanyo, gusesengura amakuru no gukusanya inguzanyo kumasosiyete manini atandukanye yo muri Kanada. Igihe rero nagarutse mu Burundi mfite ubwo bunararibonye ngakorera imwe muri banki zikomeye muri Kanada, intego yiwe\u00a0 yari iyo gutangiza umuryango nk'uwo. Ariko, naje kumenya ko ishyaka ryanjye ryashize ahandi kandi muri 2014 Jelim yavutse mbonye icyuho mu micungire ya Marketing na Event mu Burundi maze mfungura ishami mu Rwanda mu 2015. Ryabaye urugendo rutoroshye ariko rushimishije.\nInama agira ba Rwiyemeza Mirimo.\nyizera ko nta gihe cyiza cyigeze kibaho muri rwiyemezamirimo muri Afurika, cyane cyane ku bagore, kuruta ubu. Abantu muri rusange bagwa mumatsinda atatu: bake bakora ibintu, benshi bareba ibintu bibaho, nabenshi mubantu badafite imyumvire yibibaho. Umuntu wese ni umuremyi wukuri cyangwa ikiremwa cyibihe. Bashobora gushyira ibara mubidukikije, cyangwa, nka chameleone, bafata ibara mubidukikije. Igice gikomeye murugendo rwawe rwo kwihangira imirimo nukugira ubutwari bwo gutangira no kuguma murugendo rwawe. Fata ubutwari umenye icyo ushaka, ujye kubishaka. Hindura amabara yawe kandi utekereze kubibazo uhura nabyo muri societe hanyuma uzabishakire ibisubizo, mugihe winjiza. Rwose bizakomera kandi uzageragezwa kureka inshuro nyinshi ariko ntucike intege. Ikibazo kinini ntabwo ari uko watsinzwe, ni ukuguma aho kandi ugahura nurugendo rwawe rugana ku cyerekezo cyawe. Ubwanyuma, shaka umujyanama niba udafite."}
{"id": "9883", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9883", "title": "Honorine Mugorewase", "text": "Honorine Mugorewase ni rwiremezamirimo wumunyarwabda akaba afite sosiyete yigenga mu Rwanda yitwa MNR EAST AFRICA.Iyo sosiyete ayibereye umuyiobozi mukuru, ikaba yarashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2012 hagamijwe gutanga ibikoresho bya Laboratoire, imiti n\u2019ibikoresho byo kwa muganga."}
{"id": "9884", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9884", "title": "Denise Umunyana", "text": "Umunyana Denise nirwiyemeza Mirimo akaba arino mubashinze Right seat. Umunyana Denise akaba ari umugore n'umunyarwandakazi ukora muri airtel, aho ashinzwe itangazamakuru no gutanga amakuru muri icyo cyigo. Umunyana Denise ni umubyeyi ufite abana wize ufite icyiciro cy'akabili cya kaminuza nkuru. Umunyana Denise yagiye agaragara mu bbikorwa byinshi harimo 4G Internet square, Call Rwanda, Airtel Rising stars, Tap and Pay Card ya KOZAHO, MONACO Cosmetics.\nUmwuga.\nDenise Umunyana yabonye amahirwe hanyuma nymayayo ashiramubikorwa ibyoyayakuyemo; afite uburambe nubushake buhagije akaba\u00a0 afie MBA mu micungire y\u2019abakozi, kumyaka ye imyaka 36 y'amavuko yafatanije na Right Seat Ltd, isosiyete icunga imfashanyo ibafasha kongera ibikorwa byabo mu bucuruzi binyuze mu micungire y\u2019abakozi. Umunyana akaba yaganiriye na Women Today's Donah Mbabazi kubyerekeye umurongo w'akazi.\nIbyo akunda.\nDenise yavuzeko mumirimo ye akunda Human resources Magemenrt anavugako Umudendezo afite ubu guhitamo uburyo bwo kuringaniza ubuzima bwe\u00a0 nakazi. Uburyo bwebwo kurema ubu burakangutse, aziko\u00a0 kwa shobora gusama no kugerageza ibitekerezo byiwe, kandi nibyiza niba bidakozwe aba arimo gukora ibyo nkunda."}
{"id": "9885", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9885", "title": "Frida Umurerwa", "text": "Frida Umurerwa ni umunyarwanda akaba rwiyemezamirimo w\u2019umugore wo muri Pan African (Pan Africanist woman entrepreneur) ufite ishyaka ryo kuzamura no kubona isura nshya ya Afrika. Afite ikigo cyitwa Morija Supply Ltd. Yavukiye mu Rwanda ariko akurira i Burayi, yagarutse ku Mugabane mu myaka 15 ishize ashimishijwe no gushyira amaboko ye mu bikorwa by'iterambere, mbere nambere yabanje gukorera muri Afurika y'Epfo, nyuma mu Burundi ari nako akorana na bimwe mu bihugu bya EAC ubu no mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "9886", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9886", "title": "Agnes Mukashyaka", "text": "Agnes Mukashyaka ni Umunyarwandakazi uzwi mu bikorwa byo guteza imbere uburenganzira n'imibereho y'abana bafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe n'imiryango yabo. Ni umwe mu bashinze kandi akaba umuhuzabikorwa wa Izere Mubyeyi Organization, umuryango nyarwanda uharanira uburenganzira bw'abana bafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe, ubukangurambaga bwo kubarengera, no kubafasha kubona serivisi zibafasha kwiteza imbere\u202f.\nUmwuga.\nAgnes Mukashyaka ni umuhuzabikorwa wa Izere Mubyeyi Organization. Uyu muryango ukora ibikorwa birimo:\nMu mwaka wa 2023, Agnes Mukashyaka yatsindiye IVLP Impact Award, igihembo gitangwa ku bitabiriye gahunda ya \"International Visitor Leadership Program (IVLP)\" ya Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika. Yakoresheje inkunga y'icyo gihembo mu mushinga wo kumenya abana bafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe no kubahuza na serivisi zibafasha mu Mujyi wa Kigali.\nIbikorwa.\nAgnes Mukashyaka yagiye agaragara mu bikorwa bitandukanye byo guteza imbere uburenganzira bw'abantu bafite ubumuga, by'umwihariko abana bafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe. Yagize uruhare mu bukangurambaga bwo kongera ubumenyi ku bumuga no guteza imbere ubufatanye hagati y'imiryango, ibigo by'amashuri n'inzego z'ubuzima."}
{"id": "9887", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9887", "title": "Gaudence Mushimiyimana", "text": "Mushimiyimana Gaudence ni umutegarugori wumunyarwandakazi ufite ubumuga akaba ari nawe washinze murwanda Ishyirahamwe ry\u2019Abagore bafite ubumuga ryitwa UNABU(Rwanda Organization of Women with Disabilities) akaba ari n'Umuyobozi Nshingwabikorwa.\nUmwuga.\nAkorera ubuvugizi abari n'abategarugori bafite ubumuga byongeye kandi arabafasha kandi akanabashyigikira. Binyuze muri UNABU, Mushimiyimana agaragaza ko abagore n\u2019abakobwa bafite ubumuga, bahura n\u2019ibibazo bitandukanye kandi bibasirwa nihohoterwa bishingiye ku kuba ari abagore bari hirya no hino mu gihugu noneho hakiyongeraho n\u2019ubumuga. Umuyobozi nshingwabikorwa w\u2019umuryango nyarwanda w\u2019abagore bafite ubumuga (UNAB), Mushimiyimana Gaudence, avuga ko hari icyuho mu mategeko ajyanye n\u2019uburenganzira bw\u2019abafite ubumuga bwo mu mutwe gikwiye kuvaho, kugira ngo ufite ubwo bumuga ahabwe uburenganzira busesuye nk\u2019abandi ndetse n\u2019ihohoterwa ribakorerwa. Ibi nanone yabigarutseho tariki ya 24 Ugushyingo 2021 mu nama yateraniye mu Mujyi wa Kigali ihuza imiryango itandukanye iharanira uburenganzira bwa muntu by\u2019umwihariko abafite ubumuga, abanyamategeko, Minisiteri y\u2019Ubutabera (MINIJUST) ndetse n\u2019Ikigo cy\u2019Igihugu gishinzwe ubuzima (RBC).Ibibazo byagarutsweho muri iyo nama byatumye abagore bafite ubumuga bavugwaho by\u2019umwihariko bishingira ku kuba ari abagore ariko noneho hakiyongeraho kuba bafite ubumuga. Mushimiyimana abona ko igikwiye gukorwa mu gushyigikira abo bagora aruki guverinoma ikwiye gukurikiza amategeko arengera abagore kugirango yereke abakibayeho mubuzima bwu bwoba no nabakiri hasi hasi cyane ko bashyigikwe. Itegeko Nshinga, ingingo ya 21 ivuga ko buri Munyarwanda wese afite uburenganzira ku kugira ubuzima bwiza. Ingingo ya 16 mu Itegeko Nshinga ivuga ku kurinda ivangura iryo ari ryo ryose rigaragaza ko Abanyawanda bose bangana imbere y\u2019amategeko, ukorera ivangura ufite ubumuga abihanirwa n\u2019amategeko.\nInkunga.\nKuva UNABU\u00a0 yashingwa, UNTF EVAW yashyize imbere gushyigikira amashyirahamwe y'abagore. Muri 2014, yatangije icyiciro cyihariye cy\u2019inkunga igenera iyo miryango. Muri 2018, itanga ikindi icyiciro cyihariye cyo guhagarika ihohoterwa rikorerwa abagore n\u2019abakobwa bafite ubumuga UNABU yabonyemo inkunga. Ambasaderi wa Leta Zunze Ubumwe z\u2019Amerika mu Rwanda yahembye inashimira Mushimiyimana\u00a0 nkumwe mubanyarwandakazi bane b\u2019indashyikirwa kandi bagira umurava bagakora itandukaniro muri sosiyete babamo. "}
{"id": "9888", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9888", "title": "Carine-Zoe Umutoni", "text": "Carine Zoe Umutoni Numunyarwandkazi wishimye Kuba mubarwiyemezamirimo Mu Rwanda\nUbuzima bwo hambere hamwe nakazi.\nGutangira umushinga we\u00a0 byahoze ari inzozi ziwe kuva mfite imyaka 12. Ariko kubera ababyeyi biwe bombi bize cyane, nashidikanyaga buri gihe kumenya niba urugendo rwo kwihangira imirimo aricyo kintu cyiza cyo gutangira. Byabaye urugendo rwo kutamenya icyo ugomba gutegereza. Yara\u00a0 nzi ko ingorane zirimo. Kutabona amafaranga byari inzitizi. Ariko akeka ko imyifatire yiwe\u00a0 yamye ari nziza, kugirango menye ko hamwe n'Imana byose bishoboka. Noneho, yahisemo kwizera ibyo akora nkumusanzu wiwe kuriyi si. Gukoresha impano zabo nikintu cyiza umuntu wese ashobora kubona. Mbega urugendo rutangaje rwabaye kugeza ubu, kandi ruracyagaragara kuko araacyafite urugendo rurerure rwo gufata, hamwe ninzozi nini zo gusohora munzira.\nNyuma yo kumara imyaka umunani muri Afrika yepfo, yahisemo gusubira murugo agashinga uruganda rwe bwite akagira uruhare mumuryango we U Rwanda ruteza imbere ba rwiyemezamirimo bakiri bato kwihangira imirimo kandi ndizera ko iki aricyo gihe cyabo nkabanyafrika kwihangira imirimo. Igihe kirageze ngo Afurika!"}
{"id": "9889", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9889", "title": "Nuriat Kaka", "text": "Nuriat Kaka ni rwiyemezamirimo washinze Alumnae Association Peace Through Business Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nKaka ni rwiyemezamirimo windashyikirwa mu Rwanda. yatangije isosiyete yitwa Rwanda Chic - umurima worora inkoko kuva ziva ku isoko. Mu Rwanda umuryango w\u2019ubucuruzi w\u2019abagore benshi, Kaka afatwa nkumujyanama numuyobozi witsinda. Umujyanama ushakishwa, Kaka atoza abandi gutangira no guteza imbere ubucuruzi bwabo. Ishyaka rye risanzwe rimufasha guhuza abantu vuba no kubagira ingaruka mubikorwa. \nIbihembo.\nMukwezi kwa Nyakanga 2021, Nuriat Kaka yahawe igihembo cyiza cya Alumna Rwanda agihererwa mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "9890", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9890", "title": "Teta isibo", "text": "Teta Isibo ni Umunyarwandakazi wiyemeje gukora imirimo y\u2019ubugeni n\u2019ubukorikori. Ni we mbaraga (creative force) ziri inyuma ya Inzuki Designs, kandi nk\u2019umukobwa ukiri muto amaze kwiyubakira izina rikomeye mu Rwanda.\nTeta azwi cyane mu gukora:\nIbikorwa bye bikozwe n\u2019intoki (handmade), akoresha ubuhanga bw\u2019ubukorikori gakondo ahujije n\u2019ibikoresho bitandukanye. Ikindi kimuranga ni uko akorana n\u2019amakoperative menshi y\u2019abategarugori, abafasha gukora ibice byiza kandi bikarushaho guteza imbere ubukungu bwabo.\nMuri make, Teta Isibo ni urugero rw\u2019umukobwa wagaragaje ko impano, umurava, n\u2019ubufatanye n\u2019abandi bishobora kubyara umusaruro ukomeye no kubaka izina ku rwego rw\u2019igihugu no hanze yacyo.\nUbuzima bwo hambere hamwe nakazi.\nTeta Isibo w'imyaka 29 y'amavuko ni wenyine wigishije gushushanya akaba ari nawe washinze Inzuki. Ikirangantego cyu Rwanda kizobereye mu ntoki zikozwe mu ntoki, ibikoresho ndetse n\u2019imbere imbere bikozwe mu bikoresho byaho. Bikorewe i Kigali, Inzuki Igishushanyo gikorana namakoperative atandukanye yabategarugori kugirango bakore ibicuruzwa bihuza ubukorikori nuburyo bugezweho.\nInzuki Igishushanyo ni ikirango, cyihuta cyane cyu Rwanda ruzobereye mumitako ihumeka nyafurika, ibikoresho hamwe na d\u00e9cor y'imbere, byose byakozwe n'intoki.\nIbishushanyo bya Inzuki bizobereye muri Jewellery, Accesories no gutaka imbere. Yakozwe n'intoki igishushanyo cyu Rwanda hamwe nisi yose, ukoresheje ibikoresho kama. Teta ashinzwe igishushanyo mbonera, naho abanyamuryango ba koperative y'abagore hirya no hino bashinzwe gukora ibicuruzwa."}
{"id": "9891", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9891", "title": "Iradukunda Yvonne", "text": "Umunyarwandkazi Iradukunda Yvonne Emmanuella akaba rwiyemezamirimo wimyaka 20 muri Agribusiness, akoresha inyungu zuruganda rwa Hibiscus atanga umutobe, vino, Liquor nicyayi nyuma yubushomeri.\nAmateka.\n\u201dNyuma y\u2019amasomo yisumbuye, yasanze ko bitoroshye kubona akazi usaba imyanya y'akazi. Utanze ibyangombwa byawe byose ukobikenewe ugategeza igihe kirekire ntibagusubize kugezaaubwo utaye icyizere. Iradukunda niko kuzana\u00a0 ikindi cyifuzo cyo gukora hibiscus igikoresho cye cy'ubucuruzi, ari uko yasnze\u00a0 imiti gakondo ku ndwara zidakira za nyina.Ati: \u201cIgihingwa cya Hibiscus cyabaye imiti kuri mama warwaye indwara zidakira arizo: lumbago n'indwara zifata imitsi.\u201d Yongeyeho ati, ufite ibinyobwa bya Rwasagabo, avuga ko yatangiye ubucuruzi bwe hamwe n\u2019amafaranga ibihumbi ijana y\u2019amafaranga y\u2019u Rwanda nk'umurwa mukuru ariko ahura n\u2019ibibazo bimwe na bimwe by\u2019abantu batamenyereye ibicuruzwa bya hibiscus.Ati: \"Byarangoye cyane kubona isoko mu ntangiriro kuko umutobe wa hibiscus wari mushya mumatwi y'abacuruzi. Bamwe muribo basezeranye kwishyura nyuma ntibishyure. Abandi bakoresheje cyangwa banze ibicuruzwa"}
{"id": "9892", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9892", "title": "Michaella Rugwizangoga", "text": "Rugwizangoga Michaella ni umunyarwanda ukiri mutomuto akaba ari umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019uruganda rwa Volkswagen mu Rwanda, Uruganda rwabadage rukora imodoka zo mubwoko bwa VW rukanaziteranyiriza u rwanda. Niwe mudamu wambere wumwirabura yafashe umwanya nkuyu mubudage.Taliki 18/06/2022 Rugwizangoga yagizwe umuyobozi W'ishami ry'ubucyerarugendo mu rwego rw'Igihugu rw'iterambere (RDB). \nAmashuri.\nRugwizangoga yize Bachelor ya Science (Toxicology) mumwaka wa 2007 \u2013 2011 na Master ya Science (Toxicology, Chemistry) \u00a0mumwaka wa 2007 \u2013 2013 yakuye muri\u00a0 University of Kaiserslautern.\nUmwuga.\nMichaella Rugwizangoga numu injeniyeri wumunyarwanda ufite uburambe cyane mu igenamigambi, gucunga imishinga no guteza imbere ibicuruzwa. Arangije icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza, yakoze mu kigo \u00a0gishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda (RDB), VillageGroup, Imbuto Foundation (Fondasiyo ya Madamu Jeannette Kagame), ubu akaba akora nk'umuyobozi mukuru wa Volkswagen Mobility Solutions Rwanda kuva muri Mata 2018. Michaella abarizwa mu Ihuriro ry\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019isi ku isi (World Economic Forum\u2019s Global Shaper) kandi akaba umunyamuryango wa Kigali Hub kuva 2014. Global Shapers Community ni gahunda yaturutse mu Ihuriro ry\u2019Ubukungu ku Isi hamwe n\u2019urusobe rwa Hubs rwatejwe imbere kandi ruyobowe n\u2019urubyiruko rudasanzwe mu bushobozi bwabo, ibyo bagezeho ndetse no guharanira gutanga umusanzu mu baturage babo. Ni umunyamuryango wa \u201cAfrica50\u201d; itsinda rigizwe na 50 Global Shapers batoranijwe mu kwitabira ihuriro ry\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019isi kuri Afurika (World Economic Forum on Africa) AF16 muri 2016. Ni umunyamuryango wa \u201cDavos50\u201d, yavuze ku bibazo bijyanye n\u2019urubyiruko, ubuyobozi n\u2019iterambere mu Ihuriro ry\u2019Ubukungu ku Isi ryabereye i Davos mu Busuwisi. Rugwizangoga yashinze International HOPE WEEK Africa Youth Summit ikaba yarabereye yabereye i Kigali mu Kuboza umwaka 201, \u00a0ihuza abashyitsi barenga 100 baturutse mu bihugu 40 kugira ngo bige ku bikorwa byiza by\u2019u Rwanda kandi baganire ku mbogamizi mu burezi, kwihangira imirimo n'imiyoborere myiza, Yabaye Umunyarwanda wa mbere watorewe kuba uhagarariye urubyiruko mu bufatanye n\u2019u Rwanda-Rhineland-Palatinate (Ubudage), yagaragaye ko yatsindiye mu cyiciro cya 'Future Leader' mu birori byabereye muri Niger, kandi ahabwa icyubahiro na Madamu wa Perezida w\u2019igihugu, Dr. Issoufou Malika.\nIbihembo.\nMu rwego rwo gushimira ibikorwa byinshi yakoze, ubuvugizi ndetse n'ubwitange mu guha imbaraga urubyiruko, Yahawe igihembo mpuzamahanga cyitwa Active Woman Award. Muri Mutarama 2020, Rugwizangoga yahawe igihembo cy\u2019umushoramari w\u2019umwaka nk\u2019umuyobozi mukuru wa Volkswagen Rwanda,\u00a0 yagishyikirijwe na Minisitiri w\u2019Imari n\u2019Igenamigambi Uzziel Ndagijimana. "}
{"id": "9893", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9893", "title": "Akanyana Sharon", "text": "Akanyana Sharon ni umunyarwanakazi, umucuruzi, rwiyemezamirimo ushyira imbere ibikikorwa bya made in rwanda. Niwe washinze akaba n'umuyobozi wa Ishyo Foods Ltd. \nAmashuri n'imibereho.\nAkanyana yabaye miss wa kaminuza nkuru y u Rwanda ari naho yize bachelor mu mwaka wa 2005 (Miss Campus 2005). Akanyana afite impamyabumenyi mu buhinzi yakuye muri Kaminuza nkuru yurwanda na Masters mu nyigisho ziterambere. Nyuma yo kumara kwiga yashakaga akazi ariko ntiyakabona. Ibi ariko byamuhaye umwanya uhagije wo gucukumbura ishyaka rye mubyerekeranye no guteka. Iyo yasangiraga ninshuti ze cyangwa umuryango we, bakundaga ibyo yabaga yakoze nka za yogurt hamwe nimbuto zitandukanye. Ubwo igitekerezo cyo guhindura ishyaka rye ryo guteka aka bihinduramo ubucuruzi gitangira kuvuka.Sharon yatangiye ubucuruzi ahereye ku bwiyoroshye mu gikoni cye.\nUmwuga.\nIshyo Foods ni kampani yatangijwe na Akanyana Sharon warangije muri kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda muri 2018. Ishyo Foods ikora imvange y\u2019umutobe w\u2019imbuto izwi nka komfitire (jam), igakorwa hifashishijwe imbuto zirimo inyanya, vanilla,inkeri n\u2019inanasi. Ibikorwa na Ishyo Foods biboneka mu masoko atandukanye acuruza ibiribwa (supermarkets) muri Kigali nko muri Samba Foods no muri Simba. Akanyana Sharon yatangiriye ibikorwa bye mu gikoni cye, yifashishije ubushobozi buke yari afite, nyuma umushinga we uraguka ugera ku rwego rukomeye kubera umwihariko ufite. Sharon Akanyana, ni umunyamuryango wa SheTrade, akaba na nyir'ubucuruzi w\u2019isosiyete itunganya ibiribwa ikorera mu mujyi wa Kigali yavuze ko binyuze muri hub yashoboye guhabwa amahugurwa ku bucuruzi butandukanye, nko kwamamaza ndetse n\u2019uburyo bwo gukoresha imibare ye kandi akanabona uburyo bworoshye bwo kubona ubufasha bw\u2019amafaranga nandi mahirwe menshi. Ashisikariza abantu iri huriro rizafasha mu gushyigikira no kugeza ku rubyiruko rwaba rwiyemezamirimo b'abagore no kubafasha gutera imbere no kubona amahirwe menshi yo gushora imari.\nIngamba.\nAkanyana yahinduye ingamba zimikorere yubucuruzi mugihe cya COVID-19 kugirango kugirango adakomeza kwishingikiriza ama supermarkets nkabaguzi be nyamukuru. Atangira gukorana naza hoteri na resitora nkabaguzi nyamukuru kuri we, kandi yagura imikorere igera hakurya yu Rwanda no muri Afrika yuburasirazuba. "}
{"id": "9894", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9894", "title": "Habyarimana B\u00e9ata", "text": "Habyarimana B\u00e9ata ni umunyarwandakazi ndetse n\u2019umucuruzi w'umunyamwuga mu bijyanye n\u2019imicungire y\u2019imari akaba n\u2019umunyapolitiki. Ni Minisitiri w\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019inganda(MINICOM) muri guverinoma y\u2019abaminisitiri, kuva ku ya 15 Werurwe 2021. \nUbuzima.\nHabyarimana yavukiye muri Leta Zunze Ubumwe za Amerika ariko impamvu yatumye ariho avukira byatewe n\u2019akazi ababyeyi be bakoraga. Ababyeyi be bakoraga muri Ambasade y\u2019u Rwanda muri icyo gihugu. We n'ababyeyi be bagiye baba mu bihugu bitandukanye birimo Amerika, u Bubiligi n\u2019u Burusiya. Mumibereho ye yakoze mu bijyanye no gufasha abantu batandukanye kugera kuri serivisi z\u2019imari hanyuma akora no mu bijyanye no kubafasha kwiga iyo mishinga yabo ku buryo yavamo ubucuruzi cyangwa ibikorwa bibyara inyungu.\nAmashuri.\nHon. Habyarimana yakurikiranye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye n'imari no kuyicunga.muri kaminuza nkuru y'u Rwanda kuva 1996 kugeza 2000,nanone kandi afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya Masters mu miyoborere mu by\u2019imari yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Maastricht mu Buholandi. Yayibonye hagati y\u2019umwaka wa 2009 na 2011. Bitewe nuko we umuryango bagiye baba mu bihugu bitandukanye, igice kimwe cy\u2019amashuri ye yakize mu Bubiligi, ikindi akigira mu Rwanda aho yizei Kanombe, mu gihe amashuri yisumbuye yayize muri Economic Rwamagana izwi kwizina rya Groupe Scolaire St Aloys Rwamagana.\nUmwuga.\nHon. Habyarimana ni umuhanga mu bukungu ufite uburambe bwimyaka irenga 16 mu bijyanye n\u2019imari kuko mbere yuko ashyirwaho yakoraga nk'umuyobozi wungirije muri Banki ya Afurika. Yakoraga kandi nk'umuyobozi mukuru muri Agaseke Bank, Yakoze muri Banki y'abaturage y'u Rwanda (BPR) mu myanya ikomeye. Yabanje kandi gukorera ikigo cya Bill &amp; Melinda Gates Foundation,mu bijyanye no gufasha abantu kugera kuri serivisi z\u2019imari ariko ku bantu bafite ubukene bwihariye (Access to Finance for Poor). Yakoze no mu kindi kigo cy\u2019Abanyamerika cyari gifitanye imikoranire na Banque Populaire kandi akomeza imikoranire myiza. Ni umwe kandi mu bashinze Umuryango Nyafurika wa New Faces, New voices, uhuza abari n\u2019abategarugori ukanabafasha kugera kuri serivisi z\u2019imari."}
{"id": "9895", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9895", "title": "Christine Ashimwe", "text": "Christine Ashimwe ni umunyarwanda rwiyemezamirimo uharanira kubaho mubuzima buzima ni umujyanama wabana babakobwa akaba numuvugizi. Niwe washinze Rwanda Clot Awareness Network (RCAN).akaba ari n'umuyobozi mukuru wayo.\nAmashuri.\nAshimwe afite impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bumenyi bw'ubuzima yibanda kuri siyanse y'ibidukikije yakuye muri kaminuza ya Cadi Ayyad, Marrakech, muri Maroc.Afite n' impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu buringanire n'iterambere yakuye mu kigo cya kaminuza y'u Rwanda gishinzwe uburinganire. Kuri ubu arimo gukurikirana impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga muri Global Health Delivery muri kaminuza ya Global Health Equity.\nUbuzima.\nAshimwe ni umubyeyi w'abakobwa batatu akaba abana n'umuryango we i Kigali.\nUmwuga.\nMuri Werurwe 2016, Ashimwe yashinze Rwanda Clot Awareness Network nyuma yo kurwara amaraso mu kuguru kwe kw'iburyo no mu bihaha byombi mukwezu kwa ukuboza 2015. Nubwo yarwaye amaraso menshi mu bihaha no mu bwonko, ibi ntibyamubujije kwigisha abandi ibijyanye na trombose (amaraso). Ahora ashishikajwe no gutanga amasomo yigisha abandi indwara trombose, kwigisha kubyerekeye ingaruka, ibimenyetso nimitere iiyo ndwara. Atanga ubuvugizi cyane cyane ku bagore batwite kuko yizera ko nta mugore ugomba gupfa igihe cyo kubyara. Ashimwe yashyizweho nk\u2019uhagarariye abarwayi ku nshuro ya mbere na komite nyobozi y\u2019umunsi mpuzamahanga wa WTD (WTD) na International Society on Thrombose na Haemostasis (ISTH).\nIbihembo.\nAshimwe yahawe igihembo cyo gutangiza umunsi mpuzamahanga wahariwe Thrombose World Thrombosis Day 2018 aba ambasaderi wumwaka."}
{"id": "9896", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9896", "title": "Dative Nakabonye", "text": "Dative Nanyekabo ni umunyarwanda, rwiyemezamirimo, yashinze Family Circle Love Lab Organisation (FCLLO) akaba numuyobozi mukuru wicyo kigo.\nAmashuri.\nNakabonye afite Impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu bijyanye n'ubuzima bwo mu mutwe, impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor mu kubaka amahoro n'amajyambere, n'impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu iterambere ry\u2019ubushakashatsi. \nImibereho.\nNakabonye abayeho ubuzima bwa buri munsi kubwo kwiyemeza no kwizera ko \"Gushyigikira umugore ari ugushyigikira umuryango wose\". \nUmwuga.\nNakabonye yashinze FCLLO ni umuryango ukora bikorwa byo gufasha abantu batishoboye no guhanga udushya mumatsinda yabobantu.atishoboye.Nakabonye hamwe n\u2019umuryango we bashyigikira abagore bo mu cyaro bakorerwa ihohoterwa rikorerwa mu ngo n\u2019ihohoterwa rishingiye ku gitsina kugira ngo batsinde ihahamuka kandi bahabwe imbaraga.Nakabonye arazwi cyane binyuze mumuryango wa FCLLOyashinze. Uyu muryango we wahindutse ahantu heza ho kwiga kubanyeshuri, abimenyereza umwuga, nabashakashatsi baturutse mubihugu bitandukanye. Ni umwe mu bagize ihuriro ry\u2019igihugu rishinzwe kurwanya ihohoterwa rikorerwa mu ngo (NFADV)."}
{"id": "9897", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9897", "title": "Christine Mukeshimana", "text": "Christine Mukeshimana ni umunyarwanda washinze community center itanga ubufasha bwabafite ubumuga nabafite intege nke yitwa HDVC (Help for Disabled and Vulnerable Children).\nAmashuli.\nMukeshimana afite impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor muri Physiotherapy na Social Science.\nUbuzima.\nMukeshimana ni umubyeyi wabana babiri bafite ishyaka ryo gukorana nabagore nabana batishoboye. \nUmwuga.\nMu mwaka wa 2009, Mukeshimana yahangayikishijwe no kubona ubushobozi no kubura ibisubizo by'ibibazo bye, nuko ashinga umuryango wita kubana bafite ubumuga n\u2019abatishoboye witwa Help for Disabled and Vulnerable Children (HDVC). Kuva icyo gihe, imiryango myinshi yungukiwe kumikorere ye nubuyobozi bwikigo cye, Mukeshimana kandi ni umunyamuryango w\u2019ihuriro ry\u2019abategarugori bashinzwe uburezi muri Afurika (FAWE) na Organisation des Medecins du Sport (ORDEMES)."}
{"id": "9898", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9898", "title": "Christine Murebwayire", "text": "Murebwayire Christine (yavutse 10 ukwakira 1967)ni umugore akaba ari umunyarwandakazi, aho yabaye rwiyemezamirimo, akaba yarashinze copetaive ya COPROVIBA(Co-operative de Production du Vin de Banane) mu Rwanda. Murebwayire Christine ni umuyobozi mukuru ari chairperson wa Chamber of Rwanda Farmers ndetse akaba kandi nu muyobozi mukuru w'ungirije w'ishyaka rya PSF mu Rwanda.\nAmashuri yize.\nMurebwayire Christine yize amashuri makuru ya kaminuza, aho yize ibijyanye n'iterambere ryi cyaro (Bachelors' degree in Rural development).\nAkazi.\nMurebwayire Christine ni umuyobozi uzwi wakoze imirimo itandukanye:"}
{"id": "9899", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9899", "title": "Umwali Sylvie", "text": "Me Umwali Sylivie ni rwiyemezamirimo, n'umunyamategeko w'umunyarwandakazi, akaba ari mu bashinze M.ABAYO LAW FIRM LTD urugaga rwabavoka bikorera mu Rwanda bakaba batanga serivise mu gufasha gukemura Imanza cyangawa Ubundi buryo bwo gukemura amakimbirane, ubujyanama mu by'amategeko &amp; Ubujyanama mu by'umutungo w'ikoranabuhanga, Umutungo utimukanwa, Ibikorwa Remezo n'ingufu karemano, amasosiyete,Amabanki n\u2019ubucuruzi, kimwe na serivise za Noteri. Me Sylivie nk'umunyamategeko kugiti cye yagiye agaragara mu manza nyinshi nk'umwunganizi akenshi akora ku manza zijyanye n'ubucuruzi"}
{"id": "9900", "revid": "122317", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9900", "title": "Mukagahima Marie Ange", "text": "Marie Ange is a leading African entrepreneur and wellness advocate, best known as the Managing Director of Zima Healthy Group Ltd, a Premium Food focused brand dedicated to promoting plant-based nutrition and holistic living through locally sourced Rwandan products. With a strong commitment to Made-in-Rwanda innovation, she actively champions the development of African food systems, agro-processing industries, and small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs).\nUnder her leadership, Zima Healthy has become a symbol of modern African wellness, offering natural, nutrient-rich products that reflect the continent\u2019s agricultural potential. Marie Ange\u2019s work not only promotes healthier lifestyles but also supports sustainable economic growth by empowering local producers and food manufacturers.\nShe is a sought-after speaker and thought leader at summits and Continental Events, where she advocates for African self-reliance in food manufacturing, value addition, and entrepreneurship across the agro-wellness value chain."}
{"id": "9901", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9901", "title": "Mariam Muganga", "text": "Mariam Muganga (wavutse 1987) ni rwiyemezamirimo w' umugore mu Rwanda. Niwe washinze Academic Bridge, ikigo gitanga urubuga rukoreshwa mu mashuri amagana yo mu Rwanda ndetse kugeza ubu rukaba rwararenze imbibi rukoreshwa no mu bindi bihugu by' Afurika y' Iburasirazuba harimo Uganda, Burundi, Tanzania, na Kenya. \nMariam Muganga afite impamyabumenyi ya Bachelor of Science (BASc.) muri Computer Science and Information yakuye muri University of Rwanda. Ni rwiyemezamirimo ndetse n' umuyobozi mu ruganda rw' ikoranabuhanga. \nMuri 2016 Academic Bridge yatsindiye igihembo cy\u2019 itumanaho mpuzamahanga muri eEducation kubera uruhare yagize mu kuzamura uburezi binyuze muri ICT. \nMariam Muganga yateguye porogaramu ya Academic Bridge muri 2014, ayisohora muri 2015 igamije gufasha ibigo by' amashuri guhuza amakuru no koroshya itumanaho ku babyeyi binyuze mu mimaro itandukanye irimo: Kwandika abanyeshuri no kubaha kode zibaranga (Enrollment and student registration), gutegura ingenabihe (timetable), gutegura no gukurikirana uko amasomo atangwa (lesson planning), gutanga amakuru k' ubwitabire (attendance), amakuru ku myitwarire (discipline), gutanga impushya no kubimenyesha ababyeyi (permissions management), kwandika amanota (results), gukora birote (report cards and transcripts), ndetse no gushyikira ababyeyi bamenyeshwa amakuru k' umunyeshuri. \nAfatanije na mugenzi we Christian bari bahuje intego, biyemeje kubaka Academic Bridge neza batanga igisubizo gikomeye kandi cyunganira ireme ry' uburezi mu mashuri y' ibyiciro byose. \nMu mwaka wa 2025, Academic Bridge yizihije imyaka icumi (10) imaze ikora, mu kirori cyahawe insanganyamatsiko \"10 Years in the Making: Building, Adapting &amp; Growing\" bitanga ishusho y' urugendo rw' Academic Bridge mu myaka icumi. Yaranzwe no kubaka, kuyinoza, ndetse no kuyagura. Ubu Academic Bridge yabaye ubukombe. Yarasagambye kandi yigaruriye imitima y' abayobozi b' ibigo by' amashuri, abarimo, abanyeshuri, ndetse n' ababyeyi bayikoresha kubera kugirira umumaro ibigo by' amashuri mu guhuza amakuru no kwimakaza uburezi bufite ireme. \nMuri urwo rugendo rwo kubaka no kunoza Academic Bridge, Mariam Muganga yanashinze KudiBooks,urubuga rufasha ibigo by' amashuri n' abacuruzi mu bijyanye n\u2019ibaruramari no kwishyura byoroshye, rugamije gukemura ibyuho biri mu micungire y\u2019imari y\u2019amashuri n\u2019ibigo by\u2019ubucuruzi. \nAfatanije n' ikigo IST Legal, Mariam Muganga ubu arangaje imbere urubuga ruri kwimakaza ubutabera bwihuse binyuze mu guha abavugizi n' abacamanza urubuga bakoresha rwifashisha ubwenge buhangano (AI)."}
{"id": "9902", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9902", "title": "Chantal Umuhorakeye", "text": "Chantal Umuhorakeye ni umucuruzikazi w'umunyarwanda. Ari mu batangije kandi ayobora Urwambariro Shoe Hub Limited. \nUburezi.\nMuri 2013, Umuhorakeye yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko yakuye muri kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali (ULK). Yabonye kandi amahugurwa muri Digital Opportunity Trust (DOT) Rwanda.\nUmwuga w'ubucuruzi.\nChantal Umuhorakeye niwe washinze uruganda rwa Shoe Manufacturing and Shopping Limited, uruganda rukora inkweto ruherereye mu Murenge wa Kimironko, Akarere ka Gasabo, Kigali. Nyuma yo kumara imyaka irenga ibiri ashakisha akazi arakabura nyuma yo kwiga kaminuza, Umuhorakeye yiyandikishije mu micungire y'ubucuruzi no kwihangira imirimo. Muri Werurwe 2016, yifatanije n'abandi bagenzi be barindwi bashinga uruganda rukora inkweto. Uruganda rugira uruhare mu kumurika no gusana inkweto. "}
{"id": "9903", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9903", "title": "Niyibaho Berthilde", "text": "Niyibaho Berthilde (yavutse muri 1960) numudamu wumucuruzi mu Rwanda wamamaye mubucuruzi kubikomoka kubuhinzi. itanga ifu y'ibihumyo na vino y'ibitoki. Niyibaho watangiye uruganda mu mwaka wa 2006, aho ubu rukoresha abakozi bahoraho bagera kuri 30, n\u2019abandi ba nyakabyizi bataha bagera 40, rukaba ruzwi ku izina rya BN Producers. bizwi nka Belthilde Niyibaho Producers. Ikigo cy\u2019igihugu gitsura ubuziranenge cya RBS, aho gifasha Niyibaho kubona ibyangombwa, ndetse ikamugira inama, bigafashako ibihumyo bikajya mu mahanga byanditseho u Rwanda aho kubijyana mu izina rya Uganda. umushinga we washyigikiwe na Banki itsura amajyambere BRD. \nUmwuga w'ubucuruzi.\nNiyibaho yatangiye gake gake akora ibinyobwa byibitoki muri 2005 nyuma yo kurangiza amashuri yisumbuye. Yagiye mu Bushinwa abinyujije mu kigo cy\u2019ubuhinzi cy\u2019u Rwanda (RAB), kimufasha gutozwa ubuhinzi bw\u2019ibihumyo no kubitunganya. Muri 2006 yatangiye ubucuruzi bwe nishoramari rito. Mu mwaka wa 2010, yatoranijwe mu mishinga mito n'iciriritse kugira ngo ahugurwe mu Buholandi ku bijyanye no gukora imbuto y'ibihumyo abifashijwemo n'ikigo gishinzwe iterambere ry'u Rwanda. Agurisha ibicuruzwa bye mu Rwanda, Uganda, Tanzaniya, na Bukavu, mu burasirazuba bwa Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo. BN Producers Limited itanga ibihumyo bishya, byumye, itanga imbuto yibihumyo kandi itanga serivisi zamahugurwa kubaturage gukora ibihumyo nkubucuruzi butanga umusaruro. "}
{"id": "9904", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9904", "title": "Gloria Kamanzi Uwizera", "text": "Gloria Kamanzi Uwizera (Yavutse 1981), ni umunyarwandakazi w\u2019umucuruzi, ni we washinze Glo Creations. \nUbuzima bwo hambere.\nGloria wavutse 1981, ni rwiyemezamirimo mu Rwanda, yakuriye mu muryango aho sekuru na nyina bakora ubucuruzi. yari umucungamutungo muri resitora ya nyina, afite imyaka 11, akurana inzozi zo kuba umucuruzi. Yakundaga gushushanya amabara, yatezaga imbere ubuhanga bwe mumashuri yisumbuye, nyuma yaho yagiye muri Senegal gukomeza amasomo ye Mu 2004 yahuye numuhanzi wa batik aho yize ubuhanga bushya bwo gushushanya, batik atangira gushyira udushushanyo kuri t -shirt akazigurisha ku Itorero ku cyumweru yabikoraga nko kwishimisha ariko nyuma ubucuruzi bwe buto bwariyongereye. Mu 2005, yagarutse mu Rwanda aho yari afite igitekerezo cyo guhanga imirimo, atangira gukorera mu rugo mu gihe kiri hagati y'amezi atatu n'icyenda, Muri 2008, Isosiyete ye yiyandikishije maze itangira urugendo rwo kwihangira imirimo. Glo Creations nisosiyete ikora imyenda, kabuhariwe mugukora imiterere yubuziranenge bwafrica kubwimyenda no gutaka imbere murugo. \nIgihembo n'ibyagezweho.\nMu mwaka wa 2012, mu Rwanda habaye amarushanwa y\u2019igihugu y\u2019ubukorikori yateguwe na Minisiteri y\u2019ubucuruzi mu Rwanda aho Gloria yabaye umwanya wa mbere (cluster yubudozi) muri HEAP (Handicraft Excellence Award Program), Muri uwo mwaka, Minisiteri y\u2019umurimo n\u2019abaturage mu Rwanda yagaragaje Gloria nka Rwiyemezamirimo ukiri muto muri Kigali Gloria ni umwe mu ihuriro ry\u2019abagore ba rwiyemezamirimo hirya no hino ku mugabane wa Afurika uzwi ku izina rya \u201c African Women Entrepreneurship Program\u201d AWEP, ni Umuyobozi wa AWEP mu Rwanda. Ni umwe mu bagize inama y\u2019Urugereko rw\u2019Abagore Ba Rwiyemezamirimo munsi y\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo-PSF. "}
{"id": "9906", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9906", "title": "Willine Ikirezi", "text": "Willine Ikirezi Numunyarwandakazi akaba umwe mubarwiyemezamirimo bashinze Dot pharma Mu Rwanda \nUbuzima Bwohambere.\nWilline Ikirezi yatangiye 'Daily Healing Voice' muri 2020 nyuma yo guhura nibibazo byubuzima bwo mumutwe. Yahisemo gufasha bagenzi be bahuye nabyo, binyuze mumagambo ya buri munsi.\nMu ntangiriro, yandikaga inyandiko kuri terefone akayishyira ku mbuga nkoranyambaga. Icyo gihe, yari ijambo rimwe kumunsi. Amaze kubona ibitekerezo byinshi kubantu batandukanye yatangiye kwandika imirongo itatu kumunsi no gukoresha amabara ye yerekana, umuhondo numweru, kuri cote. Umuhondo ugereranya ibyiza n'ibyishimo, mugihe umweru ugereranya ubunyangamugayo mubuzima bwa buri wese."}
{"id": "9909", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9909", "title": "Amafi", "text": "Amafi ni ubwoko bw'amatungo yororerwa mu mazi, bukaba burimo ubwoko butandukanye, hari ubugira amagaragamba, n'ubundi bugira umubiri unyerera. muri rusange rero amafi akungahaye ku intungamubiri nyinshi. \namafi yororwa abari mu byuzi, naho andi muri rusange aba mu migezi, inzuzi, ibiyaga, ndetse n'ibidendeze. Mu RWANDA, hakunda kuboneka amafi yo mubwoka bwa Tirapiya, aribwo bukunzwe, muyandi atagira amagara gamba harimo ayitwa inkube, imamba ndetse n'ishinzi. Mu kivu hakunda kuboneka mo ayitwa isambaza, hamwe n'indugu.\nAmafi afite byinshi yihariye mu kutugirira akamaro.\nN'ubwo tuyashyira hamwe n'inyama ariko amafi nibyo kurya byihariye dore ko afite byinshi atandukaniyeho n'inyama z'amatungo abagwa, kuko akenshi zo ziribwa nyuma yo kumishwa, ndetse nizitumishijwe mu buryo bwabugenewe abaziteka babanza kuzikaza ku buryo zisa nkizishizemo amazi.\nAmafi ni ibyo kurya usanga henshi dore ko nabatarya inyama kubera ubwivumbure bubatera bashobora kurya amafi nubwo nayo hari abo atera ubwivumbure. kuva ku munopfu wazo, kugera ku mavuta akurwa muri zimwe, yaba izikurwa mu ruzi cyangwa izirobwa mu mazi magari ifi ni ibyo kurya bifitiye akamaro kanini umubiri wacu.\nkugeza ubu habarurwa amoko agera kuri 32000 ku isi yose gusa siko yose aribwa ahubwo haribwamo amoko make, ndetse hari n'aribwa ariko atemerewe bamwe nk'abana n'abagore batwite.\nIntungamubiri.\nMu mafi habonekamo intungamubiri ndetse zimwe muri zo ntiwazibona ahandi. habonekamo Vitamin D ihagije ndetse n'abatabasha kubona akazuba kugirango kabashe kuyibaha kurya amafi ayibaha k'urugero rwiza. harimo kandi poroteyine, vitaminB12, selenium ndetse na vitaminF, ariyo igizwe na omega-3 ivanze na omega-6.\nAkamaro k'ubuzima.\nAkamaro k'amafi k'ubuzima bwacu karihariye nkuko twabivuze haruguru, ndetse aha umubiri w'uwayariye intungamubiri ziwufasha mu mikorere yawo.\nmu byiza amafi aduha twavugamo:"}
{"id": "9914", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9914", "title": "Franz R. Friedl", "text": "\" 'Franz R. Friedl' \", nanone ku izina ry'irihimbano \" Jacques Ren\u00e9e \" (* 30 Gicurasi 1892 muri Oberkappel, Ositiriya; \u2020 5 Ukuboza Essen), yari umunya Otirishiya gucuranga inanga, umuhimbyi na uwahimbye film.\nUbuzima nakazi.\nUmuhungu wa K\u00fcfer yize amashuri yisumbuye hanyuma ahabwa amahugurwa yubuhanzi na Ros\u00e9, Carl Flesch na Hugo Kaun. Friedl yaciye akora akazi ko gutunganya ibitaramo muri Dortmund na Dresden. Kuva mu 1923 kugeza 1926, Franz Friedl yari umucuranzi w'inanga muri Teatro Col\u00f3n i Buenos Aires Arijantine, kuva mu 1927 wo muri Otirishiya yo hejuru, akaba yaranakoresheje izina ry'irihimbano Jacques Ren\u00e9e inshuro nyinshi, akora nk'umuhimbyi wigenga kandi ahimba umuziki wa chambre, kurengana, no kwidagadura kuva 1933 nabyo umuziki wa firime.\nMuri Gatatu ya Reich Friedl yari umwe mu bahimbyi ba sinema bakoreshwa cyane mu Budage kandi yanakoze firime nyinshi zo kwamamaza no anti-Semitike firime zitera nka pseudo-documentaire \" The Umuyahudi w'iteka \" irahari.. Friedl yanditse kandi amanota menshi ya firime yumuco na documentaire. Mu myaka ya mbere ya DEFA Friedl yakoraga kandi muri societe ya gikomunisiti. Mu 1951, uwahimbye ahanini yarangije imirimo ye ya firime. Ubuholandi Bj\u00f6rn Stenvers numwuzukuru wumukobwa we wenyine."}
{"id": "9915", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9915", "title": "Bj\u00f6rn Stenvers", "text": "\"Bj\u00f6rn Stenvers\" (* 25 Gicurasi 1972 muri Arnhem) ni (CEO) umuyobozi mukuru wa Eye Care Foundation akaba yarashinze ishuri ndangamurage.\nubuzima.\nMbere, yari umuyobozi wa Fonds de dotation des International Council of Museums. Kugeza mu 2016 yari umuyobozi wa Fondasiyo y'ingoro z'umurage wa Amsterdam, ari na we yashinze. Bj\u00f6rn ni we wenyine mu bitabiriye gahunda ya perezida y\u2019abaminisitiri ba Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubukungu n\u2019Umurimo wa Leta uyobowe na Perezida w\u2019Uburusiya (RANEPA, Ihuriro rya Gaidar), Uburusiya aho yigisha. Muri 2014 Stenvers yashinze ishuri rya \"Rostov Kremlin Academy\", muri 2015 yashinze \"Ishuri Ndangamurage rya Amsterdam\", 2017 \" [Aruba Inzu Ndangamurage\", \"Altai Inzu Ndangamurage\" na \"Ishuri rya Zoo rya Moscou\" yo guhugura abakozi ba muzehe. Afite imyanya yubuyobozi mpuzamahanga; Umuyobozi wa \" Kaminuza y'Abaturage ya Amsterdam \", umuyobozi wa Inzu Ndangamurage ya Diamond i Amsterdam, Iserukiramuco ry\u2019umucyo wa Amsterdam akaba n'umuyobozi w\u2019umurage ndangamuco w\u2019isi wa Igihome cya Brest, Belarusi. Bj\u00f6rn Stenvers yashakanye numuririmbyi Tamara Hoekwater. Afite impamyabumenyi nyinshi mumateka yubuhanzi, kwamamaza no gutumanaho. Bj\u00f6rn ni umwuzukuru wumukobwa umwe rukumbi wumuhimbyi wa Otirishiya Franz R. Friedl.\nIbihembo n'icyubahiro.\n Knight Grand Cross muburyo bwa cyami bwa Kambodiya\n Kwambuka iminsi ine Werurwe\n Knight Commander muri Royal Order ya Monisaraphon"}
{"id": "9916", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9916", "title": "Tamara Hoekwater", "text": "\" 'Tamara Tessa Eleonora Hoekwater' \" Heerlen, Mayo 1 1972)| Pop umuririmbyi.\nubuzima.\nTamara Hoekwatere yize mu ishuri rya Muzika Maastricht. Kuva mu 1992 kugeza 2002 yari umuririmbyi wa mbere w'itsinda rya pop Volumia!\nNyuma ya Volumia, yaririmbye mu itsinda rinini \" Igishushanyo mbonera \". Kuva mu 2002 yagaragaye muri \"The Jack Million Big-Band,\" ikaba yaravuzweho byinshi mu miyoborere n\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga muri Amerika. Muri rumwe muri izo ngendo bitabiriye Glenn-Miller - Ibirori muri Clarinda, Iowa. Mu Umujyi wa New York yakinnye na Greg Walker ([Santana (itsinda) | Santana]]). Kuri televiziyo L1 yerekana urukundo rwe rwerekana nka \"Agaciro Kumwanya\" na \"Tamara &amp; Birgit\".\nNiba ufite ikibazo kijyanye n'umuntu Bj\u00f6rn Stenvers muri Amsterdam, nyamuneka hamagara Jazzkarriere hamwe na Cees Hamelink na \"Bourgondisch Combo\" (itsinda ry'inzu ya Kaminuza ya Amsterdam)).Imikorere muri - kandi ikorera hanze. Niadtong 3 Oktubre 2014 ilang gipagawas ang ilang CD \" Ik zei ja \" sa Amsterdams Jazz Amsterdamse Academische Club Caf\u00e9. Ku ya 3 Ukwakira 2014, CD ya \"Ik zei ja\" izasohoka muri Amsterdam Jazz Caf\u00e9 ya Amsterdamse Academische Club. Kuva mu 2015 yazengurutse inshuro nyinshi hamwe na 'Quartet ya Maynugin' muri Uburusiya. Akora kandi muri babiri hamwe n'umucuranzi w' inzogera na Frank Steijns ucuranga inanga hamwe na quartet ye. Kanama 2016 ntikiraboneka kuri Museum Het Rembrandthuis i Amsterdam hamwe n\u2019icyayi n\u2019ikawa idasanzwe."}
{"id": "9917", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9917", "title": "Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubukungu n\u2019Umurimo wa Leta uyobowe na Perezida w\u2019Uburusiya", "text": "\" 'RANEPA' \" (Ikirusiya: ni Ishuri rikuru rya Perezida w\u2019Uburusiya ry\u2019Uburusiya n\u2019Ubutegetsi bwa Leta.\nMuri 2010, ANE, RAPA hamwe nandi masomo cumi nabiri yo mukarere ka serivisi zabaturage. Ishuri rikuru rya Perezida w\u2019Uburusiya ryashinzwe bityo riba kaminuza nini mu mibereho n\u2019ubukungu n\u2019ubumuntu mu Burusiya.\nIri shuri rigizwe n'amashami 22, rifite abanyeshuri 207.000 (2016) kandi riyobowe na Recteur Vladimir Mau."}
{"id": "9918", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9918", "title": "Ihuriro rya Gaidar", "text": "\" 'Ihuriro rya Gaidar' \" ni kimwe mu bintu bikomeye byabereye Uburusiya mu bucuruzi. Iki gikorwa cyiswe Yegor Gaidar. Iki gikorwa kiba buri mwaka kuva mu 2010. Aho kizabera ni Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubukungu n\u2019Umurimo wa Leta uyobowe na Perezida w\u2019Uburusiya i Moscou Uburusiya.\nIbirori byari bigizwe ninama rusange, ameza azenguruka hamwe n'ibiganiro. Abayobora ni abahagarariye guverinoma y\u2019Uburusiya, abayobozi b\u2019akarere, abayobozi bashinzwe ubucuruzi bw\u2019imbere mu gihugu ndetse n\u2019amahanga\nUshinzwe gutegura.\nIshuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubukungu n\u2019Umurimo wa Leta uyobowe na Perezida w\u2019Uburusiya (RANEPA)Uburusiya\" 'Ikigo cya Gaidar gishinzwe politiki y\u2019ubukungu' \"\nIkigo cyashinzwe mu 1990 (icyo gihe `` Institute of Economic Policy in the Academy of Economics \", nyuma Institute of Economics). Ikora ubushakashatsi bwibanze kandi bukoreshwa mubice byingenzi bikurikira: ubukungu nubukungu; Iterambere nyaryo ry'ubukungu; Imyuga ya Leta; Ibibazo bijyanye no gucunga umutungo nubucuruzi; ubukungu bwa politiki; Ibibazo by'iterambere ry'akarere; politiki y\u2019ubuhinzi; Kwiga amategeko (harimo kwiga no guteza imbere ibikorwa byemewe n'amategeko).\nIbyabaye.\n2010.\nKu ya 21-23 Mutarama, inama ya mbere kuri \"Uburusiya n'isi: Ibibazo byo mu myaka icumi ishize\". Impuguke zikomeye zaganiriye ku mpinduka z\u2019ingenzi mu bukungu bw\u2019isi mu gihe cy\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019isi kandi zisesengura uburyo bw\u2019ibanze bwo kubaho kwa Leta kandi zitanga inzira yo kuzamura ubukungu. Ibikurikira byitabiriye ibiganiro: Minisitiri w\u2019intebe wa mbere muri guverinoma y\u2019Uburusiya, Igor Shuvalov, Minisitiri w\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu mu Burusiya (mu 2010) Elwira Nabiullina, Perezida akaba n\u2019Umuyobozi mukuru wa Sberbank Herman Gref, wahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019intebe Minisitiri wa Finlande Esko Aho, umuyobozi w\u2019ubutegetsi bwa perezida w\u2019Uburusiya, Serge Naryshkin.\n2011.\nInama ya kabiri iba ku ya 16-19 Werurwe. Ibirori byazamuye insanganyamatsiko \u00abUburusiya n'isi: Gushakisha ingamba zo guhanga udushya\u00bb. Ibice bikurikira byaganiriweho cyane cyane: ibibazo byishingiro byinzego zubukungu bushya, ibisabwa bishya mubigo bya politiki na politiki yimari bijyanye, imbogamizi ziterambere ryiterambere rya kijyambere, iterambere ryiterambere ryakarere no gushakisha iterambere ryibanze. Abitabiriye ibiganiro ni: Minisitiri w\u2019intebe wungirije wa Guverinoma y\u2019Uburusiya, Igor Shuvalov, Minisitiri w\u2019Imari w\u2019Uburusiya (muri 2011) Alexei Kudrin, Umuyobozi wungirije wa Duma, Alexander Zhukov akaba n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019ubutegetsi bwa Perezida w\u2019Uburusiya, Serge Naryshkin.\n2012.\nIbirori bya gatatu byabaye ku ya 18-21 Mutarama bifite insanganyamatsiko igira iti \"Uburusiya n'isi: 2012\u20132020\". Ikiganiro cy\u2019impuguke cyibanze ku kuvugurura \u00abIngamba z\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Uburusiya n\u2019Ubukungu muri 2020\u00bb. Hano hari ibihumbi bibiri by'Abarusiya n'abanyamahanga. Impuguke zirimo Minisitiri w\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu w\u2019Uburusiya (muri 2012) Elwira Nabiullina, Minisitiri w\u2019iterambere ry\u2019akarere (muri 2012) Viktor Bassargin, Perezida akaba n\u2019umuyobozi w\u2019inama y\u2019ubuyobozi ya Sberbank Rossii, Herman Gref, Visi Perezida wa Banki y'Isi ishinzwe Uburayi na Aziya yo hagati Philip Le Wairua.\n2013.\nIbirori bya kane byabaye ku ya 16-19 Mutarama, bifite insanganyamatsiko \u00abUburusiya n'isi: Ibibazo byo Kwishyira hamwe\u00bb, insanganyamatsiko nyamukuru yari ikibazo cy\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019Uburusiya mu kwinjiza gahunda y\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019isi, kuzamura imiterere y\u2019ubucuruzi. mu Burusiya hamwe n\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019isosiyete y\u2019Uburusiya ku masoko y\u2019amahanga. Impuguke zirenga 250 zaturutse mu bihugu 38 zakoze. Umwanya wibirori wasuwe nabantu barenga 3500. Kwitabira ihuriro Robert Mundell, Umuyobozi w\u2019itsinda ry\u2019iterambere rya Banki y'Isi, Hans Timmer, Visi Perezida wa Banki y'Isi Otaviano Canuto, Umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubucuruzi ku isi, Pascal Lamy, Umuyobozi w\u2019itsinda ry\u2019ibipimo ngenderwaho bya Banki y'Isi, Augusto Lopez-Claros, Umunyamabanga mukuru wa OECD Angel Gurria. Ibirori byafunguwe na Minisitiri w\u2019intebe w\u2019Uburusiya Dmitri Anatolyevich Medvedev.\nAfatanije n\u2019abagize guverinoma y\u2019Uburusiya, abayobozi b\u2019ibihugu by\u2019ubutegetsi, bayobora ubukungu bw\u2019Uburusiya n\u2019amahanga, abakozi b\u2019umuco bakurikira bitabiriye iyo nama: Perezida wa Fondasiyo \"Televiziyo y\u2019Uburusiya\", uhagarariye bidasanzwe Perezida wa Federasiyo y\u2019Uburusiya ku bibazo. y'ubufatanye mpuzamahanga mu muco Mikhail Schwydkoi, Umuyobozi ushinzwe ubuhanzi akaba n'umuyobozi w'ikinamico ya Estrade i Moscou n'umuhanzi w'abaturage bo mu Burusiya Gennady Khazanov.\nIgitaramo cyatsindiye \" Ibihembo bya Moscou Times \". Ku ya 10 Ugushyingo 2013, Nyiricyubahiro Vladimir Posner yashyikirije igihembo umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ishuri ry\u2019ubukungu n\u2019imirimo ya Leta y\u2019Uburusiya iyobowe na Perezida w\u2019Uburusiya Vladimir Mau.\n2014.\nIbirori bya gatanu biraba ku ya 15-18 Mutarama. Insanganyamatsiko ni \"Uburusiya n'isi: Iterambere rirambye\". Minisitiri w\u2019intebe w\u2019Uburusiya D.A. Medvedev, minisitiri w\u2019intebe wungirije wa mbere muri guverinoma y\u2019Uburusiya, Igor Shuvalov, Minisitiri w\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ubukungu w\u2019Uburusiya Alexei Ulyukayev, Minisitiri w\u2019imari w\u2019Uburusiya Anton Siluanov bari bahari. Muri iryo huriro, Perezida wa kaminuza y\u2019ubukungu, Luigi Bocconi, Senateri w\u2019ubuzima, Minisitiri w\u2019intebe w\u2019Ubutaliyani muri 2011\u20132013, Mario Monti; Umunyamabanga mukuru w\u2019umuryango w\u2019ubufatanye n\u2019ubukungu n\u2019iterambere (OECD) Angel Gurria; Perezida wa Repubulika ya Ceki kuva 2003\u20132013, V\u00e1clav Klaus; Visi Perezida wa Banki y'Isi ishinzwe Kuramba Rachel Kyte; Umuyobozi J.P. Morgan Kwirukana Mpuzamahanga Jacob Frenkel; Jeffrey Sachs, umuyobozi w'ikigo cy'isi muri kaminuza ya Columbia.\n2015.\nKuva ku ya 14 kugeza ku ya 16 Mutarama, ibirori byiswe \"Uburusiya n'isi: Vector nshya.\" Ingingo nyamukuru ni ibibazo byubukungu ninzira nyamukuru yiterambere ryubukungu bwisi. Ibibazo byingenzi nibibazo byumwihariko kubijyanye n\u2019imibare n\u2019abimukira muri iki gihe, politiki y\u2019imari n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019Ubushinwa nkumukinnyi ukomeye ku rwego rwisi. Urwego nyarwo rw'ubukungu bw'Uburusiya n'ibibazo by'iterambere ryarwo biraganirwaho. Kimwe mu biganiro biheruka kuganirwaho ni ikiganiro kijyanye n\u2019ubukungu bw\u2019Uburusiya mu gihe cyo gufatirwa ibihano no kugabanuka kw\u2019ibiciro bya peteroli, cyane cyane, kuganira ku bibazo biri mu rwego rwa peteroli na gaze, kwinjiza ubuhinzi mu biribwa, the Ubufatanye mu bukungu bwa Aziya no gushakisha ibitekerezo bishya mu gushaka abakozi no gucunga politiki y\u2019ifaranga.\nMuri 2015, abantu 5.703 bitabiriye ibirori. Umubare w'abitabiriye wiyongereyeho 20% muri 2015 ugereranije na 2014, naho muri 2014 hari abashyitsi 4.765.\n2016.\nInsanganyamatsiko ya 2016 ni \"Uburusiya n'isi: Reba ahazaza\". Ibirori bizatangira ku ya 13 kugeza 15 Mutarama. Abashyitsi barenga 13.700, 817 muri bo bakaba bari abanyamahanga, bitabiriye ibirori (19% kurusha umwaka ushize).\nKu ya 18 Mutarama, ibinyamakuru bisaga 10,000 byasohotse mu bitangazamakuru. Mu bitabiriye iryo huriro harimo abahagarariye Guverinoma y\u2019Uburusiya na Duma bakurikira:\nByongeye kandi, abayobozi 18 bo mu Burusiya bitabiriye ibirori. Abayobozi bakuru 37 bo mu masosiyete y\u2019amahanga n\u2019Uburusiya bitabiriye. Impaka n\u2019ibiganiro 79, ibiganiro bya tekiniki 622 byabereye mu ihuriro, bikubiyemo ibitekerezo byose ku iterambere ry\u2019imibereho n\u2019ubukungu by\u2019igihugu. Ubusanzwe, abahanga benshi b'abanyamahanga bitabiriye: abarimu 69 b'abanyamahanga na abadipolomate 174. Mu bashyitsi b'icyubahiro muri iryo huriro harimo Perezida w'Ubugereki Prokopis Pavlopoulos. Umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019ishuri ry\u2019ubukungu n\u2019Uburusiya kuri Perezida w\u2019Uburusiya, Vladimir Mau, yatanze impamyabumenyi nka mwarimu wicyubahiro wa Academy ya Leta namategeko. Iyi mpamyabumenyi yatanzwe mu kiganiro nyunguranabitekerezo \"Uruhare rw'Inteko Ishinga Amategeko mu bukungu\", iyobowe n'Umuyobozi w'Ubuyobozi bw'Uburusiya, Serge Naryshkin."}
{"id": "9919", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9919", "title": "Eye Care Foundation", "text": "\" Fondation Eye Care Foundation' \" (\" ECF \") ni umuryango mpuzamahanga utabara imbabare ukorera mu bihugu birenga 20 byo muri Aziya\nECF yashinzwe igihe \" Eyecare Worldwide \" na \" Abaganga b'amaso ya Mekong \" yahujwe 2008. Amashyirahamwe yombi yasangiye intego kandi akorana nkuko umusingi uriho wagaragaye ko ari mwiza. CEO wa ECF ni Bj\u00f6rn Stenvers.\nAmateka.\nEyecare Worldwide (1984) yashinzwe na Tayilande] akora ubushakashatsi [[]].\n[[Dosiye:G-CECF (37190821065).jpg|thumb|406x406px|EFC plane]]\nEye Foundation ishyigikira imishinga yo muri [[Kambodiya]], [[Lawosi\u200e]], [[Nepali\u200e]], [[Tanzaniya]][na] [[Viyetinamu\u200e]] mu rwego rwo gukumira no gukiza ubumuga bwo kutabona no kutabona. Kwiyegurira Imana bifasha kandi abantu badashoboye kwitabwaho neza kandi badashobora kwivuza amaso nkamaso cyangwa kubaga amaso.\nFondation Eye Care ifite ibiro n'ibitaro muri Himalaya, [[Nepali\u200e]], Amajyepfo yAmajyepfo ya Aziya ([[Viyetinamu\u200e]]), [[Kambodiya]], [[Lawosi\u200e]]) na [[Afurika]] ([[Tanzaniya]], [[Rwanda]]). [[Toine van Peperstraten]] adalah Ambassador untuk Eye Care Foundation.\nIgihugu gikora.\n[[Tanzaniya]].\nECF ishyigikira [[ikigo nderabuzima]] cya gikirisitu cya [[Umusozi wa Kilimanjaro|Kilimanjaro]] (KCMC) ishami ryubuzima bwamaso kuva [2009 kandi ifite ibiro muri Tanzaniya kuva 2018. \nKambodiya.\nFondasiyo yatanze inkunga yo kwita kumaso muri Kambodiyakuva 1997, kugirango ifashe abatishoboye mubukungu n'imibereho myiza. ECF igamije kubaka umuyoboro uhamye wo kwita kumaso no gutanga ubuvuzi buhendutse bushyira amashami meza yo kwita kumaso mubitaro byaho. ubufatanye na serivisi z'ubuzima zo mu karere muri leta za Ratanakiri, Mondulkiri, Kratie, Svay Rieng, Tbong Khmum, Preah Vihear, Oddar Meanchey na Pailin. ECF yatangije serivisi zita kumaso kumatsinda nkabantu bake, ababana nubumuga, nabagore nabana.\nLawosi\u200e.\nECF yasuye Lawosi\u200e ku nshuro ya mbere mu 2007, itangiza imishinga muri leta ya Xieng Khouang na Houa Phanh mu mwaka wa 2011. Hatanzwe ubufasha muri utwo turere kugira ngo hongerwe ireme no kuvura amaso. Muri 2018, hafunguwe ibiro by\u2019ubuhinzi muri Lawosi\u200e. Inzobere ebyiri z\u2019amaso zarangije gutura kwa Othalmology maze batangira imirimo yabo ku mishinga yo muri leta za Houaphan na Saysomboun. Kuri Sayomboun, hashyizweho ishami rishya ryita kumaso kandi ritegurwa. Umwaka- raporo-2016. \nNepali\u200e.\nECF ishyigikira ibitaro bibiri bikomeye muri Nepali\u200e; kuri Match na Pokhara. ECF ishyigikira gahunda zubuzima bwamaso muri Gandaki, Dhaulagiri, Imikino, Gorkha na Karnali. Ibiro bya Nepali\u200ebyafunguwe mu 1988. \nViyetinamu\u200e.\nECF yagiye itera inkunga amaso muri Viyetinamu\u200ekuva mu 1993. Mbere, fondasiyo yagize uruhare mu gutegura ingando z\u2019amaso ziyobowe n\u2019ubuvuzi bw\u2019amaso n\u2019abaforomo bo mu Buholandi, zifasha kuvura abarwayi benshi ba cataracte bishoboka. ECF yashyizeho Centre 2 za Vision muri Vinh Long na Dong Thap, ku nkunga y'abaterankunga, kandi yongeraho 16 hamwe na Vision Centre hamwe n\u2019inkunga yihariye mu karere ka Mekong Delta. Ibiro bya Viyetinamu\u200emuri Ho Chi City Minh byafunguwe muri 2008."}
{"id": "9920", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9920", "title": "Oberkappel", "text": "\" 'Oberkappel' \" ni komine muri Otirishiya se leta Otirishiya yo hejuru, iherereye mu karere Rohrbach (RO). Komine ifite abaturage bagera kuri 800.\nUburinganire.\nOberkappel ifite ubuso bwa 12 km\u00b2. Komine iherereye mu ntara ya ruguru ya Otirishiya, mu buraruko bwa Otirishiya. Imipaka yombi na Ubudage hamwe na Repubulika ya Ceki iri hafi.\nImikino n'imyidagaduro.\nInzira yo kugenda yu Burayi E8 na E10 inyura aha hantu. E8 iva muri Irilande ikanyura mu bindi, mu Buholandi (bita Oeverloperpad na Lingepad mu Buholandi) ikanyura mu Budage, mu majyaruguru ya Otirishiya no muri Silovakiya kugera ku mipaka ya Polonye na Ukraine, kandi ikubiyemo ibice muri Bulugariya, hamwe nintego zizaza Istanbul muri Turukiya. E10 ikomoka muri Lapland ikanyura muri Finlande, ahahoze GDR, Repubulika ya Ceki na Otirishiya kugera Bozen / Bolzano mu majyaruguru y'Ubutaliyani; Hariho gahunda yo kwagura inzira inyura mubufaransa no muburasirazuba bwa Espagne kugera Gibraltar.\nAmateka.\nAha hantu hambere muri Hochstift Passau. Dukurikije igitabo cy\u2019ubutaka cya Rannariedl mu 1581, Oberkappel yashyizwe muri paruwasi ya Wegscheid. Muri [1783]] iyi paruwasi yigenga nka paruwasi. Mu gihe cyo kwishyira ukizana kwa 1803, igihugu gifite igice kinini cya Hochstiftischen cyaguye kuri Archduke Ferdinand wa Tuscany n'abamutoye Salzburg. Nyuma yaje kugera i Bavariya mu 1805. Oberkappel yari muri Otirishiya yo hejuru kuva mu 1814 kandi kuva icyo gihe yari umujyi uhana imbibi na [Bavariya].\nOtirishiya imaze kwigarurira Ingoma y'Ubudage mu 1938, yabaye umutungo wa Gau Oberdonau. Mugihe cya Intambara ya Kabiri y'Isi Yose Oberkappel niho ingabo zunze ubumwe zinjiye bwa mbere kubutaka bwa Otirishiya. Nyuma ya 1945, gusana Australiya yo haruguru byarabaye.\nUyu munsi Oberkappel numujyi muto wubukerarugendo."}
{"id": "9921", "revid": "88", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9921", "title": "Uwahimbye film", "text": "A \" 'uwahimbye firime' \", na none \" 'uwahimbye umuziki wa firime' \", ni uwahimbye, ku bufatanye bwa hafi na umuyobozi wa firime na / cyangwa producer, Umuziki wa Firime ya firime cyangwa televiziyo, cyane cyane mubice bya nyuma yumusaruro. Igihembo cya firime cyingenzi cyane ni Igihembo cya Academy (Oscar) kuri Umuziki wa Filime Nziza (\"Amanota Yumwimerere\").\nInkomoko yuwahimbye firime iri mu ntangiriro ya amateka ya firime, mugihe film icecekeye e yari iherekejwe na piyano kandi abahimbyi ba mbere ba firime bakoresheje umuziki byumwihariko nka piyano kuri piyano. cyangwa nk 'amanota yanditse kuri orchestre. Nyuma yo kuza kwa firime y'amajwi ni bwo umuziki wa firime wafashwe amajwi muri studio."}
{"id": "9922", "revid": "17008", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9922", "title": "Shopping Malls in Kigali", "text": "Kigali\nMu buryo budashidikanywaho biherereye mu cyerekezo cy\u2019u Rwanda, Kigali agera hakurya y\u2019imisozi miremire, hamwe n\u2019umuhanda munini uhuza ibisigaye mu gihugu. Umurwa mukuru wuzuye utuje biratuje ariko birakomeye kandi biringaniye, hamwe nabantu barenga gato 1.000.000.\nAbashyitsi bwa mbere gutaka no kwibanda cyane bahora batanga ibitekerezo byukuntu umuhanda usukuye, ikibazo cyicyubahiro muri buri gace kanyuze mugihugu.\nMuri rusange Kigali ni umujyi mushya. Yashinzwe nka sitasiyo yubuyobozi mu 1907, ihinduka umurwa mukuru wigihugu mu bwigenge mu 1962, yimukira ahitwa Huye.\nIkwirakwizwa ryinshi ryibiti bitondekanye nibiti hamwe na kare byuzuye birinzwe kugenda, aho abirukanwa usanga igice kinini cyanyujijwe kubikoresho byabo usibye niba bakeneye ubufasha, muribwo bazakirwa neza mubaturanyi.\nHano haribintu byagutse byubukorikori, nkumubare witerambere uhitamo kurya hanze no kugira ibinyobwa bibiri, byinshi hamwe no gushuka ibintu byose bikubiyemo. Umudugudu wumuco wa Kigali utanga umwanya wihariye kubanyabukorikori hafi n\u2019abagurisha ibiryo kugirango berekane kandi bahana ibicuruzwa byabo.\nKigali ikura vuba, hamwe na santeri nshya zubucuruzi, ahakorerwa ubucuruzi hamwe na salle yo hejuru yateranirizwagamo ikora muburyo bwingoro yumwami yumunsi wa kera, imurikira ikirere nijoro kuri kamwe mubantu benshi.\nMasterpiece Mall\nKu ikubitiro izwi nka SAR Motors muri Kigali, uyumunsi ni u Rwanda rugezweho, inzu yubucuruzi yakira imiryango. Baraguha hejuru yumurongo udasanzwe wo kugurisha, ibiryo, ibiryo, ikawa, inzu itangaje irekura piazza, isoko ryijoro bityo cyane cyane! Ngwino hano hamwe n'inshuti n'umuryango wawe, abasangirangendo, abafatanyabikorwa kandi udashaka kandi musangire muburambe bwa Masterpiece!\nUru ruganda ni rwiza kubatuye mu turere twa Kicukiro, Kabeza, Kimironko, Kanombe!\nAgace: KN 5 Rd, Kigali\nKigali Heights\nIkibanza cyiterambere cya Kigali giherereye imbere yakarere ka Kimihurura. Igishushanyo mbonera cya Sub Area cyerekana Agace ka Kimihurura nk 'igice cya kabiri kiri imbere muri kamwe mu turere twahinduwe cyane na Kigali kandi kazengurutswe nibice byingenzi bihari kandi byateganijwe. Uzakurikirana amaduka, cafe, nububiko rusange.\nAgace: KG 7 Ave\nM Peace Plaza\nM. Harmony Plaza ni ugukata ibintu byose muburyo bumwe hamwe nu bicuruzwa, umwanya wibiro hamwe nudukingirizo twa premium. M.Peace Plaza itanga urwego rwo hejuru, umwanya wibiro, amasoko yo kwidagadura. Urashobora kubaho, gukora, guhaha no kudindiza muri M.Peace Plaza.\nAgace: KN 4 Ave, Kigali\nCHIC Shopping Center\nInyubako ya Stylish ninyubako nini yubucuruzi iherereye mumujyi rwagati. Ntibisanzwe kandi byumunsi, urashobora kubona hafi ya byose kugirango wuzuze ibyo ukeneye. Witegure rero gushima ibiryo hamwe na buri kimwe cya gastronomi, amaduka, amazu yimyenda, ibikoresho byo murugo ndetse nakazi kakazi!\nAgace: KN 2 Ave, Kigali\nMIC Shopping Mall\nIgice cyabantu ku giti cyabo bafata MIC y'Ubucuruzi ya MIC nkikigo cyiza cyubucuruzi cyumujyi kubijyanye nimyambarire. Shakisha byongeye ubwinshi bwamaduka.\nAgace: KN 2 Ave, Kigali\nGrand Pension Plaza\nStupendous Pension Plaza ni umucuruzi ukorera muri Kigali. Pansiyo iteye ubwoba i Nyarugenge, hafi yubumwe bwubucuruzi. Ahantu heza cyane guhaha!\nAgace: 2 KN 3 Ave, Kigali\nTropical Plaza\nTropical Plaza ni inyubako yubucuruzi iherereye mumujyi wa Kigali ituranye na parike itwara abantu kandi ikikijwe nimiryango myinshi itandukanye. Ni ahantu heza kububiko, aho bakorera, ububiko rusange, resitora, nibindi.\nAgace: KN 82 St, Kigali\nKigali Shopping\nGura no Kugurisha muri platform [Shopping]. Ni isoko rizwi cyane mu Rwanda Itanga amatangazo atandukanye yo gukodesha no guhana, kugura inzu, imodoka, ikibanza nibindi bitangaje."}
{"id": "9926", "revid": "13628", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9926", "title": "Kaminuza y'Abadiventisti bo muri Afurika yo Hagati (AUCA)", "text": "Kaminuza y'Abadiventisti bo muri Afurika yo Hagati (AUCA) izwi cyane mururimi rw'i Gifaransa nka Universite Adventiste d'Afrique Central ni ikigo cya badventiste b'umunsi wa karindwi cy'amashuri makuru hafi giherereye mumugi wa Kigali, mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "9927", "revid": "10331", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9927", "title": "African Leadership University(ALU)", "text": "African Leadership University(ALU) ni Kaminuza nyafurika ikaba n' ihuriro ryibigo bya kaminuza bifite ibikorwa muri Maurice ndetse nu Rwanda bitanga impamyabumenyi ihanitse. ALU ifite intego yo guteza imbere miriyoni 3 zabayobozi bashinzwe imyitwarire no kwihangira imirimo muri Afrika ndetse nisi yose muri 2035. Ikoresha uburyo bwihariye, butwarwa nabanyeshuri, bushingiye kumushinga, hamwe nubutumwa bushingiye kubutumwa bwo gukora abiga,bigendanye nuko isi ihinduka. Inshingano zayo ni ukubaka ibigo 25 ku mugabane wa Afurika no kugira byibuze abayobozi miliyoni 3 burubyiruko bo muri Afurika mu myaka 50 iri imbere, mu guha abanyeshuri ubumenyi bujyanye n\u2019isi uko igenda itera imbere."}
{"id": "9928", "revid": "11200", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9928", "title": "Akilah Institute", "text": "Ikigo cya Akilah ni ishuri ridaharanira inyungu ku bagore ribarizwa muri Kigali, mu Rwanda. Niyo kaminuza yambere kubagore mugihugu. Ni ikigo gitanga impamyabumenyi yimyaka itatu yo kwihangira imirimo, gucunga neza abashyitsi, hamwe na sisitemu yamakuru. Akilah yemerewe gukora byemewe na mategeko binyuze muri Minisiteri y'Uburezi mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "9929", "revid": "10333", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9929", "title": "Institute of Applied Sciences Ruhengeri", "text": "INES Ruhengeri ni kaminuza izwi cyane kwizina ry' igifaransa rya Institut D'enseignement Superieur de Ruhengeri ikaba ari kaminuza y\u2019ubushakashatsi yigenga mu Rwanda. Yashinzwe ku ya 17 Ugushyingo 2003. Iherereye mu mujyi wa Ruhengeri. Muri 2019, kaminuza yatangiye ubufatanye bwimyaka itanu na kaminuza ya tekinike ya Bingen yubumenyi ngiro mu bushakashatsi no kunoza imikorere y\u2019ubuhinzi muri ako karere."}
{"id": "9930", "revid": "13251", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9930", "title": "Kigali Independent University", "text": "Kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali izwi cyane kwizina ry'igifaransa rya Universit\u00e9 Libre de Kigali cyangwa ULK iherereye mumujyi wa Kigali mu Rwanda, ni Ishuri ryigenga rikaba rimwe mumashuri makuru azwi cyane mu Rwnada, ryashinzwe ku ya 15 Werurwe 1996 kandi rigengwa n\u2019Itegeko No 27/2013 ryo ku wa 24/5/2013 rigenga ishyirahamwe n'imikorere, y'Amashuri Makuru mu Rwanda, Itegeko No 13/2009 rigenga Umurimo mu Rwanda, Iteka rya Perezida No 51/01 ryo ku ya 13/7/2010 rishyiraho ubuziranenge mu mashuri makuru."}
{"id": "9931", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9931", "title": "Mount Kenya University", "text": "Kaminuza ya Mount Kenya (MKU) ni ikigo cyigenga, ikigo-kinini, gikodeshwa na ISO 9001: 2015 Yemejwe muri Kenya. Yashinzwe na Prof. Simon N. Gicharu. MKU ni imwe muri kaminuza nini zigenga mu gihugu cyu Rwanda.\nigitecyerezo cyo gushinga kaminuza cya tangiye 1996\nUmwihariko.\nMu mwaka w'2005 Ikigo cyabaye icyambere cyigenga muri kenya cyemerewe gutanga amahugurwa kubahanga mubya farumasi ikigo cy'imiti cya minisiteri yubuzima.\nMount kenya ni kaminuza yemerera abanyeshuri biyishyurira nabishyurirwa na leta cyangwa ibigo byigenga.\nmu mwaka 2009 kaminuza ya mount kenya yatangije ishuri ryubumenyi mboneza mubano ry'arimo ishami ry'uburezi hamwe n'abanyeshuri ba dipolome makumyabiri n'umunani(28).\nna Bachelor's of Education.\nmuri Mutarama 2010 hashyizweho ushuri ry'uburezi\nMount kenya.\nAmasomo Aboneka Muri mount Kenya.\nimpamya bumenyi y'ubucuruzi\nImpamya Bumenyi ya siyanse mu ikorana buhanga ni tumanaho \nList of Campuses.\nIkigo gikuru cya Mount Kenya University Thika Campus giherereye mu mujyi wa Thika, hafi kilometero 47 (29 mi) mu majyaruguru y\u2019uburasirazuba bwa Nairobi, umurwa mukuru n\u2019umujyi munini wa Kenya. Imiterere yacyo kuri GPS ni 1\u00b002'44.0\"S, 37\u00b004'54.0\"E (mu mibare: -1.045559, 37.081669)."}
{"id": "9932", "revid": "15089", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9932", "title": "Kaminuza ya Carnegie Mellon", "text": "Kaminuza ya Carnegie Mellon izwi kwizina rya CMU ni ikigo kimwe muzigize kaminuza ya Carnegie Mellon ibarizwa i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Iyi kaminuza yatangijwe mu 2011 na Perezida w\u2019u Rwanda Paul Kagame. Umuhango wo gutangiza kaminuza kandi ukaba wariwitabiriwe na Farnam Jahanian, perezida wa CMU."}
{"id": "9933", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9933", "title": "College of Agriculture, Animal Sciences and Veterinary Medicine", "text": "Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubuhinzi, Ubumenyi bw\u2019inyamaswa n\u2019ubuvuzi bw\u2019amatungo (CAVM) ni rimwe muri kaminuza 6 zo muri kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda (UR) ryashyizweho mu 2013 n\u2019itegeko n \u00b0 38 ryo ku ya 23/09/2013. Iri shuri ryashyizweho rigamije guteza imbere ubumenyi, guteza imbere kwigisha nubushakashatsi, no gufasha sosiyete nyarwanda kuvumbura ibisubizo bishya kugirango bikemure ibibazo byingutu."}
{"id": "9934", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9934", "title": "College of Arts and Social Sciences", "text": "Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubukorikori n\u2019Ubumenyi rusange bw\u2019imibereho (CASS) ni rimwe muri kaminuza esheshatu (6) zo muri kaminuza yu Rwanda (UR). Iyi kaminuza ikaba yarashinzwe mu 2013 nkuko bigaragazwa mu itegeko no38 ryo ku wa 23/09/2013). Icyicaro gikuru cya CASS giherereye mumajyepfo y'u Rwanda mu kigo cya Huye ariko gikorera mu bigo bitandatu (Huye, Gikondo, Remera, Gako, Musanze na Nyakinama), kandi gifite abakozi bo mu kigo gishinzwe guteza imbere ururimi ku bigo byose bya kaminuza y'u Rwanda.\nCASS igizwe n'amashuri ane (Ishuri ry'ubuhanzi n'indimi, ishuri ry'itangazamakuru n'itumanaho, ishuri ry'imiyoborere n'ishuri ry'amategeko), ibigo bine (Ikigo gishinzwe guteza imbere ururimi (CLE), Ikigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi ku buringanire (CGS), Ikigo cyo Gukemura amakimbirane (CCM), hamwe n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe ubufasha mu by'amategeko (CLAM) na Radio yitwa Radio Salus."}
{"id": "9935", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9935", "title": "College of Business and Economics", "text": "Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubucuruzi n\u2019Ubukungu(CBE) ryashyizweho ku mugaragaro mu rwego rwa kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda ku itegeko 38 ryo ku ya 23/09/2013. Ryahoze ari Ishuri ry\u2019Imari n\u2019amabanki ariko ubu akaba yarahujwe mu rwego rwa kaminuza yu Rwanda (UR).\nIshuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubucuruzi n\u2019Ubukungu (CBE) ni rimwe muri kaminuza esheshatu zigizwe na kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda, ikigo cy\u2019amashuri makuru ya Leta yo mu Rwanda, cyashyizweho n\u2019amategeko NO 71/2013 ryo ku ya 10fO9 / 2O3 kandi kigena inshingano, ububasha, imitunganyirize n\u2019imikorere. CBE ifite ibigo bine byingenzi birimo Gikondo, Huye, Nyagatare na Rusizi. CBE ni ikigo cyihariye mu bucuruzi, mu bukungu, mu bukerarugendo no mu kwakira abashyitsi."}
{"id": "9936", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9936", "title": "College of Education (CE)", "text": "Kaminuza y'u Rwanda-ishuri rikuru nderabarezi (UR-CE). Ni imwe muri kaminuza zirindwi zigize kaminuza y'u Rwanda. UR-CE yashinzwe muri 2013. Ikaba yarashyizweho hagamijwe guhindura neza imiterere yiterambere ryabakozi cyane cyane mubijyanye numwuga w'uburezi.mu rwanda kaminuza zinderabazi zitandukanye hari iri mu akarere ka kayonza ariyo ce college of education.iyi yitwa rukara campus"}
{"id": "9937", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9937", "title": "College of Medicine and Health Sciences (CMHS)", "text": "Ishuri rikuru ry'Ubuvuzi n'Ubuzima ni rimwe mumashuri atandatu agize kaminuza y'u Rwanda. Iri shuri ryashyizweho muburyo bwemewe namategeko rikaba ryarashinzwe kuya 15 Ukwakira 2013. Iri shuri rikuru rizwi kandi ku izina rya UR-CMHS, rikaba rifite uruhare runini mu iterambere ry\u2019imibereho n\u2019ubukungu by\u2019igihugu binyuze mu guhugura abaganga b\u2019inzobere n\u2019inzobere mu buzima. Mu rwego rwo gushyigikira ibi, Ishuri rikuru ryubaka ubushobozi bujyanye niyi mpamvu mu kuyobora gahunda zamahugurwa yubuzima no kongerera ubushobozi, binyuze muri gahunda zikomeye kandi zifite akamaro."}
{"id": "9938", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9938", "title": "College of Science and Technology (CST)", "text": "College of Science and Technology (UR-CST) ni ishuri rikuru ry'Ubumenyi n'Ikoranabuhanga rya Kaminuza y'u Rwanda, iherereye mu Akarere ka Nyarugenge mu Mujyi wa Kigali. \nYahoze ari ishuri Rikuru ry'Ubumenyi n'ikoranabuhanga rya Kigali (izwi cyane kwizina rya KIST cyangwa Institut des Sciences et des Technologies de Kigali), nicyo kigo cya mbere cyibanda ku ikoranabuhanga mu mashuri makuru yashyizweho na leta y'u Rwanda. KIST yashinzweho mu Gushyingo 1997. Abafatanyabikorwa bakomeye mu ishingwa ryayo ni Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi, UNIPOD mu Rwanda, na GTZ, uruganda rw\u2019Abadage.\nIshuri Rikuru ry'Ubumenyi n'Ikoranabuhanga (CST) ryashinzweho na leta y'u Rwanda mwi ITEGEKO N \u00b0 71/2013 Ryo ku wa 10 Nzeri 2013 rishyiraho kaminuza y' u Rwanda (UR) kandi rimenya inshingano yayo, imbaraga, imiterere n'imikorere nkishuri ry'ikoranabuhanga ryihariye mukwigisha no guhugura abakozi bafite ubumenyi buhanitse mubijyanye nubumenyi, n'ubumenyingiro hamwe nubwubatsi kugirango bakurikirane iterambere ry'igihugu.\nMu rwego rwo kubahiriza ibyo leta yu Rwanda yiyemeje kugera ku ntego n\u2019intumbero bigaragara muri EDPRS 2 y\u2019igihugu ndetse na Vision 2020 yahindutse 2050 ubu, Ishuri Rikuru ry\u2019Ubumenyi n\u2019ikoranabuhanga (CST) ni rimwe muri kaminuza esheshatu zihariye ziri munsi ya kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda. CST igira uruhare runini mu kwigisha no gukora ubushakashatsi, kwegera abaturage no gutera inkunga abikorera ku giti cyabo bafite akazi kabuhariwe.\nAMASHURI AYIGIZE MUKICIRO CYAKABIRI CYA KAMINUZA(schools In bachelors degree)\n1.Ishuri Ryigisha gukora ibishushanyo mbonera by'amazu nizindi nyubako,ibidukikije n'imigereka yabyo\".(School of Architecture and Environment\").harimo ibyiciro bya:\n2.Ishuri Ryigisha ubwubatsi bw'imihanda n'amazu, amashanyarazi, n'ubwubatsi bw'imashini (\"School of engineering). Aha\" harimo\n3.Ishuri Ryigisha iby'ikoranabuhanga, mudasobwa, n'itumanaho(\"School of ICT\"). Zimwe muri porogaramu(program) zirimo ni\n4. Ishuri Ryigisha iby'ubucukuzi bw'amabuye y'agaciro n'ubumenyi (\"school of mining and geology\").Naho harimo \n5.Ishuri Ryigisha ubumenyi bw'ibanze nka Matematike, Ubugenge, Ubushakashatsi bw'imiti (Chemistry), n'Ibinyabuzima(s\"chool of science\"). Aha ho harimo\n\u2022Ishami ry'Imibare na Sitatisitiki (Mathematics and Statistics).\n\u2022 Ishami ry'ubujyenge(physics).\n\u2022Ishami ry'ubutabire(, chemistry).\n\u2022Ishami ry'ibunyabuza(conservation biology).\nINYUBAKO ZIGIZE IKIGO"}
{"id": "9939", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9939", "title": "IPRC Gishari", "text": "IPRC Gishari, yahoze yitwa Gishari Integrated Polytechnic (GIP) yashinzwe mu 2013 na RNP (Polisi y'u Rwanda) hamwe n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019abakozi (WDA). IPRC Gishari iherereye mu Mudugudu wa Shaburondo, Akagari ka Bwinsanga, Umurenge wa Gishari, Akarere ka Rwamagana, ku nkombe z\u2019ibiza byo mu kiyaga cya Muhazi mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba..IKindi yigisha imyuga irimo ubuhinzi,ubwubatsi,ibyerekeye amazi no kuyayobora(Plumbing),ubukanishi(mechanical engineering),na amashanyarazi. Imaze gusohora abanyeshuri 7000 kuva yatangira.\nubuhinzi ni rimwe mu mashami y'imyuga yigishwa muri IPRC Gishari bigirira umumaro cyane abanyeshuri bahiga ndetse n'abaturajye muri rusange.muri IPRC gishari harimo ubufasha bwa leta y' U Rwanda yo kwiga kaminuza mu mezi atatu bagakora isuzuma rito bakajya mu kazi. muri iyo myuga harimo isomo ryo kwita ku buzima bw'inkoko, n'indi myuga,ubworozi ndetse n'ubuhinzi."}
{"id": "9940", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9940", "title": "Fred Swaniker", "text": "Fred Swaniker (1976) ni rwiyemezamirimo wo muri Gana akaba n'inzobere mu iterambere ry'ubuyobozi. Yatangije imiryango ine igamije guteza imbere abayobozi, cyane cyane muri Afrika. Niwe washinze ishuri rikuru rya African Leadership Academy na kaminuza ya Afrika y'Ubuyobozi ifite icyicaro i Kigali, mu Rwanda. Niwe kandi washinze umuyoboro nyafurika wo kuyobora hamwe na Global Leadership Adventures.\nUbuzimwa bwe bwahambere.\nSe ni umunyamategeko n'umucamanza. Afite imyaka ine, byabaye ngombwa ko ahunga Gana nyuma yo guhirika ubutegetsi. Mbere yimyaka cumi n'umunani avutse, yabaga mubihugu bine bya Afrika. Amashuri ye yayize muri Macalester College muri Minnesota. Nyuma yaje gukora mu kigo ngishwanama cya McKinsey &amp; Company i Johannesburg mbere yo gukora impamyabumenyi ya MBA i Stanford, muri Californiya. Arangije amasomo ye, yamenyekanye cyane nka Arjay Miller Scholar amumenya ko ari mu 10% ba mbere mu itsinda ry\u2019abanyeshuri beza mu ishuri rye.Ishuri ryigisha ubuyobozi nubuhanga bwo kwihangira imirimo kubanyeshuri baturutse muri Afrika yose, kubategurira no kwiga kaminuza.. Kuva muri 2017, abayobozi bagera ku 1.000 bazaza mu ishuri. Ku banyeshuri benshi, amafaranga y'ishuri avanwaho kugira ngo basezerane gukorera muri Afurika nyuma y'amasomo yabo.Muri 2014, mu nama ya TED yabereye muri Berezile, Swaniker yatangaje ko yaguye icyerekezo cye: umuyoboro mushya wa kaminuza 25 zo muri Afurika uzahugura abayobozi miliyoni 3 muri 2060.Kuva mu 2016 hafunguwe ibigo bibiri: imwe muri Maurice naho iya kabiri mu Rwanda muri Kigali. Ikinyamakuru cyo muri Amerika cyihuta cyagaragaje uyu muyoboro w\u2019ishuri na kaminuza nkimwe mu masosiyete agezweho muri Afurika. Byongeye kandi, itangazamakuru CNN ryerekanye uyu mushinga nka Havard yo muri Afurika.\nGraca Machel wahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019uburezi muri Mozambike akaba n\u2019umupfakazi wa Nelson Mandela, yabaye umuyobozi wa kaminuza naho Donald Kaberuka wahoze ari Perezida wa Banki Nyafurika itsura amajyambere, ari mu nama y\u2019ubuyobozi.\nUmwuga.\nMu masomo ye i Stanford, yanditse gahunda yubucuruzi yo gushinga ishuri: Ishuri Rikuru ry'Ubuyobozi Nyafurika. Ishuri rifite pan-nyafurika rigamije guhugura abayobozi bakeneye Afurika muri iki gihe Yemeza ko imwe mu feri nyamukuru ku iterambere rya Afurika ari ukutagira ubuyobozi bubi mu ntore ziriho ubu. Bitewe n\u2019imikoranire ye yateje imbere muri Californiya mu kibaya cya Silicon, yashoboye kubona inkunga maze atangiza ishuri akimara kurangiza Stanford mu 2004.\nIshuri ryigisha ubuyobozi nubuhanga bwo kwihangira imirimo kubanyeshuri baturutse muri Afrika yose, kubategurira no kwiga kaminuza.. Kuva muri 2017, abayobozi bagera ku 1.000 bazaza mu ishuri. Ku banyeshuri benshi, amafaranga y'ishuri avanwaho kugira ngo basezerane gukorera muri Afurika nyuma y'amasomo yabo.Muri 2014, mu nama ya TED yabereye muri Berezile, Swaniker yatangaje ko yaguye icyerekezo cye: umuyoboro mushya wa kaminuza 25 zo muri Afurika uzahugura abayobozi miliyoni 3 muri 2060.\nuva mu 2016 hafunguwe ibigo bibiri: imwe muri Maurice naho iya kabiri mu Rwanda muri Kigali. Ikinyamakuru cyo muri Amerika cyihuta cyagaragaje uyu muyoboro w\u2019ishuri na kaminuza nkimwe mu masosiyete agezweho muri Afurika. Byongeye kandi, itangazamakuru CNN ryerekanye uyu mushinga nka Havard yo muri Afurika.Graca Machel wahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019uburezi muri Mozambike akaba n\u2019umupfakazi wa Nelson Mandela, yabaye umuyobozi wa kaminuza naho Donald Kaberuka wahoze ari Perezida wa Banki Nyafurika itsura amajyambere, ari mu nama y\u2019ubuyobozi."}
{"id": "9941", "revid": "120294", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9941", "title": "Institute of Legal Practice and Development (ILPD)", "text": "The Institute was established by law in 2006 as an Institution of Higher Learning and has been in operation since 2008. The establishment of this Institute was part of the implementation of judicial reforms that the Government of Rwanda embarked on in early 2000. To meet the demand for a legal workforce with enhanced skills, ILPD was assigned the task of providing the relevant training and research to the fresh graduates beginning their legal careers and to professionals already in practice who had not undertaken the requisite training.\nThe Institute of Legal Practice and Development (ILPD) plays a vital role in the development of the Rwandan Justice and Legal System. The Institute currently runs fourteen (14) postgraduate Diploma programs. ILPD also runs a wide range of other continuing legal education (CLE) courses to ensure that all legal professionals are kept up to date and have opportunities to refresh and develop their skills.\nILPD is also a research hub of the justice sector, conducting funded research projects on a range of issues relating to justice policy, legal practice and law development.\nThe Institute of Legal Practice and Development offers the courses in four different modes: The Full-time mode in Nyanza, Part-time mode (The evening schedule in Kigali), Part-time Weekend mode (The weekend schedule of Kigali, Weekend Nyanza, Weekend Musanze), as well as the Part-time Executive mode run in Kigali.\nThe Institute has been able to maintain its position as Ihuriro - a meeting place- where lawyers from different branches of the legal professions, different legal traditions, including Common law, Civil law and traditional law, meet and learn from each other.\nWith over four thousand graduates including international graduates from seventeen African Countries in its Postgraduate Diploma in Legal Practice (DLP) program at ILPD, this highlights the Institute\u2019s growing influence in shaping the legal profession across Africa.\nILPD graduates gain the unique advantage of being qualified to practice in both civil and common law jurisdictions, equipping them for diverse legal careers across Africa and beyond. ILPD also offers a high-quality legal education at a competitive cost, making it an excellent choice for aspiring legal professionals seeking affordability without compromising excellence.\nThe Institute's faculty consists of both local and international legal experts, ensuring a high-quality, practice-oriented education. On its faculty there are foreign and Rwandan Justices and Chief Justices, Prosecutor Generals and National Prosecutors, Senior Counsels, highly qualified academics, etc. The Institute implements a competence-based curriculum that is completed by public lecturers from highly qualified policy or decision- makers from Rwanda and from abroad. The Institute perspective falls within the vision of the Rwandan leader, President Paul Kagame, that it is possible to have a world-class education right here in Africa.\nRwanda has emerged as a top destination in Africa due to its strong governance, economic growth, and commitment to sustainability. In 2024, the International Congress and Convention Association (ICCA), the country and city rankings, has ranked Rwanda the second destination in Africa for International Conferences after South Africa. The country is renowned for its safety and stability, maintaining one of the lowest crime rates on the continent. Tourism is a major attraction, with the famous mountain gorillas in Volcanoes National Park, Akagera National Park's Big Five Safari, and Nyungwe Forest\u2019s canopy walk, among others. The nation\u2019s economy is one of the fastest-growing in Africa, fueled by innovation in technology, with Kigali emerging as a tech hub. As of the latest available data, Rwanda consistently ranks as the top country in Africa for adherence to the rule of law. In the World Justice Project's (WJP) Rule of Law Index 2024, Rwanda achieved an overall score of 0.63, leading the continent in governance and justice.\nThe Institute of Legal Practice and Development (ILPD) headquarters is located in Nyanza City, in the Southern Province\u2014a historical city that once served as the capital of the Rwandan kingdom. In 2024, the city celebrated its 125 years since it was established by King Yuhi V Musinga. Nyanza is renowned for its rich cultural heritage with two historical museums, \"inyambo\" cows generally known for the symmetrical white horns that stretch into the air several feet above their heads, cleanliness and peaceful environment, making it an ideal place for learning and living.\nILPD boasts state-of-the-art infrastructure, including modern, well-equipped classrooms, advanced ICT facilities, high-speed internet connectivity across the campus, and the best law library in the region. It provides on-campus accommodation tailored to students' preferences and offers various leisure activities to enhance the students\u2019 experience.\nWith its world-class facilities, expert faculty, and serene learning environment, ILPD stands as a premier institution for legal training in Africa.\nFor more information:\nWebsite: https://www.ilpd.ac.rw/home\nX: https://x.com/LegalPracticeRW\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/ilpd.ac.rw\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/ilpd_rwanda/\nLinkedin: https://www.linkedin.com/in/institute-of-legal-practice-and-development-ilpd-3287bb299/"}
{"id": "9942", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9942", "title": "IPRC Ngoma", "text": "Integrated Polytechnic Regional College Ngoma (IPRC Ngoma) ni ishuri rikuru ry\u2019imyuga n\u2019ubumenyingiro mu Rwanda \u2013 Koleji ya Ngoma nimwe mumashuri makuru agize Rwanda Polytechnic. IPRC-NGOMA (yahoze yitwa ETO Kibungo) yashinzwe mu 1989 na guverinoma y'u Rwanda. Mu 1994 mugihe cya jenoside yakorewe abatutsi ishuri ryafunze imiryango. Mu Gushyingo 2012, nibwo ishuri ryisumbuye rya Tekinike rya Kibungo ryazamuwe mu kigo cya Integrated Polytechnic Regional Centre (IPRC) mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba na guverinoma y'u Rwanda."}
{"id": "9943", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9943", "title": "IPRC Kigali", "text": "Integrated Polytechnic Regional Centre (IPRC) Kigali, ni ishuri ryimyuga nubumenyingiro riherereye mu karere ka Kicukiro mumujyi wa Kigali,Rwanda. Yashinzwe bwa mbere na leta yu Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2008 nka \"Kicukiro College of Technology (KCT)\". Inshingano yibanze ya koleji kwari ugutezimbere no gutanga ubumenyi bwumwuga kurwego rwa dipolome (A1).\nIri shuri rikuru ryarazwe ibikorwa remezo bisanzwe biri muri ETO Kicukiro byarifashije gukora nk'ishuri ryisumbuye rya Tekinike mu 1994 nubwo ibikoresho byayo hafi ya byose byangijwe mugihe cya jenoside. Nyuma ya jenoside amashuri abiri yisumbuye yakoresheje ibikorwa remezo bikurikirana kugeza muri Mutarama 2008.\nMuri Nyakanga 2008, Guverinoma y'u Rwanda (GoR) yafashe icyemezo cyo guhuza uburezi bwa tekiniki, Uburezi bw'imyuga n'amahugurwa muri sisitemu ihuriweho (TVET). Kugeza ubu ishuri rikuru rya IPRC Kigali riri mubigo bizwi kandi bikora muri Rwanda Polytechnic."}
{"id": "9944", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9944", "title": "East African Christian College", "text": "Ishuri Rikuru rya Gikristo rya Afurika y'Iburasirazuba (EACC), nii Ikigo cy'Amashuri makuru cy'Itorero ry'Abangilikani gifite ikicaro i Kigali, mu Rwanda cyashinzwe muri 2021.\namateka.\nEACC yahimbwe na musenyeri mukuru Dr Laurent Mbanda muri 2019, igitekerezo cye cyemejwe n'inama y'abaminisitiri y'u Rwanda mu Kuboza 2020."}
{"id": "9946", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9946", "title": "IPRC Karongi", "text": "Integrated Polytechnic Regional College (IPRC) ya Karongi nimwe muri IPRC umunani zigize Polytechnic yu Rwanda. Ishuri Rikuru rya Polytechnic Regional College (IPRC) ryashinzwe mu 1990/1991. Ni ishuri ritanga amahugurwa ya Tekiniki na Vocational Education mubyiciro byose kugeza kurwego rwa karindwi bizwi nka Advanced Diploma.Amasomo batanga ari mumashami atanu byumwihariko Ubwubatsi bwa Tekinoloji &amp; Ibidukikije, Amashanyarazi &amp; Electronics Ubwubatsi hamwe na Porogaramu y\u2019ikoranabuhanga ry\u2019amashanyarazi, gucunga neza abashyitsi, amakuru n\u2019ikoranabuhanga mu itumanaho hamwe na IT hamwe n\u2019ubuhanga bw\u2019imashini hamwe n\u2019ikoranabuhanga rya Automobile na Production &amp; Manufacturing Technology Programs."}
{"id": "9947", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9947", "title": "IPRC Musanze", "text": "IPRC Musanze ni ikigo cya leta gihugura amashuri makuru yashyizweho kugirango gitange uburezi bwa tekiniki n\u2019imyuga, gikora munsi yu Rwanda Polytechnic. IPRC Musanze yubatswe nkimpano yabashinwa ibinyujije muri Ambasade yayo mu Rwanda.\nIPRC Musanze yatangiye gufata abanyeshuri bwa mbere ku ya 30 Werurwe 2015, icyo gihe yari ikitwa Musanze Polytechnic ikorera mu kigo gishinzwe iterambere ry'abakozi (WDA). Hamwe no gushinga Rwanda Polytechnic muri 2018, izina ricyo kigo ryarahindutse iza kwitwa IPRC Musanze. IPRC Musanze iha abanyeshuri uburezi bwa tekiniki n\u2019imyuga n'amahugurwa yo kuba abanyamwuga mubijyanye n'ubuhinzi, ubwubatsi, amashanyarazi na elegitoroniki, hamwe no gucunga abashyitsi. Binyuze muri gahunda zikigoabanyeshuri bahabwa impamyabumenyi ya A1 n'amasomo magufi."}
{"id": "9948", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9948", "title": "IPRC Tumba", "text": "IPRC Tumba nizwi cyane kwizina rya Tmba Colleg of Technology(TCT), ikaba iherereye muntara y'amajyaruguru, akarere ka Rulindo, Tare,Rwanda. yashinzwe mu 2007 hashingiwe ku cyemezo cya guverinoma cyo kubyara abakozi bafite ubumenyi buhanitse kugirango bahuze inganda n\u2019imibereho. IPRC tumba itanga amasomo atatu aganisha kuri dipolome yigihugu (A1) aribyo: Renewale Energy (RE), Electronics na Telecommunication (ET), hamwe n'ikoranabuhanga (IT)."}
{"id": "9950", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9950", "title": "Mara Group", "text": "Mara Group n'isosiyeti nini itanga serivisi zitandukanye zirimo ubucuruzi bw'ibikoresho by'ikoranabuhanga byiganjemo telefoni zigendanwa (Mara phones), banki ndetse no gutunganya ibikomoka k'ubuhinzi. \nAmateka.\nIyi sosiyeti ifite ikicaro gikuru mu mugi wa Dubai mu igihugu cya United Arab Emirates yashinzwe na mu 1996, ubu iyi sosiyeti imaze gufungura amashami yayo mu ibihugu 25 birimo ibihugu 22 muri Afrika, ikaba imaze guha akazi abarenga ibihumbi cumi na kimwe (11000) by'abaturage. Iyi sosiyeti imaze imyaka 26 ishinzwe, mu mwaka wa 2010 yatoranyijwe na World Economic Forum nka Sosiyeti ikura cyane ku isi yose.\nMara phones.\nMara group yatangije uruganda rutunganya telephone nini za Smartphone mu mugi wa Kigali-Rwanda mu kwezi kwa cumi 2019. Izo telefoni ni MaraZ1, MaraX1 na Mara S zikoranye ikoranabuhanga ritandukanye ririmo irya finger print sensor, triple rear camera. Sosiyeti ya Mara group mu Rwanda ikorera mu icyanya cyahariwe inganda imasoro mu mugi wa Kigali, aho itangiririye imirimo yo gukora telephone zigendanwa yahaye akazi abanyarwanda 200 bangana na 90% aho abagore bihariye 60% byabakozi bose ndetse ikaba ifite intego yo kongera umubare w'abakozi kugera nibura kuri 300.\nUbucuruzi.\nMara phone izwi nka Mara X igura amadorari y'amerika $130 ahwanye Rwf120,250 naho Mara Z igura amadorari y' amerika $190 (or Rwf175,750). Izi telephone ziboneka ku kicaro cya sosiyeti Kigali Business Centre ndetse no muyandi masoko atandukanye yo mugihugu. AShish J. Thakkar nkuko yabitangarije ikinyamakuru the newtimes, ayugako bashaka kwagura amasoko y'ibikoresho bikorerwa mu Rwanda bikagera mu bihugu byo hanze birimo Angola, Kenya na DRC congo. "}
{"id": "9951", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9951", "title": "Kibogora polytechnic", "text": "Kibogora polytechnic ni Kaminuza y'igenga ishingiye kw'idini rya Methodist Libre, ifite ikicaro gikuru mu ntara y'iburengerazuba mu karere ka Nyamasheke, umurenge wa Kanjongo mu Rwanda. Umushinga wo gutangiza iyi kaminuza watangiye muri Nyakanga 2011 ku igitekerezo cy' itorero rya methodiste libre, ibitaro bya Kibogora ndetse n'abaturage batuye mu bice bigize intara y'iburengerazuba.\nAmateka.\nUbuyobozi bw'itorero ryigenga rya Methodiste nyuma yo gukora ibiganiro byimbitse k'umushinga wo gutangiza kaminuza bwatanze ubusabe kuri minisiteri y'uburezi na minisiteri y'ubutegetsi bw'igihugu Ugushyingo 2011, Minisiteri y'ubutegetsi bw'igihugu yasubije ubusabe bwabo Kuwa 7 Mutarama 2012, ikurikirwa na minisiteri y'uburezi kuwa 31 Kanama 2012. Nyuma yo kwemererwa ubwo busabe, Iyi kaminuza y'itorero rya Methodiste libre mu Rwanda, yatangiye kwakira abanyeshuri bambere kuwa 17 Nzeri 2012, mu masomo y'ubuganga na theology, kuwa 10 Ukwakira 2012 ikigo gishinzwe amashuri makuru mu Rwanda (HEC) cyemereye iyi kaminuza andi mashami abiri arimo ay'Uburezi n'ubucuruzi (Business and development studies) mu ishami ry'ubukungu n'iterambere ry'icyaro.\nIcyerekezo.\nKibogora Polytechnic (KP) yemejwe n'ikigo k'igihugu gishinzwe amashuri makuru (HEC) ndetse ihabwa uburenganzira busesuye (License) Ukwakira 2014 hashingiwe ku itegeko nomero 07/2015 ryo kuwa 15 Werurwe 2015. Iyi Kaminuza igamije gukemura ikibazo cy'abanyeshuri baburaga aho bakomereza kaminuza hafi yabo igihe batabaga babonye buruse yo gukomeza muri Kaminuza nkuru y' u Rwanda. Kibogora Polytechnic (KP) itanga impamyabushozi mu ikiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza(Masters) n'ikiciro cya kabiri cya Kaminuza (bachelor) mu mashami y'uburezi (education), ubuganga (Health sciences), Ubucuruzi (Business and development studies) na Theology \nUbutumwa.\nKugira uruhare mu kuvugurura umuryango w\u2019u Rwanda ku ruhande rwo kuzamura ireme ry\u2019abakozi mu bijyanye n\u2019uburezi, mu gufasha abahawe impamyabumenyi kurushaho kwikorera ubwabo, umuryango n\u2019Imana, binyuze mu mikurire y\u2019umwuka, kwiga imyuga n\u2019ubushakashatsi, no kugira uruhare mu iterambere ry'abaturage."}
{"id": "9952", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9952", "title": "Kaminuza yigenga ya kigali", "text": "Kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali.\nKaminuza yijyenga ya Kigali (ULK) ni kaminuza yashinzwe mu mwaka wi 1996 ni ishuri rimwe\nmu mashuri makuru ryigenga mu Rwanda. ni rimwe mu mashuri kandi afite abanyeshuri batari bake\nmuri kaminuza ziri m' Umujyi wa Kigali. ULK kandi afite amashami menshi atandukanye\nAmateka.\nKaminuza yigenga ya Kigali (ULK) nkuko twa bibonye haruguru yashinzwe tariki 15 werurwe 1996\nnyuma ya Genocide yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda. yatangiye ikorera mu nyubako ya Mutagatifu Pawulo\nULK kandi yaje kubaka inyubako zayo zambere mu murenge wa Kacyiru aho yaje kuhahindura amashuri\nyisumbuye azwi na Glory secondary school. 2007 nibwo ulk yimuriye ibikorwa byayo bya Kminuza\nmu murenge wa Gisozi aho yari imaze kubaka inyubako nshyashya. iyi Kaminuza kandi yashinzwe na \nprof Rwigamba Balinda mu rwego rwo gufasha urubyiruko rwu Rwanda kuzamura ireme ry' uburezi.\nndetse ni iterambere ry'igihugu cyu Rwanda\nfakirite.\nKaminuza yijyenga ya Kigali kandi ifite amashami menshi atandukanye harimo nka\n- ishami ry'ubumenyi Rusange\n- ishami ry'ubumenyi bwa Mudasobwa\n- ishami ry'amategeko\n- ndetse na polytechnics\nUbudasa.\nKaminuza yigenga ya Kigali kandi nimwe muri kaminuza mu Rwanda zifite\nStade mu kigo imbere kandi nini kuburyo ishobora kwakira abantu benshi\nIbikorwa remezo.\nULK kandi yimuriye amashuri yayo abanza nayisumbuye ku nyubako yayo nshya iherereye\nku gisozi. Kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali ifite stade ihagije kuburyo ibirori byabanyeshuri\nbayo bashoje ariho bibera ndetse si ibyo gusa babasha kwakira ibitaramo bitandukanye\nnibindi birori. ndetse nibiterane by'amatorero atandukanye."}
{"id": "9957", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9957", "title": "Joy Kansangire", "text": "Joy Kansangire ni umucuruzikazi w'umunyarwandakazi akaba n'umuyobozi wa Promota Creations Ltd, yamenyekanye ikora udupfukamunwa mu gihe cy'icyorezo cya Covid mu Rwanda. Mugihe cya guma mu rugo Kansangire yavuze ko bafite ubushobozi bwo gukora mask hafi 7000 burimunsi kandi bafite gahunda yo kuzamura bitewe n'udukenewe. "}
{"id": "9958", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9958", "title": "Rwigamba Balinda", "text": "Prof Rwigamba \nProf Rwigamba Balinda yavutse mu mwaka wi 1948 avukira muri kivu yaruguru ahitwa masisi mu cyahoze ari Zaire\nubu akaba ari Repuburika iharanira Demokarasi ya Congo akaba ari umuyobozi w'ikirenga\nwa Kaminuza yigenga ya Kigali iherereye i Kigali mu murenge wa Gisozi ndetse akaba ari nawe nyirayo\nya yishinze mu mwaka wi 1996 nyuma ya Genocide ya korewe abatutsi mu Rwanda mu 1994\nAmashuri yize.\nahagana mu mwaka wi 1974 nibwo yarangije Lisence yambere muri philosophie Anglaise muri kaminza imwe \ny'Ikinshasa mumwaka wi 1977 kandi abona indi Lisence muri Linguistique Africaine muri Kaminuza yi \nLubumbashi mu mwaka wi 1982 yabonye kandi impamya bushobozi yo kurwego rwa PHD arinabwo yabaga \numuyobozi wa Kaminuza i Lubumbashi kubera uburyo yize ari umuhanga kandi abona amanota meza \nyigishije kandi no kuriyo kaminuza yigagaho. ndetse akaba yaranditse nibitabo byinshi bitandukanye\nUbuzima bwite.\nProf Rwigamba Balinda yavutse kuya 10/10/1948 avukira mu gihugu cyabaturanyi muri Congo\nafite umugore umwe witwa Nyirashyirambere Marie Louise nabana batandatu kuva 2003 -2014\nProf Rwigamba yabaye umuyobozi w'umuryango wa za Kaminuza zose zigenga na amashurimakuru\nbyo mu Rwanda kuva mu mwaka wa 2003 kugeza mu kwakira 2011 Prof Rwigamba yabaye Senateri\nmu Rwanda \nUbudasa.\nProf Rwigamba Balinda azwiho kuba ari umu Kristo kandi agakunda abantu cyane avugako kandi yahoze\nafite inzozi zo kuzaba umuherwe kugirango nawe azakize abandi kandi akaba abishimira Imana\nkuko yabigezeho ni mwe m bantu bafite kaminuza zigenga zikomeye mu Rwanda Prof Rwigamba \nkandi yanditse ibitabo byinshi bitandukanye muribyo harimo icyo yise UMUCRISTO W'UKURI\nIndoto za Prof Rwigamba.\nKuva akri muto yiga mu mashuri abanza nayisumbuye yari umuhanga abona amanota y'ikirenga mwishuri\nku myaka 15 yandikaga ku makayi ye ngo Prof Dr Rwigamba Balinda\nULK yayitangije yakira abanyeshuri 204 bakodesha munyubako ya mutagatifu pawulo iherereye mu mujyi wa kigali\nakora sporo yo kuzamuka amadarage y'inyubako ye akoreramo\nakunda kurya imboga rwatsi no kunywa amazi menshi\nAkamaro.\nprof Rwigama Balinda kandi kubera kugira neza kwe yahoze yfuza gufasha abntu benshi mu gihugu\ncye cyu Rwanda ndetse no muri kariyeri ye y'uburezi bityo akaba ari umwe mubantu bashimirwa cyane\nnabantu benshi ndetse bamwe bakanabigaragaza mu nyandiko zikubiye mu bitabo bagiye bandika\nProf Rwigamba kandi numwe mubantu batangije Kaminuza zigenga mu Rwanda akaba ashimirwa \nnabenshi kubera iterambere yagize mu burezi mu Rwanda ndetse no muri kaminuza zitandukanye \nyaciyemo mugihugu cya congo."}
{"id": "9959", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9959", "title": "Heirs Holdings", "text": "Heirs Holdings ni umuryango ufite ishoramari rigari, ufite icyicaro i Lagos, muri Nijeriya ufite inyungu z\u2019ishoramari mu nzego zitandukanye muri Afurika\nAmateka.\nHoldings yashinzwe mu mwaka 2010 na Tony O. Elumelu, CON nyuma kujya muzabukuru mu mwaka wa 2010 muri Banki yunze ubumwe ya Afurika (UBA) Plc, aho yari yarabaye Umuyobozi w\u2019itsinda (Group managing director). \nMu mwaka wa 2011, Heirs Holdings yakoze ishoramari ryayo rya mbere igamije kugira imigabane igenzura muri Transcorp, uruganda runini rwa Nijeriya. Muri 2012, Heirs Holdings yongeye gushora imari mu mutungo utimukanwa no mu rwego rw'imari. Afriland Properties Plc,n'ikigo k'imicungire yumutungo, ishoramari, nisosiyete yiterambere; United Capital Plc, itsinda rya serivisi yimari nishoramari; na Afrika Prudential Registrar Plc, utanga serivise yo kwiyandikisha\nMuri 2013, Heirs Holdings yiyemeje miliyoni 2,5 z'amadolari y'Amerika, nk'umushoramari umwe rukumbi w\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo muri Perezida Barack Obama Power Africa Initiative afite intego yo kongera 30.000MW y\u2019amashanyarazi mashya, kongera amashanyarazi byibuze miliyoni 60 z'abaturage muri Sub-Saharah African. Muri 2020, Heirs Holdings yaguze neza OML17 muri, na mubyo bita peteroli na gaze muri Afrika mumwaka wa 2020\nIshoramari.\nIshoramari rya Heirs Holdings ryateguwe muburyo butandatu:,, no \nUbukungu.\nInyungu za Heirs Holdings nishoramari muri serivisi zimari bigabanya amabanki, ubwishingizi, banki ishoramari, imicungire yumutungo no kwandikisha isoko ryimari\nUbuyobozi.\nAs of August 1, 2021:"}
{"id": "9960", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9960", "title": "Tony Elumelu", "text": "Tony Onyemaechi Elumelu (yavutse ku ya 22 Werurwe 1963) ni umuhanga mubijyanye n'ubukungu muri Nijeriya, akaba n'umugiraneza. Afite ubucuruzi, yise Heirs Holdings niwe washinze Fondasiyo ya Tony Elumelu ((TEF). \nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nUbuto bwe n'umuryango.\nElumelu yavukiye i, Plateau, muri Nijeriya, ku ya 22 Werurwe 1963, avuka kuri Suzanne na Dominic Elumelu ukomoka muri Onicha-Ukwu muri Aniocha y'Amajyaruguru y\u2019akarere ka Leta ya Yakuranye na barumuna be bane, umwe muri bo ni Ndudi Elumelu, umuyobozi muto mu nteko ishinga amategeko ya Nigeriya (Nigerian Federal House of Representatives)\nUburezi (Education).\nYize ibijyanye n'ubukungu muri kaminuza ya Leta ya Bendel (ubu ni) ahabwa impamyabumenyi ya BSc na Master of Science in Economics yakuye muri kaminuza ya Lagos.\nUmwuga.\nUmwuga we wa mbere.\nElumelu yakoze muri Banki y\u2019ubumwe ya Banki ya Nijeriya (Nigerian Bank Union Bank) nk'umunyamuryango w\u2019Urubyiruko muri National youth Service Corps mu 1985 mbere yo gutangira umwuga we wo gucuruza. Muri 2005 Elumelu yaguze imigabane muri banki za leta zose, nyuma aguze na Banki yunze ubumwe ya Afrika (UBA).\nMu mwuga we wa mbere, yagize ati;Natangiye umwuga wanjye w'ubucuruzi, ngurisha copi z'impapuro kugira ngo mbe umwihariko,nari muto kandi nshonje, ndetse nkora cyane, ariko ikigaragara ni uko nari umwe gusa mu bihumbi by\u2019abasore barangije muri \nNijeriya, bose bifuzaga gutsinda.\nMu 1997, Elumelu yayoboye itsinda rito ry'abashoramari, ahita ashyiraho banki yitwa (struggling crystal bank) nyuma yigihe gito bayihindurira izina bayita (Standard Trust Bank). Yahinduye inyungu mu myaka mike maze muri 2005 ahita azamurwa mu intera nini mu rwego rw\u2019amabanki muri Afurika yo munsi y\u2019ubutayu bwa Sahara agura Banki yunze ubumwe ya Afurika (UBA). Nyuma y\u2019ihuzwa rya Standard Trust Bank na Banki yunze ubumwe ya Afurika muri 2005, Elumelu yayoboye iyi sosiyete nk'umuyobozi ushinzwe amatsinda kuva mu itsinda ry\u2019amabanki yo mu gihugu kimwe kugeza muri banki ya Afurika ifite amashami mu bihugu 20 bya Afurika, Ubufaransa, Amerika n'Ubwongereza kugera igihe yeguriye k'ubutegetsi muri 2010, nyuma yo kuva muri board ya UBA yahise ashora imari ye ashyiraho umuryango mugari uzwi nka Heirs Holdings abikorana n'ibikorwa by'urukundo binyuze mu muryango The Tony Elumelu Foundation muri 2010 nyuma yo kujya muzabukuru, kugera uyu munsi uyu muryango uracyakora ibikorwa by'urukundo kuko ufasha urubyiruko guteza imbere imishinga yabo y'ubucuruzi.\nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nElumelu mu 1993 yashakanye na Awele Vivien Elumelu, ukora umwuga w' ubuganga. Babyarane abana barindwi\nIbihembo n'Ishimwe yahawe.\nElumelu yakiriye ibihembo bitandukanye ashimirwa uruhare rwe mubucuruzi no kwihangira imirimo."}
{"id": "9963", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9963", "title": "Kaminuza Catholic", "text": "Kaminuza Gatolika y'u Rwanda (CUR ; Catholic University of Rwanda) yashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2010, ni ikigo cyigenga cy\u2019amashuri makuru giherereye mu mujyi wa Butare, Intara y'Amajyepfo mu Rwanda, ni umugi utuwe n' abaturage bari hagati ya 1.000.000-5.000.000, iyi kaminuza yemewe n'amategeko ndetse yahawe uburenganzira busesuye bwo gutanga ubumenyi na Miniseteri y'uburezi mu Rwanda.\nIntego, indangagaciro n'icyerekezo cya CUR.\nIntego.\nCUR yiyemeje gutanga uburezi bufite ireme bushingiye kuri Kristo bushingiye ku buryo bwuzuye. Igitekerezo cyo kurema cyavutse kubushake bwo gukomeza gukemura ibibazo bya siyansi n'ikoranabuhanga mu gushyigikira ubumenyi bukomeye butuma abayirangiza bakomeza kuba intangarugero ku isoko ry'umurimo\nIcyerekezo.\nIcyerekezo cya kaminuza ya CUR ni ukuba indashyikirwa mu guteza imbere siyanse, uburezi bw'inyangamugayo kandi ziyemeje kugira uruhare mu mibereho, ubukungu, ikoranabuhanga no guhugura abanyamadini.\"\nIndangagaciro.\nAbayobozi biyi kaminuza batangaza ko izi ari indangagaciro zashyizweho hakurikijwe ibikenewe ku isoko ry'umurimo kandi ko bigomba gutozwa buri munyeshuri wese ugeze muri iyi kaminuza gatolika \"Imiyoborere myiza: kwihesha agaciro, ubuyobozi bwiza, kubahiriza uburenganzira bwa muntu, kwihanganirana, guteza imbere uburinganire, ubwenegihugu no gukunda igihugu, ubwisanzure mu masomo: Inshingano z\u2019imibereho ya mwarimu, ibitekerezo bifite intego, Icyerekezo cy\u2019abaturage cyiza, Icyerekezo gikenewe ku isoko: guhanga udushya mu ikoranabuhanga\"\nAmasomo.\nKaminuza Gatolika y'u Rwanda (CUR) igizwe n'amashami atandatu afite icyicaro ku i TABA, Akarere ka Huye, na Alexis KAGAME Campus, Save, Akarere ka Gisagara. CUR itanga impamyabumenyi ihanitse yemewe mu Rwanda nahandi hose ku isi mu masomo atandukanye CUR itanga amasomo y'uburezi ndetse nizindi serivisi nyinshi ku abanyeshuri harimo isomero, hamwe na serivisi z'ubuyobozi. Ifite gahunda eshatu: Gahunda yumunsi, Gahunda ya nimugoroba, gahunda ya wikendi. Itanga amasomo muri gahunda yimyaka 4 cyangwa 5 iganisha kuri \"Bachelors degree\" hamwe nigihembo giciriritse kuburyo bukurikira: \nMu mwaka wa 2017 Abanyeshuri 375 bigaga mu mashami atandukanye muri Kaminuza Gatolika y\u2019u Rwanda ikorera i Save mu karere ka Gisagara ikanagira Campus ku Itaba mu mujyi wa Butare, bahawe impamyabumenyi z\u2019icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza"}
