{"id": "9966", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9966", "title": "Akazi Kanoze (AKA)", "text": "Akazi Kanoze ni Umushinga wafunguwe muri 2015 numuryango wa USAID ufite intumbero yo gufasha urubyiruko mu kwihangira imirimo Ukaba ushyurwa mu bikorwa nikigo cya EDC(Education Development Center)\nAmateka.\nNyuma y'uko umushinga w'abanyamerika witwa USAID uteye inkunda umushinga AKAZI Kanoze watangiye ufasha urubyiruko guhera mu mwaka wa 2015, aho bafashije urubyiruko rutandukanye mu bijyanye no kwiteza imbere ndetse no kubongerera ubumenyi n'ubushobozi mu bikenewe ku masoko. Akazi kanoze katangiranye n'urubyiruko rurenze ibihumbi bibiri harimo abahungu n'abakobwa, umusaruro byatanze nuko mirongo itandatu kwijana by'urubyiruko rwahuguwe babonye imirimo mu bigo bitandukanye hano mu Rwanda.\nKuva yashingwa aka kazi yagiye ifasha cyane urubyiruko mu kubahugura mu bigendanye no kumenya ibikenewe kw'isoko ry'umurimo, kubona igishoro n'uburyo wakibyaza umusaruro, kwihangira imirimo, ubuvugizi ndetse n'ibindi bikorwa bitandukanye bigamije kongerera urubyiruko ubushobozi. Benshi mubafashishwe cyane nakazi kanoze harimo abakobwa bagera ku munani kwijana bahawe akazi nabandi badamu batabonye amahugurwa\nImbogamizi.\nAkazi kanoze n'umuryango watangiriye mu Rwanda washyizweho cyangwa watekerejweho kubw'ibibazo n'imbogamizi byagaragaraga muri sosiyete nyarwanda harimo nkuko mirongo ine kw'ijana(40%) ryabatuye igihugu cy'u Rwanda n'urubyiruko ruri hagati y'imyaka 14-35 y'ubukure. Abarenga ibihumbi bibiri barangiza amashuri yisumbuye buri mwaka naho abarenga ibihumbi mirongo icyenda bajya mu mashuri yigisha ubumenyi ngiro mu Rwanda (TVET School) nyuma yibi byosehakomeza kubaho ikibazo cy;ubushomeri kiri ku kigera cya mirongo itandatu na gatanu kw'ijana (65%) mu Rwanda. Biciye mu bufatanye na minisiteri y'uburezi, akazi kanoze kafashije urubyiruko rwinshi mu kubongerera ubumenyi ndetse n'ubushobozi kugirango batange umusanzu n'imbaraga zabo mw'iterambere ry'igihugu. \nUmusaruro.\nAkazi kanoze yatanze umusaruro cyane aho kugeza ubu bamaze gufasha barenga ibihumbi magana biri na makumyabiri (220,000) bakaba barabonye amahugurwa abaha ubumenyi ndetse anabategurira kubona ubushobozi bwo guhangana kwisoko ry'umurimo, cyane ko benshi barangizaga amashuri bakaba abashomeri,Akazi kanoze yahinduye ayo mateka ifasha benshi kwitezaimbere. Akazi kanoze yafatanije na minisiteri y'uburezi mu guhindura integanyanyigisho mumashuri y'isumbuye zifasha abanyeshuri kurangiza kwiga biteguye guhangana nabandi ku isoko ry'umurimo, ibi bikaba byaratangiye muri 2016. Sibyo gusa kandi abanyeshuri bashyizwe mu matsinda yo kwizigamira no kugurizanya aho ubu bafite amatsinda arenga magana atatu na mirongo inane natatu (383) abarenga magana inani bakaba bayabamo buri musi ndetse bakaba bamaze kwizigamira arenga ibihumbi cumi nikenda byamadorari ($19,000), uru rubyiruko rwose rufite intumbero yo kwitegura akazi, kuko akazi gatanga ubuzima!"}
{"id": "9967", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9967", "title": "NEP Kora wigire", "text": "NEP (National Employment Program) Kora wigire ni gahunda yatangijwe na leta y'u Rwanda, igamije guteza imbere urubyiruko mu kwihangira imirimo idashingiye kubuhinzi hibandwa cyane ku rubyiruko, abagore, n'abafite ubumuga\nAmateka.\nNEP Kora wigire, Yashizweho mu mwaka wa 2014, ikaba ari gahunda ya leta, ikora muburyo bwo kuyobora, gutanga inama ndetse no gutanga umusaruro. NEP kora wigire ni ihuriro ry'ibigo byinshi bigamije gutanga amakuru yo gutegura imyuga, amakuru n'amahugurwa mu bijyanye no gushakisha akazi hamwe n'izindi nkunda z'ubujyanama zishobora kuvamo cyangwa kubyara akazi. Ibigo byambere bya NEP byashyizwe mu mugi wa Kigali, Akarere ka Musanze hamwe n'Akarere ka Huye. NEP Kora wigire nurubuga rwashyizweho n'Ikigo gishinzwe iterambere mu Rwanda (RDB) kugirango bagere kuri benshi bifashishije ikorana buhanga\nIbyagezweho.\nNyuma y'imyaka itanu NEP Kora wigire yagize umumaro cyane, aho yafashije urubyirko mu kongera ubumenyi no kunoza ibyo bakora biciye muri gahunda ya Made in Rwanda, NEP kora wigire ikaba yaratanze amahugurwa mu bigo bitandukanye by'imyuga iyaha urubyiruko mu bice bitandukanye harimo ububaji, guteka no kwakira abashyitsi,ubwubatsi, gusudira ndetse n'ubukanishi.\nIntumbero.\nNEP Kora wigire ni imwe muri gahundaza leta zitezweho kuzamura umubare w'urubyiruko n'abagore rw'ihangira imirimo idashingiye kubuhinzi kugera kuri (75%) abarangije aya mahugurwa bahambwa inguzanyo zo kubafasha gushyira mubikorwa imishinga yabo aho babasonera kuva kuri 20% kugera kuri 50% bitewe n'ingano y'inguzanyo kandi bagashobozwa kubona ingwate biciye muri BDF. Intego ya kabiri ya NEP kora wigire nuguteza imbere umuco wo kwihangira imirimo ndetse n'imishinga mito cyangwa iciriritse ikabasha gushyigikirwa"}
{"id": "9968", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9968", "title": "Harambee youth employment accelerator", "text": "Harambee n'umuryango udaharanira inyungu ufite uburambe bwinshi mu gushaka ibisubizo n'udushya dushobora gukemura ikibazo cy'uushomeri kwisi yose uhereye mu Rwanda no muri Afurika. \nIbyo Bakora.\nHarambee ni ikigo cyashyiriweho gukemura ibibazo cy'ubushomeri cyari cyugarije urubyuruko cyane cyane rurangije kaminuza; hifashishijwe ikoranabuhanga, ubufatanye ndetse no guhanga udushya kugirango bareme ibisubizo bifatika birandura ubushomeri mu rubyiruko. Harambe akaba ari ikigo kimaze imyaka irenga icumi kikaba gikorera mu Rwanda no mugihugu cya afurika yepfo. Mu Rwanda gikorera kuri maison de gene kimisagara.\nAmahugurwa atangwa na Harambee.\nHarambee itanga amahugurwa ku bantu bose bashaka akazi bari hagati y'imyaka cumi n'umunani kugeza kuri mirono itatu n'itanu(18-35); Harambee itanga amahugurwa kubantu bashaka kwihugura mu kuvuga ururimi rw'icyengereza, kwiga gukoresha mudasobwa neza, kwihugura muburyo umuntu ategura ikizamini cy'akazi"}
{"id": "9969", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9969", "title": "Rwakabamba silas", "text": "Pros,Dr Silas Rwakabamba.\nni umunyarwanda wavukiye mugihugu cyabaturanyi cya Tanzaniya ndetse aba arinaho yigiye amashuriye.\nyize kandi muri Kaminuza ya Leeds mugihugu cy'Ubwongereza ari naho yize ibijyanye nubuhanga muri\nBsc mu mwaka wi 1971 na PHD MU 1975 nyuma yaho kandi Prof Dr Rwakabamba yaje gusubira mu gihugu\ncya Tanzaniya aho yinjiye nku mwarimu muri Kaminuza ya Daar es alam mwishami ry'ubwubatsi.\nIbindi.\nProf Dr Rwakabamba Silas yabaye kandi umuyobozi mukuru wikigo cy'ubumenyi nikorana buhanga cy Kigali\nageze mu Rwanda kandi yabaye umuyobozi mukuru wa kaminuza nkuru yu Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2006\nnyuma yaho kandi mu mwaka wa 2013 yagizwe minisitiri wibikorwa Remezo muri guverinoma yu Rwanda\nmuri 2014 yabaye kandi Minisitiri w'uburezi mu Rwanda kugeza\nIbishya.\nprof Dr Rwakabamba kandi kubera ubushobozi nubuhanga yatoranyijwe na leta y' igihugu\ncy'ubwongereza nkuwahagararira kaminuza yabo mu Rwanda Coventry university bitezeho ko\nkubushobozi bwe nububasha ndetse nibitekerezo bye nkumuntu ushoboye bizongerera cyane itsinda \nryiyo Kaminuza ya coventry gusobanukirwa no kubaka umubano mu bihugu bya Afurika yo munsi y'ubutayu bwa sahara\nImirimo.\nProf Dr Rwakabamba Silas yetzweho muri manda yiwe muriyi Kaminuza azateza Imbere ubucuruzi mu Karere akoresheje\nubunararibonye afite ndetse nubu menyi n'urusobe Rwitumanaho\nAmavuko.\nProf Dr Silas Rwakabamba yavutse mu mwaka wi 1947 avikira mugihugu cy'abaturanyi cya Tanzaniye \nnkuko twabisomye haruguru bivugwa ko ari naho yize mbere yuko ajya mubwongereza"}
{"id": "9971", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9971", "title": "DOT Rwanda", "text": "DOT Rwanda ni umuryango ukorera mu Rwanda udaharanira inyungu ufite inkomoko mu igihugu cya Canada, Ibikorwa by'uyu muryango ku isi byatangijwe na Madamu Janet Longmore muri 2001 ubwo yatangiraga kumugaragaro uyu muryango ufasha urubyiruko guteza imbere ibikorwa byabo by'ubucuruzi bigamije iterambere aho muri Canada. Uyu muryango wamenyekanye ku isi nka Digital Opportunity Trust (DOT) watangiye ibikorwa byo gufasha urubyiruko gushyira mu ibikorwa imishinga ifite udushya no guhindura sosiyeti nziza mu Rwanda uhashyira mu mwaka wa 2010, ubwo wageraga mu Rwanda bwa mbere witwa DOT Rwanda. uyu muryango mu Rwanda uhagarariwe na madamu Violette Uwamutara ndetse akaba ari na African Region Advisor. \nAmateka.\nDOT Rwanda nyuma yo kugera mu Rwanda yatangiye ibikorwa bitandukanye byiganjemo ibyo guteza imbere imibereho myiza y'urubyiruko binyuze muri gahunda zitandukanye ifatanyije na Minisiteri y'ikoranabuhanga mu Rwanda (MINICT) na Minisiteri y'urubyiruko (Miniyouth), zimwe muri izo programs; intore mu Ikoranabuhanda, Start up, Reach up, Innojo, Digital ambassador, Daring to Shift, Gera ku ntego, Girl street, nizindi. DOT Rwanda ikorana n'urubyiruko, abikorera, guverinoma, n\u2019imiryango iharanira inyungu z'abaturage n'iterambere rigamije kubageza ku cyerekezo cy'iterambere no gutinyuka guhanga udushya. Mu mwaka wa 2012 DOT Rwanda niho yabaye umufatanyabikorwa wa Minisiteri y'urubyiruko nkuko bivugwa na minisitiri Honorable Rose mary Mbabazi ufite urubyiruko mu inshingano ze ni mu ijambo yagejeje ku abantu bari bitabiriye isabukuru y'imyaka icumi DOT Rwanda imaze ikorera mu Rwanda kuwa 31 Werurwe 2021. Umuyobozi wa DOT ku isi Janet Longmore yashimiye abayobozi b'igihugu ndetse anavugako yishimiye impinduka DOT Rwanda yagize mu iterambere ry'abanyarwanda mu myaka 10 Ishize yagize ati \" amajyambere amaze gugerwaho kandi ikigaragara kuri njye nuko ingaruka za DOT Rwanda zagize uruhare runini muri societe yu Rwanda\", kuri uwo munsi niho hashyizwe k'umugaragaro program nshya ya Daring to Shift igamije kongerera ubushobozi urubyiruko rukora ubucuruzi butandukanye aho izajya ifasha abakobwa cyangwa abagore ku kigero cya 70% ndetse n'abagabo 30% ariko batarengeje imyaka 35 yubukure. Mu myaka 10 gusa DOT Rwanda yashyizeho ihuriro rikomeye kandi rishya ry\u2019abanyeshuri 821 barangije muri porogaramu zitandukanye; abambasaderi b'ikoranabuhanga, abayobozi b\u2019abaturage, hamwe n\u2019abashya mu mibereho, bahaye imbaraga bagenzi babo ndetse n\u2019abaturage.\nIbyagezweho.\nDOT Rwanda yahuguye urubyiruko yibanda ku kuzamura ubukungu burambye kuva mu 2010. Urubyiruko n\u2019abagore barenga 62.000 mu Rwanda bitabiriye amahugurwa yo kongerera urubyiruko ubushobizi mukuyobora (youth leadership), kwihangira imirimo, na gahunda zo guhanga udushya. Binyuze muri iki gikorwa, Abanyarwanda 109.000 (50%by'abagore) muri rusange bahawe ubumenyi bwa digitale, kwihangira imirimo no kuyobora, kwihangana, hamwe n\u2019imiyoboro kugira ngo babone umutekano kandi batange imibereho myiza kandi bagire uruhare mu iterambere ry\u2019abaturage \nMuri Werurwe 2021, DOT Rwanda yatangije Daring to Shift (D2S) umushinga wimyaka ine ushyira abakobwa bakiri bato murwego rwo gukura kwuzuye. Uyu mushinga uzagaragaramo urubyiruko 7,650 (abakobwa 70% bakiri bato) bafite hagati yimyaka 18 na 35 bayobora ibikorwa byiterambere byiterambere ryabo mumiryango yabo hejuru yinkingi eshatu; 1) Gutezimbere ubucuruzi binyuze muguhuza ibikoresho nubuhanga bushya bwa digitale, (2) Gukoresha binyuze muri Digital \nKuwa 17 Ugushyingo 2021 ba rwiyemezamirimo 40 ba Aspiring Social Entrepreneurs (abagore 31 n'abagabo 9) baturutse mu turere 20 bahawe ikigega cya prototyping hamwe na Digital Opportunity Trust (DOT) Rwanda, bikaba biteganijwe ko bizabafasha gufungura amahirwe mashya mbere yo kwinjira ku isoko\nAkazi.\nDOT Rwanda itanga akazi k'urubyiruko rw'abakobwa cyangwa abagore bakiri bato ndetse n'abagabo batarengeje imyaka 35 y'ubukure biciye muri program zayo zitandukanye."}
{"id": "9973", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9973", "title": "Jean Claude MUHIRE", "text": "Muhire Jean Claude Ni rwiyemezamirimo ukiri muto ukomoka mu Rwanda ufite uburambe burenga imyaka itanu (5) mu guharanira iterambere ry'abaturage cyane cyane yibanda ku kubaka amahoro, uburezi bw'abana no kubavuganira. Jean Claude ni umuyobozi mukuru w'ikigo kidashingiye ku nyungu Love the Kids Rwanda Orgranization (LKRO) akaba ari nawe wagishinze.\nAmateka.\nJean Claude Muhire nyuma yo kubura maman we ku myaka 12 gusa ntagire n'amahirwe yo kubona papa we, yakuranye na nyirakuru utari ufite ubushobozi bwo kumwitaho bituma ahura n'ibizazane mu mikurire ye nkabandi bana ndetse yavutse ari ikinege; ibi byatumye akura afite intego yo gufasha abana bo kumuhanda akabakura mu buzima bwo kuba mayibobo, akabahindurira ubuzima biciye mu kigo Love the kids Rwanda Organization. Muhire n'umunyarwanda uharanira amahoro, Umukinnyi wa filime yitwa \"LIZA\" ivuga kwihohoterwa abana babakobwa bakunda guhura naryo ndetse n'umwanditsi w'ibitabo. Muhire mu mwaka wa bibiri na makumyabiri (2020) basanze imyiko ze zose zarashegeshwe zitagishoboye gukora aho zari zigeze kukiciro cya nyuma iyo atabona umutabara yari gupfa, yaje guhambwa impyiko n'umukunzi we ndetse waje kuba umugore we muri 2020 witwa Uwera Ingabire Marie Reine.\nIkigo Love the Kids Rwanda (LKR).\nLKRO ni ikigo gifasha abana bimfubyi cyane cyane abana bo mu muhanda cyangwa batagira kivurira kibaha amahirwe ibyo bakeneye mu mikurire yabo ngo batange umusaruro ndetse bagere ku nzozi zabo. Iki kigo cyatangiye muri 2015 gitangirana abana cumi n'abarindwi (17), aho kugeza ubu bafite ijana na mirongo itanu nabatatu(153) baturuka mu miryango itifashije ndetse ibayeho nabi muri sosiyete nyarwanda babaha amafaranga y'ishuri, ibikoresho by'ishuri harimo imyambaro y'ishuri, amakaye, amakaramu, ibikoresho by'isuku n'ibindi kuva mumashuri y'incuke kugeza mu mashuri y'isumbuye. Iki kigo cyabonye abafatanya bikorwa benshi harimo umushinga 250 effect, umushinga udaharanira inyungu ufasha abana batishoboye, harimo ibigo byabihaye Imana ndetse nabantu kugiti cyabo bumva ko kuberaho abandi ari inshingano ya buri wese. \nIbihembo y'atsindiye.\nJean Claude Muhire yatsindiye ibihembo byinshi harimo African award leader of the year 2016, Global dialogues context international winner 2015,World of children hero award nominee 2018,Queens young leader highly commended runner-up 2016, nibindi byinshi\nIbindi wareba.\nJean Claude interview with Radio Rwanda \nLiza Film yanditswe ikanasohorwa na Jean Claude "}
{"id": "9977", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9977", "title": "Romain Murenzi", "text": "Murenzi Romain yavukiye mu Rwanda mu mwaka 1959 Afite ubwenegihugu bwa America, ni umuhanga mu isomo ry'ubugenge (Physics), yahoze ari minisitiri w'ubumenyi (science) mu Rwanda. \nAmashuri.\nAfite impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza yakuye mu Burundi mu 1982. Mu mwaka 1986 yahawe impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu cya Kaminuza (Master) muri Physics muri Kaminuza Gatolika ya Louvain () mu Bubiligi maze mu mwaka 1990 ahakura impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga.. Muri 2013 yabonye impamyabumenyi ihanitse mu by'amategeko mu ikoranabuhanga n'itumanaho muri kaminuza ya (UK).\nAmateka y'akazi.\nMurenzi yabaye umuyobozi mukuru wa TWAS (The World Academy of Sciences), muguteza imbere siyanse mu bihugu bikiri mu nzira y'amajyambere i Trieste, mu Butaliyani. Yatangiye gukora kuri uwo mwanya kuva muri mata 2011 kugeza Gicurasi 2016. Nyuma yamaze amezi 14 ari umuyobozi w'ishami ry'ubumenyi na politiki no kongera ubushobozi \"Natural Sciences sector for UNESCO in Paris\" mu Bufaransa, yagarutse ku mirimo ye nk'umuyobozi mukuru wa TWAS muri Nzeri 2017.\nMurenzi yabaye umwarimu w'ubugenge muri kaminuza ya (USA) kuva 1993 kugeza 2001, akaba n'umuyobozi w'ishami ry'ubugenge kuva 1999 kugeza 2001. Muri 2001, perezida w'u Rwanda, Paul Kagame yamugize Minisitiri w'uburezi, ubumenyi, ikoranabuhanga, ubushakashatsi n'itumanaho. Kuva muri Werurwe 2006 kugeza Nyakanga 2009, yabaye minisitiri mu biro bya Perezida ushinzwe ubumenyi, ikoranabuhanga, ubushakashatsi n'itumanaho. Nk'uko urubuga rwa rubitangaza ngo Minisitiri Murenzi yagize uruharinmuguteza imbere ubumenyi bwa siyansi mu gihugu.Ku rwego mpuzamahanga, hamwe nabandi bahanga nka na,yashyigikiraga umwuga w'abashakashatsi bakiri bato muri Siyanse\nMu mwaka wa 2009, yavuye mu Rwanda ajya kuba umuyobozi w'ishyirahamwe ry'abanyamerika rishinzwe guteza imbere Ubumenyi () ikigo cy'ubumenyi, ikoranabuhanga n'iterambere rirambye, ryibanda cyane cyane ku bihugu biri mu inzira y'amajyambere. Yatorewe kuba umwe mubagize TWAS mu 2005 n\u2019ishuri rikuru ry\u2019ubumenyi nyafurika (African Academy of Sciences) muri 2012. Yabaye kandi umwarimu wasuye muri kaminuza ya. Ubushakashatsi bwa siyansi bwa Murenzi bwibanze ku gushyira mu bikorwa imiyoboro myinshi ikomeza ihinduka (Quantum mechanics); gutunganya amafoto n'amashusho, siyansi n'ikoranabuhanga."}
{"id": "9979", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9979", "title": "Domitilla Mukantaganzwa", "text": "Domitilla Mukantaganzwa (yavutse ku wa 11 Ugushyingo 1964) ni umunyamategeko w'Umunyarwandakazi. Ni Perezida w'Urukiko rw'Ikirenga rw'u Rwanda kuva ku wa 3 Ukuboza 2024.\nMbere yaho, Domitilla Mukantaganzwa yayoboye Urwego rw'Igihugu rushinzwe Inkiko Gacaca kuva mu 2003 kugeza mu 2012. Kuva mu 2019 kugeza mu 2024, yari Perezida wa Komisiyo y'u Rwanda ishinzwe ivugururwa ry'amategeko.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nDomitilla Mukantaganzwa yavutse ku wa 11 Ugushyingo 1964. Yavukiye i Kimihurura, mu Karere ka Gasabo, mu Mujyi wa Kigali.\nYatangiye amashuri abanza mu 1971, muri Ecole Primaire de Kacyiru. Yize icyiciro rusange cy'amashuri yisumbuye muri Notre Dame de Lourdes de Byimana. Iri shuri ubu riri mu Karere ka Ruhango. Yize icyiciro cya kabiri muri Lyc\u00e9e Notre-Dame de C\u00eeteaux i Kigali. Yahize ubukungu.\nMu 1983, Domitilla Mukantaganzwa yatangiye kwiga amategeko muri Kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda. Yahavanye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu mategeko. Nyuma yaho, yabonye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya gatatu (Master's) mu by'amahoro n'ububanyi n'amahanga. Yayikuye muri Hekima University College, muri Kenya. Yanize muri Institute of Legal Practice and Development (ILPD) mu Rwanda.\nUmwuga.\nMu 1987, Domitilla Mukantaganzwa yatangiye akazi ka Leta. Yabaye Burugumesitiri wungirije wa Komini y'Umujyi wa Nyarugenge. Yakoze kandi mu by'amategeko muri Minisiteri y'Ubutegetsi bw'Igihugu no muri Minisiteri y'Ubuhinzi.\nNyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, yabaye Umuyobozi Mukuru muri Minisiteri y'Imibereho Myiza n'Umurimo. Nyuma yaho, yakoreye UNICEF. Yakurikiranaga ibibazo by'abana batari kumwe n'ababyeyi babo. Mu 1999, yinjiye muri Komisiyo y'Itegeko Nshinga n'Amategeko. Iyo komisiyo yateguye Itegeko Nshinga rya 2003.\nMu Kwakira 2003, Domitilla Mukantaganzwa yagizwe Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa w'Urwego rw'Igihugu rushinzwe Inkiko Gacaca. Inkiko Gacaca zaciye imanza za Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi. Yakoze uwo murimo kugeza Inkiko Gacaca zisoje imirimo yazo mu 2012. Mu 2009, Inkiko Gacaca zari zimaze gusuzuma amadosiye arenga miliyoni imwe.\nMu Kuboza 2019, Domitilla Mukantaganzwa yagizwe Perezida wa Komisiyo y'u Rwanda ishinzwe ivugururwa ry'amategeko. Yasimbuye Aimable Havugiyaremye.\nKu wa 3 Ukuboza 2024, Perezida Paul Kagame yamugize Perezida w'Urukiko rw'Ikirenga. Yabaye kandi Perezida w'Inama Nkuru y'Ubucamanza. Yasimbuye Faustin Nteziryayo. Yarahiriye uyu murimo ku wa 12 Ukuboza 2024. Visi Perezida w'Urukiko rw'Ikirenga ni Alphonse Hitiyaremye.\nDomitilla Mukantaganzwa yashakanye na Th\u00e9oneste Mutsindashyaka. Th\u00e9oneste Mutsindashyaka yigeze kuba Minisitiri w'Uburezi n'Umuyobozi w'Umujyi wa Kigali."}
{"id": "9980", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9980", "title": "Th\u00e9oneste Mutsindashyaka", "text": "Th\u00e9oneste Mutsindashyaka (yavutse mu 1963) ni umunyapolitiki w'Umunyarwanda. Yabaye umuyobozi w'Umujyi wa Kigali kuva mu 2001 kugeza mu 2006. Yabaye kandi Guverineri w'Intara y'Iburasirazuba. Nyuma yaho, yabaye Umunyamabanga wa Leta muri Minisiteri y'Uburezi.\nKuva mu 2013 kugeza mu 2018, Th\u00e9oneste Mutsindashyaka yayoboye RECSA. Mu 2020, yagizwe Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda muri Repubulika ya Kongo.\nUbuzima.\nUbwana n'amashuri.\nTh\u00e9oneste Mutsindashyaka yavutse mu 1963 i Kigali. Yize amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye i Kigali. Yakomereje kaminuza i Butare. Afite impamyabumenyi mu mibare.\nUmwuga.\nNyuma ya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994, Th\u00e9oneste Mutsindashyaka yinjiye mu buyobozi bwa Leta. Yabaye umunyamabanga mukuru muri minisiteri eshatu. Iya mbere ni Minisiteri y'Urubyiruko, Umuco na Siporo, kuva mu 1994 kugeza mu 1996. Nyuma yaho yakoze muri Minisiteri y'Umutekano mu Gihugu.\nMuri Werurwe 2001, Th\u00e9oneste Mutsindashyaka yatorewe kuba umuyobozi w'Umujyi wa Kigali. Yabonye amajwi 593. Uwo bari bahanganye yabonye amajwi 56.\nKu wa 1 Mutarama 2006, yabaye Guverineri w'Intara y'Iburasirazuba. Muri Mata 2008, yashyikirije uyu mwanya Ephraim Kabaija.\nMuri Werurwe 2008, yagizwe Umunyamabanga wa Leta muri Minisiteri y'Uburezi. Yari ashinzwe amashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye. Muri Nyakanga 2009, yavanywe muri Guverinoma. Ubushinjacyaha bwamukoreye iperereza. Iryo perereza ryari rijyanye n'isoko ryatanzwe mu Ntara y'Iburasirazuba. Mu 2010, yagizwe umwere.\nMu 2013, Th\u00e9oneste Mutsindashyaka yagizwe Umunyamabanga Nshingwabikorwa wa RECSA. RECSA ni ikigo cy'akarere gishinzwe kurwanya ikwirakwizwa ry'intwaro nto. Icyicaro cyayo kiri i Nairobi, muri Kenya. Yavuye kuri uwo mwanya muri Gicurasi 2018.\nKu wa 14 Kanama 2020, Inama y'Abaminisitiri yamugize Ambasaderi w'u Rwanda muri Repubulika ya Kongo. Yasimbuye Jean Baptiste Habyalimana. Muri Mata 2021, yashyikirije kopi z'impapuro zimwemerera guhagararira u Rwanda i Brazzaville. Ahagararira kandi u Rwanda muri Kameruni.\nTh\u00e9oneste Mutsindashyaka yashakanye na Domitilla Mukantaganzwa."}
{"id": "9983", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9983", "title": "INES RUHENGERI", "text": "Ines Ruhengeri ni kaminuza yigenga itanga ubumenyi mu mashami atandukanye. Mu Rwanda ikaba yarashinzwe mu mwaka wa 2003, n'imwe muri kaminuza zo mu Rwanda iherereye mu karere ka Musanze mu ntara y'Amajyaruguru ikaba yigamo abanyeshuri batandukanye bahavoma ubumenyi harimo abanyarwanda n'abanyamahanga. \nAmateka.\nINES Ruhengeri yafunguye amarembo ku mugaragaro tariki ya 17 ugushyingo mu mwaka wa 2003.ikaba itanga impamyabumenyi zitandukanye harimo ikiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza \" bachelor's degree \" n'impamyabumenyi yisumbuyeho y'ikiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza ariyo \" masters degree \" harimo amashami ya siyanse, imisoro, uburezi, icungamari, ikoranabuhanga n'andi mashami atandukanye.\nInes Ruhengeri imaze guha ubumenyi mu mashami yayo atandukanye kuva mu mwaka wa 2003 abanyeshuri barenga ibihumbi birindwi (7000) bahakuye impamyabumenyi zitandukanye. \nIbindi Wamenya.\nAbarimu n\u2019abashakashatsi ba kaminuza yigenga ya INES Ruhengeri bakoze ikoranabuhanga ryiswe \u2018Geodatabase of taxable land\u2019 rigaragaza ubutaka bwa buri karere kose k\u2019igihugu hagamijwe kumenya amakuru yose agaragaza urutonde rw\u2019ubutaka buri mu gihugu busorerwa n\u2019ubudasoreshwa. Ku itariki 11 Ukwakira mu mwaka wa 2019, nibwo hamuritswe iri koranabuhanga mu muhango witabiriwe n\u2019Ubuyobozi bw\u2019Ibigo bitandukanye harimo ubuyobozi bw'ikigo Gishinzwe Imicungire n\u2019Imikoreshereze y\u2019Ubutaka (RLMUA), ikigo gishinzwe Imiturire n\u2019Imyubakire mu Rwanda (RHA) n\u2019ubuyobozi bw'ikigo cy'Imisoro n\u2019Amahoro (RRA).\nImiyoborere ya kaminuza Ines Ruhengeri.\nKaminuza ya Ines Ruhengeri iyobowe na Padiri Dr Hagenimana Fabien, ubuyobizi bwa kaminuza mu nzego zitandukanye bufatanya n'ubuyobozi bw'abanyeshuri mu kugera ku ntego za kaminuza n'iterambere ryayo muri rusange.\nAmasomo.\nIkiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza kigizwe n'amashami akurikira mu rurimi rw'icyongereza \"Undergraduate\"\nIcyiciro cya kabiri cy'impamyabumyenyi ya kaminuza ya Ines Ruhengeri \" postgraduate \" mu cyongereza\nAmashakiro.\nJump to navigationJump to search"}
{"id": "9984", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9984", "title": "Christian University of Rwanda", "text": "Kamunuza ya Gikirisitu y u Rwanda \" Christian university of Rwanda (CHUR) ni kaminuza yigenga ikorera mu gihugu cy u Rwanda Ikaba itanga ubumenye mu mashami atandukanye ikaba ifite abanyeshure bari hagati (10,000-50,000), ikaba iherereye mu ntara ya amajyaruguru mu mujyi wa gitesi.\nAmateka.\nCHUR ni kamunuza nigenga y itorero ry abangirikani ikaba iri kumwanya wa 18 muri kamunuza zo mu Rwanda ikaba iri ku mwanya wa 12811 ku rutonde rwa kaminuza zo ku isi,\nImiyoborere.\nCHUR ifite ubuyobozi bwa akaminuza muri rusange bufatanya nu ubwabanyeshuri mu kugera ku iterambere rya kaminuza \n\"Amasomo\".\nCHUR ifite amasomo atandukanye arimo, aya za siyanse na tekinologi, ubuhinzi,iterambere ry icyaro, uburezi na andi abanyeshuri ba CHUR bavomamo ubumenyi butandukanye \nIbindi wamenya kuri CHUR.\nCHUR ni kaminuza yi genda ya gikiristu ya korega mu Rwanda ubu ikaba yarahagaritwe mu mwaka wa 2020 muri kaminuza zitanga ubumenyi mu gihugu cy u Rwanda. "}
{"id": "9988", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9988", "title": "Kaminuza y' ikoranabuhanga n'ubugeni ya byumba", "text": "Kaminuza y ikoranabuhanga n' ubugeni ya byumba mu magambo y icyongereza ni \"U niversity of Technology and Arts of Byumba (UTAB)\", ni kaminuza yo mu Rwanda itanga ubumenyi butandukanye mu mashami y' ikoranabuhanga n' ubugeni iherere mu ntara y' amajyaruguru mu karere ka Gicumbi.\nAmateka.\nUTAB ni kaminuza y ikoranabuhanga n'ubugeni iherere mu karere ka gicumbi ikaba yarakinguhe amarembo ya abashaka ubumenyi muri mutarama ku wa 26 mu mwaka wa bibiri ni tandatu (2006) ikaba yaritwaga \"Institut Polytechnique de Byumba(IPB)\".\nKu wa 25 ugushyingo 2015 icyahoze cyitwa IPB cyahindutse UTAB hiyongeramo andi masomo ajyanye ni icunga mutungo, uburezi ndetse nayandi iba kamunuza yemeywe mu Rwanda n' icyigo gishinzwe amashuri na za kaminuza mu Rwanda aricyo HEC.\nUTAB ni kaminuza imaze imyaka irenga 10 gitanga ubumenyi mu ikoranabuhanga n ubugeni ku banyeshuri babanyarwanda na abanyamahanga.\nUbuyobozi.\nUbuyobozi bwa kaminuza y ikoranabuhanga n ubugeni ya byumba iyobowe na Prof. Dr Clet NIYIKIZA afatanyije na Nyiricyubahiro Musenyeri Nzakamwita Servilien, Umushumba wa Diyoseze ya Byumba ni izindi nzego za UTAB n' ubuyobozi bwa abanyeshuri.\nAmasomo.\nUTAB itanga amasomo mu byiciro bitandukanye nka \" undergraduate \" icyiciro cya ambere cya kaminuza, icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza aricyo \" postgraduate \" mu rurimi rw' icyongereza na amaso y igihe gito \"short course \" mu rurimi rw' icyongereza \nikiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza hari aya masomo akurikira \" postgraduate \".\nharimo amaosomo y uburezi, ubunzi n ibidukikije \nikiciro cya amasomo yi igihe gito na aya akurikira \"short courses \".\nna andi menshi "}
{"id": "9990", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9990", "title": "Niyitegeka Gratien", "text": "Niyitegeka Gratien yavutse kuwa 25 ugushyingo 1978 akaba ari umukinnyi wa filimi, Urwenya n'ikinamico. mumirimo yihangiye harimo no kuba avuga imivugo akaba n'umusizi w'umunyarwanda\nGratien yabyawe na Ngarukiye thacien na Mukarusharaza Bernadethe,akaba afite impamyabumenyi y'ikiciro cyakabiri cya kaminuza. akaba yaravukiye Mukarere ka Rurindo.\nYiga ibinyabuzima nubutabire murwunge rwamashuri rwa Rurima. Gratien mubuzima busanzwe yaje kwihangira imirimo, akora ibinubyinshi ariko, byose bijyanye nubuhanzi.\nItangiriro ry'e.\nyatangiye guhanga ibihanganobye yiga mu wagatandatu wa mashuri abanza nibwo yatangiye guhimba imivugo nabyenda gusetsa.agezemuwakane w,amashuri y'isumbuye nubwo yakinye ikinamico yitwa\"sirikoreye\",ariwe wakinye yitwa gutyo, yarushwanaga kubumwe n'ubwiyunge.\nicyogihe yaratsinze ahebwa kurwego rw'igihugu.yakuze afite inzozi zokuzambara tigana[inkweto zarizingezweho kera] nokuzaba uwambere kuberako ababyeyibe bahoraga babimubwira kenshi.\nkubernu yatinyaga urushinge nago yarikwifuza kuba muganga.gusa ibyobyose yabigezeho yabaye uwambere ni nkweto za tigana yazambaye agiye kubatizwa. umuryangowe yarawufashije arihira amashuri bashikibe. Gratien azwi cyane nka Seburikoko,Sekaganda, Papa sava na Ngagi. ibi byamuteje imbere nditse abona nibihembo bitandukanye.\nAmashuri yize.\nYize amashuri y'icyiro rusange muri ES-Rutongo, Naho ayisumbuye ayiga muri college ya Rurima mu karere ka Bugesera mw'ishami ry'ubutabire,Nimugihe kaminuza yo Yayize muyahoze ari KIE mu ishami rya BIO-GEO uburezi. Niyitegeka Gratien kandi afite impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya 2 cya Kaminuza muyahoze ari KIE ubu ikaba yarabaye Kaminuza y'u Rwanda ishami rya Remera."}
{"id": "9991", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9991", "title": "Papias Malimba Musafiri", "text": "Papias Malimba Musafiri ni umunyarwanda w'umushakashatsi ndetse akaba ari n'umunyapolitiki, yabaye Minisitiri w'uburezi muri guverinoma y'u Rwanda, kuva ku ya 25 Kamena 2015, asimbuye Prof. Rwakabamba Silas. Mbere yaho Musafiri yari Umuyobozi w\u2019Ishami ry\u2019Ubukungu n\u2019Ubucuruzi (CBE) mu cyahoze ari Ishuri ry\u2019Ubukungu n\u2019Amabanki, SFB, ndetse yari umurezi umaze igihe cy\u2019imyaka 14 mu burezi n\u2019ubushakashatsi.\nAmashuri.\nDr. Papias yabonye impamyabumenyi yikiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu bucuruzi n\u2019icungamutungo (Bachelor of commerce) muri Kaminuza ya Dar-Es-Salaam naho icyiciro cya gatatu (Master) yiga icungamari n'ikoranabuhanga (MBA) ayikura muri Indian yo mu gihugu cy\u2019Ubuhinde, mu gihe impamyabushobozi y\u2019ikirenga yize Ityazabwenge mu by\u2019Ubucuruzi cyangwa Philosophy in Finance muri Vellore Institute of Technology University mu igihugu cy'ubuhinde.\nAmateka y'Akazi.\nMuri 2001, Musafili yagiye akora imirimo itandukanye muri za kaminuza, ubushakashatsi n'ubujyanama Mbere yo gushinga kaminuza y'u Rwanda(UR) muri 2013, yari afite umyanya w'ubuyobozi bukuru mubigo byinshi bigizwe na UR. Yabaye Director of Administration and Human Resources, Dean, Faculty of Management, Vice Rector Academics and Acting Rector, mu bigo by\u2019amashuri makuru. Mbere yo kugirwa minisitiri w\u2019uburezi, yari Umuyobozi w\u2019ishuri rikuru ry\u2019ubucuruzi n\u2019ubukungu (CBE) rya kaminuza yu Rwanda mu cyahoze ari Ishuri ry\u2019Ubukungu n\u2019Amabanki, SFB, ndetse yari umurezi umaze igihe cy\u2019imyaka 14 mu burezi n\u2019ubushakashatsi. yabaye Minisitiri w'uburezi muri guverinoma y'u Rwanda, kuva ku ya 25 Kamena 2015, Mu ivugurura ry\u2019abaminisitiri ryo ku wa 5 Ukwakira 2016, no ku wa 31 Kanama 2017, yagumishijwe muri guverinoma kandi agumana inshingano z\u2019uburezi. Nyuma yatangaje iseswa niy'irukanwa ry\u2019abarimu ba Uganda mu Rwanda, nyuma y\u2019amasezerano yabo yo kwigisha arangiye. Tariki 6 Ukuboza 2017 nibwo Perezida wa Repubulika Paul Kagame yashyizeho Dr Eug\u00e8ne Mutimura nka Minisitiri mushya w\u2019Uburezi asimbura Dr. Papias Musafiri Malimba"}
{"id": "9993", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9993", "title": "Uwamutara violette", "text": "Uwamutara Violette yayoboye DOT Rwanda kuva yashingwa mu mwaka wa 2010. Mbere ya DOT Rwanda yamaze imyaka irindwi muri Ambasade y\u2019u Rwanda i Washington DC, atangira ari umusesenguzi wa politiki maze arazamuka aba umudipolomate ku mwanya w\u2019Umunyamabanga wa mbere. Arangije ubutumwa bwe, yoherejwe muri Minisiteri y\u2019ububanyi n\u2019amahanga ya Kigali, ashinzwe ibihugu bya Aziya na Gicurasi 2007 kugeza Ukuboza 2007.\nAmashuri.\nViolette afite impamyabumenyi y'ikirenga mu buyobozi bwa Leta (Master\u2019s Degree in Public Administration) yibanda ku iterambere mpuzamahanga yakuye muri kaminuza ya Carleton (Carleton university) yakuye mu igihugu cya Canada na Bachelor of Arts mu by'ubukungu no guteza imbere igereranya ryaturutse muri kaminuza ya Trent (Trent university)\nAmateka.\nViolette ni umunyamuryango wa Afrika Leadership Network (ALN) akaba yarahawe igihembo cya Anita Borg Institute Change Agent Award ya Grace Hopper Celebration y'abagore muri Mudasobwa. Muri 2016, Violette yagizwe umwe mu bagore 25 ba mbere b'icyubahiro ba Amazon's Watch Magazine muri Afurika kubera ibikorwa bye byo guteza imbere ubukungu abakobwa n'abagore bakiri bato.Ni umujyanama mu Imbuto Foundation ikigo cyashinzwe na Madamu wa Perezida wa Rwanda na MasterCard Foundation Young Africa Work, kandi agira uruhare mu guteza imbere ubukungu bw\u2019urubyiruko n\u2019abagore ndetse n\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ikoranabuhanga. Kuva Gashyantare 2009 kugeza Ukuboza 2009 yabaye Country Manager wa RAISER RESOURCE GROUP RWANDA, ni ikigo cya Kenya giteza imbere abakozi. Kanama 2000 - Nyakanga 2003 yabaye umusesenguzi wa politiki muri Ambasade ya Repubulika y'u Rwanda, Washington, D.C. Amerika. Kanama 2003 kugeza Nyakanga 2007 yabaye umunyamabanga wa mbere muri Ambasade ya Repubulika y'u Rwanda, Washington, D.C. Amerika.\nIbihembo yahawe.\nMuri 2013 yahawe igihembo na ANITA BORG INSTITUTE cya ABIE CHANGE AGENT AWARD, Iki gihembo cyatanzwe mu rwego rwo gushimirwa ubwitange yagize ku ruhare rw'umugore mu gihe kizaza cy'u Rwanda n'ikoranabuhanga mu itumanaho no guhanga udushya muri Afurika, no guteza imbere abakobwa bakiri bato mu ikoranabuhanga no kubamenyesha amahirwe n'imyuga mishya mu ikoranabuhanga, kwihangira imirimo ndetse no mu mishinga ishinzwe imibereho myiza. \n2014 yahawe igihembo cy'abagore Bakomeye muri Afurika Mubucuruzi na Guverinoma no Kwishimira kuba indashyikirwa mumashyirahamwe (CEO).Iki gihembo cyatanzwe mu rwego rwo gushimirwa ibyagezweho nkuwatsinze mu burezi no mu mahugurwa: Abikorera ku Rwanda mu Kinyamakuru Umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019abagore bakomeye mu bucuruzi no mu bihembo bya Leta."}
{"id": "9994", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9994", "title": "Kerry Uwineza", "text": "Kerry Uwineza n'umunyarwandakazi, ndetse akaba n'umuyobozi mukuru w'iduka ricuruza imyenda Mackenzies Rwanda afatanyije na bagenzi be bane aribo Naomie nishimwe wigeze kuba miss Rwanda muri 2020, kathia Kamali Uwase, Brenda Iradukunda, Pamela Loana Uwase. kerry akaba ari rwiyemezamirimo ukiri muto mu Rwanda\nUwo ariwe.\nKerry Uwineza n'umukobwa ukiri muto wakunze kwitabira amarushanywa menshi yo kujya impaka(debates competitions) ndetse akagenda atsindira n'ibihembo muri ayo marushanywa, amwe yateguwe na Idebate Rwanda ndetse na Aspire debate Rwanda. Inzira yo kuba rwiyemezamirimo yayitangiye akiri muto cyane, afatanyije n'incuti ze bakaba bakoresha imbuga nkoranya mbaga mu gucuruza, no gushaka aba client harimo nko gukora utuvideo dusubiramo indirimbo z'abandi ndetse n'ibindi, bakaba bifashisha cyane urubuga rwa instragram\nImyenda ya ZOI.\nAba bakobwa uko ari batanu bafite iduka ricuruza imyenda yitwa Zoi, akaba ari ijambo ryakuwe mu kigiriki risobanura ubuzima, iyi myenda kandi iba ikozwe mu gitambaro cya satini (satin) cyorohera cyena, akaba ari umwihariko wa Mackenzies Rwanda"}
{"id": "9995", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9995", "title": "Denyse Umuhuza", "text": "Denyse ni umunyarwandakazi, w'umwanditsi w'ibitabo by'abana byinshi harimo Uruhimbi rwa Nyanka, Karisa wa Munyantamati n'ibindi... sibyo gusa ahubwo ari mu bantu bashinze isomero agati library rikorera mu Akarere ka Musanze ndetse akaba ari mu rubyiruko ruharanira uburenganzira bwamuntu ndetse no kurwanya akarengane nihohoterwa rikorerwa abagore.\nUbuzima bwo kwandika.\nDenyse yatangiye kwandika ibitabo by'abana ku myaka cumi n'umunani(18) bikaba byaratewe nuko yakuze atozwa gusoma nawe ageraho arabikunda cyane. Uruhimbi rwa Nyanka nicyo gitabo cya mbere yanditse aho yerekanaga ko abana ba bakobwa bafite ubushobozi n' imbaraga n'ubwiza buturutse imbere muri bo, bibafasha gukemura ibibazo byinshi byugarije isi. Iki gitabo kibigaragaza hifashishijwe inyamaswa. Sibyo gusa ahubwo yaje no kwandika igitabo Karisa wa Munyantamati, kivuga ukuntu abana bikigihe batagishaka gukora bumva bazagira ubukire nkaho bubizaniye cg buvuye mukirere batabukoreye ngo batange imbaraga zabo. Denyse akunda kwandika kubana kandi akunda gutanga ibitekerezo bye ku mbuga nkoranya mbaga akumva icyo abandi babivugaho.\nIsomera Agati Library.\nIsomero Agati library ryatangijwe mu mwaka wa 2018 mu Akarere ka Musanze ritangizwa na Denyse Umuhuza hamwe na bagenzi be batanu bafite intego yo gukundisha abana n'ababyeyi gusoma ndetse no kurema umuco wo gusoma mu banyarwanda. Agati library yatsindiye ibihembo ndetse ibona n'inkunga nyinshi zivuye mu miryango ishyigikira imishinga yo gukundisha abana bato gusoma Agati library ifite ubushobozi bwo kwakira abana barenga ijana (100) ku munsi ndetse bafite nibitabo birenga igihumbi kugeza ubu bakaba bashobora no gusoma bifashishije mudasobwa cyangwa amaterefone agezweho\nUbuvugizi.\nDenyse afite ishyaka n'umuhate wo kuvugira abana b'abakobwa ndetse n'abagore muri rusange, abashishikariza kwigira no gukunda umurimo ndetse no kugira inzozi zagutse mu buzima bwabo. Akaba yarabitangiye aho yafashaga abana b'abakobwa kwigarurira icyizera no kwiyumvamo ubushobozi mu mushinga Ninyampinga. Denyse kandi afite urubuga yandikaho ibitekerezo bye, ubujyanama, ubukangurambaga no gushishikariza urubyiruko gukunda gukora no gutekereza kubyabagirira umumaro."}
{"id": "9996", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9996", "title": "Eduard Mendy", "text": "Edouard Osoque Mendy umukinnyi ukina Umupira wamaguru wabigize umwuga kandi w'umuhanga\nukina mwi kipe ya premier Legue Chersea ndetse akanakina mwikipe y'igihugu cya Senegal\nEdouard Osoque Mendy.\nni umukinyi ukomeye uzwi cyane muri championa nyinshi zitandukanye yamamaye cyane nka nyezamu\nw'ikipe ikomeye muri premier League ariyo Chelsea ndetse n ikipe y'igihugu ya Senegal\nEdouard yavutse kuya 1 Werurwe 1992.\nAmateka.\nEdourad yatangiye umwuga we wo gukina mugihugu cy'ubufaransa aho yakinaga mwishuri rya Le Havre\nnyuma yaho gato aza gusinya amasezerao nk'umukinnyi wabigize umwuga mukiciro cya gatatu muri cherbourg\nmu mwaka wa 2011. nyuma yaho gato Mendy yaje kwerekeza muri Marsceille muri 2014 ubwo yakomeje kwerekana ubuhangabwe\nnku munyezamu ukomeye mu mwaka wa 2020 nibwo yaje gusinya amasezerano mu ikpe ikomeye muri premier league Chelsea\nubwo bamuhayae angana na millioni 22 z'amapawundi muri Championa ye yambere yahise aba umunyezamu wambere\nwumuri Africa ukuniye ikipe ikomeye nka Chelsea.\nIbihembo.\nMendy kandi nyuma yo kwigaragaza muri Chelsea yaje kwegukana izina ry'umunyezamu mwiza wa UEFA\nndetse aba umunyezamu Mwiza wa FIFA mumwaka wa 2021 aribwo yabaga umenyezamu wambere\nwo muri afurika wegukanye ibihembo.nyuma yo kwiyegurira Senegal kandi avuye muri Guinea Bisau \nyabaye umunyezamu mwiza muri championa ya Afurika muri 2019. yafashije kandi igihugu cye gutwara\nigkombe muri 2021 arinabwo yabaga umunyezamu mwiza mwirushanwa."}
{"id": "9997", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9997", "title": "Janet Museveni", "text": "Janet Kainembabazi Museveni yavukiye muri Uganda mu ntara ya Kajara, mu akarere ka Ntungamo kuwa 24 Kamena 1948 kwa Eduard Birori na Madam Mutesi. Yize amashuri abanza kuri Kyamate akomeza n'amashuri yisumbuye mu ikigo cy'abakobwa cya Bweranyange girl's schoolmuri Uganda.\nAkazi yakoze.\nJanet ni umunyapolitiki muri Uganda wabaye Madamu wa mbere wa Uganda kuva mu 1986. yashakanye na Perezida wa Yoweri Kaguta Museveni, babyaranye abana bane. Kuva kuwa 6 Kamena 2016 yabaye minisitiri w'uburezi na siporo mu nama y'abaminisitiri muri Uganda, yabanje kuba Minisitiri w'ibikorwa bya muri guverinoma ya Uganda kuva kuwa 27 Gicurasi 2011 kugeza kuwa 6 Kamena 2016. yabaye kandi umudepite watowe ahagarariye intara ya Ruhaama mu akarere ka Ntungamohagati ya 2011 na 2016. yasohoye igitabo cyivuga k'ubuzima bwe cyitwa \"urugendo rw'ubuzima bwanjye\" (My life's Journey) muri 2011.\nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nJanet Museveni yagiye mubuhungiro mu 1971, ubwo Idi Amin yahirikaga ubutegetsi bwa mu ubutegetsi bwa gisirikari. Yashakanye na Yoweri kaguta Museveni muri Kanama 1973. Igihe ingoma ya Idi Amin yavaga kubutegetsi muri Mata mu 1979, yasubiye muri Uganda ayuye muri Tanzania aho yari atuye m' ubuhungiro n'umugabo we.\nMuri Gashyantare 1981, ubwo Yoweri Museveni yatangizaga intambara y'inyeshyamba \u00a0kurwanya guvernoma ya perezida Obote, Janet Museveni n'abana be bongeye kuba i Nairobi muri Kenya, aho babanaga n'incuti z'umuryango kugeza mu 1983, Mu 1983 bimukiye i muri suwede, yagumyeyo kugeza muri gicurasi 1986, hashize amezi ane Ingabo za Yoweri Museveni zimaze gufata ubutegetsi i Kampara.\nUmwuga.\nJanet Museveni yashinze umuryango wa Uganda uharanira gukiza impfubyi (UWESO), ikigo cy'ubutabazi cyigenga mu mpera za 1986, avuga ko cyatewe n'ubunararibonye bwe nk'impunzi. Yinjiye mu bukangurambaga bwa virusi itera SIDA muri Uganda mu myaka ya za 1990, agirana umubano na Pasteri w'intagondwa kubera uburere bwo kwirinda gusama muri Uganda. Mu Gushyingo 2005, yatangaje ko azashaka icyicaro cy'inteko ishinga amategeko y'intara ya Ruhaama mu matora rusange yo muri Gashyantare 2006. Yaharaniye uwo mwanya n'umukandida mu ihuriro ry\u2019impinduka za demokarasi, Augustin Ruzindana, maze atsinda cyane. Yongeye gutorwa muri Werurwe 2011 indi manda y'imyaka itanu. Ku ya 16 Gashyantare 2009, Janet Museveni yagizwe Minisitiri w\u2019ibikorwa bya Karamoja, n\u2019umugabo we, Perezida Yoweri Museveni. Ku ya 27 Gicurasi 2011, yazamuwe kuba Minisitiri w\u2019ibikorwa bya Karamoja. Ku ya 6 Kamena 2016, nyuma y\u2019uko umugabo we yongeye gutorerwa kuba Perezida, yagizwe Minisitiri w\u2019uburezi na siporo."}
{"id": "9998", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=9998", "title": "Shingiro Aline Sano", "text": "Aline Sano Shingiro uzwi nka ALYN Sano ni Umuhanzi Nyarwanda wamenyekanye cyane mu gihugu cy'u Rwanda ndetse no hanze yacyo kubera gusubiramo indirimbo z'abandi bizwi nka cover ndetse agakora n'ize bwite. \nAline Sano Shingiro.\nUmuhanzikazi ukorera umuziki we mu Rwanda ndetse no hanze yarwo wamamaye cyane kubera gukora cyangwa gusubiramo indirimbo z'abandi ndetse agakora n'ize bwite yamamaye cyane kubera ijwi rye ryiza. \nUrugendo rwa muzika rwa Alyn Sano.\nAline Sano uzwi nka Alyn sano nk'izina akoresha muri muzika avuga ko yatangiye umuziki we muri 2010 ubwo yaririmbaga muri korari y'ikigo cy'Amashuri yizeho aho bita i Gitwe mu Karere ka Ruhango mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo. Yakomeje gukorera umuziki we muri korari yigisha bagenzi be baririmbanaga kugeza mu mwaka wa 2015 ubwo yahinduraga ibitekerezo akava muri korari.\nUko yavuye muri korari.\nAlyn Sano yavuye muri korari muri 2015 ubwo yagiraga ibyago akabura umuvandimwe we mu mpanuka yarangiza agatabarwa n'abavandimwe bo hanze bataririmbanaga kandi we yari yizeye ko abavandimwe be bo muri korari bazamuba hafi, nk'abantu yiyumvagamo kurusha abandi araheba asezera korali ubwo asa nk'ubivumburaho nk'uko abivuga agenda agiye avuga ko muri icyo gihe musaza we mukuru nawe usanzwe ari umutunganya muziki aribwo yamusabye kwiga indirimbo zitandukanye nizo yari asanzwe amenyereye muri korari maze yinjira muri muzika bakunda kwita iyisi atyo. \nIbihangano bya Alyn Sano.\nAlyn Sano yamamaye cyane ku ndirimbo zirimo nka:\n-kontorora\n-naremewe wowe\n-for us\n-Rwiyoborere\n-We the BEST\nNdetse n'izindi nyinshi cyane ko yagiye akorana n'abandi bahanzi benshi batandukanye bo mu Rwanda\nRumuri.\nAlyn Sano yakoze igikorwa cyitwa Listening Party, ku itariki yo ku wa 18 Kamena, aho cyari kigamije ahanini kumvisha abantu bari inshuti ze, abavandimwe ndetse hari n'abandi iyi albumu mbere y' uko ayigaragaza hanze, vuba ku wa Gatanu tariki 23 Kamena, iyi alubumu yayise RUMURI, ni izina rituruka kw\u2019ijambo urebye urumuri, ahanini kwishakamo urumuri bigufasha kwimurikira no kumurikira ahandi wagezeho, ni albumu yitiriye n'ubundi indirimbo yitwa RUMURI, zicuranze mu mujyana ya Kinyarwanda, aho yakozwe na Pastor P, ayiririmba aho ari umukobwa cyangwa ugomba kubera abandi urumuri, ndetse ko ibibazo byose uba ufite ugomba kubyikemurira ukishakamo ibisubizo. Sano avugako icuraburindi riri mu buzima ducamo namenye ko rikurwaho n'urumuri urebye runturukamo. Rero ndi urumuri. Albumu ya Alyn Sano akaba yaratangiye gukorwa muri 2020, harimo indirimbo yari asanzwe zacurangishijwe ibikoresho gakondo, iriho indirimbo 13, hari indirimbo ebyiri harimo izo yahuriyemo n'abandi bahanzi, hariyitwa \u2018Abasamyi ba Nkombo\u2019 ni yo yise Lioness, ndetse na Why yakoranye na KIVUMBI King, Mariya, Inshuti\u2019 yakozwe na Bob Pro, iyi albumu yayikoze nyuma aho hashize y\u2019imyaka itanu atangiye umuziki mu buryo bw'umwunga.\nIbitaramo.\nAlyn Sano yagiye yitabira ibitaramo byinshi bitandukanye mu Rwanda no Hanze yarwo harimo nka Voice Africa ndetse n'ibindi aherutse kandi gukorera igitaramo online ku itariki 27 Gicurasi 2020 mu rwego rwo kubahiriza amabwiriza agenga COVID 19"}
{"id": "10003", "revid": "6702", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10003", "title": "Diane Cyuzuzo", "text": "Diane Cyuzuzo Nirwiyemeza mirimo akaba umwe mubashinze Afriduino.Akaba afite imyaka 25 yamavuko akaba yararangije ikiciro cya kabiri cya Kaminuza muri Kaminuza y\u2019u Rwanda ishami rya Huye, aho yarangije mu gashami ko kwita ku buzima bw\u2019inyamaswa z\u2019agasozi no kuzibungabunga, Zoologie mu rurimi rw\u2019Igifaransa.\nIbihembo.\nRwiyemeza mirimo Diane Cyuzuzo niwe uherutse gutwara igihembo cya hangafest.Ku wa gatandatu, tariki ya 11 Ukuboza, Abanyarwandakazi batanu bashya mu guhanga udushya bazajya bahatanira ibihembo-100.000 by'amadolari y'amarushanwa ya Hanga Pitchfest Nibwo Diane yaje kwegukana amadollari mirongo itanu yamanyamerica.byaribyishimo kuriwe yavuzeko bimutunguye kubonako ariwe utsine ikinda akaba ariwe mukobwa wenyine warurimo muriryo rushanwa.Iyi Gahunda yariyateguwe na Minisiteri y\u2019ikoranabuhanga no guhanga udushya ndetse n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019u Rwanda (RDB) igamije gutanga urubuga rwo kwerekana ba rwiyemezamirimo-ba tekinoloji n\u2019impano zo guhanga baturutse mu gihugu hose."}
{"id": "10007", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10007", "title": "Uburezi muri Turukiya", "text": "Uburezi muri Turukiya bugengwa na gahunda y\u2019igihugu yashyizweho hakurikijwe ivugurura rya Atat\u00fcrk nyuma y\u2019intambara yo kwigenga ya Turukiya. Nuburyo bugenzurwa na leta bugamije kubyara ibyiciro byumwuga ibigo byimibereho nubukungu byigihugu.Kwiga ku gahato bimara imyaka 12. Amashuri abanza nayisumbuye aterwa inkunga na leta kandi kubuntu mumashuri ya leta, hagati yimyaka 6 na 19, naho 2003 kwandikisha abana muriki kigero byari hafi 75%. Amashuri yisumbuye cyangwa ayisumbuye ntabwo ari itegeko ariko arasabwa kugirango noneho atere imbere muri kaminuza. Muri 2012 muri Turukiya hari kaminuza 165. Usibye \"Ishami Ryugurura Uburezi\" (Turkish) muri kaminuza ya Anadolu, kwinjira bigengwa n\u2019ikizamini cy\u2019igihugu, \u00d6SYS, nyuma y\u2019abanyeshuri barangije amashuri yisumbuye bakoherezwa muri kaminuza bakurikije imikorere yabo.\nAmateka.\nNyuma yo gushingwa kwa Repubulika ya Turukiya imitunganyirize ya minisiteri y\u2019uburezi yagiye itera imbere buhoro buhoro kandi ivugururwa n\u2019Itegeko no 2287 ryatanzwe mu 1933. Minisiteri yahinduye amazina inshuro nyinshi. Yaguye muri Minisiteri y\u2019umuco (1935\u20131941) yitwa Minisiteri y\u2019uburezi, urubyiruko, na siporo (1983\u20131989). Kuva icyo gihe yitwa Minisiteri y'Uburezi bw'igihugu. Mbere ya Repubulika, ibigo by'uburezi ntibyari bifite imico y'igihugu. Amashuri yateguwe mumiyoboro itatu itandukanye yari ibigo bihagaritse bitigenga. Iya mbere kandi ikunze kugaragara muri uyu muryango ni amashuri y'uturere na madrase bishingiye ku myigishirize ya Koran ururimi rw'icyarabu no gufata mu mutwe, icya kabiri ni amashuri y'Ivugurura n'amashuri yisumbuye ashyigikira udushya naho uwa gatatu ni amashuri makuru n'amashuri mato hamwe n'amahanga. kwigisha ururimi. Itegeko ryo guhuriza hamwe uburezi, no 430 ryatanzwe ku ya 3 Werurwe 1924. Hamwe n'iri tegeko, imiyoboro itatu itandukanye yarahurijwe hamwe, iyambere yarafunzwe, iya kabiri iratezwa imbere naho iya gatatu ijyanwa mu igenzura no gukurikiranwa na Minisiteri y'Uburezi. Imwe mu ntego zayo kwari ugushyira mu bikorwa ubunyangamugayo mu burezi. Mu itegeko ry\u2019umuryango w\u2019uburezi no 789 ryatanzwe ku ya 22 Werurwe 1926 Minisiteri y\u2019uburezi y\u2019igihugu yahawe inshingano zo gusobanura impamyabumenyi n\u2019uburinganire bw\u2019amashuli ya Leta n\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo yamaze gufungura cyangwa gufungura minisiteri itari Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi y\u2019igihugu.. Iri tegeko ryazanye gahunda nshya nka \"nta shuri rishobora gufungurwa muri Turukiya nta ruhushya rwumvikanyweho na Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi\" cyangwa \" integanyanyigisho zizategurwa na Minisiteri y\u2019Uburezi\". Ibigo byigisha imyuga-tekiniki byahoze biyobowe ninzego zibanze byashyizwe muri minisiteri yuburezi.\nMu 1923-24, hari muri Turukiya, abanyeshuri barenga gato 7000 bo mumashuri yisumbuye, abanyeshuri bagera ku 3.000 bo mumashuri yisumbuye, abanyeshuri bagera kuri 2000 biga tekinike ndetse nabanyeshuri ba medrese 18.000 muribo 6.000 bavuga ko ari abanyeshuri nyabo naho abandi biyandikisha kuba ukuwe mu gisirikare. Muri icyo gihe abaturage ba Turukiya bari miliyoni 13-14.\nAmashuri Abanziriza abanza Muri Turikiya.\nAmashuri abanza abanza akubiyemo uburezi butemewe bwabana hagati y-amezi 36-72 bari munsi y\u2019amashuri abanza. Ibigo by-amashuri abanza, pepiniyeri yigenga byafunguwe nkamasomo yincuke n\u2019amasomo ngiro mubigo byuburezi byemewe kandi bitemewe bifite ubushobozi bwumubiri bukwiye. Serivisi zijyanye n'uburezi bwibanze butangwa na pepiniyeri, amashuri y'incuke, amasomo ngiro yafunguwe mbere na mbere na Minisiteri y\u2019uburezi ndetse no mu bigo by\u2019umunsi, amashuri y\u2019incuke, amazu yita ku bana, amazu yita ku bana n\u2019ibigo byita ku bana byafunguwe na minisiteri zitandukanye. n'ibigo bigamije kwita cyangwa uburezi bishingiye ku biteganywa n'amategeko icumi, sitati ebyiri n'amabwiriza icumi. Mu mwaka w'amashuri 2001\u20132002, abana 256.400 barigwaga naho abarimu 14.500 bakoreshwa mu bigo 10.500 by'amashuri abanza. \nAmashuri Abanza muri Turikiya.\nAmashuri abanza (Turkish) bimara imyaka 4. Amashuri abanza akubiyemo uburezi n'inyigisho bigenewe abana bari hagati ya 6-14, ni itegeko kubenegihugu bose, abahungu cyangwa abakobwa, kandi bitangwa kubuntu mumashuri ya leta. Ibigo by'amashuri abanza ni amashuri atanga imyaka umunani yuburezi budahwema, iyo abayirangije bahabwa impamyabumenyi yibanze. Imyaka ine yambere yishuri ryibanze rimwe na rimwe bita \"Ishuri rya mbere, 1. Urwego \"(Turkish \"Kademe\") ariko byombi nibyo.Hano haribintu bine byingenzi mubyiciro byambere, icya kabiri nicyiciro cya gatatu aribyo; Igiturukiya, Imibare, Hayat Bilgisi (bisobanurwa ngo \"Ubumenyi bwubuzima\") nururimi rwamahanga. Ku cyiciro cya kane, \"Hayat Bilgisi\" asimburwa na Science and Social Studies. Ururimi rwamahanga rwigishijwe mumashuri ruhinduka kuva mwishuri. Igikunze kugaragara cyane ni icyongereza, mugihe amashuri amwe yigisha ikidage, igifaransa cyangwa icyesipanyoli aho kuvuga icyongereza. Amashuri amwe yigenga yigisha indimi ebyiri zamahanga icyarimwe.Mbere ijambo \"ishuri ryisumbuye\" (tr: \"ortaokul\") ryakoreshejwe mumashuri yimyaka itatu kugirango rikurikire imyaka itanu iteganijwe kuri \"Ishuri ryambere\" (tr: \"ilkokul\"). Noneho imyaka ine ya kabiri yuburezi bwibanze rimwe na rimwe bita \"Ishuri ryambere, 2. Urwego \"(Turkish \"Kademe\") ariko byombi nibyo. Amashuri abanza arashobora kuba ayigenga cyangwa ayigenga. Amashuri ya Leta ni ubuntu ariko amafaranga yishuri ryigenga ahinduka kuva mwishuri akajya mwishuri. Indimi z'amahanga zigishwa mu Mashuri Yigenga ubusanzwe ziri ku rwego rwo hejuru ugereranije n\u2019Amashuri ya Leta ku Mashuri Yigenga menshi ahitamo guha abavuga ururimi kavukire nk'abarimu.\nHariho amasomo atanu yibanze kumashuri ya gatandatu na karindwi; Igiturukiya, imibare, siyanse, amasomo mbonezamubano n'indimi z'amahanga. Ku cyiciro cya munani, amasomo mbonezamubano asimburwa na \"Amateka ya Turukiya ya Revolution na Kemalism\" (tr: TC \u0130nk\u0131lap Tarihi ve Atat\u00fcrk\u00e7\u00fcl\u00fck).Mu mwaka w'amashuri 2001\u20132002, miliyoni 10.3 z'abanyeshuri zarigwaga naho abarimu 375.500 bakoreshwa mu mashuri 34,900."}
{"id": "10009", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10009", "title": "Minisiteri y'uburezi mu Rwanda", "text": "Minisiteri y'Uburezi (\"Ministry of Education\", MINEDUC) ni minisiteri ya Leta y'u Rwanda. Ishinzwe uburezi mu gihugu. Icyicaro cyayo kiri i Kigali.\nKuva muri Nzeri 2024, Minisitiri w'Uburezi ni Joseph Nsengimana.\nInshingano.\nInshingano ya MINEDUC ni uguha Abanyarwanda ubumenyi bufasha iterambere ry'igihugu. Itanga uburezi bufite ireme kuri bose. Ubwo burezi bwibanda ku kurwanya ubujiji, ku bumenyi n'ikoranabuhanga, no ku ndangagaciro nziza.\nInshingano z'ingenzi za MINEDUC ni izi:\nMu 2017, MINEDUC yagenzuraga ibigo by'uburezi birenga 13 000. Ibyo bigo byari bifite abanyeshuri barenga miliyoni 3,6 n'abakozi bagera ku 93 000.\nAbayobozi.\nGaspard Twagirayezu yayoboye MINEDUC kuva muri Kanama 2023. Mbere yaho, yari Minisitiri wa Leta ushinzwe amashuri abanza.\nKu wa 11 Nzeri 2024, Joseph Nsengimana yasimbuye Twagirayezu. Mbere yaho, Nsengimana yakoreraga Mastercard Foundation. Yanakoze igihe kirekire muri sosiyete ya Intel. Claudette Irere ni Minisitiri wa Leta muri MINEDUC."}
{"id": "10010", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10010", "title": "Umurenge wa Jarama", "text": "Umurenge wa Jarama ni umurenge wo mu Karere ka Ngoma, mu Intara y'Iburasirazuba y'u Rwanda. Ugizwe n'utugari dutanu.\nMuri 2022, Umurenge wa Jarama wari utuwe n'abaturage 31 122. Abaturage bose baba mu cyaro. Ubuhinzi bw'ibigori, ibishyimbo na soya ni bwo bukorwa cyane.\nMu Rwanda, imitegekere y\u2019igihugu igizwe n\u2019inzego zikurikira: Intara \u2192 Uturere \u2192 Imirenge \u2192 Utugari \u2192 Imidugudu.\nAmateka.\nMu gihe cya Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi, Abatutsi benshi bishwe i Jarama. Ubwicanyi bwatangiye ku wa 7 Mata 1994. Ku wa 9 Mata, Abatutsi barenga 200 bishwe mu masaha make. Bamwe bajugunywe mu byobo. Abandi bajugunywe mu bishanga by'Akagera. Impunzi z'Abarundi zo mu nkambi za Sake na Nemba zafatanyije n'Interahamwe kwica. Nyuma zasubiye mu Burundi. Imibiri yabonetse yashyinguwe mu Urwibutso rwa Jenoside rwa Rukumberi.\nUbuso n'abaturage.\nUmurenge wa Jarama ufite ubuso bwa 91,27 km\u00b2. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2012, wari utuwe n'abaturage 23 861. Mu ibarura rusange ryo mu 2022, wari utuwe n'abaturage 31 122. Muri bo, abagabo bari 14 942, abagore bari 16 180. Abaturage bose baba mu cyaro. Ubucucike ni abaturage 341 kuri km\u00b2.\nUtugari.\nUmurenge wa Jarama ugizwe n'utugari dutanu:\nUbukungu.\nUbuhinzi ni bwo bukorwa cyane mu Murenge wa Jarama. Muri 2024, Akarere ka Ngoma kavuze ko Jarama ari wo murenge weza ibigori byinshi mu karere. Jarama ni na wo wa mbere mu kweza ibishyimbo na soya. Muri uyu murenge hari koperative yitwa KOPAMUJA. Ihinga ibigori, ibishyimbo na soya. Muri 2024, yari ifite abanyamuryango 479. Abahinzi bavuga ko umusaruro w'ibigori wavuye kuri toni 1 ugera kuri toni 5 kuri hegitari. Ibyo babikesha ifumbire n'imbuto z'indobanure.\nIbikorwa remezo.\nMuri 2024, Umurenge wa Jarama wari ufite amashuri atanu y'uburezi rusange.\nAbaturage b'Akagari ka Ihanika bavomaga amazi y'Ikiyaga cya Sake. Ayo mazi yabateraga indwara. Muri Kamena 2024, inzego z'umutekano zabegereje ivomo. Iryo vomo rivana amazi mu Kiyaga cya Sake, rikayasukura. Amazi abikwa mu bigega bibiri bya litiro 20 000. Ishuri rya Umuka na ryo rivoma kuri iryo vomo.\nMuri Gicurasi 2017, Polisi y'u Rwanda n'Akarere ka Ngoma bahaye abaturage 98 bo mu Kagari ka Karenge amashanyarazi akomoka ku mirasire y'izuba."}
{"id": "10011", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10011", "title": "Kaminuza Mpuza mahanga ya Rusizi", "text": "Kaminuza mpuza mahanga ya Rusizi mu magambo y 'icyongereza ni \" Rusizi Interantional University (RUI)\" ni kamunuza itanga ubumenyi Rwanda ikaba ihereye mu ntara y 'iburengeruzuba, akarere ka Rusizi ya kira abanyarwanda na abanyamahanga mu mashami yayo atandukanye, ikaba itanga impamyabumyenyi zitanduka harimo iyi kiciro cya mbere cya kaminuza ni zindi.\nAmateka.\nKamunuza mpuzamahanga ya Rusizi yatangiye mu mwaka wa bihumbi biri na kumi ni ine (2014) itangirana na amashami yayo atandukanye harimo ayubuvuzi bw' abantu nu ubugeneni.\nAmasomo.\nHari amasomo atangwa na kaminuza mpuzamahanga ya Rusizi akurikira:\nUbuyobozi.\nDr Gahutu Pascal ni wari umuyobozi wa kamuniza mpuza mahanga ya Rusizi mu ri 2017 \nIbindi wamenya.\nKamunuza mpuzamahanga ya Rusizi yigeze guhagarikwa mu mwaka w' ibihumbi bibiri na kumi ni itanu nyuma y 'isuzumwa ryari rimazwe gukorwa na minisiteri y uburezi mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "10013", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10013", "title": "Patricie Uwase", "text": "Patricie Uwase ni umu engeniyeri w'umunyarwandakazi kandi akaba n'umunyapolitiki mu gihugu cye mu Rwanda\nakaba ari umwe mu banyapolitiki bakiri bato mu Rwanda kuko yavutse mu mwaka wi 1989\nUwase Patricie.\nUwase Patricie wavukiye mu Rwanda mu mwaka wi 1989 yahoze ari umunyamabanga uhoraho muri Minisiteri y'ibikorwaremezo\nmu Rwanda kurubu akaba yaragizwe State Minister \nImirimo ye.\nPatricie ni umu enjeniyeri ufite akamaro kanini cyane mu buyobozi kuva muri 2015 yabaye kandi umujyanama wa \nwa tekiniki wa Minisitiri w'ibikorwa remezo mu Rwanda mu nshingano ze harimo mu kwibanda cyane ku mirimo imwe\nnimwe ifitiye igihugu akamaro harimo nka Kigali convention center hamwe n'ikibuga kindege mpuzamahanga cya Bugesera\nYakoze kandi muri Comite yigihgu ishinzwe gutegura ibikoresho byo gutwara abantu kuva muri 2016 kugeza 2018 nanone\nPatricie yakoraga nka visi perezida wi inama yikigo gikomeye mu Rwanda nka Rwandair\nAmashuri.\nPatricie Uwase afite Impamyabumenyi ya Bacherol muri sience mubijyane nubwubatsi yakuye mu Ishuri rikuru\nnderabarezi rya Kigali (KIST) afite kandi Impamyabumenyi y ikirenga muri sience yakuye muri kaminuza ya California"}
{"id": "10014", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10014", "title": "UBUREZI BWO MURI AUSTRALIA", "text": "Uburezi muri Ositaraliya bukubiyemo imirenge y'uburezi bwabana bato (precc amashuri) n'uburezi bwibanze (amashuri abanza), hagakurikiraho amashuri yisumbuye (ayisumbuye), amashuri makuru (kaminuza n'amashirahamwe yiyandikisha (RTOs). Kugenga no gutera inkunga uburezi n'inshingano za Leta n'intara, nyamara leta ya Ositaraliya nayo igira uruhare runini. Uburezi muri Ositaraliya ni itegeko hagati y'imyaka ine, itanu, cyangwa itandatu na cumi na gatanu, cumi na gatandatu cyangwa cumi na karindwi, bitewe na leta cyangwa intara n'itariki y'amavukoKu mashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye, amashuri ya reta yigisha abagera kuri 60 kw'ijana vy'abanyeshuri ba Ositaraliya, hafi 40 kw'ijana mu mashure adaharanira inyungu. Ku rwego rwa kaminuza, kaminuza nyinshi zo muri Ositaraliya ni rusange, kandi amafaranga y\u2019abanyeshuri atangwa binyuze muri gahunda yinguzanyo yabanyeshuri aho kwishyura bitangwa mugihe ababerewemo imyenda bageze kurwego runaka. Bishimangiwe na Ositaraliya yujuje ibyangombwa, yashyizwe mu bikorwa mu 1995, Ositaraliya yashyizeho gahunda y\u2019igihugu y\u2019impamyabumenyi, ikubiyemo amashuri makuru, imyuga n\u2019amahugurwa (VET), n\u2019uburezi bushingiye ku ishuri. Ku mashure abanza n'ayisumbuye, integanyanyigisho za Australiya zagiye zitegurwa kandi zishirwa mu ngiro kuva mu 2010. Australiya ni igihugu gitanga uburezi ku isi ku banyeshuri mpuzamahanga, kandi mu 2012 cyashyizwe ku mwanya wa gatatu mu gutanga uburezi mpuzamahanga nyuma y\u2019Amerika n'Ubwongereza. Ositaraliya ifite umubare munini w\u2019abanyeshuri b\u2019abanyamahanga ku muturage w\u2019abatuye isi ku bwinshi, aho abanyamahanga 812.000 biyandikishije muri za kaminuza n\u2019ibigo by\u2019imyuga mu mwaka wa 2019.\nAmabwiriza y'inkunga muri Ositaraliya.\nAmabwiriza, imikorere, n\u2019inkunga y\u2019uburezi ni inshingano za Leta n\u2019intara kubera ko guverinoma ya Ositaraliya idafite ububasha bw\u2019itegeko nshinga bwo gushyiraho amategeko yerekeye uburezi. Nyamara, guverinoma ihuriweho na leta ifasha gutera inkunga amashuri ategamiye kuri leta, ifasha gutera inkunga kaminuza za leta no gutera inkunga amashuri makuru binyuze muri gahunda y\u2019inguzanyo y\u2019abanyeshuri, kandi ikagenga abatanga imyugaInyigisho nyuma y\u2019urwego igengwa n\u2019ibikorwa bya Ositaraliya yujuje ibyangombwa, sisitemu ihuriweho n\u2019ubumenyi bw\u2019igihugu mu mashuri, amashuri y\u2019imyuga n\u2019amahugurwa, hamwe n\u2019amashuri makuru.Ironderero ry\u2019uburezi, ryashyizwe ahagaragara n\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye ryita ku iterambere ry\u2019abantu muri 2018, rishingiye ku mibare yo mu 2017, ryashyize Ositaraliya ku mwanya wa 0.929, ku mwanya wa kabiri ku isi.\nAmashuri Abanza nayi cuke.\nGahunda yamashuri ABANZA na progaramu mbere yincuke muri Ositaraliya ntisanzwe kandi ntabwo ari itegeko. Icya mbere kigaragaza abana benshi bo muri Ositaraliya bagomba kwigira hamwe nabandi hanze yuburere gakondo ni ukurera abana cyangwa itsinda ryababyeyi. nkibi ntibisanzwe bifatwa nkishuri, kuko uburezi bwintangarugero butandukanye nishuri ryibanze muri leta zose nintara, usibye Ositaraliya yuburengerazuba aho amashuri abanza yigishirizwa mubice bigize amashuri abanza na Victoria aho urwego rwa leta, Imikorere ya Victorian Yambere Yiga no Gutezimbere (VEYLDF) ikubiyemo abana kuva bakivuka kugeza kumyaka 8, ikoreshwa namashuri amwe murwego rwigihugu. Muri Queensland, porogaramu zitangira amashuri bakunze kwita Kindergarten cyangwa Pre-Prep kandi mubisanzwe bikorerwa wenyine ariko bikurura inkunga ya leta iyo ikoresheje byibuze amasaha 600 kumwaka kandi bigatangwa numwarimu wiyandikishije. \nUbusanzwe amashuri abanza ayobowe na leta nintara, usibye muri Victoria, Ositaraliya yepfo na New South Wales aho usanga akenshi bayoborwa ninama zaho, amatsinda yabaturage cyangwa imiryango yigenga. Amashuri abanza atangwa kubana bafite imyaka itatu kugeza kuri itanu; umubare w'abitabira uratandukanye cyane muri leta, ariko 85.7% by'abana bitabiriye amashuri abanziriza ishuri. Umwaka mbere yuko umwana agomba kwiga amashuri abanza niwo mwaka nyamukuru w'amashuri abanza. Uyu mwaka uritabiriwe cyane kandi urashobora gufata amasaha make yibikorwa muminsi y'icyumweru.\nAmashuri abanza n'ayisumbuye.\nAmashuri 10.584 yiyandikishije yakoreraga muri Ositaraliya muri 2019, muri yo 7.092 ni amashuri ya leta. Kugeza muri 2019, amashuri ya leta yigishije 65.4% byabanyeshuri bose. Muri 2017, hari abarimu bari munsi ya 282.000 mumashuri abanza nayisumbuye ya Ositaraliya. Mu mashuri atagengwa na Leta, hafi bibiri bya gatatu byari amashuri gatolika. Igice kinini cyibiciro byishuri rya leta byujujwe na leta cyangwa intara bireba. Guverinoma ya Ositaraliya itanga igice kinini c'inkunga ya leta mumashirahamwe adaharanira inyungu, yunganirwa na reta hamwe nintaraAmashuri ategamiye kuri leta, yaba ay'amadini cyangwa ay'isi asanzwe yishyura amafaranga y'ishuri ku gahato n'andi mafaranga. Amashuri ya leta atanga uburezi nta mafaranga y'ishuri ateganijwe, nubwo amashuri menshi ya leta asaba kwishyura amafaranga 'kubushake' kugirango yishyure amafaranga runakaHatitawe ku kuba ishuri ari leta cyangwa itegamiye kuri Leta, rigengwa n\u2019urwego rumwe rw'amasomo. Urwego ruyobowe na Ositaraliya ishinzwe integanyanyigisho, Isuzuma na Raporo. Amashuri menshi asaba abanyeshuri kwambara imyenda yabigenewe. Umwaka w'ishure muri Ositaraliya utangura muri Mutarama ukarangira mu Kuboza."}
