{"id": "10130", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10130", "title": "Itanganzo mpuzamahanga ku bidukikije ryi RIO", "text": "Itangazo rya Rio ku bidukikije n\u2019iterambere ryabyo, rikunze kwitwa itangazo rya Rio, ni inyandiko ngufi yakozwe numuryango w\u2019abibumbye muri1992 hagendewe kubyavuye mu \u201cInama y\u2019ibidukikije n\u2019iterambere\u201d (UNCED), izwi ku izina rya Summit Earth. Itangazo rya Rio ryari rigizwe n\u2019amahame 27 agamije kuyobora ibihugu mu iterambere rirambye. Yasinywe n\u2019ibihugu birenga 175.\nAmateka.\nIhuriro ry\u2019i Rio ryemeje Itangazo, ryabaye kuva ku ya 3 kugeza ku ya 14 Kamena \n1992. Nyuma yaho, amahanga yateranye kabiri kugirango asuzume intambwe imaze guterwa mu gushyira mu bikorwa amahame yinyandiko; mbere mu mujyi wa New York mu 1997 mu nama rusange y\u2019umuryango w\u2019abibumbye, hanyuma i Johannesburg mu mwaka wa 2002. Mu gihe inyandiko yafashije mu kumenyekanisha ibidukikije, ibimenyetso byatanzwe mu mwaka wa 2007 byerekanaga ko ari intego nke zari zaragezweho icyo gihe kubidukikije. \nIbirimo.\nTwifashishije \"imiterere-karemano kandi yuzuzanya y'isi,\" iwacu \", Itangazo rya Rio ritangaza amahame 27. Ihame rya mbere rivuga ko iterambere rirambye ryibanze cyane cyane kubantu, bafite uburenganzira bwo kubaho ubuzima bwiza kandi butanga umusaruro muburyo bwa kamere. Ingingo ya 11 itanga icyifuzo ko ibihugu bizashyiraho amategeko y\u2019ibidukikije. Izindi ngingo zirimo gushyiraho ihame ryo kwirinda, rigomba \"gukurikizwa cyane na leta ukurikije ubushobozi bwabo\" (ihame rya 15), hamwe n\u2019ihumanya ry\u2019ikirere, ibihugu bishishikarizwa gukurikiza aho bigamije inyungu rusange. kandi kutagoreka ubucuruzi n\u2019ishoramari mpuzamahanga (ihame rya 16). Ihame rya nyuma risaba gusohoza andi mahame muburyo bunyuze mu mucyo."}
{"id": "10131", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10131", "title": "Urugomero rwa Ntaruka", "text": "Amateka.\nUrugomero rwa ntaruka rwubatswe mu mwaka wa 1959, rukaba ruherereye mu karere ka Burera, mu murenge wa Kinoni ho muntara y' amajyaruguru. kugeza ubu uru rugomero rutanga amashanyarazi ungana na MW11,5, ndetse amazi urwo rugomero rukoresha mugutanga amashanyarazi,aturuka mu gishanga cya Rugezi.\nAkamaro.\nMu karere ka Burera aho uru rugomero ruherereye, 12,1% -15% by'abaturage nibo bagerwagaho n' amashanyarazi muri 2015,gusa ubuyobozi bwako karere buvugako bushyize imbaraga mukugeza amashanyarazi ku baturage benshi ba Burera, dore ko Ntaruka itanga amashanyarazi menshi cyane agera kuri MW11,5 bityo abanyaburera ntibakwiye kuba mukizima cyangwa ngo bacane itadowa."}
{"id": "10132", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10132", "title": "RWANDA GREEN FUND", "text": "Ikigega cy\u2019Igihugu cy\u2019Ibidukikije-FONERWA ni ikigega gitera inkunga imishinga yo kubungabunga ibidukikije no kurwanya imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe, cyashyizweho na Leta y\u2019u Rwanda mu mwaka wa 2012. Ni kimwe mu mu bigega binini ku mugabane wa Afrika bifite bene izi nshingano. FONERWA ikoresha izina rya Rwanda Green Fund mu bikorwa byayo byo kumenyekanisha ibyo ikora ku bafatanyabikorwa.\nIntego.\nGukusanya, gucunga, gukurikirana \u00a0ndetse no gufasha inzego kubona inkunga n\u2019ubushobozi bwo mu kuzana impinduka mu rwego rwo kubaka iterambere rirambye kandi ridahungabanywa n\u2019ingaruka zikomoka ku mihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe.\nIcyerekezo.\nGufasha u Rwanda gukemura ibibazzo ruhura nabyo muri gahunda yo kurengera ibidukijije no guhangana n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ibihe ndetse no kubaka ubukungu butangiza ibidukikije hagamijwe kwihutisha intego z\u2019igihugu zo kubaka iterambere rirambye.\nFONERWA ikoresha izina rya Rwanda Green Fund.\nFONERWA ikoresha izina rya Rwanda Green Fund mu bikorwa byayo byo kumenyekanisha ibyo ikora ku bafatanyabikorwa.\nNka kimwe mu nzego ziri ku isonga rwo guharanira ko u Rwanda rwubaka ubukungu burambye kandi butabangamira ibidukikije, ibidukikije."}
{"id": "10134", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10134", "title": "IFUMBIRE MVARUGANDA", "text": "Ifumbire mvaruganda ni imwe mu mafumbire akoreshwa mu Rwanda mu buhinzi, yongera umusaruro ariko igira ingaruka ku kugundura[gushimura] ubutaka, kwanduza amazi n\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere\nIfumbire mvaruganda yangiza ibidukikije..\nImvaruganda ikunzwe gukoreshwa mu buhinzi bw'ibihingwa bitandukanye mu gihugu hari ikoreshwa babagara imyaka cg bayitera. Haje gukorwa ubushakakashatsi bugaragaza ko ifumbire mvaruganda kubera ikoreshwa ryayo ryishi cyangwa nabi yangiza ibidukikije n'ibinyabuzima biba mubutaka. ifumbire mvaruganda yangiza ubutaka nttihaboneke umusaruro wari witezwe ndetse no kwanduza amazi bika byica bimwe mu binyabuzima n'ibimera biba mu mazi.\nUburyo abahinzi bagira umusaruro mwiza badakoresheje ifumbire mvaruganda.\nHamaze gukora ubushakashatsi bywagaragaje ko ifumbire mvaruganda yangiza ibidukikije ikanduza amazi ibigo bitandukanye byita kubidukijreje byakanguriye abahinzi gukoresha ifumbire y'imborera,ikomoka kubimera,ku matungo,kubisagazwa bya amatungo,no gukoresha ifumbire nziza itangwa n'iminyorogoto yatangiye gukoreshwa mu Rwanda itangiza ibidukikije kandi itanga umusaruro.\nIfumbire itangwa ni iminyorogoto.\nHamazwe gukora ubugenzuzi n'ubushakashatsi hasanzwe ifumbire y'imborera ikorwa hifashishijwe iminyorogoto ari nziza ku bihingwa n'urosobe rw'ibimera n'ibidukikije muri rusange."}
{"id": "10135", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10135", "title": "Kwimura abatuye mubishanga mu mujyi wa Kigali", "text": "Ibishanga ni urusobe rwibinyabuzima rwuzuyemo amazi. Mu Rwanda, ahantu hamwe na hamwe huzura amazi mu gihe cy'imvura. Muri Werurwe 2020, Bitewe no kubahiriza amategeko y\u2019ibidukikije mpuzamahanga no gucunga ibidukikije, umujyi wa Kigali wafashe icyemezo cyo kurangiza ikibazo cyo gutura mu bishanga / mu bishanga bimura abantu mu turere tw\u2019ibyago nyuma y\u2019imvura nyinshi. Uwahoze ari Minisitiri w\u2019ubutegetsi, Anastase Shyaka yavuze ko iki gikorwa cyagenze neza. \nIbikoresho.\nMugihe cyo guhitamo ahantu hashobora guteza ibyago byinshi uburyo butandukanye bwo gukora ubushakashatsi bwarimo inyandiko, kamera, ubushakashatsi bwakozwe hamwe na software ikora nka ArcGIS, uburyo bwose bwakoreshaga uturere twose two mumujyi wa Kigali.\nInyandiko.\nGuverinoma y'u Rwanda yari yarabujije gutura mu bishanga kuva mu 2005, kuva icyo gihe guverinoma yabwiraga abafite imitungo kwimuka ariko abantu bake baragerageza abandi birananirana. Intego nyamukuru za guverinoma kwari ukugarura ibishanga no gushyiraho ibyiza nyaburanga byumujyi. Umujyi wa Kigali wagaragaje Hegitari 7.700 z\u2019ibishanga birimo imitungo 2000 harimo inganda, ubucuruzi n\u2019amazu yo guturamo."}
{"id": "10136", "revid": "19167", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10136", "title": "Nyandungu Urban Wetland Eco-Tourism Park", "text": "Icyanya cy'ubukerarugendo mu gishanga cya Nyandungu ni parike y\u2019ubukerarugendo y\u2019u Rwanda gifite hegitari 134 iri hagati y\u2019Akarere ka Gasabo na Kicukiro gifasha abantu gukora ingendo muri bishimira ahantu nyaburanga n\u2019inyamaswa zo mu cyanya cya Nyandungu. iki cyanya cyashizweho n'ibintu by'ingenzi nk'ibidendezi by'imitako, ibiti by'ubwoko bwinshi, ubusitani bw'ibiti bivamo imiti, inzira nyabagendwa,ahatangirwa amafunguro(resitora), ikigo cy'amakuru n'izindi serivise zo kwidagadura hagamijwe kubungabunga ibidukikije, kwigisha abagenzi no kuzamura imibereho myiza y'abaturage byashyizwe mu bikorwa n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe imicungire y\u2019ibidukikije mu Rwanda (RWANDA EMVIRONMENT MANAGEMENT AUTHOLITY (REMA) muri 2020..\nAmateka.\nMu mwaka w\u2019 2015 ni bwo hatekerejwe umushinga wo guhindura iki gishanga no kukigarurira ubuzima kikitwa icyanya cy\u2019Ubukerarugendo bubungabunga Ibidukikije.Iki gishanga kiri ahazwi nko kuri 15 hagati y\u2019Akarere ka Kicukiro n\u2019aka Gasabo, gahunda yo kugitunganya yatangiye muri 2017,gishowemo asaga miliyari eshanu z\u2019amafaranga y\u2019u Rwanda, yo kugitunganya kugira ngo kibe cyakorwamo n\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019ubukerarugendo. Muri icyo Cyanya hagaragara urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima bitandukanye, harimo ibiti by\u2019amoko atandukanye birimo n\u2019ibivamo imiti nk\u2019umuravumba, igicuncu n\u2019umubirizi kandi hari amoko y\u2019inyoni arenga 70.\nIterambere.\nnyuma yo gusobanikirwa ko ibishanga ari umutungo kamere w'igihugu kandi ko bifashweneza byavamo kongera umusaruro w'igihugu ndetse nabagituye mu mujyi wa kigali bimwe mubishanga \nbyaho byaratunganyijwe bigirwa icyanya ndaburanga kuburyyo ubu iki gishanga kiri muri bimwe mu bishanga byo mu Rwanda bisurwa naba mukerarugendo benshi muri Kigali kandi bikinjiza akayabo\nk'amafaranga atari make.\nUmusaruro icyanya cya Nyandungu.\nHari akamaro kenshi kitezweho ubu katangiye kugararagara mu kubungabunga ibidukikije no kongera ubwiza."}
{"id": "10137", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10137", "title": "Iruka Ry'ikirunga cya Nyiragongo muri 2021", "text": "Ku ya 22 Gicurasi 2021, umusozi cyangwa ikirunga cya Nyiragongo muri Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo watangiye guturika no kuruka. Kugeza ku ya 25 Gicurasi, abantu 32 bapfuye bazize kuruka kandi amazu 1.000 yarasenyutse.\nAmavu n'amavuko.\nNk\u2019uko umuyobozi wa parike ya Virunga abitangaza ngo iruka ry'umusozi wa Nyiragongo risa n'iruka ryabaye muri 2002, ryahitanye abantu 250. Muri Nzeri 2020, Katcho Karume, umuyobozi w\u2019ikigo cy\u2019ibirunga cya Goma, yavuze ko ikiyaga cya lava cyari cyuzuye vuba, byongera ibyago byo kuruka mu myaka mike iri imbere, Karume yavuze kandi ko umutingito ushobora kugaragara mbere. Observatoire yari imaze hafi umwaka idakora neza mbere yuko iruka, nyuma yuko Banki y'Isi igabanije inkunga nyuma y'ibirego bya ruswa. Observatoire ntiyashoboye kwishyura umurongo wa interineti kugirango uhuze monitor ya kure cyangwa lisansi yo gutwara abakozi buri gihe aho babireba; abakozi babonaga amakuru gusa mugihe basuye ikirunga. Muri Kanama 2020, raporo yo mu \"mabaruwa y\u2019ubushakashatsi bwa Geofiziki\" ishingiye ku kugereranya ibikorwa by\u2019amateka n\u2019ibikorwa byabereye i Nyiragongo byagaragaje ko hashobora kubaho iturika hagati ya Werurwe 2024 na Ugushyingo 2027. \nKuruka.\nAhagana saa kumi n'ebyiri n'igice z'umugoroba. _ _ Guverinoma ya DRC yasabye abatuye umujyi kwimuka. Ikigereranyo cya lava cyagereranijwe ko cyagenderaga kuri 1 kilometre per hour (0.62\u00a0mph), byemereraga abantu umwanya wo guhunga. Amaherezo lava yahagaze mu karere ka Buheme gaherereye mu majyaruguru ya Goma, isenya amazu magana. Nubwo mbere byavuzwe ko lava yatembaga mu mujyi ndetse ikagera no ku kibuga cy\u2019indege mpuzamahanga cya Goma mu majyepfo y\u2019umujyi, nyuma y\u2019umunsi byemezwa ko ikibuga cy\u2019indege ndetse n\u2019ahantu hubatswe umujyi bitagize ingaruka. Nyamara, imigezi ya lava yari yambutse umuhanda wa N2, ikata Goma mu mujyi wa Beni ugana mu majyaruguru. \nAbantu bagera ku 8000 baturutse i Goma bambutse u Rwanda bahunga. UNICEF yavuze ko bishoboka ko abimuwe basubira mu rugo kugira ngo bamenye amazu yabo yasenyutse, harimo kubura amazi n'amashanyarazi. Amakuru dukesha BBC avuga ko byemejwe ku mugaragaro n'abayobozi b'u Rwanda ko abarenga 3.000 binjiye mu Rwanda bava i Goma. UNICEF yongeyeho ko usibye abahungiye mu Rwanda, abandi bantu 25.000 na bo ngo bahungiye mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Sake. \nKu ya 24 Gicurasi, umutingito ukomeye wibasiye umujyi wa Goma. \nKu ya 25 Gicurasi, saa 11:03 za mu gitondo, umutingito ufite ubukana bwa 5.3 wibasiye hafi yawo, usenya inyubako nyinshi kandi utera ubwoba ko hashobora kubaho ibice bishya mu kiyaga cya lava cyangwa guturika. \nKu ya 27 Gicurasi, abayobozi bategetse kwimura ibice bya Goma, bituma abantu ibihumbi icumi bagenda, kubera ibyago byo biva mu kuruka kw'ikirunga. Ndima Kongba, guverineri w'ingabo mu ntara ya Kivu y'Amajyaruguru, yategetse kwimura hafi kimwe cya gatatu cy'abatuye umugi, mu turere 10. Kongba yavuze ko magma yagaragaye munsi y'umujyi ndetse n'ikiyaga cya Kivu hafi yacyo ishobora kwiyongera, bigatuma bishoboka ko ikiyaga gishobora guturika. Mu gihe abaturage ba Goma bahungiye ku mupaka w'u Rwanda berekeza i Gisenyi, bamwe mu baturage ba Gisenyi bahungiye iburasirazuba nyuma yo kunyeganyezwa no guhinda umushyitsi, umutingito munini wageze kuri 4.9. umutingito wageraga kure nka Kigali, umurwa mukuru w'u Rwanda, 90 kilometres (56\u00a0mi) uvuye aho byaberaga. \nKu ya 7 Kamena, nyuma y\u2019ibikorwa by\u2019ibiza bimaze kugabanuka, guverinoma ya Kongo yatangaje ko izatangira gucyura mu byiciro by\u2019abaturage bahunze umujyi. \nAbahitanwa n\u2019ibyangiritse.\nUmuvugizi wa guverinoma, Patrick Muyaya, mu ijoro ryo ku ya 23 Gicurasi yavuze ko hapfuye abantu cumi na babiri: babiri bari bahiye kugeza bapfuye; icyenda mu mpanuka yo mu muhanda bahunga; n'abagororwa bane bishwe bagerageza kuva muri gereza ya Camp Munzenze i Goma. UNICEF yatangaje ko abana barenga 170 baburiwe irengero, naho abana 150 batandukanijwe n'imiryango yabo. Ku ya 24 Gicurasi, habonetse imirambo itanu y\u2019abahohotewe bahumeka, bituma umubare wa uba 20. Nyuma y\u2019abantu bapfuye bagera kuri 32, kubera ko bamwe mu bapfuye ku ya 24 Gicurasi nyuma yo guhumeka umwotsi na gaze y\u2019ubumara igihe bagendaga ku gice cya lava ikonje. Ibi byatangajwe na Patrick Muyaya, umuvugizi wa guverinoma, ubwo yagaragazaga ko bishoboka ko umubare wiyongera mu gihe hakomeje gushakishwa ababuze. \nAkanama gashinzwe impunzi muri Noruveje kavuze ko amazu magana atandatu n'amashuri atanu byasenyutse. Imidugudu 17 ikikije ikirunga yatangaje ko yangiritse, nubwo imibare yahagaze muri Goma. \nLoni ivuga ko guhera ku ya 25 Gicurasi, amazu 1.000 yarasenyutse n'imidugudu 17 irasenyuka. \nKu ya 28 Gicurasi, abayobozi batangaje ko bimuwe ku gahato abantu bagera ku 400.000 bava i Goma kubera guturika. Iyimurwa rije mu gihe \"igihugu kitorohewe\" kubera ibikorwa by'inyeshyamba mu karere. \nKunegura.\nAbaturage bashinje Observatoire ya Goma kuba idatanga amakuru y'iruka. Banki y'isi yari yarakuyeho inkunga yagenewe abahanga bakora ubushakashatsi muri 2020, kandi nyuma y\u2019amezi make, ikigo cy\u2019indorerezi cyahagaritse gukurikirana ikirunga. Ku ya 10 Gicurasi 2021, ikigo cy\u2019ubugenzuzi cyari cyatanze amakuru y'uko ibikorwa by\u2019ibiza byabereye i Nyiragongo byariyongereye, kandi mbere yari yaraburiye ko ikiyaga cya lava cy\u2019ibirunga cyuzuye, bikongerera amahirwe yo guturika cyangwa ibiza biterwa na nyamugigima. Nk\u2019uko byatangajwe n'umuyobozi ushinzwe ubumenyi mu kigo cy\u2019ibirunga cya Goma, Celestin Kasereka Mahinda, ngo kubura amafaranga ni byo byatumye bigora abahanga bo muri Observatoire kuburira abaturage icyo gihe kiruka. Mahinda kandi yagiriye inama abaturage ba Goma kwirinda kujya ahantu hibasiwe na lava kuva mu birunga, bityo bakirinda kugenda bitari ngombwa, kubera ko lava ari mbi kandi ari uburozi. \nIngaruka.\nKuva ku ya 22 Kanama 2021 ubuzima bwagarutse cyane muri Goma. Abayobozi batekereza kwimura ibice by'umujyi mu mujyi wa Sake kubera iterabwoba ryatewe n'ikirunga n'ikiyaga cya Kivu. "}
{"id": "10138", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10138", "title": "Ibicyeri", "text": "Mu Rwanda haramoko yi bicyeri arenga 53 kandiko ayo moko yose afite akamaro mw,iterambere ry,igihugu bityo ibicyeri bikaba bikwiriye ku bunga bungwa. kwisi hose haramoko yi bicyeri ajyera 108.\nAmazina y'ibicyeri.\nMU Rwanda hagaragara amoko 4 yi bicyeri.\n1.Nyamabondo\n2.Imitubu 49\n3.seseria\nUmumaro wi bicyeri.\nIbicyeri bimenyekanisha imihindagurikire y'ikirere.nu mwimerere \nIbicyeri dushobora kubyifashisha tukabona amakuru yose ducyeneye ku bishanga. \nIbicyeri birya udukoko duto bityo bikagabanya umubare w'u twashoboraga kwajyiza ibihigwa n'ibindi bimera.\nIbicyeri bijyira uruhare murucyera rujyendo ku buryo abantu batapfa kubimenya.\nIbicyeri n'ibiribwa bikomeye kunyoni hari nyoni zirira ibicyeri kandi izo nyoni zikaba zikurura ba mucyerarujyendo.\nIngaruka z'ibicyeri mu Rwanda.\nHaramutse hatari ibicyeri mu rwanda inyoni z'irya ibicyeri zahunga cg zikazimira icyogihe byahobya igihugu byinshi\nUmwihariko w'ibicyeri.\nIbicyeri bifite umwihariko kuko nahandi wa bisanga kwisi. \nharubwoko 3 bwihariye mu rwanda utasanga ahandi. "}
{"id": "10139", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10139", "title": "Kunywera itabi muruhame", "text": "kunywera itabi muruhame ubusanzwe si byiza nubwo hari abadasobanukiwe ububi bwabyo ariko abahanga\nmu buzima bwa muntu bagaragaza ububi bwo kunywera itabi \nitabi muruhame.\nAshingiye ku Iteka rya Perezida N\u00b0 13/ ryo ku wa 25/05/2005 ryemeza kandi rihamya burundu Amasezerano Mpuzamahanga y\u2019Ishami ry\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye ryita ku Buzima yerekeranye ububi bwo kunywa itabi ndetse no kurinywera muruhame\nbyagaragaye ko kunywa itabi ubwabyo byangiza ubuzima bw'abarinywa ndetse nabatarinywa ariko begeranye nabarinywa kuko barihumeka\nmu mwuka mu Rwanda ndetse nahandi kw'Isi bagiye bafata ingamba zitandukanye zo kwirinda ingaruka z'itabi ndetse no kubuzima bwite bw'abaturage\nmu Rwanda hafashwe ingamba zo gushyiraho ahantu humwihariko kubanwyi b'itabi igihe bari ahantu habera ibikorwa Rusange.\nInteko ishinga amategeko umutwe w'abadepite wagaragaje Impungenge iterwa nikoreshwa ry'Itabi ku Rubyiruko mu Rwanda ndetse isaba Minisiteri y'ubuzima kugaragaza\nIngamba irimo gufata mukurwanya ikoreshwa ry'itabi mu Rwanda ndetse no kugaragaza dose yemewe y'itabi rigomba kunyobwa mugihugu kuko biteye impungenge cyane cyane \nku Rubyiruko.\nIngaruka zo Kunywa Itabi.\nRaporo ya Tobacco Atlas ya 2019 igaragaza ko buri mwaka mu Rwanda hapfa abantu barenga 2000 bazize indwara ziterwa no kunywa itabi, naho Ishami ry\u2019Umuryango w\u2019Abibumbye ryita ku buzima Organization Mondale De sant\u00e9 OMS rikagaragaza ko buri mwaka ku Isi hapfa abantu miliyoni 8 bazize itabi.\nMu bindi leta isabwa harimo gushyiraho ahantu hagenewe kunywera itabi mu buryo bwa rusange. \nIngamba.\nmuri 2017 Ugushyingo itariki 16 umujyi wa Kigali washyizeho ingamba zo kwirinda ingaruka zo kunywa Itabi ubwo \nkampenye yo kurwanya kunywa itabi kuko ryica ubuzima bwabarinywa ubwo bagiraga bati ikirere nta mipaka kigira ntaburenganzira \nnabuke umuntu afite bwo kunywera itabi muruhame kereka igihe ari wenyine\nbemeza ko kandi mu Rwanda abana bari munsi yimyaka 18 batemerewe kunywa itabi ndetse no kurikoraho ariko abakuru bo bararinywa\nbagiye bashyiraho kandi ibyapa bigaragaza ko kunywera itabi muruhame bitemewe ahantu henshi hatandukanye nko kumazu\ny'ubucuruzi mutubyiniro mutubari mwisoko ndetse nahandi henshi hatandukanye hahurira abantu benshi."}
{"id": "10140", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10140", "title": "Igishanga cya Nyandungu", "text": "Igishanga cya Nyandungu.\nMumyaka yashize uwumvaga nyandungu yayumvaga ari nk'igishanga cyibasirwa n'imyuzure igishanga giteye ubwoba kandi bamwe bagikoreshaga nk'ikimoteri kuko bamenagamo imyanda yo mungo zabo cyari igishanga ubonako ntakerekezo gifite. Muri icyogihe ibinyabuzima byari biri muri icyo gishanga harimo nk'inyoni n'ibindi byatangiye guhunga, utuyira nyabagendwa turasibama kubera imyuzure ikabije n'isayo byamanurwaga n'imvura ituruka hirya no hino muri Kigali. Hakorerwaga kandi ubuhinzi butita kubidukikije ikigishanga cyari cyarakamye kubera kutitabwaho no gucukuramo ibumba.\nUbukungu.\nMu mwaka wa 2015 nibwo hatekerejwe umushinga wabyazwa muri iki gishanga murwego rwo kubungabunga ibidukikije, ndetse no kukibyaza umusaruro kigakurura ba mukerarugendo basura umujyi wa kigali aribwo hafatwaga ingamba zo kugihinduramo pariki y'ubukerarugendo bubungabunga ibidukikije ikongerwa muzari zisanzwe mu Rwanda. imirimo yo kugitunganya yatangiye muri 2016.\nAkamaro kicyigishanga.\nMuguhindura iki gishanga hatekerejwe kubungabunga bw'urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima,kubakamo ibikorwa remezo ndetse no kubibyaza umusaruro bigakurura ba Mukerarugendo bakatwinjiriza amadovizi mu gihugu cyacu ikigishanga kandi hateganyijwe guterwamo ibiti bisa nkibiri gucika birimo;\u2018umugote\u2019, \u2018igikakarubamba\u2019, \u2018imiravumba\u2019, \u2018iminyinya\u2019, \u2018ikirogora\u2019, \u2018umubirizi\u2019, \u2018igicuncu\u2019, \u2018igitenetene\u2019,Ndetse n\u2018umukunde.\nkugirango bizifashishwe mugusobanurira abakiri bato ibyo aribyo hari kandi ubusitani bwo kwicaramo ndetse n'utuyira twa siporo\nturi kubuso bwa kirometero 10 hatewemo kandi imiti imwe n'imwe yo mubimera yakoreshwaga n'abakera mubuvuzi gakondo\nnyuma yo gutunganywa kw'iki Gishanga kandi byatumye bimwe mubinyabuzima byari byarahunze birimo nk'inyoni n'ibindi bigarukamo.\nInyungu Rusange.\nIki gishanga gifitiye igihugu akamaro cyane cyane umujyi wa kigali ndetse n'abagituriye kuko kigizwe n'urusobe rw 'ibinyabuzima ndetse n'ibyatsi bitanga imiti myinshi itandukanye yifashishwa mukuvura indwara zimwe nazimwe ikigishanga kirimo kandi ahantu ho kuruhukira,aho gufatira amafunguro,aho gukinira ikinamico,ndetse n'utuyira twa siporo z'abanyamaguru ndetse n'amagare.\nInyoni ziri muri iki gishanga.\nMuri ikigishanga harimo amoko y'inyoni asaga 70 ndetse n'urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima bitandukanye n'amoko y'ibiti menshi atandukanye harimo natanga imiti n'ibindi byingirakamaro k'ubuzima bwa muntu.\nAho giherereye.\nNyandungu Urban Wetland Eco-Tourism Park, ni uburyo iki gishanga kiri gutunganywamo, ni igishanga giherereye mu Mirenge ya Ndera ho mu Karere ka Gasabo na Nyarugunga muri Kicukiro,"}
{"id": "10141", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10141", "title": "Urugomero Rwa Nyabarongo ya II", "text": "Urugomero rwa Nyabarongo II, ni urugomero runini rwubatswe kuri Nyabarongo mu Rwanda. Urugomero rureshya na 48 metres (157\u00a0ft) ubujyejuru na 228 metres (748\u00a0ft) mu burebure, rukoze ikigega gifite ubushobozi bwo 846,000,000 cubic metres (2.9876208046. Biteganijwe kandi ko iki kigega kizatanga amazi yo kuhira hafi 20,000 hectares (49,000 acres), munsi y\u2019urugomero. Byongeye kandi, urugomero ruzakira Sitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi ya Nyabarongo II, ifite ingufu za megawatt 43.5. \nAho biherereye.\nUrugomero rwa Nyabarongo II ruherereye hafi y'umujyi wa Shyorongi, mu Karere ka Rulindo n\u2019akarere ka Gakenke mu Ntara y'Amajyaruguru ndetse n\u2019akarere ka Kamonyi mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyepfo y\u2019u Rwanda. Ubu ni 21 kilometres (13\u00a0mi) mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru w' u Rwanda. \nAmateka.\nMuri kamena 2018, guverinoma yu Rwanda, ibinyujije mu kigo gishinzwe \"iterambere ry\u2019ingufu\" (EDCL), ishami rya Rwanda Energy Group (REG), yemeranyije na Sinohydro kugira ngo bubake uru rugomero rugamije (a) kubika amazi yo kuhira (b) kugenga imyuzure (c) gutanga megawatt 43.5 zingufu zamashanyarazi kugirango wongere kuri gride yigihugu. \nMuri Mata 2019, amasezerano hagati y\u2019impande yarasobanuwe. Sinohydro yashinzwe kubaka urugomero no kugira ibice bikora, bitarenze 2025. Icyitegererezo cyinyubako kizakoreshwa cyemeranijweho \"kubaka, gutunga, gukora no kwimura\" (BOOT). Ikiguzi cy'umushinga cyateganijwe ni miliyoni 214 z'amadolari. Sitasiyo ya Nyabarongo II igamije kongera 28 megawatts (38,000\u00a0hp).\nIterambere, inkunga nigihe ntarengwa.\nAmasezerano y\u2019ubwubatsi, n'amasoko yahawe Sinohydro, ikigo kita ku mashanyarazi ya Leta m\u2019Ubushinwa, inganda n\u2019ubwubatsi, ku giciro cy\u2019amadorari miliyoni 214. Amafaranga yahawe guverinoma y'u Rwanda, avuye muri Exim Bank y'Ubushinwa ku buryo bworoshye. Kubaka byatangiye muri Mata 2021 bikaba biteganijwe ko bizakomeza kugeza mu Kuboza 2025. \nIbikorwa remezo bifitanye isano.\nUsibye urugomero n\u2019amashanyarazi, Sinohydro isezerana kubaka ibikorwa remezo bikurikira, mu rwego rwuyu mushinga: (a) ikiraro cyambukiranya uruzi rwa Nyabarongo (b) uruganda rukora amashanyarazi 110kV (c) umurongo wa 110kV upima 19 kilometres (12\u00a0mi), kuva kuri sitasiyo y'amashanyarazi kugera kuri sitasiyo ya Rulindo, aho ingufu zizinjira muri gride y'igihugu (d) umuhanda uhoraho ugana ahahoze urugomero. Ibyo byose bizarangira mumezi 56. "}
{"id": "10142", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10142", "title": "Urugomero rw'Umugezi w'Akanyaru", "text": "Urugomero rw'Umugezi w'Akanyaru, ni urugomero rwambuka uruzi rwa Akanyaru, ku mupaka mpuzamahanga uhuza u Rwanda n'Uburundi. Urugomero ruzakora ikigega gifite ubushobozi bwa 333,000,000 cubic metres (1.1759784018. Biteganijwe ko ayo mazi azatanga amazi yo kunywa ku bantu bagera ku 614.200 mu bihugu byombi. Biteganijwe kandi ko iki kigega kizatanga amazi yo kuhira kuri 12,474 hectares (30,820 acres) bw\u2019ubuhinzi mu Burundi no mu Rwanda, bikagirira akamaro abahinzi 24.948. Urugomero ruzatanga kandi amashanyarazi akomoka ku mazi y'Akanyaru, afite ingufu za 14.5\u00a0MW (19.400)\u00a0hp). \nAho biherereye.\nSitasiyo y\u2019amashanyarazi iri ku ruzi rwa Akanyaru, ku mupaka w\u2019u Rwanda n\u2019Uburundi, mu karere ka Gisagara muri iki gihe mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyepfo, u Rwanda ndetse no muri Komine ya Ntega mu Ntara ya Kirundo, mu Burundi. \nUrugomero rugera kuri 160 kilometres (99\u00a0mi), kumuhanda, mu majyepfo yuburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru wu Rwanda. Ubu ni 150 kilometres (93\u00a0mi), kumuhanda, mumajyaruguru ya Gitega, umujyi wu Burundi. \nAmateka.\nMu mwaka wa 2012, ibihugu byombi byo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba hamwe na gahunda y'ibikorwa byo mu biyaga bya Nil Equatorial (NELSAP), byagaragaje \"umushinga wo guteza imbere umutungo w'amazi y'Akanyaru\". Muri uwo mwaka, NELSAP yakoze ubushakashatsi bwibanze. \nMuri 2015, Inama y'Abaminisitiri ya Nili yemeje umushinga wa Akanyaru. Intumwa zaturutse mu Rwanda no mu Burundi zapimye aho umushinga uzaba muri Gicurasi 2016. Muri Werurwe 2018, NELSAP yateguye icyifuzo cyuzuye cyo guterwa inkunga na Banki nyafurika itsura amajyambere (AfDB). Muri 2020, hatanzwe amasoko yo gusuzuma ingaruka z\u2019ibidukikije n\u2019imibereho myiza y\u2019abaturage (ESIA), gahunda y\u2019ibikorwa byo kwimura abantu (RAP), ubushakashatsi bwuzuye bushoboka, gutegura ibisobanuro birambuye no gutegura inyandiko zipiganwa kumushinga. Biteganijwe ko ubushakashatsi bwumushinga buzarangira muri Werurwe 2022. \nInkunga.\nMuri Gashyantare 2021, ikiguzi cy'umushinga cyabazwe miliyoni 190 US $. Gusaba inguzanyo byakorewe AfDB, hamwe na \"NEPAD IInfrastructure Project Preparation Facility\" (NEPAD-IPPF). \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nIcyifuzo cya 14.5 megawatts (19,400\u00a0hp) cy'Amashanyarazi ya Akanyaru, biteganijwe ko azatanga amashanyarazi kumazu 141.111 mubihugu byombi, akorera abantu bagera kuri 846.000. Uyu mushinga urimo kandi gusana amasoko yangiritse hejuru yurugomero rwa Akanyaru. "}
{"id": "10143", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10143", "title": "Urugomero rwa Nyabarongo I", "text": "Urugomero rwa Nyabarongo I ni Urugomero rwa 28 megawatts (38,000\u00a0hp) z\u2019amashanyarazi mu Rwanda. \nAho biherereye.\nUrugomero ruherereye k'umugezi wa Nyabarongo, hafi y'umudugudu wa \"Mushishiro\", Akarere ka Muhanga, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo. harimo 75 kilometres (47\u00a0mi), kumuhanda, mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru mu Rwanda. Mushishiro iri hafi 35 kilometres (22\u00a0mi), kumuhanda, mumajyepfo yicyicaro cyintara y'amajyepfo. \nIncamake.\nUrugomero rwa Nyabarongo I ni urugomero rw'amashanyarazi mu Rwanda, rwuzuye mu Kwakira 2014, rufite itariki yo gutangizwa mu Gushyingo 2014. Ku kigereranyo cya miliyoni 110 US $, hateganijwe kwishyiriraho ubushobozi bwa MW 28. Uyu mushinga urimo urugomero, rufite igishushanyo mbonera cy\u2019uruzi, hakurya y'Uruzi i Mwogo, imwe mu masoko y'uruzi rwa Nyabarongo. Uyu mushinga, wakozwe na Angelique International Limited &amp; Bharat Heavy Electricals Limited yo mu Buhinde, n\u2019umushinga munini w'amashanyarazi mu Rwanda, kugeza ubu. Naresh Kapoor Sr., ni Umuyobozi mukuru ushinzwe umushinga washyizweho na Angelique International Limited yo mu Buhinde. Bimwe mubikorwa byubwubatsi byanasezeranye nisosiyete yo muri Ositaraliya Snowy Mountains Engineering Corporation (SMEC). Ibyo bice byombi byahujwe na gride yu Rwanda ku ya 27 Ukwakira 2014 na 30 Ukwakira 2014. Guverinoma y'u Rwanda yahaye rwiyemezamirimo igihe ntarengwa mu Kwakira 2014. urugomero rw\u2019amashanyarazi rwararangiye ishyikirizwa abakiriya ku ya 28 Ugushyingo 2014. Yafunguwe ku mugaragaro na perezida w'u Rwanda ku ya 5 Werurwe 2015. "}
{"id": "10144", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10144", "title": "Urugomero rwa Rukarara", "text": "Urugomero rwa Rukarara ni Urugomero rwa 9.5\u00a0MW (12.700)\u00a0hp) z\u2019amashanyarazi mu Rwanda. \nAho biherereye.\nSitasiyo y'amashanyarazi iherereye ku mugezi wa Rukarara, mu Karere ka Nyamagabe, mu Ntara y'Amajyepfo y'u Rwanda, hafi 182 kilometres (113\u00a0mi) mu majyepfo ashyira uburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru mu Rwanda \nIncamake.\nUrugomero rwa MW 9,6 rwubatswe mubyiciro byinshi. Icyiciro cya mbere, gifite ubushobozi bwa MW 6.9, cyarangiye muri 2011. Icyiciro cya kabiri, gifite ubushobozi bwa MW 2,2 cyarangiye muri 2014. Amafaranga yo kubaka sitasiyo yose y\u2019amashanyarazi yari miliyoni 13.12 US $, inkunga yatanzwe na guverinoma yu Rwanda, Umuryango w\u2019ubumwe bw\u2019ibihugu by\u2019Uburayi n\u2019ikigo gishinzwe iterambere ry\u2019Ububiligi. \nIbindi bitekerezo.\nAmashanyarazi yatanzwe yimurwa binyuze muri sitasiyo nshya i Rukarara no mu murongo mushya w'amashanyarazi maremare kuva Rukarara kugera Kirinda. "}
{"id": "10145", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10145", "title": "Urugomero rwa Ruzizi ya III", "text": "Urugomero rwa Ruzizi ya III ni urugomero rw\u2019amashanyarazi ruteganijwe gushyirwaho ingufu za MW 147 mu gihe rwuzuye. \nAho biherereye.\nurugomero rw\u2019amashanyarazi ruherereye ku mugezi wa Ruzizi, unyura ku mupaka uhuriweho n\u2019u Rwanda na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (RDC). Aho iherereye ni 5 kilometres (3\u00a0mi) mu burengerazuba bw'umujyi wa Bugarama, mu Karere ka Rusizi, mu Ntara y'Uburengerazuba bw'u Rwanda, hafi 267 kilometres (166\u00a0mi), mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru w'u Rwanda. Imirongo igereranya ya Ruzizi ya III Yamashanyarazi ni: \nIncamake.\nurugomero rw\u2019amashanyarazii ni urwa gatatu muri casade y'amashanyarazi ku ruzi rwa Ruzizi, igirira akamaro ibihugu by'Uburundi, DRC n'u Rwanda. Amashanyarazi arimo Ruzizi I (megawatt 29.8) na Ruzizi II (megawatt 43.8), byombi biherereye mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Ruzizi ya III kandi byombi bikora guhera muri Kamena 2017. Imbaraga zitangwa zizagabanywa mubihugu bitatu binyuze mumiyoboro isanzwe yo gukwirakwiza, ihujwe na Ruzizi I na Ruzizi II. Amashanyarazi yombi hamwe numuyoboro wohereza bizasubirwamo. Biteganijwe ko u Rwanda rwakira megawatt 50 na megawatt 147 zavuye kuri Ruzizi III. \nInkunga.\nKugeza mu Kuboza 2015, amafaranga yo kubaka yabazwe ni miliyoni 625.19 US $. Muri ibyo, \"miliyoni 138.88 z'amadolari y'Amerika zizatangwa na Leta aturutse muri AfDB na miliyoni 50.22 z'amadorali yavuye mubikorera\". Abandi baterankunga barimo Banki y\u2019ishoramari y\u2019i Burayi, KfW na Banki y'Isi. Raporo iheruka gushyira igiciro cya miliyoni 450 $. Gufunga gutanga amafaranga biteganijwe ko bizagerwaho hagati ya 2021. \nAbashinzwe iterambere.\nMuri Kanama 2019, byavuzwe ko guverinoma eshatu z\u2019Afurika bireba zahisemo Scatec (yahoze yitwa SN Power) na Serivisi ishinzwe guteza imbere inganda (IPS) kugira ngo ikore uyu mushinga w\u2019ibikorwa remezo by\u2019ingufu zishobora kuvugururwa., ingufu zitangwa hano biteganijwe ko zizatwara amadolari ya Amerika 0.11 na US $ 0.13 kuri kilo Watthour yingufu. Abantu bagera kuri miliyoni 30 bazabyungukiramo. "}
{"id": "10146", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10146", "title": "Kurinda Amashyamba kimeza", "text": "Amashyamba kimeza ni amashyamba yimejeje afite ibiti byimejeje ndetse n'ibindi binyabuzima bibamo bikaba bihaba nta muntu wabigizemo uruhare.\nAmashyamba mu Rwanda.\nAmashyamba ni kimwe mu mitungo ya kamere u Rwanda rugifite byumwihariko amashyamba ya kimeza bikaba akarusho kuko bifasha mw'ibungabungwa by'urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima.\nMu Rwanda dufite amashyamba kimeza hari amanini n'amato. mu mashyamba u Rwanda rufite harimo amashyamba azwi nka Gishwati, Nyungwe ndetse n'ishyamba rya mukura.\nAkamaro k'amashyamba.\nAmashyamba abahanga bemezako ari nk'ibihaha by'isi kuberako anyunyuza umwuka urimo ubumara (Carbon) mu ndimi zamahanga, nkuko bidashobokako umuntu abaho nta bihaha afite niko n'isi idashobora kubaho idafite amashyamba.\nkwita no kurinda amashyamba kimeza mu Rwanda.\nGuverinoma y'U Rwanda yahagurukiye ikibazo cyaba rushimusi bibiti bituma bagabanuka ndetse hafashwe n'ingamba zikaze zo kurinda amashyamba. mu ngamba zafashwe zirimo kongerera abaturage ubumenyi kugirango bizamure imyumvire bafite kukurinda Amashyamba ariko hakanashyirwaho n'uburyo abaturage bakwiteza imbere ariko banarinda amashyamba. Mu intangiriro amashyamba 20 niyo yashizwe mu azabanza kwitabwaho ariko uko ubushobozi buboneka nandi akazakomeza kwitabwaho. mu rwego rwo kurinda amashyamba kandi hashyizweho gahunda yo gutera ibiti bikavangwa n'imyaka cyane cyane ahegereye ya mashyamba akeneye kurindwa kugirango abaturage nibakenera ibiti bakoreshe ibyo bateye batangije amashyamba."}
{"id": "10147", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10147", "title": "Urugomero rwa Ruzizi IV", "text": "Urugomero rwa Ruzizi IV, ni urugomero rw\u2019amashanyarazi, ruzatanga ingufu za 287 megawatts (385,000\u00a0hp). \nAho biherereye.\nUrugomero rwa Rusizi IV rw ' amashanyarazi ruherereye ku mugezi wa Ruzizi, unyura ku mupaka uhuriweho cg (uhana imbibi) n\u2019u Rwanda na Repubulika Iharanira Demokarasi ya Kongo (DC). Aho iherereye ni 5 kilometres (3\u00a0mi), iburengerazuba bw 'umujyi wa Bugarama, mu Karere ka Rusizi, mu Ntara y\u2019Uburengerazuba, 252 kilometres (157\u00a0mi), mu majyepfo y'uburengerazuba bwa Kigali, umurwa mukuru w'u Rwanda. Ruzizi IV, yegereye izindi sitasiyo eshatu z'amashanyarazi ku ruzi rwa Ruzizi, arizo Rizizi I, II na III. \nIncamake.\nUru rugomero rw 'amashanyarazi ni urwa kane (4) ku ruzi rwa Ruzizi, rugira akamaro ibihugu by'Uburundi, DRC n'u Rwanda. Amashanyarazi arimo Ruzizi I (29.8 megawatt) na Ruzizi II (megawatt 43.8), byombi biherereye mu majyaruguru y'uburengerazuba bwa Ruzizi III kandi byombi byarangiye gukora guhera muri Mutarama 2020. Sitasiyo ya Ruzizi III Amashanyarazi ni megawatt 147 z'amashanyarazi arimo gutezwa imbere kuva mu ntangiriro ya za 2010. Imbaraga zituruka kuri ayo mashanyarazi zisaranganywa kimwe hagati y\u2019ibihugu bitatu bituranye. \nInkunga.\nMuri Mutarama 2020, Banki Nyafurika itsura amajyambere yemeje inkunga ingana na miliyoni 8 zo gutegura uyu mushinga. Ibi bikurikira bikurikira indi nkunga ya US $ 980.000 yemejwe mu mpera za 2018 ikigo gishinzwe \"ubufatanye bw\u2019iterambere ry\u2019ibikorwa remezo bya Afurika\" (NEPAD-IPPF), bigana ku ntego imwe. "}
{"id": "10148", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10148", "title": "Amashashi na Parasitiki", "text": "Reta y'u Rwanda yatangiye guca ikoreshwa ry' amashashi na parasitiki nkabimwe mu bikoresho byifashishwaga mu buzima bw' abanyarwanda harimo uducupa twamazi dukoze muri palasitiki, amashashi yakoreshwaga afungwamo bimwe mu bicuruzwa nk'isukari, amafu atandukanye cyangwa amashashi yakoreshwaga atwarwamo ibyahashywe mu masoko.\nItegeko rihana ikoreshwa ry' amasashi na parasiki.\nMu mwaka wa 2008, Leta y\u2019u Rwanda yasohoye itegeko ribuza ikorwa, itumizwa, ikoreshwa n\u2019icuruzwa ry\u2019amasashi akoze muri parasitiki. Iri tegeko rinagena n\u2019ibihano ku warirezeho birimo igifungo kiva ku mezi atandatu kugeza ku mwaka n\u2019ihazabu iva ku bihumbi 100 kugera ku bihumbi 500 Frw cyangwa kimwe muri byo ku bakora cyangwa abakoresha aya masashi. Ugurisha \u00a0aya masashi we ahanishwa kuva ku ihazabu y\u2019ibihumbi 10 kugera ku bihumbi 300 Frw, naho umuntu wese utabyemerewe ukoresha aya masashi\u00a0 ahanishwa ihazabu iri hagati y\u2019ibihumbi 5 n\u2019ibihumbi 100\nIkoreshwa ry'amashashi na parasiki byangiza ibidukikije.\nNyuma yikorwa ry'ubushakakashatsi ku bidukikije reta y'uRwanda ibicishije mu Ikigo cy\u2019 igihugu cyo kurengera ibidukikije REMA bagarageje muri zimwe mu ngaruka mbi ziterwa n'ikoreshwa ry' amashashi na palastiki zikurikira:\nAmashashi na parasiki byangiza ibidukikije umwuka duhumeka,yanduza amazi ndetse ni izindi ngaruka mbi cyane kubidukikije muri rusange "}
{"id": "10149", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10149", "title": "Umugezi wa Akagera", "text": "Urizi rwa kagera ruzwi kwizi rya, Ni uruzi rwo muri Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, rukaba rugize igice cy'imigezi yo hejuru ya Nile kandi rutwara amazi ava mu masoko ya kure cyane. Uburebure bwa kilometero 597 (371 mi) uhereye ku nkomoko yayo iherereye mu kiyaga cya Rweru mu Rwanda.\nAho unyura.\nIgice cy'umugezi witwa Kagera gitangirira mu Burundi, gitemba kiva mu kiyaga cya Rweru. Kuva ku kiyaga, gitemba iburasirazuba ugana ku Rwanda-Burundi na Rwanda-Tanzaniya kugera mu masangano n'umugezi wa Ruvubu. Amazi ya Kagera rero atangwa, Nyabarongo yu Rwanda, igaburira ikiyaga cya Rweru, na Ruvubu yo mu Burundi. Ntibizwi muri izi nzuzi zombi zigaburira ni ndende bityo rero isoko yanyuma ya Nili. Kuva aho ihurira, Kagera itembera mu majyaruguru ku mupaka wa Rwanda na Tanzaniya, hejuru y\u2019isumo rya Rusumo no muri Parike ya Akagera. Ihita ifata iburasirazuba, ikurikira umupaka wa Tanzania na Uganda hanyuma ikisuka mu kiyaga cya Victoria muri Uganda. Mu 1898, Uruzi rwagaragaye cyane mu mateka y'ibihugu runyuramo, cyane cyane u Rwanda. Mu 1894, Umudage Gustav Adolf von G\u00f6tzen yambutse Kagera ku isoko ya Rusumo, atangira igihe cy'abakoloni b'u Rwanda; no mu 1916, mu Ntambara ya Mbere y'Isi Yose, Ababiligi batsinze Abadage, binjira mu Rwanda mu nzira imwe. Uruzi rwamenyekanye cyane mu 1994 kubera gutwara imirambo yavuye muri jenoside yo mu Rwanda mu kiyaga cya Victoria, bituma hamenyekana ko ibintu byihutirwa mu turere twa Uganda, aho imirambo yaje kugaragara\nIcyo wa menya.\nKagera yazamutse mu Burundi yinjira mu kiyaga cya Victoria., gitanga hafi metero kibe 6.4 z'amazi ku mwaka (hafi 28 ku ijana by'ikiyaga gisohoka). Kagera ikorwa no guhurira kwa Ruvuvu na Nyabarongo, hafi y\u2019amajyaruguru y\u2019ikiyaga cya Tanganyika. Igizwe n'ibice by'Uburundi - Tanzaniya, u Rwanda - Tanzaniya, u Burundi - u Rwanda, na Tanzaniya - Uganda. Yitiriye izina rya Parike y'igihugu ya Akagera mu majyaruguru y'u Rwanda, ndetse no mu karere ka Kagera muri Tanzaniya. Ku ruzi hari Isumo rya Rusumo, ahantu h'ingenzi kwambukiranya u Rwanda na Tanzaniya. Ni hafi y'umujyi wa Rusumo.\nJenoside.\nMuri jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo mu 1994 akagera ka koreshwaga mu guta imirambo kuko ibihumbi by'abatutsi bo mu rwego rwa politiki biciwe ku nkombe z'umugezi. Uruzi rwanganaga imirambo yiciwe mu kiyaga cya Victoria muri uganda."}
{"id": "10150", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10150", "title": "Kwita no Kurinda Ibishanga", "text": "Igishanga ni agace kubutaka karangwa n'ubushyuhe, acide ndetse n'uburumbuke buke bw'ubutaka n'amazi asohoka. igishanga ni ahantu hari ubutaka butose, akenshi bufite amazi, ibiti n'ibindi bimera bitandukanye.\nIbishanga mu Rwanda.\nIbishanga bibarirwa mu mitungo y'amazi leta ifite, ibishanga bihoramo amazi bikaba binakungahaye ku bimera bigomba kurindwa by'umwihariko, ibishanga bigomba kwitabwaho hitawe cyane kuruhare n'umumaro bigira mu kubungabunga urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima.\nkurinda ibishanga hitawe no kuburenganzira bw'abaturage.\nkuri uyu munsi isi ihangayikishijwe n'umuvuduko ukomeye wizimira ry'ibishanga. muriki kinyejana kimwe cya kabiri cyabo bimaze kuzimira."}
{"id": "10152", "revid": "10331", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10152", "title": "GUPFUNYIKA MU MPAPURO (ENVELOP)", "text": "Reta y'u Rwanda ibinyujije mu kigo cy\u2019 igihugu cyo kurengera ibidukikije REMA yatangije ikoreshwa ry' impapuro mu gupfunyikamo ibi bikurikira iryo nk' amafu, isukari nibindi byapfunyikagwa mu mashashe kandi yangiza ibidukikije.\nImpapuro ntizzngiza ibidukikije..\nImpapuro ni zirabora ntizangiza ibidukikije, impapuro zirabora, ubutaka. amazi ndetse n'urusobe rw'ibinyabuza muri rusange."}
{"id": "10154", "revid": "11826", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10154", "title": "Itabi ry'umwotsi", "text": "Itabi ry'umwotsi.\nItabi ni kimwe mu biyobyabwenge banywa cyangwa se basohora umwotsi.\nItabi rikorwa hifashishishijwe ibibabi,abahanga mu by'ubuzima bavuga ko\nMuri ikigihe hariho ubwoko burenga 70 bw'itabi. mu Rwanda nahandi kw'Isi.\nIngaruka ziterwa n'itabi.\nkunywa itabi byangiza mu buryo bukomeye bitewe n'uko umwotsi w'itabi \nhabamo ikinyabutabire kitwa nikotine,ifite ubushobozi bwo kwangiza \nuturemangingo twubatse ubwonko, ndetse bukangiza ubushobozi bwo gufata \nAbahanga bavuga ko nikotine ihagarika ubudahangarwa bwo kurema \nuturemangingo dusimbura utwangiritse.\nIkindi ni ko abanywi b'itabi bigabanyiriza\nImyaka 14 yo kubaho ugereranije n'abatarinywa.\nku banywi b'itabi barimenyereye ntabwo arikuntu cyoroshye guhita barireka burundu.\nbisaba cyane kuba umuntu afite ubushake bukomeye\nbwo kurireka mbere ya byose\nKunywera itabi mu ruhame.\nNyuma y'indwara zikomeye zihitana imbaga abantu batuye isi, zirimo ibyorezo n'indwara zidakira nka Sida ndetse na kanseri yo mubihaha y'isasira ubuzima n'imbaga y'abatuye isi, Ishami ry'umuryango w'abibumbye ryita ku buzima ryemeza ko itabi ari kimwe mu biteza abatuye isi kwibasirwa n'indwara zikomeye z'ihitana imbaga y'abatuye mu Rwanda nahandi hose kw'isi.\nMiriyoni 6 nibo bapfa bariguze bakarinywa, naho abasaga ibihumbi 890 bicwa n'ingaruka ziterwa \nNo guhumeka umwotsi w'itabi rinywewe mu ruhame, ni kuvuga ko ushobora kwicwa n'ingaruka z'itabi ariko utarinywa, ahubwo bigaterwa n'uko w'icaranye n'umuntu uri kurinywa, aba baturage kandi bapfa batarageza kumyaka 70 y'amavuko.\nIbigize itabi.\nHabonekamo:\n.nikotine\n.caribone monogiside (imyuka ihumanya)"}
{"id": "10155", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10155", "title": "Rubaya community gene banki", "text": "Rubaya community gene Bank iherereye mu murenge wa Rubaya mu karere ka Gicumbi gaherereye mu majyaruguru yu Rwanda, iyobowe na koperative Kundisuka. Yatangiye igihe umuhinzi witwa Mpoberabanzi Silas na agronome ukorera mu murenge wa Rubaya bari bamaze kumenya ko bikenewe kubika neza imbuto zabimwe mubihingwa kuko hari bimwe bigenda bibura mu akarere (urugero: ubwoko bwinshi bwibishyimbo, amashaza, ibigori, ingano n'amasaka). Ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry'umushinga ryatewe inkunga n'abakozi b'ikigo k'igihugu gishinzwe ubuhinzi (RAB) ku bufatanye na Bioversity International (Plate 18). Komite icunga ndetse ikanareberera umutungo w'ishyirahamwe yashinzwe muri Nzeri 2012 kandi igizwe n' abanyamuryango bagera ku icumi hamwe na Mpoberabanzi Silas nka perezida. Ububiko bwa Rubaya community gene banki bwubatswe n'abanyamuryango ku inkunga ya Vision 2020 umurenge program na Minisiteri yubutegetsi bw'igihugu.\nIntego nyamukuru.\nIntego yabo nyamukuru nukubika ibihingwa byibanze mukarere (ibigori, ingano, ibishyimbo n'ibirayi), ariko abahinzi bafite uburenganzira bwo gukoresha ibikoresho n'imbuto zibitse muri sitoke no kubungabunga izindi mbuto n'ibikoresho byifashishwa byifashishwa mu gutera. The community gene banki ntiragira uruhare rugaragara mubaturage, urugero, mugutanga imbuto cyangwa kuzamura umusaruro, kuko ikiri mucyiciro cyayo cyambere. Ariko, icyerekezo cyabanyamuryango ni ugushora imari mu kugwiza imbuto, gukora imbuto nziza zizajya zihabwa abaturage bo mukarere,n'amabanki. Ibi bizafasha guhindura uruganda rw'ubuhinzi gushingira kubucuruzi mu ma koperative nkuko byemejwe na RAB.\nImikorere n'ibikorwa.\nThe community gene bank ifite inshingano eshatu: kubungabunga imbuto z'ibihingwa byayo; gutanga amahugurwa y'ubuhanga mu buhinzi; no gukwirakwiza ubwoko bw'imbuto z'ibihingwa biri hafi kuzimangana cyangwa bigenda biba bikeya kuko abahinzi bahindukirira ubwoko bw'ibihingwa bwiza. Banki yabaturage ya gene yatangiye gukusanya imbuto\nihereye kubahinzi mumidugudu ibegereye no kuvugurura ibikoresho by'ibimera ishobora kubikwa mu kigega cyayo. Mu ntangiriro, yakoreraga mu ibibanza bitatu bito byose hamwe bingana na 0,30ha, ariko ubu byaragutse kugeza kubibanza 15 (0.85ha) byatewemo ubwoko bw'imbuto zitandukanye zirimo iz'ibishyimbo, ibigori, amashaza, amashaza yinka, ibirayi, ibijumba n'amasaka\nIbibazo bya tekiniki no guhuza imiyoboro.\nImbuto zujuje ubuziranenge zatoranijwe mu murima ukoresheje lente zifatanije n\u2019ibiti bizima, uburyo bwa gakondo bwo guhitamo imbuto. Iyo bimaze gusarurwa, abakozi ba koperative bandika imbuto zatoranijwe z'ibihingwa bitandukanye kandi bakabibika muburyo butandukanye hakurikijwe ubwoko bw'imbuto. Kugeza ubu, nta sisitemu yemewe yo kwandika ubumenyi gakondo hamwe namakuru ajyanye nubwoko bwibanze bwabitswe muri Community gene bank. Amakuru ajyanye nubwoko, ubufindo, amatariki yo gutera, Amatariki yo guca nyakatsi, gufumbira n'imvaruganda n'amatariki yo gusarura kubwoko bwose bibitswe mu ikaye, bitandukanijwe neza nibikorwa n'ibihe. Aya makaye abikwa n'umunyamabanga wa koperative. Abagize komite bagirana inama buri kwezi yo kuganira kubibazo, ariko intebe ishobora guhamagaza inama ibidasobanutse mugihe byihutirwa. Inyandikomvugo ibikwa n'umunyamabanga. \nThe community gene banki uhabwa inkunga ya tekiniki muri RAB na agronome w'umurenge. Vuba aha, yahawe inkunga nto ya na Bioversity International yo kugura amasahani, ibikoresho bya pulasitiki, amacupa n'umuti wica udukoko. Umuganda gene banki ikorana nurubyiruko rwa Isonga Mw'Isango koperative kandi yahujwe n'abandi bahinzi n'imiryango ya leta kuri urwego rwigihugu, nka Caritas Rwanda, umuryango utegamiye kuri leta (ONG) ukora mu buhinzi, na RAB. Vuba aha, abanyamuryango ba koperative ya rubaya basuye koperative ya community gene banki muri Uganda kugirango basangire uburambe no kuganira kubibazo bya gene banki, harimo inzira yo kwagura amasoko y'umusaruro, kubungabunga ibyagezweho no kubika imbuto z'ibishyimbo neza. Mu ruzinduko, abahinzi baturutse mu bihugu byombi bifatanije n\u2019aborozi n\u2019abandi bahanga mu gusuzuma uruhare rw\u2019imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere ndetse n\u2019ingamba zo guhangana nazo, no kugena imico yifuza guhuza n'imihindagurikire y'ikirere impinduka. Bakoze kandi isuzuma ry'itabira ryimbuto zabo kugirango babone izifite iyo mico yajya ihangana n'ihindagurika ry'ikirere. Icya nyuma, ariko ntarengwa, bashishoje k'uburyo abahinzi bashobora guhanahana ubwoko bw' imbuto.\nPolitiki y'ibidukikije.\nPolitiki y'u Rwanda yo guhuza ubutaka no kwibanda ku gihingwa kimwe cy'ibanze yagize ingaruka mbi ku bikorwa bya koperative ya gene banki kuko ubwoko bwayo bw'ibihingwa ntibishobora guhingwa mu bwisanzure n'abahinzi. Guverinoma ikwirakwiza imbuto (ubwoko bunoze) hamwe nifumbire mvaruganda murwego rwo kongera umusaruro. Icyakora, Ubuyobozi bw'ikigo gishinzwe gukurikirana inyungu n'imikorere y'amakoperative mu Rwanda (Rwanda Cooperative Association RCA) bwatanze inama kubagize komite ya koperative uburyo bwo kuringaniza ubwoko bw'imbuto buteganijwe n'ubwoko bwabo bwo guhitamo. \nRubaya coomunity gene banki yashoye RWF 889.000 (hafi US $ 1.306) yo gushiraho no kubungabunga yimbuto zayo. Aya mafaranga yafashije kwishyura ikiguzi cyo gukodesha ubutaka, kugura imbuto n'ifumbire no guhemba umukozi. Rubaya community gene banki ntishobora gukora idafite inkunga yo hanze kuko ubukode bwubutaka nigiciro cyubuhinzi\ninyongeramusaruro ni ndende. Kugira ngo banki ya gene yigenge mubukungu kandi irambye, abahinzi bakeneye ubufasha bwamafaranga nubuhanga kugirango bashobore kwagura ibikorwa byabo no kongera umusaruro ninyungu.\nAhazaza.\nUrebye ahazaza, The community gene bank yashizeho imiyoboro hamwe na RAB kurwego rwigihugu hamwe nubushakashatsi bwubuhinzi bwigihugu cya Uganda Ishirahamwe kurwego rwakarere kugirango ibone inkunga ya tekiniki. Koperative nayo ikeneye gushimangirwa mubijyanye nubuyobozi."}
{"id": "10156", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10156", "title": "Safe water", "text": "Safe water.\nWater is connected to every forms of life \nOn the earth. As a creteria, an adequate, clean\nAnd safe drinking water supply has to be available\nFor various users.\nImportant of cleaning water.\nClean water and sanitation are one of most important\nthings required of the health of humans. Our day to day activities require numerous espacts in which clean water in required for sustainable living.\nIf water is cloudy, allow to sattle, them skim the clean water..\nStore the boiled water in clean sanitized container\nWith tight covers.\nFiltering:\nFilter water through a clean cloth, \nPaper towel, or coffee filter or allow\nits to settle, then draw off the clean water.\ncontents:\nw"}
{"id": "10157", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10157", "title": "Ubuhinzi bw'imigano mu Rwanda", "text": "Umugano ni igihingwa gikura vuba cyane kwisi. Ubwoko bumwe na bumwe bwimigano bushobora gukura kurenza metero 1 kumunsi, nibura cm 4 ku isaha imwe. Politiki yo mu Rwanda yemeje ko ibiti by'imigano byakongerwa mu mashyamba n'ingamba z'iterambere muri rusange, ariko igice kimwe cya societe kiracyumva ko hakitatabwa cyane kubyerekeranye nubushobozi bwimigano no gutanga ibisubizo kubibazo byakazi mu igihugu. Imigano mu Rwanda ihinze k'ubuso bwa hegitari 4382 z'ubutaka, bingana na 1.82 ku ijana by'amashyamba yose y\u2019igihugu. Mu Rwanda, hari amoko atandukanye y'imigano, harimo Bambusa vulgaris, Arundinaria alpine na Oxythenanthera abyssinica. Ubushakashatsi bwakorewe muri Ruhande Arboreum bwerekanye ko Dendrocalamus giganteus ari ubundi bwoko bukura neza mu Rwanda.\nAmateka.\nUmuyobozi mukuru wa Bambousa Ltd, Jean Bosco Uwizeyimana, avuga ko ubufatanye bwa Leta n\u2019abikorera mu micungire y\u2019ibihingwa by\u2019imigano mu Rwanda butazashimangira gusa icyifuzo cya guverinoma cyo kongera icyatsi kibisi, ahubwo kizafasha kugera ku mibereho myiza n'inyungu z'ubukungu ndetse inyungu z\u2019ibidukikije.\nUwizeyimana, ufite uruganda rwe rukora kirida, (inkoni ya barbecue) mu biti by'imigano, yavuze ko usibye gukemura ibibazo cy'igabanuka ry\u2019ibidukikije, no kwangirika kw'ubutaka no gutema amashyamba, imigano ishobora no kugira uruhare runini mu guhanga imirimo, kwinjiza amafaranga binyuze mu kongerera agaciro ibikomoka k'umugano. Nizera ko leta n'abikorera nibamara guhurira hamwe kugira ngo bakoreshe ayo mahirwe yo kubyaza umugano agaciro, dushobora kubona ibicuruzwa byinshi by'agaciro, nka fibre, ibiryo n'ibindi bishimangirwa muri gahunda ya Made-in-Rwanda bivuye mu biti by'imigano. Yasabye Guverinoma gushora imari mu kongera ubushobozi kugira ngo igire uruhare runini mu biti by'imigano, usibye kugera ku ntego y'igihugu 30% by'amashyamba. \nMu nama yabereye i Kigali, yakiriwe na Minisiteri y'Umutungo Kamere Dr Vincent Biruta, yavuze ko iyi nama yahamagariwe gusangira ubunararibonye hagati y\u2019abafata ibyemezo n\u2019abikorera ku giti cyabo mu gutunganya imigano, kunoza ubufatanye no kuganira ku buryo bwo guteza imbere igihingwa cy'imigano. Kuva mu mwaka wa 2010, minisiteri yazamuye imigano kugira ngo ikoreshwe nka zone buffer ku nkombe z'umugezi, harimo Akanyaru, Sebeya na Nyabarongo. Icyakora, abashoramari bake bahisemo gushishikarira iki gikorwa, kiganisha ku gusarura amashyamba yimigano \u201cyeze\u201d. Biruta yagize ati \" dukeneye abantu bashobora gusarura ibiti by'imigano no kubikoresha mugutunganya amenyo, ubukorikori, nibindi.\nAkazi.\nU Rwanda rukwiranye no gukoresha imigano kandi inyungu zayo zirashobora kugerwaho haba ku bidukikije ndetse no ku bantu. Urebye imiterere y\u2019imirima itatanye hirya no hino mu Rwanda, hari amahirwe yo gushinga inganda zikomeye z\u2019imigano zidasaba ikoranabuhanga rinini ariko zongerera agaciro ibicuruzwa bitoshye. Guverinoma irashaka gukorana cyane n\u2019abikorera kugira ngo ibyo bigerweho, byatanga akazi kandi bikazamura amafaranga mu cyaro,\nAkamaro k'imigano.\nKuberako imigano ishobora gukura kubutaka butandukanye, imigano irashobora guhingwa neza mubihugu byinshi bikunda kwangizwa n'ibiza ndetse n'imihindagurikire y'ikirere. Kongera igihingwa cy'Imigano ni uburyo bwiza bwo kugabanya imihindagurikire y\u2019ikirere hamwe n\u2019ibihingwa bikurikirana, bikurura toni ziri hagati ya 100 na 400 za karubone kuri hegitari. Mu 1997, hashyizweho umuryango mpuzamahanga uhuriweho na leta hagamijwe guteza imbere ubuhinzi bw\u2019imigano, Umuryango mpuzamahanga w\u2019imigano na Rattan. Ubusanzwe imigano isarurwa nkibikoresho byo kubaka, ibiryo, ubukorikori nibindi bicuruzwa byakozwe"}
{"id": "10158", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10158", "title": "Ishyirahamwe ryo kubungabunga ibidukikije mu Rwanda", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ryo kubungabunga ibidukikije mu Rwanda (mu gifaransa: Association pour la Conservation de la Nature au Rwanda [ACNR]) ni Umuryango utegamiye kuri Leta washinzwe muri Kanama 1992 mu rwego rwo gushyira mu bikorwa u Rwanda, Itangazo rya Rio ku bidukikije n'iterambere. ACNR yiyemeje guteza imbere kubungabunga urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima binyuze mu micungire kandi irambye yo gucunga umutungo kamere mu Rwanda. Ibikorwa byibanda ku guteza imbere no gushyira mu bikorwa gahunda, ingamba n\u2019imishinga kugira ngo urusobe rw\u2019ibinyabuzima (amashyamba, ibishanga), cyane cyane inyoni n\u2019uturere tw\u2019ibinyabuzima (IBA) bibungabunzwe kandi bikarindwa, kugira ngo ubuzima bwabyo n\u2019ubunyangamugayo bibe mu mibereho yabyo. \nACNR ni ishyirahamwe ryabanyamuryango hamwe nabanyamuryango 135 baturutse mu gihugu hose. Amatsinda 14 yigisha kumutungo kamere n'imibereho y'inyamaswa mumashuri (abantu barenga 3.500) hamwe na santeri 5.\nInshingano.\nInshingano z'umuryango ACNR ni uguteza imbere no kubungabunga urusobe rw'ibinyabuzima binyuze mugushyiraho imicungire irambye yo kwita k'umutungo kamere mu Rwanda. \nIcyerecyezo.\nIcyerekezo cy'umushinga wa ACNR nugufasha abanyarwanda bose kumva kandi bakagira uruhare mukubungabunga urusobe rwibinyabuzima kubwinyungu zabazabakomokaho ndetse nigihe kizaza.\nItegeko rigenga ibikorwa by'umushinga ACNR.\nImbaraga zo kubungabunga ubutaka ku isi zishimangirwa n\u2019igihugu ndetse n\u2019ibihugu by\u2019amategeko agenga ibidukikije. Harimo amategeko agenga umutungo, amategeko agenga imikoreshereze yubutaka, amategeko yimisoro nogushyigikira imari, hamwe noguha ubushobozi amategeko yo kubungabunga no kurengera ibidukikije biherereye muduce twashyizweho n'abantu, aya mategeko ashyirwaho kandi yihariye n'igihugu cyangwa akemezwa n'inama igena amategeko y'igihugu.Turahuza abakora ibikorwa byo kubungabunga ibidukikije bakoresha, batezimbere kandi bahuza ibikoresho byemewe n'amategeko hamwe na politiki kugirango bashireho uburyo bukomeye butuma abantu n\u2019imiryango bakora ibikorwa byiza kandi birambye byo kubungabunga ubutaka mu nkiko zabo.\nUbushakashatsi bwakozwe n'umushinga mu mujyi wa Kigali.\nKigali n'umurwa mukuru n'umujyi munini w'u Rwanda. Ni mu gihugu hagati, washinzwe mu 1907 kuri metero 1.567 (5,141 ft). Ubu ituwe na baturage bagera kuri miliyoni 1.2 kandi igizwe n'uturere dutatu aritwo: Gasabo, Kicukiro na Nyarugenge (Umujyi 2016). Ubushakashatsi bwakorewe mu turere twose tugize uyu mujyi wa Kigali, ahantu 5 hakorewe ubushakashatsi; 3 muri ho ni abattoirs (Nyabugogo, Kabuga &amp; Kicukiro abattoir) n'imbuga 2 zimenwaho imyanda (nyanza &amp; Nduba) aho ushobora gusanga imirambo y'ibiguruka n' imyanda aho usanga ubwoko bwibisimba byinshi bigaragaye murwego rwo kugirango zibone ibyo zirya. Umubare wose wakoreshejwe mugihe cyo gusura ibice bitabwaho imyanda kugirango hasuzumwe ibisigazwa by'ibiguruka byahatakarije ubuzima ndetse nibindi bihashakira imibereho byashyizwe hanze Ku ya 29 Nzeri 2017, 23 Ukwakira 2017, na 10 Werurwe 2018, Association pour la Conservation de la Nature au Rwanda (ACNR), kubufatanye Kaminuza yu Rwanda (UR), umujyi wa Kigali, imicungire y'ibimboteri 2 b'imyanda, nabantu batuye munkengero nabatuye hafi yaho ubushakashatsi bwarimo gukorerwa kugirango hamenyekane ubwoko bw\u2019ibisimba, imiryango biturukamo no kwita kukumenya igituma ibisimba bigabanuka, ubushakashatsi bwabereye ku kimboteri cya Nyanza, Mwendo na Nduba, ndetse no muri Nyabugogo, Kicukiro na Kabuga abattoirs mumujyi wa Kigali, u Rwanda\nUmwanzuro.\nUbu bushakashatsi bwatanga amakuru yibanze kugirango ashimangire ubuvugizi bwo kubungabunga ubuturo bwubwoko bwibisimba mumujyi ndetse nigihugu muri rusange. Ibi bizaganisha kuri guteza imbere gahunda y'ibikorwa byuzuye yo kubungabunga ibisiga byamenyekanye muri Rwanda."}
{"id": "10160", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10160", "title": "Kugaruka kw'intare muri parike akagera", "text": "kugarura intare mu kagera\nBigaragaza ko u Rwanda ruza\nKwisonga muduteza imbere\nUbukera rugendo.\nparike nasiyonari Akagera niyo \nIza kw'isonga mu gusurwa cyane \nNaba mukera rugendo mu Rwanda.\nIyi parike iri kubuso bwa kilometero kare\n1,122. Ikora ku turere nka katonza,Nyagatare,\nGatsibo mu burasirazuba bwu Rwanda. Akaba \nArinayo nini. \nImibereho nu uburyo intare zororoka.\nWaruziko mugihe cy'ubukonje...\nInyungu ku baturage b' igihugu... "}
{"id": "10161", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10161", "title": "Ishyirahamwe ryo kubungabunga inyamaswa zo mu Rwanda", "text": "Ishyirahamwe ryo kubungabunga inyamaswa zo mu Rwanda (mu cyongereza: Rwanda Wildlife Conservation Association [RWCA]) yashinzwe na Dr. Olivier Nsengimana mu 2015 kugira ngo ikureho ubucuruzi butemewe bw\u2019inyamaswa nk'imisambi () mu Rwanda no kwagura ibikorwa by'ubushakashatsi no kubungabunga andi moko yangiritse kandi abangamiwe mu Rwanda no mu karere ka Afurika y\u2019iburasirazuba.\nUbutumwa.\nInshingano z'umuryango wacu ni ugutanga ibisubizo birambye kubibazo bikomeye byo kubungabunga inyamaswa mu Rwanda no mukarere ka Afrika yuburasirazuba dukoresheje uburyo bwose bushoboka na disipulini nyinshi nk'inzira imwe yadufasha kugera k'ubuzima bw'imyamaswa neza.\nUbushakashatsi.\nMu ibarura ryabo ryambere ryigihugu rya Gray Crowned Crane muri 2017, babonye crane 487. Muri 2019 umubare wa crane wabonetse wageze kuri 748! RWCA ikora ibarura ikoresheje ubushakashatsi mu kirere no ku butaka. RWCA yashyizeho itsinda ry'abantu 30 bashinzwe kubungabunga ibidukikije bakorera mu bice by'igihugu kandi bahora babika amashusho ya Gray Crowned Cranes bakoresheje porogaramu yihariye. Muri 2019 hakozwe inyandiko 1045 zo kureba hamwe namakuru ajyanye nimyororokere yizi nyamaswa naho zikunda gutura.\nAmateka ya Grey crowned crane.\nThe Grey crowned Crane, ifitanye isano rya hafi na black crowned crane, kandi ubwo bwoko bwombi bwagiye bufatwa nkubwoko bumwe. Bwombi buratandukanye hashingiwe ku bimenyetso bya genetike, guhamagarwa, plumage n'ibice byambaye ubusa nka maguru, kandi abategetsi bose babifata nk'ubwoko butandukanye muri iki gihe. Hariho ubwoko bubiri, muri afurika y'iburasirazuba B.r. gibbericeps (crested crane) buherereye m'uburasirazuba bwa repubulika iharanira demokarasi ya Kongo no muri Uganda, iyo nyoni ihagarariwe mu ibendera ry'igihugu, na Kenya muburasirazuba bwa Afrika yepfo. Ifite ahantu hanini h'uruhu rutukura rwambaye ubusa hejuru yuruhu rwera kuruta ubwoko buto butoranijwe, B. r. regulorum (outh African crowned crane), yororoka kuva Angola yepfo kugera muri Afrika yepfo."}
{"id": "10162", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10162", "title": "Partnership for Enhancing Agriculture in Rwanda through Linkages", "text": "Ubufatanye mu kuzamura ubuhinzi mu Rwanda binyuze mu guhuza isoko (icyongereza:Partnership for Enhancing Agriculture in Rwanda through Linkages PEARL), wari umushinga wo guteza imbere ubuhinzi mu Rwanda. \nIntego ya PEARL kwari ugufasha igihugu cy'u Rwanda mu bikorwa byo kwiyubaka bivuye ku ngaruka za Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994. PEARL yakoranye n\u2019abaturage bo mu cyaro hirya no hino mu Rwanda kugira ngo binjize amafaranga binyuze mu guteza imbere ibikomoka ku buhinzi no guhuza isoko.\nPEARL yatewe inkunga n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019Amerika gishinzwe iterambere mpuzamahanga kandi kiyobowe n\u2019abashakashatsi bo muri kaminuza ya Leta ya Michigan, kaminuza ya Texas A&amp;amp;M n\u2019inzego zinyuranye z\u2019u Rwanda zirimo kaminuza nkuru y\u2019u Rwanda, Ikigo cy\u2019ubushakashatsi mu buhinzi mu Rwanda, Ikigo cy\u2019ubumenyi, ikoranabuhanga n\u2019imicungire mu Rwanda. n'Ikigo cy'igihugu gishinzwe ikawa. Amikoro ya kaminuza yanyujijwe mu cyaro hagamijwe guteza imbere ubuhinzi no kongera amafaranga.\nUmushinga wakoranye namakoperative y'abahinzi kongera no kwamamaza ibicuruzwa bitandukanye by'ubuhinzi, byibanda ku ikawa n\u2019ibindi. Kongera kwitondera kugenzura ubuziranenge no guhuzagurika mu musaruro byatumye habaho intsinzi mu byoherezwa mu mahanga. Urugero rwo gutsinda ni umusaruro no kugurisha ikawa ya Maraba iva Maraba, mu Rwanda. Umuyobozi wa PEARL yari Dr. Timothy Schilling."}
{"id": "10163", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10163", "title": "Sugar production in Rwanda", "text": "U Rwanda rutanga umubare muto w'isukari y'ibara ry'umukara mu bihugu bine muri bitandatu bigize Umuryango w'Afurika y'Iburasirazuba, ari nka Kenya, u Rwanda, Tanzaniya na Uganda, bingana na toni zigera ku 12.000, buri mwaka guhera muri Kanama 2016. Hamwe n\u2019ikoreshwa ry\u2019i gihugu ripima toni zigera kuri 90.000 za metero buri mwaka muri 2016, biteganijwe ko muri 2020, imikoreshereze y\u2019umwaka izaba igeze kuri toni 160.000, bitwara amadolari arenga miliyoni 150 yo gutumiza mu mahanga. akeneye kuvugururwa.\nUmusaruro wumurage.\nNyuma ya jenoside yo mu Rwanda yo muri 1994, guverinoma nshya ya FPR yirukanye Kabuye Sugar Works, uruganda rukora isukari rukumbi muri iki gihugu mu itsinda rya Madhvani ryo muri Uganda, mu rwego rwo kugura miliyoni 1.5 z'amadolari y'Amerika. Uruganda rutanga metero ziri hagati ya 10,000 na 15.000 za tome yisukari yumukara buri mwaka. Itandukaniro ritumizwa muri Uganda no mu turere twa kure harimo Ubushinwa na Amerika y'Epfo. \nUmusaruro mushya uteganijwe.\nItsinda rya Madhvani rirateganya kongera umusaruro i Kabuye kugera kuri toni 55.000 buri mwaka. Iterambere ririmo ishoramari rishya rifite agaciro ka miliyoni 75 z'amadolari (hafi miliyari 60 z'amafaranga y'u Rwanda), n'itsinda. Harimo kubaka sitasiyo yumuriro wa co-generation ifite ingufu za n'ikigo gikora Ethanol gifite ubushobozi bwo gukora miliyono 6 z'amadolare buri mwaka. Ubutaka bwinshi burasabwa guhinga inkoni nyinshi kugirango iyi ntego igerweho. Guverinoma y'u Rwanda n'itsinda rya Madhvani bakoze ibiganiro kugira ngo iyi gahunda igerweho. Muri Kanama 2016, guverinoma yashyize umukono ku masezerano y\u2019ubwumvikane n\u2019abashoramari baturutse muri Maurice, kugira ngo bashinge uruganda rushya rw\u2019isukari mu Ntara y\u2019Uburasirazuba bw\u2019u Rwanda, bivugwa ko ruzatwara hagati y\u2019amadolari miliyoni 250 na miliyoni 300 z'amadorali. Hafi ya 8 yu butaka burasabwa gukora umurima wa nucleus, hamwe nabahinzi-borozi batanga ibisigaye bisabwa. Uruganda rukora amashanyarazi rufitemegawate zigera 25 birateganijwe. Ubushobozi bwo kubyaza umusaruro iki kigo gishya buteganijwe kuri toni zigera kuri 100.000 metrike buri mwaka. "}
{"id": "10164", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10164", "title": "Gucunga Imyanda mu Rwanda", "text": "Incamake.\n90% by\u2019imyanda iboneka hirya no hino mu gihugu itwarwa ndetse ikajungunwa ahantu hatemewe kandi hatizewe. Akenshi, usanga imyanda ijya mu migezi, mu masoko y\u2019imigezi, ndetse ikajya mu bihingwa. Ibi bituma habaho ukwandura gukomeye kw\u2019amazi yo kunywa ndetse n\u2019ibindi byanduza cyane cyane bituruka mu bice bituwe cyane n\u2019amashuri, ndetse n\u2019inkongi zitera imyotsi myinshi yanduza ikirere. \nU Rwanda rukaba rusesengura uburyo butandukanye bwakoreshwa mu gucunga imyanda, hagahinduka uburyo bwo gucunga imyanda hakoreshejwe ibimoteri, ahubwo hagakoreswa ubundi buryo burambye kandi bukemura ibibazo bitera ku bidukikije. \u00a0FONERWA ikazafasha mu guha amahirwe no gufasha imishinga n\u2019ishoramali mu rwego rwo kwihutisha ishyirwa mu bikorwa ry\u2019uburyo bwo kugira imicungire irambye y\u2019imyanda.\nImijyi ibungabunga ibidukikije.\nU Rwanda ruragira imijyi ku kigero kihuta cyane, aho 35% b\u2019abaturage biteganyijwe ko bazaba batuye mu mijyi mu mwaka wa 2021. Umuvuduko w\u2019ukwaguka kw\u2019imijyi byitezweko uzakomeza kwiyongera kuko Igihugu kirushaho kubakira ubukungu bwacyo ku mijyi iteye imbere ndetse n\u2019umwego rwa serivisi\nNanone, Muri gahunda ya Leta y\u2019icyerezo 2020, u Rwanda rwashyize imbere cyane iterambere ry\u2019imijyi irambye, kandi uku kwaguka kw\u2019imijyi kutabangamiye \u00a0ibidukikije. Hashyizweho inzira ndetse n\u2019uburyo busobanutse bugenga iterambere ry\u2019umujyi wa Kigali ndetse n\u2019imijyi 6 yunganira Kigali mu rwego rwo kurushaho kuyobora iyubakwa ry\u2019ibikorwaremezo by\u2019umujyi ndetse n\u2019igenamigambi ryawo\nBy\u2019umwihariko, FONERWA itera inkunga ishyirwamubikorwa ry\u2019umushinga w\u2019ikitegererezo wa 620ha wiswe Green City Kigali wo gukora inyigo y\u2019umujyi utangiza ibidukikije ishobora no kwifashishwa hirya no hino mu gihugu ndetse no kugaragaza indi mishinga yunguka mu bice by\u2019imijyi mu nzego zirimo zerivisi z\u2019amazi, ubwikorezi, ikoranabunganga n\u2019itumanaho."}
{"id": "10166", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10166", "title": "African Wildlife Foundation", "text": "The African Wildlife Foundation (AWF) n\u2019umuryango mpuzamahanga uyobora ibidukikije wibanda gusa ku nyamaswa zo muri Afurika ndetse n\u2019ubutaka bwo ku gasozi. Gahunda za AWF n'ingamba zo kubungabunga ibidukikije bigamije kurengera inyamaswa n\u2019ubutaka bwa Afurika no guharanira ejo hazaza heza h\u2019abatuye ba Afurika.\nAWF irinda inyamaswa zo muri Afurika n'ubutaka bwo ku gasozi ziherereyemo n'umutungo kamere. Kuva ryashingwa mu 1961, uyu muryango warinze amoko n\u2019ubutaka bigenda byangirika, uteza imbere imishinga yo kubungabunga ibidukikije ifasha abaturage bo muri Afurika, kandi ihugura abenegihugu b\u2019Afurika babungabunga ibidukikije.\nAmateka ya AWF.\nFondasiyo Nyafurika Yita ku Buzima bw'inyamaswa (AWLF) yashinzwe mu 1961 na, umucamanza ukize akaba n'umuhigi, akaba n'umwe mu bagize club ya Washington Safari. Abandi banyamuryango bashinze Club ya Safari ni, wahoze ari umusirikare w\u2019ingabo z\u2019Amerika zirwanira mu mazi akaba n\u2019umunyamakuru; wo muri CIA; James S. Bugg, umucuruzi; na, nyuma aba umuyobozi ushinzwe imari ya \nTrain yari ifite impungenge ko abashinzwe parike y\u2019iburayi bazasimburwa n\u2019abanyafurika batujuje ibyangombwa mu bikorwa byo kubungabunga ibidukikije mu gihe ibihugu bya Afurika byabonye ubwigenge. Ibihugu 20 byo muri Afurika byigenga mu 1960 na 1961. Train yaranditse ati: \"Muri Tanganyika honyine, guverinoma iherutse gutegeka ko Abanyafurika 100% binjira muri serivisi y\u2019imikino bitarenze 1966! Yumvaga ko byihutirwa gutoza Abanyafurika kuba inzobere mu nyamaswa\nIbyagezweho.\nInkunga ya mbere yatanzwe na AWLF ni $ 47,000 yo gufasha kubona i Mweka, muri Tanzaniya mu 1963. Iri shuri ryateguwe na Bruce Kinloch, Umuyobozi mukuru w\u2019imikino ya Tanganyika, nk\u2019ikigo cy\u2019ubupayiniya cyo guhugura abayobozi b\u2019inyamanswa zo muri Afurika. Inkunga ya Mweka nayo yatanzwe n\u2019ikigo cy\u2019, hamwe n\u2019, hamwe n\u2019ibikoresho byatanzwe na guverinoma ya. Kugeza mu mwaka wa 2010, iryo shuri ryari rimaze guhugura abashinzwe inyamaswa zirenga 4.500 baturutse mu bihugu 28 bya Afurika ndetse n\u2019ibihugu 18 bitari Afurika\nMu 1963, AWLF yatangije gahunda yo gutanga buruse yo kuzana abanyafrika bato muri kaminuza zo muri Amerika aho bashoboraga kwiga ibijyanye n\u2019ibinyabuzima n\u2019imicungire y\u2019ibinyabuzima. AWLF yubatse ikigo cyigisha kubungabunga ibidukikije muri uwo mwaka, giherereye ku bwinjiriro bwa parike ya Nairobi. Mu 1967, AWLF yatanze $ 50.000 yo gutera inkunga yo kubaka ikigo cy'ubushakashatsi muri Tanzaniya. Mu 1970, AWF yashinze ishuri rishinzwe gucunga inyamaswa i, muri Kameruni, ritanga inyigisho mu gifaransa. Mu myaka ya za 1970 na 1980, AWLF yakomeje gutera inkunga abanyeshuri, kandi inafasha mu bikorwa byo kubungabunga ibidukikije, akenshi itanga ibikoresho nk'amahema, ibikoresho by'ibinyabiziga, pompe y'amazi, n'ibikoresho bifotora aho gutanga amafaranga.\nMu 1969, AWLF yafashe iyambere mubukangurambaga bushigikiwe nandi matsinda yo kubungabunga imvubu. Mu 1974, fondasiyo yatangiye gahunda yo kwiga ingwe. Mu 1983, AWF yaretse \"Ubuyobozi\" mu izina ryayo. Train yababajwe nimpinduka, yizera ko umuryango wabuze umwimerere w'inshingano zawo. Kuri we, ryari ryarahindutse irindi shyirahamwe ryo kubungabunga ibidukikije, ritanga inkunga ku burengerazuba bwo gukora ubushakashatsi ku nyamaswa. Nyamara, ubushakashatsi nkibikorwa bya Dian Fossey ku ngagi na Cynthia Moss ku nzovu, byombi byashyigikiwe na AWF, biragaragara ko byari ingirakamaro\nFondasiyo yaharaniye gushaka amafaranga. Mu 1968, ingengo yumwaka yari munsi y $ 250.000 USD. Mu 1988, umwaka AWF yatangiriyeho ubukangurambaga bwo kurwanya guhiga inzovu, fondasiyo yari ifite abakozi batandatu ningengo yumwaka ingana na miliyoni 2 gusa. Igihe AWF yujuje imyaka 30 mu 1991, akanama gashinzwe umutekano gakomeje kwiganjemo Abanyamerika bakomeye kandi bakize, benshi muri bo bakoreraga ku zindi nzego zidaharanira inyungu.\nIcyicaro muri Afurika.\nIcyicaro gikuru cya African Wildlife Foundation kiri i Nairobi, muri Kenya gifite ibiro muri Afurika y'Epfo, Tanzaniya, Uganda, Zambiya na Washington, DC. Ishirahamwe risonewe umusoro hakurikijwe ingingo ya 501 (c) (3) yigitabo c'imisoro n'amahoro. Kugeza mu 2009 hari 36 bagize Inama y'Ubutegetsi n'abakozi 132 bahembwa. Amafaranga akusanywa binyuze mu butumwa butaziguye, gutanga ibyifuzo, kujurira kuri interineti, gutanga gahunda, kwamamaza bijyanye n'impamvu, no kujurira abanyamuryango. Abayobozi bakuru ba fondasiyo babaye"}
{"id": "10169", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10169", "title": "IMYUKA IVA MU BINYABIZIGA NO MUNGANDA IHUMANYA IKIRERE", "text": "Reta y'u Rwanda yatangije gahunda yo kugabanya imyuka ihumanya ikirere iyo myuka ikaba iva byumihariko; mu binyabiziga cyane cyane mu modoka hakorwa ubugenzuzi mu binyabiziga byakozwe mbere ya 1992 harebwa amavuta akoresha na za moteri no kugabanya imyuka iva munganda na handi hatandukanye.\nIntego u Rwanda rufite mu kugabanya imyuka ihumanya ikirere.\nIntego igihugu cy'u Rwanda cyihaye yo kugabanya ku gipimo cya 38% imyuka yoherezwa mu kirere ikagipfukirana ibizwi nka (Green House Gases), izaba yagezweho mu gihe cyateganijwe cy'imyaka 10 iri imbere, ibi bikazunganirwa na gahunda zisanzweho zo kubungabunga ibidukikije zashyizweho na leta y'u Rwanda mukubungabunga ibidukikije. Iyi ntego yo kugabanya 38% ry'imyuka yoherezwa mu kirere izaba yagezweho muri 2030 nkuko Leta y'u Rwanda yabyiemeje.\nIbarurisha mibare ku myuka yorezwa mu kirere mu Rwanda.\nBimwe mu byohereza imyuka myinshi mu kirere mu Rwanda hari ibinyabiziga byohereza imyuka ingana na 13%, ibikorwa by'ubwubatsi nk'imihanda n'ibindi byohereza 14% by'imyuka, naho imyuka iva mu butaka ijya mu kirere ingana na 16%, amafumbire mvaruganda yoherezayo mu kirere imyuka ingana na 13%\u00a0 mu gihe ibishingwe byohereza 5% by'imyuka mu kirere.\nAmwe mu masezerano u Rwanda rwasinye mu kugabanya imyuka yoherezwa mu kirere..\nReta y'uRwanda yasinye amwe mu masezerano mpuza mahanga ajyanye no kugabanya imyuka ihumanya ikirere iva mu bikorwa bya muntu aya masezerano naya akurikira:\nIcyo itegeko nshinga rya repubulika y'u Rwanda rivuga kubidukikije..\nITEGEKO NGENGA N\u00b0 04/2005 RYO KUWA 08/04/2005 RIGENA UBURYO BWO KURENGERA, KUBUNGABUNGA NO GUTEZA IMBERE IBIDUKIKIJE MU RWANDA\nIbikorwa u Rwanda ruri gukora mu kugabanya imyuka ihumanya ikirere iva mu binyabiziga na handi hatandukanye..\nReta y'uRwanda yashyize imbaraga mu kugabanya bimwe mu bikorwa byangiza ibidukikije cyane ibisohora imyuka yangiza ihumanya ikirere.\nMurwego rw'ibinyabiziga hakozwe ibi bikurikira"}
{"id": "10171", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10171", "title": "Umusambi Village", "text": "Umusambi Village.\nUmusambi Village washinzwe n\u2019ishyirahamwe ryita ku nyamaswa zo mu Rwanda (Rwanda Wildlife Conservation Association) ziyobowe n\u2019umuvuzi w\u2019amatungo Olivier Nsengimana, ni igishanga cyagaruwe i Kigali, mu Rwanda kikaba ubuhungiro bw\u2019imisambi irenga 50(\"Balearica regulorum\") yakuwe mu bucuruzi butemewe bw'amatungo. \nIzi nyoni zamugaye kubera ubunyage, kutaba aho zagakwiye kuba kandi ntizishobora kurekurirwa mumashyamba. Umusambi Village uha izo nyoni ahantu ho kuba hazibereye kuburyo zongera kumva ziri aho zigomba kuba muburyo bwa kamere(reconnect with nature).\nUko Umusambi village watangijwe.\nNsengimana Olivier yatangije umushinga w'Umusambi Village mu mwaka wa 2014. Icyari kigamijwe kwari uguhagarika ubucuruzi butemewe bw'imisambi, guteza imbere ubukangurambaga mu kurekura imisambi myinshi yajyanywe ikagaruka mu buzima bwo ku gasozi, muri Parike ya Akagera.\nMuri uwo mushinga, basanze imisambi myinshi yaramugaye kubera gufungwa kwayo. Ibi bikunze guhuzwa no gufata no gutwara, ndetse no gukata amababa kugirango birinde ko iguruka, bishobora kugenda nabi cyane iyo bikozwe nta buhanga. \nibindi wasanga mu Umusambi village.\nMuri umusambi village hakorerwa ubworozi bw' izindi nyamanswa nk' ibinyugunyugu, uducurama nizindi. "}
{"id": "10172", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10172", "title": "Ibinyoro", "text": "Indwara y'ibinyoro\nIbinyoro n'indwara y'ibasira Ikiremwa muntu, Igafata cyane uruhu, amagufwa n'utundi duce, nka karitiraje, ibinyoro akaba n'indwara yandura hagati y'umuntu n'undi, ikaba yarabayeho kuva kera. \nUko indwara y'ibinyoro yandura.\nUbusanzwe indwara y'ibinyoro n'indwara utera Kwangirika kuruhu iyo itavuwe kare kandi ngo ivurwe neza.Indwara y'ibinyoro ikaba iterwa n'agakoko ka treponema pertenue. Indwara y' ibinyoro ikaba ikunda kuboneka mugihugu cyangwa mubice aho isuku arinke, nanone ibinyoro bikunda kuboneka mubice by'amashyamba, ikaba iterwa n'isuku nkeya.. "}
{"id": "10174", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10174", "title": "Schizophrenia", "text": "Schizophrenia ni indwara yibitekerezo irangwa no kwibeshya, kwibeshya, kuvuga nabi, imyitwarire idahwitse cyangwa imyitwarire ya catatonike, kimwe nibimenyetso bibi. Nibura kimwe muri ibyo bimenyetso kigomba kuba imvugo idahwitse, kwibeshya cyangwa kwibeshya. Abarwayi ntabwo byanze bikunze bahura nibi bimenyetso byose kandi haribisabwa byigihe, icyakora kubwubugufi sinzabinjiramo.\nIbitekerezo bya salusiyo no kwibeshya bigize schizofrenia bita ibimenyetso byiza. Iri jambo mubyukuri risobanura ko bahura nibintu byiyongera mubyukuri. Ibi biranga sikizofreniya nibyo bizwi cyane kandi bikunda kwitabira neza imiti.\nIgice cya sikizofreniya gikunze kuvugwa ni ibimenyetso bibi, cyangwa ibyo umuntu abura. Ibi bimenyetso birimo kwirinda (kubura motifike), kutagaragara mu maso, alogiya (kugabanya imvugo), na anedoniya (cyangwa bigoye kumva umunezero.) Ibi bimenyetso bibi ntibishobora kwitabira neza imiti kandi birashobora kuba igice kibabaza cyane muriyi ndwara..\nAbantu barwaye sikizofreniya nabo usanga bafite ubushishozi buke mumiterere yabo kandi ntibatahure ko bafite uburiganya cyangwa salusiyo, ahubwo basa nkukuri. Ibi bituma sikizofreniya igora cyane kuyivura kuko abantu barwaye sikizofreniya bakunze kutemeranya ko bafite iyi ndwara kandi ntibumve impamvu bakeneye gufata imiti. Uku kubura ubushishozi gufatwa nijambo 'anosognosia.'\nAho gutekereza rero - yewe uriya musore yumva amajwi, agomba kuba schizofrenic, nyamuneka gerageza kwibuka ko sikizofreniya igoye cyane kurenza iyo. Hariho izindi ndwara nyinshi zo mumutwe zishobora kubamo salusiyo no kwibeshya usibye schizofrenia. Muri byo harimo indwara ikomeye yo kwiheba ifite imiterere ya psychotic, indwara ya bipolar ifite imiterere ya psychotic, indwara ya psychotic disorder, schiziophrenifom, hamwe nibintu / imiti itera indwara ya psychotic, nkavuga amazina make.\nKuvura sikizofreniya bisaba kwisuzumisha no kwisuzumisha kwa muganga w\u2019indwara zo mu mutwe cyangwa umuforomo w\u2019abaforomo w\u2019indwara zo mu mutwe ushobora kwandika imiti igabanya ubukana."}
{"id": "10175", "revid": "121925", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10175", "title": "History of Rwanda", "text": "Rwanda was a small country originated from Gasabo. She was under a control of kings and the time reached who were kings were replaced by president.The firs king of Rwanda was Gihanga Ngomijana.MUTARA III Rudahigwa ruled from 1931 TO 1959.He was replaced by Kigeli v NDAHINDURWA from 1959 to 1961 before one yea Rwanda to get Her independence as presidence.he became presidence in1962"}
{"id": "10181", "revid": "11335", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10181", "title": "Salima Mukansanga", "text": "Salima Radhia Mukansanga yavutse mu mwaka 1988 ni umusifuzi w'umupira wa amaguru mpuzamahanga ufite inkomoko mugihugu cy' u Rwanda\nSalima MUKANSANGA yavukiye muntara y'uburengerazuba mukarere ka Rusizi ari naho yakuriye, afite impamyabushobozi y'ikiciro cya 2 cya kaminuza mubijyanye n'ubuforomo n'ububyaza yakuye muri Kaminuza ya Gitwe yo mukarere ka Ruhango muntara y'amajyepfo. Mukasanga akiri mumashuri yisumbuye yifuzaga kuzaba umukinnyi wa Basketball. \nSalima Mukansanga yatangiriye urugendo rwe rwo gusifura, ubwo yigaga mumwaka wanyuma mumashuri yisumbuye kukigo cya Saint Vincent de Paul Musanze mumukino wanyuma w'irushanwa ryari ryateguwe n'ubuyobozi bw'icyo kigo.\nUyu munyarwandakazi yatangiye kugaragara mumwuga wogusifura umupira w'amaguru mugikombe cy'isi gitegurwa ni shirahamwe ry'umupira w'amaguru kw'isi FIFA cyabaye mu mwaka 2019 mu gihugu cy'Ubufaransa\nUmwuga.\nMukansanga Salima Rhadia ni umusifuzi mpuzamahanga w'umunyarwandakazi mu mwaka 2007 nibwo yatangiye gusifura bwambere byemewe na FERWAFA. \nmuwa 2012 abanyarwandakazi batanu babaye abasifuzi mpuzamahanga muri abobatanu babiri bohagati harimo Mukansanga abandi batatu arabo kumpande ku rwengo mpuzamahanga Mukansanga yatangiye gusifura nkumusifuzi wa 4 kugirango yisange asifura mukibuga hagati byamusabye imyaka 2 ubwo Zambiya yakinaga na Tanzania muri 2014 gushaka itike y'Igikombe cya Afurika,yitwaye neza bimufungurira amarembo yokuba umusifuzi kuruhando mpuzamahanga Mukansanga Akaba yarashyizwe kurutonde rwabasifuzi batatu Babadamu bazasifura igikombe cy'Isi muri Qatar.\nIbindi wamenya.\nUmunyarwandakazi Salma Mukansanga yasifuye umukino wa mbere mu mateka y'igikombe cya Africa cy'abagabo.\nnubwambere umukino warugiye kuyoborwa numugore mugikombe cya Afurika kuva cyatangira mumyaka 65 kimaze gikinwa,numukino yarayoboye womutsinda rya 2 waberaga i Yaound\u00e9 wahuzaga Zimbabwe na Guinnea, numukino wambere uyumunyarwandakazi yaragiye gusifura mugikombe cy'abagabo kandi numukino wari witezwe nabantu benshi, cyari ikintu gikomeye kuri Salima Mukansanga.\nSalima Mukansanga, mumwaka wa 2022 yabaye umugore wa mbere ukomoka kumugabane wa Afurika wasifuye mumikino yanyuma y'igikombe cy'isi cyabereye kumugabane wa Asia mugihugu cya Qatar."}
{"id": "10182", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10182", "title": "Nyagahura Margaret", "text": "Nyagahura Margaret (yavutse taliki 13 Kamena 1961) Ni umugore akaba umunyarwandakazi w'umunyapolitike, uzwi mu murimo igiye itandukanye mu gihugu. Nyagahura Margaret yabaye mu inteko inshinga amategeko aho yari mu mutwe wa badepite mu basenateri, ninaho yageje gutorewa kuba uwungirije Niyongana Gallican yatorewe kuba perezida akungirizwa na Nyagahura Margaret muri komisiyo y\u2019 imibereho myiza n'uburenganzira bwa muntu n\u2019ibibazo by\u2019abaturage. Nyakubahwa Margaret Nyagahura yarahiriye kuba umusenateri ku italiki 12 ukwakira 2012.\nIbyo Yakoze.\nNyagahura Margaret umunyarwandakazi wavutse taliki 13 kamena 1961 avuka mu Rwanda. Nyagahura Margaret akaba ari umusenaterikazi washyizweho na perezida wa repubulika Paul Kagame, akaba yarize akanakora ibijyanye na sociology ibijyanye nu bumenya muntu, wakoreraga kandi diaspora ari nkumufasha wita cyane ku barwayi, ari umutoza, no mu bagore bakora ubucuruzi ndetse akaba n\u2019umunyamabanga nshingwabikorwa w\u2019ishyirahamwe ry\u2019umuco nyarwanda baba muri Suwede. Nyagahura Margaret akaba ari umwe mubakoze ku isuzuma rikuru kuri CBC, aho bajyaga kuganira n'amashami atandukanye y'uburezi mu Rwanda; abarimu, abayobozi b'ibigo, abanyeshuri n'abayobozi b'inzego z'ibanze kugirango bamenye uko bihagaze n'ibibazo bihari mu burezi.\nAMASHAKIRO.\nhttps://web.archive.org/web/20210709182833/https://uok.ac.rw/senators-visit-university-kigali/"}
{"id": "10184", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10184", "title": "Gateka Esther Brianne", "text": "Gateka Esther Brianne wamamaye nka Dj Brianne ni umunyarwandakazi utuye mu Rwanda,ukora akazi ko kuvanga imiziki mu Rwanda. Gateka akaba ari umugore w' umunyamuzika uvanga imiziki aho yatsinze mu irushanwa rya The choice Awards. \nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nGateka Esther Brianne yavukiye mu gihugu cya Kenya ariko ubu atuye mu Rwanda niho akorera ibikorwa bye bya buri munsi, ni umubyeyi w'umwana umwe, atangaza ko atabayeho mu buzima bwiza akiri umwana, bikaba aribyo byamuhaye kuba akunda kandi akita ku bana cyane kugira ngo nabo batazabaho nabi. Avugako yubaha Imana, akunda abantu ariko ababazwa n'abamufata uko atari n'abamuca intege mu byo akora. Gateka Esther Brianne wahisemo kwita ku bana babayeho nabi cyane cyane abana baba ku muhanda, aho hatumye bitera impamvu Gateka yashinze umuryango wita ku bana ku muhanda wiswe Organisation La perle Briane Foundation ufasha abana mu buryo bwo kubasubiza mu mashuri, kubarinda cyane inzara ndetse no kubaha icyizere cy'ejo hazaza akaba yita ku bana bagera kuri 25.\nAkazi akora.\nDj Brianne akora akazi ko kuvanga imiziki, yamamaye cyane mu mwaka 2020 ubwo hariho guma mu rugo kubera icyorezo cya covid-19, Dj Brianne yagiye akorera ku bitangazamakuru bitandukanye bya Radio na Television aribyo Flash TV, Magic FM na Royal FM akaba n'ubu ari ho agikora. Dj Brianne ni umushoramari aho yashinze iduka ricuruza inzoga zizwi nka Rikeri(liquor) n'izindi zitandukanye. "}
{"id": "10185", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10185", "title": "Mukamabano gloria", "text": "Mukamabano Gloriose azwi nka gloria, ni Umunyamakuru w'ikigo kigihugu cy'itangazamakuru. Mukamabano Gloria akaba anashinzwe gukurikirana progaramu n'imikorere Bya kc2.\nGloria Mukamabano yaririmbye mundiro zabahanzi nyarwanda baba raperi batandukanye hari nkiyo bita ubuto bwanjye arikumwe na fireman(Ubuto bwanjye),yonjye kumvikana kandi mundirimbo (Bye bye Nyakatsi) arikumwe na Bull Dogg.\nUyumuhanzikazi akaba ari numunyamakuru kuri televiziyo y'urwanda."}
{"id": "10186", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10186", "title": "Darina kayumba", "text": "Kayumba Darina wambitswe ikamba ry igisonga cya kabiri rya Nyampinga wu Rwanda mu mwaka 2022.akaba yarangije amashuri yisumbuye. Nyampinga Darina waje mwirushanwa akaba mu bakobwa bahagarariye umujyi wa kigali.Miss Darina akaba yaraje muri top 3 yabantu bafite impano mw irushanwa rya Nyampinga wu Rwanda. Kayumba Darina ni umwe mu bakobwa beza bavuzwe na benshi mu irushanwa rya nympinga Miss Rwanda kubera ijambo ritamenyerewe intabire ryasakaye ahantu hose, ubwo we yivugiragako ashobora kuba yarayiriye. Kayumba Darina ubu we nabandi bakobwa bagenzi be babiri (harimo Mutabazi Sabine ndetse na Umuhoza Pascaline) aho rero bafunguye Sosiyete ya Groupon Entertainment aho izajya ikora ibijyanye no gutegura ibitaramo, Aho iki gitaramo kizabera ahitwa Envision ku wa Gatandatu tariki 29 Ukwakira 2022. Kayumba Darina akaba aherutse gupfusha papa umubyara ise. \nUmwuga.\nNyampinga Darina ni umunyamideli muri komanyi yitwa MJW management,MJW management ikaba ari mwe mukampanyi areberera inyungu z abanyamideli\u00a0 hirya n hino bagera kuri 4000 ifite icyicaro muri Etiopiya.\nMu busanzwe Darina azwi mukwampamariza amakompanyi agiye atandukanye dore ko ubu ari mu bakobwa bake mu Rwanda bakurikirwa ku rubuga rwa Instagram aho akurikirwa n ibihumbi 33.2 kandi buri munota kuwundi baba biyongera."}
{"id": "10189", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10189", "title": "Mutesi Marie Aime", "text": "Mutesi Marie Aime ni umupaster wumunyarwandakazi akaba umubyeyi wanyuze muntambara nyinshi mubuzima bwe agera aho yumva bimukomereye ubukene bumurembeje kuburyo yageze aho bimugora kwinjira murusengero ariko afata icyemezo cyo kwikomeza mu mana\nUbuzima bwite.\nPasiteri Mutesi Marie Aim\u00e9e ni umukozi w'Imana waherewe inshingano z\u2019ubupasiteri mu itorero rya muri Dormition Church International mu mwaka w'2016. amaze guhabwa ubupasiteri iri torero ryaje gufungwa ariko uyu mukozi w'Imana ntiyaretse gukorera Imana yakomeje kuvuga ubutumwa bwiza nk\u2019umuhamagaro we.\nUmutesi yakirijwe mu Itorero rya ADEPR Gasogi mu 1997, yigaga mu mwaka wa gatanu w\u2019amashuri abanza.\nUyu muvugabutumwa yanyuze mu matorero atandukanye, byanamufashije kugwiza igikundiro mu bayoboke be. Yabaye umwe mu bayobozi b\u2019Itorero rya Zion Temple mu Ntara y\u2019Amajyepfo ho muri Paruwasi ya Gisagara."}
{"id": "10191", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10191", "title": "Aissa Cyiza", "text": "Cyiza Aissa (yavutse 1990) ni umunyarwanda w'umunyamakuru wa bigize umwuga akaba yaratangiye uwo mwuga mu mwaka wa 2012, akaba yaratangiriye umwuga w'Itangazamakuru mu gitangazamakuru cya isango star mu gihe cy'imyaka itatu, aho yahise ajya ku kinyamakuru cya Royal FM arinaho akaba ariho abarizwa ubu. \nAmasomo.\nCyiza Aissa yize amashuri abanza muri Ecole Primaire Muhima aho yahavuye atangira ayisumbuye muri Groupe scolaire y' ibutare, ahava akomereza muri St Joseph I kabgayi, yahavuye akomereza muri ICK yi Kabgayi gusa ntiyaje gusoza ayo masomo, nyuma aza gusubukura amasomo muri ULK muri international relations.Cyiza ubwo yari arangije amashuri y'isumbuye yabonye Bourse imwemerera kwiga muri kaminuza ya KIE, arayanga kuko yaunda itangazamakuru. \nAkazi.\nCyiza Aissa yakoreye ibigo bigiye bitandukanye harimo ibitangazamakuru, ibigo by'igenga, ndetse no muri leta aho akora icyiganiro ISHYA vyinyura ku ikigo cy'igihugu cyitangazamakuru cya RBA, kuri television yu Rwanda. \nKuwa 24 Werurwe 2025, Cyiza Aissa yagizwe umuyobozi w'ungirije w'iradiyo ya Royal FM. Muri Kanama 2025, Aissa yagizwe Umuyobozi Mukuru wa radiyo Royal FM."}
{"id": "10192", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10192", "title": "Kalimpinya Queen", "text": "Kalimpinya Queen ni umukobwa w'umunyarwandakazi wavutse ku italiki ya 6 kanama mu mwaka 1998 avukira i kigali mu Rwanda. Queen yabaye igisonga cya gatatu cya nyampinga w'u Rwanda mu mwaka 2017.Mu birori byo kwizihiza isabukuru ye y'imyaka cumi n'icyenda yongeye kwerekana ubuhanga n\"ubwiza kandi n'urugwiro nkuko byashimangiwe nabagenzi be babanye muri miss rwanda bamuvuze ibigwi byinshi cyane. \nAmateka.\nKalimpinya Queen yavukiye mu karere ka Nyarugenge mu mujyi wa kigali ku italiki ya 6 kanama mu mwaka 1998. Queen yize amashuli abanza mu kigo cya na Ecole Primaire Cyahafi na APACOPE, akomereza amashuli yisumbuye y'ikiciro rusange mu kigo cya St Aloys i Rwamagana akomereza ikiciro kisumbuye kuri Lycee de Kigali aho yarangirije mu mu mwaka 2015. Miss Queen Kalimpinya wigeze kuba umukobwa w'igisonga cya gatatu cya miss muri Miss Rwanda 2017, akaba yarabatijwe mu mazi menshi, kuvuka ubwa kabili, yemera kwakira Yesu Kirisito nk\u2019Umwami n\u2019Umukiza we, Uyu mukobwa yabatijwe ku munsi wa pantekote ku wa 28 Gicurasi 2023 na Ap\u00f4tre Alice Mignone Kabera akaba ariwe washinze Women Foundation Ministries ndetse rwose akaba n\u2019Umushumba Mukuru wa Noble Family Church.\nMu Isiganwa ry'Imodoka.\nMiss Kalimpinya Queen Ku nshuro ya mbere,yagiye gutwara imodoka muri \u2018Rwanda Mountain Gorilla Rally\u2019 aho yabaye Umunyarwandakazi wa mbere uhatanye muri iri siganwa ry\u2019imodoka rikomeye mu Rwanda.yagiye kwandikiramo amateka rizaba guhera tariki 23 kugeza tariki 25 Nzeri 2022.Muri Werurwe mu mwaka 2022 Kalimpinya yaje kwitabira \u201cSprint Rally All Star 2022\u201d ryakiniwe mu mihanda yo mu Karere ka Rwamagana anabasha kurirangiza ariko icyo gihe yari umushoferi wungirije Yoto Fabrice. Babaye aba kane anegukana igikombe cy\u2019umukobwa witwaye neza mu isiganwa. Mu irushanwa Huye Rally rya bereye mu karere ka Huye, Miss Kalimpinya yabaye uwa gatatu ndetse ahabwa igihembo cy\u2019umugore witwaye neza. Kalimpinya Queen ubu ni umwe mu Banyarwanda bari mumyanya y'imbere ku rutonde rw\u2019abakina imikino yo gusiganwa mu modoka ku mugabane w' Afurika. Miss Queen Kalimpinya akaba asanzwe akora mu ruganda rukora imyenda y\u2019abagore rwo mu Rwanda, akaba akazi afatanya n\u2019aya marushanwa."}
{"id": "10193", "revid": "9716", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10193", "title": "Bahati Grace", "text": "Bahati Grace.\nBahati Grace n'umunyarwandakazi wavutse 15 werurwe 1991. Grace yabaye Nyampinga w'urwanda 2009, Akora nkumwunganizi mubuvuzi wamenyo. \nUbuzima bwite.\nBahati yavukiye mu bugande 15 werurwe 1991, mu 1994 ubwo yaramajije kugira imyaka itatu we numuryango we bimukiye mu Rwanda. yavukiye mu muryango mugari aho umuryango ninshuti ze aringenzi kubuzima bwe. \nUmwuga.\nBahati ubwo yagiraga imyaka 16 yiyemeje gukora umwuga wo kumurika imideli yabiterwagamo imbaraga nababyeyi ndetse ni nshuti ze, ubwo yaragejeje imyaka 18 yinjiye mwirushwanw arya nyampinga wu Rwanda 2009 kunshuro yaryo ya kabiri nyuma yiryambere ryabaye 1994. yabaye Nyampinga wu Rwanda ndetse numukobwa uhiga abandi mukwifotoza. muri Bahati yahisemo gukomereza inzozi ze muri Leta zunze ubumwe za Amerika kuwa 22 Kamena 2011. Bahati yabaye Umunyamabanga rusange w umuryango wabanyarwanda ndinshuti baba muri Amerika kuva 2017 kugera 2019.\nAmashuri.\nBahati afite impamyabumenyi yiciciro ya cyakabiri cya kaminuza mubijyanye ni binyabuzima nubutabiri yize mri Kaminuza yitwa Mount Mercy anakomerezayo nibijyanye nu buvuzi bwamenyo."}
{"id": "10194", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10194", "title": "Cyuzuzo Jeane D'arc", "text": "Cyuzuzo Jeane D'arc ni umunyarwandakazi ukora umwuga w'itangazamakuru w'imyidagaduro wabigize umwuga. Cyuzuzo Jeane D'arc ni umugore akaba yarize muri Kaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda, aho yize itangazamakuru, yahakuye impamyabushobozi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza, ndetse si ibyo gusa kuko afite Masters, icyiciro cya gatatu cya kaminuza, mu bijyanye n'ububanyi n'amahanga, byose yakuye muri Kaminuza Nkuru y'u Rwanda, akaba ari umugore ufite umugabo n'umwana umwe, Cyuzuzo Jeane D'arc niwe muyobozi mukuru wa Ishya LTD.\nMu itangazamakuru.\nCyuzuzo ni umunyamakuru uzobereye umwuga wakoze ku maradiyo atandukanye ariyo Radiyo 10 kuva muri 2012-2015, Radiyo Isango star muri 2016 Aho yavuye ajya kuri Radiyo Royal FM, ubu akaba akora Kuri Radiyo Kiss FM.\nIBY'URUKUNDO RWE..\nCyuzuzo taliki ya 5 Ukuboza 2021 yasangije abamukurikira amafoto yerekana umuhango yambikiwemo impeta n'umugabo we Niyigaba Thierry Eric. Nibwo yambitswe impeta n'umukunzi we amusaba kuzamubera umufasha. Cyuzuzo yemeye adashidikanyije kuzabana akaramata na Thierry Eric Niyigaba. Taliki 12 Ugushyingo 2022 Thierry Eric Niyigaba yasabye Jeanne d'Arc Cyuzuzo. Taliki 12 Ugushyingo 2022 Cyuzuzo Jeanne d'Arc Yasezeranye na Thierry Eric Niyigaba Imbere y'Imana, nk'umugore n'umugabo."}
{"id": "10195", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10195", "title": "Olive Izerimana", "text": "Ubuzima.\nIzerimana Olive n'umunyarwandakazi ufite imyaka 26 yavutse tariki ya (11/12/1996). \nIbigwi.\nIzerimana akina umukino wo gusiganwa ku magare aho yatangiye gusiganwa kinyamwuga muri uwo mukino mu mwaka(2018)ndetse anitabira amarushanwa mpuzamahanga yabagore basiganwa kumagare ku rwego rwa Africa mumwaka 2019 arinabwo yegukanye umwanya wa 17 mu bari bitabiriye amarushanwa bose muri Africa."}
{"id": "10196", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10196", "title": "Umurerwa evelyne", "text": "Amavu n'amavuko.\nUMURERWA EVELYNE yavutse 1977, avukira mumugi wa kigali ubu ni mukarere ka Nyarugenge. Ni umwe mu banyamakuru ba radio na television, akaba yaratangiye umwuga witangaza makuru 1998 ubwo yari arangije amashuri y'isumbuye (centre Islamique d'enseignements secondaires de kigali).\nIbikorwa yakoze.\nIyo ugiye kureba amakuru mu kinyarwanda ahari mubitecyerezo bya benshi haza izina UMURERWA EVELYNE kuko amaze kwiga yakoze kuri radio na television rwanda (RWANDA TV) akaba ayimazeho imwaka igera kuri 21 akora umwuga w'itangazamakuru ariho nanubu agikora. Ababyirutse mu myaka ya 2000 baribuka, aho buri wa Gatandatu mu masaha y'umugoroba buri wese yabaga yicaye imbere ya televiziyo, uwo iwabo batayifite akajya kuyivumba yanga gucikwa n'ibiganiro yakoraga, Aho yagiye akora ibiganiro nka tele Detante, tinyuka urashoboye, umugore mu iterambere hamwe numunyamakuru usoma amakuru mu kinyarwanda.\nMu kiganiro yagiranye n'ikinyamakuru IGIHE, yavuze ko zari inzozi zibaye impamo, kuko yari yarakuze yiyumvamo kuzaba umunyamakuru ukomeye, kuburyo rimwe na rimwe yagendaga yivugisha mu nzira. Yagize ati \" Kuva kera narabikundaga cyane, nakurikiranaga kenshi Radio Rwanda, rimwe na rimwe nkajya mfata umwanya nkigana abanyamakuru bayo nka ba Amabilisi Sibomana, hari n'ubwo nagendaga nivugisha. Nabyinjiyemo nkiri muto cyane ku buyo na Kaminuza n'andi mahugurwa yose nagiye mbona, urebye nayakoze ndi mu itangazamakuru.\"\nBitewe n'uburyo abantu bishimira ibyo akora ndetse abana b'akobwa bagatangira kumufata nk'icyitegererezo byatumwe arushaho kugira umuhate. Ati \" Ni umwuga mwiza, ku buryo kuwuvamo hari igihe bigorana. Ni umwuga uguhitisha ahantu hose kandi neza, ni umwuga utuma w'iyubaha. Ni umurimo mwiza cyane iyo wawukoze mu buryo bunoze kandi bwa kinyamwuga.\"\nYavuze ko itangazamakuru rishobora kukugeza ahantu henshi ndetse mu gihe warikoze wirinda amarangamutima udashobora kurambirwa.\nTinyuka urashoboye ikiganiro kimurutira ibindi.\nNubwo yagiye akora ibiganiro byinshi by'urubyiruko bigakundwa ndetse akavuga amakuru benshi bakaryoherwa, Umurerwa we ahamya ko muri byinshi yakoze icyamurutiye byose ari icy'abagore cyitwa \"Tinyuka urashoboye\"yatangiye muri 2010.\nAti \" Ni ikiganiro bishimisha iyo mpuye n'umugore akambwira ati nakoraga akazi kampemba amafaranga buri kwezi ariko uyu munsi kubera ko ngenda nkurikira ibiganiro byawe byaramfashije ndikorera. Ubu n'uwansubiza mu kazi ngo ampembe amamiliyoni ntabwo nshobora kubikora.\" Muri iki kiganiro aganira n'abagore bari mu nzego zitandukanye bafite ibikorwa bikomeye bagezeho.\nUretse kuba iki kiganiro yatangiye biturutse ku gitekerezo cye bwite, akunganirwa n'ubuyobozi bw'ikigo cy'itangazamakuru (RBA) akorera, gituma abenshi batinyuka kwikorera, abana b'abakobwa bakajya mu myuga yafatwaga nk'igenewe abagabo, abo baganira ahamya ko abigiraho byinshi. Ati \"Hari igihe nganira n'umugore runaka nkavuga ngo ariko ubu nanjye nyuma y'aha sinamera nkawe? Nanjye bambera urugero, nubwo mba ndi mu kiganiro, bimpa ibitekerezo by'inzira nakoresha nashatse guhindura ubuzima nerekeza mu iterambere. \nAkazi hamwe nu muryango.\nAti \"Hano akazi kacu kabanyamakuru kaba gateguye neza, uretse n'ikiganiro cya 'Tinyuka Urashoboye' nkora no gusoma amakuru. Yego baraguhamagara uhora witeguye, ariko bisaba kwiha intego. Burya iyo umuntu ari umubyeyi, agira uburyo abyitwaramo,kwita k'ubana n' uburere bwabo bukitabwaho kandi n'akazi kakagenda neza.\" Ibyo yabivuze afite abana batatu harimo nuwari ucyiri umwana muto cyane.\nUmurerwa Akomeza avuga ko ubuzima bwiza abayemo uyu munsi abukesha umwuga witangazamakuru rikomatanyije n'umugisha uturuka ku Mana. Ati \"Uyu munsi mba ahantu ntakodesha, imodoka yose nshatse ndayigura, ariko nanone byose bisaba kwizigama.\"\nInseko, uburanga n'imiterere bya Umurerwa kuri televiziyo ni nabyo uhuye nawe mu buzima busazwe uhita ubona, ndetse nta n'uwatinya kuvuga ko mu myaka isaga 21 nta kintu kinini yahindutseho.\nUmurerwa iyo atari mu kazi, umwanya we awuharira gukora siporo zirimo kwiruka, gym tonic, rimwe narimwe akajya koga, ariko byose ntibimubuza kwiragiza Imana yo mugenga wa byose. "}
{"id": "10197", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10197", "title": "Iradukunda Grace Divine", "text": "Iradukunda Grace Divine uzwi ku mazina ya Dj Ira, ise umubyara yitwa Mbonimpa Juvenal. Dj Ira yageze mu Rwanda bwa mbere muri 2015 ubwo yari aje gusura mubyara we Sakubu Hassan (Deejay Bisoso) nawe uvanga umuziki kuri televiziyo y'u Rwanda. \nUbwenegihugu.\nDj Ira yari asanzwe afite ubwenegihugu bw'u Burundi bwonyine, ariko mu minsi mikeya ishize aherutse guhabwa ubwenegihugu na nyakwubahwa umukuru w'igihugu cy'u Rwanda H.E Paul Kagame mu gisabo Dj Ira yasabiye mu ruhame taliki 16 Werurwe 2025 mu gitaramo n'urubyiruko muri BK Arena.\nDj Ira kuva Ku wa kabiri tariki 15 Mata 2025 ya baye imbere y'amategeko y'Urwanda umunyarwandakazi.\nMuri muzika.\nIradukunda Grace Divine uzwi ku mazina ya Dj Ira, ni umuvangamizikikazi ukunzwe mu Rwanda ufite inkomoko mu gihugu cy'u Burundi uzwi ku izina rya DJ Ira, ni umwe mu bakobwa bake batinyutse gukora uyu mu mwuga wari umenyerewemo n' abahungu gusa, cyane ko avuga ko ari akazi ka buri munsi, aho ahura n'imbogamizi z'abagabo baza kumutereta bamwitiranya n'indaya. Dj ira yigishijwe na mubyara we Dj Bissoso amaze kwigaragaza henshi mu bitaramo bikomeye bitandukanye ndetse yanagaragaye henshi mu bitaramo bya PGGSS6, avangavangira imiziki abahanzi benshi batandukanye, ndetse aha ni naho benshi bamubonyemo kuba ari umukobwa ushoboye kuba yanezeza imbaga y'abitabiriye ibitaramo abavangavangira imiziki ku buryo bw'umwuga."}
