{"id": "10278", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10278", "title": "Felicite Rwemarika", "text": "Amavuka..\nFelicite Rwemarika yavutse taliki 09 Werurwe 1958.\nAmashuri yize..\nFelicite Rwemarika yabonye impanya bushobozi mubijyanye nubuganga muri mulago hospital muri Uganda. Yabonye Kandi dipolome mu bijyanye nimiyoborere mubucurizi (Business administration)muri kaminuza ya Cambridge college online(2007).\nUrugendo rwa Felicite Rwemarika..\n1985-1995 Yakoze ubuganga mubitaro bya mulago hospital muri Uganda.\n1997-2004 Felicite Rwemarika yatangiye ubucuruzi bubiri butandukanye aribwo: salon yubwiza na resitora (restaurant).\nRwemarika mumikino..\n2003 Felicite Rwemarika yashinze anahagarira mumategeko AKWOS(Association of Kigali women's in sports).\n2007-2011 Rwemarika yabaye umujyana muri Rwanda National Olympic sports committee.\n2013-2017 yinjiye munzu yumupira wamagura mu Rwanda (Ferwafa) nku muyibozi wumupira wabagore.\n2012 yitabiriye irushanwa rya ashoke fellow..\n2015. Yabonye igihembo cya stars foundation and from girls collective.\n2016 yabonye igihembo cya IOC cyo gushyigikira siporo Yabagore muri Africa"}
