{"id": "10281", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10281", "title": "Niyomubyeyi noella", "text": "Niyomubyeyi Noella ni umunyarwandakazi wamenyekanye mu gukina filimi yuruhererekane Seburikoko, akaba azwi ku izina rya Fofo muri iyo filimi. yigeze no kwitabira irushunwa rya Nyambinga w'u Rwanda 2022.\nUmwuga akora.\nNoella yatangiye gukina filimi mu 2016 iyo filime yitwaga virunga high school yacaga kuri televiziyo ya Lemigo, nyuma yaho yakomeje gukina mu mafilime atandukanye harimo Seburikoko,Papa sava bituma ajyenda amenyekana.Fofo kandi yitbiriye irushunwa rya Nyambinga w'u Rwanda 2022.\nAmateka yihariye.\nNoella ni umugore,yarashatse afite umugabo witwa Niyigena Daniel barushinze ku wa 2 Ukwakira 2022, nyuma yaho baje kubyarana umwna w'umukobwa."}
