{"id": "10285", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10285", "title": "Uwera Dalila", "text": "Uwera Dalila Niwe Wabaye Nyaminga wu Rwanda bwa mbere hari tariki 17 ukuboza 1993 muhango wabereye kuri Hotel chez Lando i Remera.Nyampinga w'u Rwanda#cite note-3\nAmateka.\nUwera Dalila yashakanye n\u2019umugabo Dirk basanzwe baba mu gihugu cy\u2019Ububiligi, yabwiye Radio Rwanda icyatumye yitabira iri irushanwa rya Nyaminga Wu Rwanda ryari ribaye ku nshuro ya kabiri mu gihugu cy'uRwanda.Yagumye asobanura icyatumye ajya muri Miss Rwanda mu mwaka 1993. Yavuze ko yarasanzwe arumunyamideli guhora abikora yerekana imyambaro igenzweho ikindi abobari bashinzwe ibyo byimideri ni nabo Bamujyanye mwirushanwa rya Nyaminga wu Rwanda.Nyuma yaho yaje gushakana numugabo kumugabane wiburayi ariwe Dirk. Uwera Dalila yaje guhishuye andi mabanga y\u2019urugo rwe mu biganiro yagirinye nitangazamakuru hano mu Rwanda aho yahamirije abanyamakuru ko yamaze gutandukana n\u2019umubiligi bari barashakanye,gusa yirinda kugaruka ku cyo yapfuye n\u2019uyu wahoze ari umugabo we na cyane ko ngo ari ibintu biri hagati yabo ndetse yumva nta mpamvu n\u2019imwe yatuma atangaza icyo bapfuye.\nUwera Dalila yavuzeko yaje gutandukanye n\u2019umugabo bari barashakanye nyuma yo kubyarana umwana umwe. Mu kiganiro ni icyo kinyamakuru yavuze ko nyuma yo gutandukana n\u2019uyu wari umugabo we yatangiye ubuzima bushya ndetse anongeraho ko yamaze kubona umusore bakundana bagiye kumarana umwaka wose bari mu rukundo ndetse bakaba biteguye kurushinga mu gihe icyo aricyo cyose baba bamaze kubyumvikana\nIbihembo.\nUwera Dalila Avugako Bahawe ikamba ari abakobwa 20 avugako bimwe muhihembo Yibuka harimo Imikufi hanyuma ibindi bakaba batarabibonye kubera bayise bahunga berekeza kumugabane w\u2019i Burayi.\nIcyo avuga.\nAvuga ko kuba yarambaye ikamba rya Nyampinga w\u2019u Rwanda wo mu mwaka 1993 abona ari agaciro gakomeye kuri we ndetse ko kugeza ubu agifite ishema ryaryo.Akongera avugako Kuba yarabaye Nyampinga w\u2019u Rwanda bivuga byinshi cyane.byamuhesheje agaciro byatumye amenya agaciro kiwe, byatumye akomeza kuba umwali ukwiriye u Rwanda n\u2019ubu aracyabyitirirwa. aracyitirirwa Nyampinga w\u2019u Rwanda akaba ari naryo shema nanubu afite, nta nyungu akurikiranye cyane ariko agaciro gakomeye afite n\u2019uko yahagarariye u Rwanda."}
{"id": "10286", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10286", "title": "Nubuhoro Jeanne", "text": "Nyampinga w'u Rwanda watowe bwa mbere ni Nubuhoro Jeanne atorerwa muri Hoteri M\u00e9ridien ubu yahindutse Marasa Umubano mu 1991 akaba yarishwe muri genocide yakorewe abatutsi mu 1994. Yaje gusimburwa na Uwera Dalila watowe mu Ukuboza mu 1993 agomba kuba Nyampinga w'u Rwanda mu 1994 akaba ari nawe wamenyekanye cyane akaba kuri ubu aba mu gihugu cy'Ububirigi.Nyampinga w'u Rwanda\nAmateka.\nNubuhoro Jeanne ni we wambitswe ikamba rya mbere mu Rwanda mu 1991 mu birori byabereye kuri Hotel M\u00e9ridien [ubu basigaye bayita Umubano Hotel]. Icyo gihe Nubuhoro Jeanne atorwa yigaga mu mashuri yisumbuye mu ishuri rya G.S.N.D.B.C mu kigo cy'i Byumba. Uyu mukobwa ni mwene Munyankindi Jean na Nyiramadadari M\u00e9diatrice, bari batuye i Ndera ari naho bamwiciye muri Jenoside yakorewe Abatutsi mu 1994.\nIcyo Musaza we Amuvugaho.\nAragira ati: \"1992 bimaze gukomera hano mu Rwanda, aho byari bikomeye batangiye guterwa grenade,avuga ko mushiki we na nyina bagiye i Burundi bahunze bagezeyo biberayo. Yagezeyo ajya no mu irushanwa rya Nyampinga wo mu gihugu cy' Uburundi, yaje muri batatu ba mbere. Sinzi niba yarabaye igisonga cya kangahe ariko ari muri batatu ba mbere.\"Yongeraho ati \u201cIcyo gihe habaye ibibazo bya ba Ndadaye bagaruka mu Rwanda, Jenoside yabaye batashye. Nubuhoro na mama babiciye i Ndera muri Caraes, yiciwe rimwe na murumuna wanjye witwaga Jean Fid\u00e8le Mutaganira na Paulina Mutesi, abo bavandimwe banjye bari muri ba bandi basizwe n\u2019abasirikare b\u2019abazungu nyuma interahamwe zirabica\".\nUrupfu yapfuye rw'agashinyaguro.\nMudahunga Jean Marie ari we Musaza Wa miss wa mbere W'u Rwanda avuga ko Miss Nubuhoro Jeanne yishwe nabi urupfu rubabaje ndetse rw\u2019agashinyaguro muri Jenoside, ngo mu makuru n'ubuhamya bwatanzwe n\u2019abarokokeye i Ndera, hari abahamya ko interahamwe zavanye uyu mukobwa mu bandi zimukorera iyicarubozo. Ngo interahamwe zamujombaguraga ibyuma zikanamubwira zimwishongoraho ko \u2018ari we Nyampinga w\u2019u Rwanda."}
