{"id": "10288", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10288", "title": "Mukarubayiza Drocella", "text": "Ubuzibwa bwite.\nZANINKA Amazina ye nyakuri ni Mukarubayiza Drocella. Ni umubyeyi w'imyaka 60 y'amavuko akaba afite ndetse abana 6, abakobwa 3 n'abahungu 3 hamwe n'abuzukuru 6, umukuru muribo afite imyaka 15 y'amavuko. Uyu ni umukinnyi wo mu ikinamico \"Musekeweya\" ndtse nizindi nyinshi harimo iyitwa \"Intabwe Idasobanya\" kuko yatangiye gukina ikinamico kuva kera.\nIbindi kuri we.\nZaninka Mubuzima bwe bwa buri munsi ni umuntu woroherana kdi ugerageze kubana naburi wese, ni umukristo w'umuvugabutumwa urimo no kwiga theologie. Zaninka akunda kurya ibiribwa gakondo.ku kinjyanye n'ibinyobwa yagize ati \" Nkunda amazi n'icyayi\" \n= Amashakiro.\n="}
{"id": "10289", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10289", "title": "Umunezero Alice", "text": "Ubuzima bwite.\nAp\u00f4tre Mignone Ubundi ababyeyi be bamwise Alice Umunezero ariko baza kumuhimba Mignone riza no kumufata riba ari ryo rimenyekana cyane. Yavukiye i Burundi aranahakurira kuko ariho ababyeyi be bari barahungiye.\nApotre Mignone Uyu muvugabutumwa bwiza bwa Kristo ni umubyeyi w'abana batatu 3 yibyariye ndetse n'anadi benshi arera nkuko abyivugira.niwe wantangije umuryango witwa Women Foundation Ministries n'urusengero rwitwa Nobel Family Church. Akaba ari umugore wa Eric Kabera.\nIbihembo yabonye.\nApote Mignone Akaba yarahawe udushimye hamwe n'ibihembo byinshi, hari nkaho yahawe igihembo cya \"Sifa Award\" muri muri compasiyo."}
{"id": "10290", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10290", "title": "Rwemalika Felicite", "text": "Rwemalika Felicite yavutse ku ya 9 werurwe 1958 avukira mu Rwanda kandi yabaye wa IOC kuva mu 2018. wa kaminuza y'Abanyamerika ya Nijeriya ku bumwe n'ubwiyunge binyuze muri siporo Kandi ku rwego rw'Akarere ni Perezida w'Inama y'Abagore kandi ku rwego rw'Igihugu ategura amahugurwa hagamijwe gukangurira no guteza imbere siporo nk'igikoresho gikomeye cyo kubaka amahoro, gukemura amakimbirane, uburinganire n'ubwuzuzanye mu bukungu."}
{"id": "10292", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10292", "title": "Abayo yvette sandrine", "text": "Abayo Yvette Sandrine ni umunyarwandakazi ukora umwuga w'itangazamakuru bwibanda ku myidagaduro.Ni umunyamakuru umenyerewe mugukora itangazamakuru muburyo bw'ibyegeranyo akabinyuza kuri YouTube ye. Akaba kandi yarakoreye ibitangazamakuru bitandukanye, birimo TV1 RWANDA, BTN TV RWANDA, B+ TV hamwe na Red Blue JD ahava ajya gushinga umuyoboro we ari naho agikora kugeza ubu\nAbayo Yvette Sandrine is a prominent Rwandan journalist and YouTuber known for her captivating documentaries, love stories, and deep-dive videos on her ABAYO Yvette Sandrine YouTube Channel."}
{"id": "10298", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10298", "title": "Miss Chanelle", "text": "Nirere Ruth uzwi nka Miss Chanelle ni umuhanzi nyarwanda wamamaye cyane mu Rwanda no hanze yarwo, yamamaye ahagana mu w'i 1998, aza kumenyeknishwa cyane n'indirimbo ye yise Ndarota. Miss Chanelle yagiye akorana n'abahanzi batandukanye mu Rwanda, Kenya n'ahandi.\nAmateka.\nMiss Chanelle ni Umuhanzikazi ndetse akaba n' icyamamare mu Rwanda no hanze yarwo. Amazina ye nyakuri yitwa NIRERE RUTH yamamaye cyane mu mwaka w'i 1998 ubwo yari akiri muto cyane kubera ijwi rihebuje, yamamaye cyane ku ndirimbo ye NDAROTA gusa si yo gusa kuko na nyuma yaho yagiye akora izindi nyinshi zitandukanye, harimo n'izo kwibuka zaremaga agatima abasigajwe iheruheru na Genocide yakorewe abatutsi mu Rwanda muw'i 1994 Mata. Miss Chanelle kandi yagiye akora injyana nyinshi zitandukanye harimo nk'izizwi nka Zouk, acoustic, R&amp;B n'izindi.\nIbindi bikorwa.\nNirere Ruth wamamaye nka Miss Chanelle ntabwo yahagaritse umuziki we ahubwo yakomeje kwigarurira imitima ya benshi mu Rwanda, ubwo mu mwaka wa 2009 yashyiraga ahagaragara Album ye ya mbere yise NARROW ROAD iyi Album yari yiganjeho indirimbo ze nyinshi zibandaga ku muziki w'u Rwanda cyari igitaramo cyanyuze benshi mu bakunzi be cyane cyane abari mu mujyi wa Kigali. Si ibyo gusa kuko iyi album yariho indirimbo nyinshi yakoranye n'abahanzi batandukanye bo mu Rwanda no mu karere nka UGANDA, KENYA n'abandi. \nSi ibyo gusa kandi Miss Chanelle mu mwaka wa 2012 yakoreye ibitaramo bitandukanye muri SUDAN mu rwego rwo kunezeza ingabo z'u Rwanda zari mu butumwa bw'amahoro muri icyo gihugu. Miss Chanelle kandi muri 2013 yimukiye mu gihugu cy'Ubufaransa aho byavuzwe ko agiye gusoza amashuri ye mu bijyanye n'amajwi mu mwaka wa 2017. Miss Chanelle yagaragaye muri filimi bise MERCY OF THE JUNGLE hamwe na Marc Zinga ndetse na Stephane Bak yakozwe na Karekezi Joel. Miss Chanelle kandi ageze mu Bufaransa nibwo yibarutse Imfura ye ubwo byari ibicika ku mbuga nkoranyambaga kubera amafoto yari yashyize hanze agaragaza inda atwite yayambitse ubusa.\nIbihembo yatsindiye.\nMiss Chanelle yagiye atwara ibihembo byinshi bitandukanye muri byo harimo nk'ibyo bita Preal of Africa Music Award aho byari ibyishimo kuri we n'abakunzi be kuko yabitwaye inshuro eshatu zikurikiranye (3) muri 2006,2007,2008 ariwe wegukana icyo gihembo cya Preal of Africa Music Award. Muri 2009 kandi nabwo yatwaye igihembo cya salax Award cy'umugore w'umuhanzi wahize abandi mu Rwanda."}
{"id": "10301", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10301", "title": "Assoumpta Abayezu", "text": "Assoumpta Abayezu ni umunyarwandakazi ukora umwuga w'itangazamakuru kuri radio na televiziyo. Yatangiye akorera Isango star nyuma yerekeza kuri Radiyo na TV 10 mu minsi ishize nibwo yagiye kuri RBA akora mu kiganiro cy'imyidagaduro, amahumbezi n'izindi porogarame.\nUbuzima bwe bwite.\nAssoumpta Abayezu yasezeranye imbere y'Imana n'imbere y'amategeko n'umukunzi we Niyobuhungiro Caleb bari bamaze igihe mu munyenga w'urukundo aho yamusabye ko yazamubera umugore taliki ya 22 Gicurasi 2022 nawe akabyemera. Umuhango wo gusezerana imbere y'Imana wabereye mu Karere ka Gasabo mu Murenge wa Remera kuwa 4 taliki ya 22 Ukuboza 2022. Umuhango wo gusaba no gukwa wabereye muri Golden Garden i Rebero mu mujyi wa Kigali."}
{"id": "10302", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10302", "title": "Miss Peace Ndaruhutse Kwizera", "text": "Miss peace Ndaruhutse Kwizera umunyarwandakazi witabira irushanwa ryubwiza mu Rwanda mu mwaka 2016 akegukana ikamba ryigisonga cyambere,numukobwa uhiga abandi mumafoto nyuma yoguhatana nabakobwa benshi bari bitabiriye irushanwa akabahiga muruwo mwaka nanone yitabiriye irushanwa ryitwa naiades ryahurizagahamwe ibihugu byafurika aho yegukanye ikamba nyuma yoguhiga abakobwa bahagarariye ibihugu byabo muri Afrika."}
