{"id": "10304", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10304", "title": "Aisa Cyiza", "text": "Aisa Cyiza ni umunyakuru kuri Royal FM ubusanzwe akora ikiganiro kitwa AM to PM gitangira saa tanu z'amanywa kugeza saa munani z'umugoroba akaba akundwa nabatari bake kubera ijwi rye. Aisa Cyiza yatangiye umwuga w'itangazamakuru muri 2012 ubu maze imyaka irindwi awukora ni umunyamakuru wavutse mu 1990.Aisa Cyiza ni umunyamakuru wamenyakanye cyane ubwo yakoraga kuri radio Isango Star, kuri ubu akaba ari kubarizwa kuri Royal FM aho ari gukorera ikiganiro Roya Drive na MC Tino wavuye kuri KFM kikaba ari ikiganiro gikunzwe nabantu benshi bakurikira iyi Radiyo."}
{"id": "10307", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10307", "title": "Uwamariya Immacul\u00e9e", "text": "Ubuzima bwite.\nUwamaliya Immaculee ni umwe mu babikira w'ihaye Imana, tuzi ku mazina ya Soeur Immaculee, yavutse itariki 7 ukuboza 1970 avukira mu Akarere ka nyarugenge mu mugi wa Kigali. Akaba yarafashe iki cyemezo cyo kwiha Imana mu bihe bikomeye, kuko iki gitekerezo yakigize mu 1992, yari arangije amashuri yisumbuye, afite n'akazi.\nAmashuri yize..\nSoeur Immaculee yize muri APACOPE amashuri yisumbuye y'imyaka 3 rusange, Akomereza muri Saint Aloys i Rwamagana yiga ibijyanye ni baruramari. Arangije kwiga yakoze muri MINFOP, ubu ni MIFOTRA, Soeur Uwamaliya Immaculee ubu akaba ari umuyobizi w'ikigo cy'amashuri yisumbuye i Kansi mu Akarere ka Gisagara mu intara y'amajyepho y'u Rwanda. Akaba yarashinze umuryango \"Famille Esperance\" (FAES) mugucyemura ibibazo byugarije ingo n'iterambere ryazo. "}
{"id": "10308", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10308", "title": "Umubyeyi Sharifa", "text": "Umubyeyi Sharifa ni rwiyemezamirimo w'umunyarwandakazi ukora inkweto yagize igitekerezo cyo kwikorera nyuma yuko atakaje akazi kubera COVID 19 muri guma murugo niho yabonye umwanya wo gutekereza ikindi cyintu yakora cyamubyarira inyungu kurubu akaba afite inzu ikora inkweto yitwa Ceka uburyo ikoramo umukiriya yerekana inkweto ashaka bakazimukorera cyangwa bagahimba nizindi. Umubyeyi nyuma yo gushinga Ceka ikorera i gikondo yashatse abari basanzwe badoda inkweto kumuhanda arabatoza batangira gukorana kinyamwuga kurubu Umubyeyi avugako bahisemo kujya bakora inkweto abakiriya bashaka kugirango borohereze abajya kuzigura hanze.Umubyeyi akomeza avugako imbogamizi zihari ari ukugera kubantu bataba muri kigali kandi umwihariko wizi nkweto nuko zitandukanye nizisanzwe kw'isoko zikaba zigura hagati 14000 Rwfkugeza kuri 20000 Rwf iz'abagore naho iz'abagabo ni 20000 Rwf kugeza 30000 Rwf."}
{"id": "10309", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10309", "title": "Liza Kamikazi", "text": "Solange Umuhire wamyekanye nka Liza Kamikazi mu muziki nyarwanda ni umuhanzikazi watangiye aririmba indirimbo zisanzwe(secular music) nyuma akaza kwinjira mu kuririmba indirimbo zihimbaza Imana. \nAmashuri yize.\nLiza Kamikazi yize muri Kaminuza y'u Rwanda i Huye mu ishami ry'itangazamakuru aho yakuye impamyabumenyi y'icyiciro cya kabiri cya kaminuza mu ishami ry' itangazamakuru.\nUbuzima bwite.\nKamikazi ni umubyeyi w'abana batatu akaba afite umugabo bahuriye mu mwuga w'ubuhanzi aho uwo mugabo yatangiye amufasha mu miririmbire gusa amwigisha uko aririmba neza ariko biza kuvamo urukundo baza kubaka umuryango. Liza yaje kwegurira ubuzima bwe Yesu Kristo arakizwa yinjira mukuririmba indirimbo zihimbaza Imana.\nUmwuga.\nLiza yatangiye umwuga w'ubuhanzi mu myaka 17 ishize aho yatangiye aririmba indirimbo zisanzwe zakunzwe cyane, amaze gukizwa nibwo yatangiye kuririmba indirimbo zihimbaza Imana nazo zakunzwe cyane, Liza afatanya ubuhanzi n'itangazamakuru aho akora kuri televisiyo y'u Rwanda agakora ikiganiro cya gikiristitu kitwa \" umutima ku mutima\" (Heart to Heart)."}
{"id": "10310", "revid": "11559", "url": "https://rw.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=10310", "title": "Mahoro Gerardine", "text": "MAHORO GERARDINE umuyobozi wa Act05\nMahoro Gerardine ni Umunyarwandakazi utuye mu bufaransa, n' umujyamama akaba n' umuyobozi mukuru wa Act05, afite uburambe bukomeye ku mishinga yo murwego rwo hejuru haba mu bikorera ndetse no munzego za leta.\nMahoro kandi avuga ko aringomwa gushimangira amahirwe k'uruhande rw'afurika y'uburengerazuba, akaba yarashyizeho igikorwa cya ACT05 gihereza guverinoma, ubucuruzi ndetse n'abayobozi n'abinzego.\nMahoro Gerardine akaba yatowe muri 30,abayobozi bato bari munsi y'imyaka 40 bingenzi mukazoza k'afurika na fondasiyo y'ubufaransa hamwe na Perezida Emmanuel Macron hamwe na Nana Akufo-oddo endosementi, yatorewe kandi kuba Umuyobozi w'ihuriro rya Montana muri Afurika 2019_2022 kubera ibikorwa bye byo kunoza ingamba z'ubufatanye bw'afurika n'uburayi, akaba ari umufatanye bikorwa n'ibihugu 19 bya afurika ndetse n'ibihugu 3 by'iburayi.\nUbumenyi.\n. Gutunganya ibikorwa by'ubukungu no kubikurikirana\n. ingamba n'ubufasha mu bikorwa byo gukora\n. ubushakashatsi"}
